(205440, 11909, 3112, '<td valign="top">Fabulous night-capture feel.  A stolen moment from a cat''s oh-so-hard life.</td>', 'Fabulous night-capture feel.  A stolen moment from a cat''s oh-so-hard life.', '2003-02-03 00:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(205447, 11759, 5700, '<td valign="top">umm... those are canadian geese aren''t thay?<br/>:o)</td>', 'umm... those are canadian geese aren''t thay?:o)', '2003-02-03 00:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(205449, 11933, 6202, '<td valign="top">Good shot, and considering the time of day just being there deserves a 10 =o)</td>', 'Good shot, and considering the time of day just being there deserves a 10 =o)', '2003-02-03 00:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(205453, 11865, 1647, '<td valign="top">Very cliche and very well done!  The reflection of the board in the very top drop really makes this photo for me.  The border is simple and appropriate.  A really good photo - the only critical comment is the reflection of the room where the drop meets the water, but it''s only a minor thing.</td>', 'Very cliche and very well done!  The reflection of the board in the very top drop really makes this photo for me.  The border is simple and appropriate.  A really good photo - the only critical comment is the reflection of the room where the drop meets the water, but it''s only a minor thing.', '2003-02-03 00:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(205454, 12020, 5700, '<td valign="top">Been there, done that</td>', 'Been there, done that', '2003-02-03 00:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(205455, 11916, 5700, '<td valign="top">both the barn and the horse look old, nice photo      8<br/>Ben</td>', 'both the barn and the horse look old, nice photo      8Ben', '2003-02-03 00:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(205459, 11717, 5700, '<td valign="top">ummm... i hope that is not real..... it kinda grosses me out!</td>', 'ummm... i hope that is not real..... it kinda grosses me out!', '2003-02-03 00:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(205461, 11955, 1143, '<td valign="top">Very creative. I really like the way the light fades from right to left. The edge of the mirror doesn''t really bother me. I even dont mind seeing the corner of it. The bowl of flowers is really cool. I think that it and its reflection would be a neat shot on their own. If you''re gonna show the vase of fruit flowers then I''d rather see the whole reflection or have it cropped differently. The super bright reflection is distracting. Overall it has more of a painting feel than a photograph, and it''s a cool take on the topic.</td>', 'Very creative. I really like the way the light fades from right to left. The edge of the mirror doesn''t really bother me. I even dont mind seeing the corner of it. The bowl of flowers is really cool. I think that it and its reflection would be a neat shot on their own. If you''re gonna show the vase of fruit flowers then I''d rather see the whole reflection or have it cropped differently. The super bright reflection is distracting. Overall it has more of a painting feel than a photograph, and it''s a cool take on the topic.', '2003-02-03 00:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(205462, 11832, 5700, '<td valign="top">Love all the detail in the bear''s coat... looks good       8<br/>Ben</td>', 'Love all the detail in the bear''s coat... looks good       8Ben', '2003-02-03 00:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(205464, 11755, 5700, '<td valign="top">Can you say hair club for cats.... not only a member......................</td>', 'Can you say hair club for cats.... not only a member......................', '2003-02-03 00:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(205469, 11959, 1647, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty good portrait although my eyes are drawn to his hands rather than his face.  I think it''s because they are lighter.  Composition is very good although the white background is perhaps a little too stark.  Focus is good, colour is good.  Finally, the shadows are a little harsh - perhaps a second light source would be good.  Having said all that though - still a lovely portrait.</td>', 'This is a pretty good portrait although my eyes are drawn to his hands rather than his face.  I think it''s because they are lighter.  Composition is very good although the white background is perhaps a little too stark.  Focus is good, colour is good.  Finally, the shadows are a little harsh - perhaps a second light source would be good.  Having said all that though - still a lovely portrait.', '2003-02-03 00:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(205472, 11944, 5700, '<td valign="top">My grandma looks like that too!</td>', 'My grandma looks like that too!', '2003-02-03 00:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(205480, 11929, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like the focus and I like the colours although the composition is a little uncomfortable for myself.  Especially the line which continues from the dogs nose.  Also, I would have been tempted to include more of the head.  Certainly the angle of the face and the intensity of the eye really do a lot for the image - well done.</td>', 'I like the focus and I like the colours although the composition is a little uncomfortable for myself.  Especially the line which continues from the dogs nose.  Also, I would have been tempted to include more of the head.  Certainly the angle of the face and the intensity of the eye really do a lot for the image - well done.', '2003-02-03 00:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(205484, 11840, 1647, '<td valign="top">The colour is great and the silohuette works well.  The balance between sky and land is also good.  I think it would have been better if it only featured the tress though, and not the buildings in the distance - they compete a little and I think the trees would always win.  The aspect ration of your final image is well suited to the topic.</td>', 'The colour is great and the silohuette works well.  The balance between sky and land is also good.  I think it would have been better if it only featured the tress though, and not the buildings in the distance - they compete a little and I think the trees would always win.  The aspect ration of your final image is well suited to the topic.', '2003-02-03 00:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(205486, 11960, 5700, '<td valign="top">Too many distractions in front of the childs face for me.    5<br/>Ben</td>', 'Too many distractions in front of the childs face for me.    5Ben', '2003-02-03 00:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(205488, 11963, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great dog.  Black and white is well suited to this image.  I think the composition could have been better if the nose was lower in the shot (~1/3 up from bottom) rather than central - too much neck and not enough eye brows.  Focus on the nose is great and the shallow depth of field is interesting (but probably not my preference).  Good work.</td>', 'Great dog.  Black and white is well suited to this image.  I think the composition could have been better if the nose was lower in the shot (~1/3 up from bottom) rather than central - too much neck and not enough eye brows.  Focus on the nose is great and the shallow depth of field is interesting (but probably not my preference).  Good work.', '2003-02-03 00:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(205489, 11801, 5700, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the vivid part.</td>', 'I don''t see the vivid part.', '2003-02-03 00:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(205492, 11921, 1647, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, although I don''t feel it''s "the best you can" - it''s a little unconventional for a pet photo.  As an artistic photo though it works very well - it certainly held my attention for a while.</td>', 'Interesting shot, although I don''t feel it''s "the best you can" - it''s a little unconventional for a pet photo.  As an artistic photo though it works very well - it certainly held my attention for a while.', '2003-02-03 00:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(205493, 11876, 92, '<td valign="top">WOW @ This is a great pet photo and dad is cute too :) I love the eyes on both. You''ve captured them well and the light is perfect ! = 10</td>', 'WOW @ This is a great pet photo and dad is cute too :) I love the eyes on both. You''ve captured them well and the light is perfect ! = 10', '2003-02-03 00:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
