(205572, 11916, 51167, '<td valign="top">This is a very great photo of the horse.  When the picture first loaded up I thought that the top part of the photo is a little wasted space.  I think you should crop closer to the horse.  The color on him is great.</td>', 'This is a very great photo of the horse.  When the picture first loaded up I thought that the top part of the photo is a little wasted space.  I think you should crop closer to the horse.  The color on him is great.', '2003-02-03 01:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
