(205597, 12049, 92, '<td valign="top">Beautiful ! The lighting is wonderful !!!!! 10</td>', 'Beautiful ! The lighting is wonderful !!!!! 10', '2003-02-03 01:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(205599, 11791, 92, '<td valign="top">So precious !!!!!!</td>', 'So precious !!!!!!', '2003-02-03 01:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(205606, 11715, 51167, '<td valign="top">This makes an awesome panoramic.  You see what it look like to you if you cropped it right below the horses cheeks to get rid of the mans arms.  I love this shot like that.  Just thought I''d pass off an idea to see if you like it that way too.</td>', 'This makes an awesome panoramic.  You see what it look like to you if you cropped it right below the horses cheeks to get rid of the mans arms.  I love this shot like that.  Just thought I''d pass off an idea to see if you like it that way too.', '2003-02-03 01:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(205608, 11754, 5783, '<td valign="top">would be great if it was in focus</td>', 'would be great if it was in focus', '2003-02-03 01:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(205610, 11826, 51167, '<td valign="top">The angle you shoot this at is perfect.  He''s a beaut.  My critique on it would be to have a slightly bigger DOF or focus on his eye.  It looks like the camera was confused and focused right between his eye and nose.   I think it would be perfect if that was done.  These shots are hard to take, my parents cats always move.</td>', 'The angle you shoot this at is perfect.  He''s a beaut.  My critique on it would be to have a slightly bigger DOF or focus on his eye.  It looks like the camera was confused and focused right between his eye and nose.   I think it would be perfect if that was done.  These shots are hard to take, my parents cats always move.', '2003-02-03 01:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(205611, 12046, 92, '<td valign="top">Wonderful !!!!!!</td>', 'Wonderful !!!!!!', '2003-02-03 01:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(205615, 12050, 51167, '<td valign="top">cute, cute cat.  Dang his pupils are dialated big time.</td>', 'cute, cute cat.  Dang his pupils are dialated big time.', '2003-02-03 01:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(205616, 11767, 6418, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, and is a beautiful photo!  The smoke is putting something into the space.  I like it!</td>', 'Nice lighting, and is a beautiful photo!  The smoke is putting something into the space.  I like it!', '2003-02-03 01:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(205617, 11912, 6202, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept.</td>', 'Interesting concept.', '2003-02-03 01:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(205618, 11695, 51167, '<td valign="top">great shot.  I like the space above his head because it gives a sense that he''s looking at something.  Good composition.</td>', 'great shot.  I like the space above his head because it gives a sense that he''s looking at something.  Good composition.', '2003-02-03 01:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(205620, 12005, 6418, '<td valign="top">Very cute!  I hope I can take a photo of my kids like this in the future!</td>', 'Very cute!  I hope I can take a photo of my kids like this in the future!', '2003-02-03 01:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(205621, 11847, 6418, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Classic!!</td>', 'Great shot! Classic!!', '2003-02-03 01:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
