(205624, 11731, 6405, '<td valign="top">Photos should be taken during the chalege, this one looks like march or april photo./..</td>', 'Photos should be taken during the chalege, this one looks like march or april photo./..', '2003-02-03 01:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(205625, 11714, 92, '<td valign="top">This is really nicely done and so cute !</td>', 'This is really nicely done and so cute !', '2003-02-03 01:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(205626, 12017, 6328, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait.  Everything in this photo leads me right back to this child''s eye''s and smile.  Nicely done.  The red tunnel and blue sweater/top complement each other, and I just love seeing one "flash" in the child''s eye which is the normal, compared to the usual two or three that you sometimes see in most professional sittings.  Nice sharp photo, sharp colors, very appealing.</td>', 'Very nice portrait.  Everything in this photo leads me right back to this child''s eye''s and smile.  Nicely done.  The red tunnel and blue sweater/top complement each other, and I just love seeing one "flash" in the child''s eye which is the normal, compared to the usual two or three that you sometimes see in most professional sittings.  Nice sharp photo, sharp colors, very appealing.', '2003-02-03 01:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(205627, 11759, 4767, '<td valign="top">Ducks quack.  Geese honk.  THESE birds should honk, eh?</td>', 'Ducks quack.  Geese honk.  THESE birds should honk, eh?', '2003-02-03 01:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(205628, 12049, 6328, '<td valign="top">Hope the child didn''t get hurt when he fell from heaven.  Beautiful picture, nice composition, sleeping so peacefully, the black background fits this photograph perfectfully.  It does seem that the top feathers look a bit out of focus? or are thus just ruffled a bit?</td>', 'Hope the child didn''t get hurt when he fell from heaven.  Beautiful picture, nice composition, sleeping so peacefully, the black background fits this photograph perfectfully.  It does seem that the top feathers look a bit out of focus? or are thus just ruffled a bit?', '2003-02-03 01:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(205634, 11755, 4767, '<td valign="top">Got Cattitude?</td>', 'Got Cattitude?', '2003-02-03 01:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(205635, 11858, 6328, '<td valign="top">The flower looks beautiful against the black background.  The macro and focus are both good.  Lovely colors from the black centre to the green, orange and all the way out to the yellow and the green stem</td>', 'The flower looks beautiful against the black background.  The macro and focus are both good.  Lovely colors from the black centre to the green, orange and all the way out to the yellow and the green stem', '2003-02-03 01:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(205637, 11971, 6328, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing photograph.  I like the way you''ve captured the white of the cat''s paws, the white chest, the white hair in the ear, through your lighting technique.  The shadow on the cloth is interesting.  Very sharp photo and you make it stand out by focusing the subject on the left.</td>', 'Very intriguing photograph.  I like the way you''ve captured the white of the cat''s paws, the white chest, the white hair in the ear, through your lighting technique.  The shadow on the cloth is interesting.  Very sharp photo and you make it stand out by focusing the subject on the left.', '2003-02-03 02:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(205641, 11774, 6328, '<td valign="top">Cute photograph, with what seems to be a great mood, but the photo seems to be out of focus.  Don''t know if it''s just me. . . or not?</td>', 'Cute photograph, with what seems to be a great mood, but the photo seems to be out of focus.  Don''t know if it''s just me. . . or not?', '2003-02-03 02:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(205644, 11678, 6328, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait of child and cat.  Lighting is soft and really makes a difference.  The eyes of both the girl and the cat focus right on the person looking at the photo and hold your attention.  Unfortunately, the picture on the wall in the background is distracting, but other than that, nice overall photo.</td>', 'Nice portrait of child and cat.  Lighting is soft and really makes a difference.  The eyes of both the girl and the cat focus right on the person looking at the photo and hold your attention.  Unfortunately, the picture on the wall in the background is distracting, but other than that, nice overall photo.', '2003-02-03 02:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(205646, 11876, 6418, '<td valign="top">Really a nice picture!  Makes me want to have a dog!!</td>', 'Really a nice picture!  Makes me want to have a dog!!', '2003-02-03 02:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(205649, 11995, 6418, '<td valign="top">Very a sweet shot, and is classic!</td>', 'Very a sweet shot, and is classic!', '2003-02-03 02:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(205650, 12003, 6328, '<td valign="top">My eyes focused on the soft white petals of the Orchid and then were led to the red and yellow. . . and then unfortunately to the background of the trees and branches.  And excellent photograph, but I think the background got too busy.   The Orchid is is very sharp focus and the colors are bright and makes the flower something beautiful to look at.</td>', 'My eyes focused on the soft white petals of the Orchid and then were led to the red and yellow. . . and then unfortunately to the background of the trees and branches.  And excellent photograph, but I think the background got too busy.   The Orchid is is very sharp focus and the colors are bright and makes the flower something beautiful to look at.', '2003-02-03 02:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(205651, 11706, 3273, '<td valign="top">Nice enough composition but I think that the lighting is a little harsh (as evidenced by the strong shadow on the wall).</td>', 'Nice enough composition but I think that the lighting is a little harsh (as evidenced by the strong shadow on the wall).', '2003-02-03 02:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(205652, 11897, 1829, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colour and lighting.  The water adds a nice touch to your image.  I really like the composition as well.  Beautiful, stunning work.  Well done and GL.</td>', 'Beautiful colour and lighting.  The water adds a nice touch to your image.  I really like the composition as well.  Beautiful, stunning work.  Well done and GL.', '2003-02-03 02:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(205656, 11922, 1829, '<td valign="top">Excellent vibrant colours of the hibiscus flower.  We have them growing all over the place where I''m from.  Excellent composition and clarity.  GL</td>', 'Excellent vibrant colours of the hibiscus flower.  We have them growing all over the place where I''m from.  Excellent composition and clarity.  GL', '2003-02-03 02:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
