(205960, 11709, 1185, '<td valign="top">A little too dark to make out enough detail on the dog. More DOF on the background would have helped too. Cute dog though.</td>', 'A little too dark to make out enough detail on the dog. More DOF on the background would have helped too. Cute dog though.', '2003-02-03 10:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
