(206094, 11861, 6328, '<td valign="top">my eyes are attracted immediately to the flowers and stay there.  You''ve captured my attention with the sharpness of your photo.  The color is great, but I wonder what''s happening to the petal on the far right?  it seems to be going out of focus a bit?  The soft lighting seems perfect and the depth of field is great, keeping the flowers warm and out front.</td>', 'my eyes are attracted immediately to the flowers and stay there.  You''ve captured my attention with the sharpness of your photo.  The color is great, but I wonder what''s happening to the petal on the far right?  it seems to be going out of focus a bit?  The soft lighting seems perfect and the depth of field is great, keeping the flowers warm and out front.', '2003-02-03 12:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
