(206103, 12027, 5044, '<td valign="top">Contrast is a little too much. You can''t see much detail in the dog. I also find the background very busy.</td>', 'Contrast is a little too much. You can''t see much detail in the dog. I also find the background very busy.', '2003-02-03 12:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(206104, 12018, 6328, '<td valign="top">I like the way you''ve used the rule of 3rds here.  It make your photo stand out most vividly!  It''s an excellent photograph with a professional look to it.  The color is outstanding and really holds a person''s attention.  Your background color suits the pear to a T.  I like the way the lighting creates the shadow on the right side of the fruit.  Wonder if there would have been any way to get rid of that crease in the cloth on the right side?  It''s just a bit distracting.</td>', 'I like the way you''ve used the rule of 3rds here.  It make your photo stand out most vividly!  It''s an excellent photograph with a professional look to it.  The color is outstanding and really holds a person''s attention.  Your background color suits the pear to a T.  I like the way the lighting creates the shadow on the right side of the fruit.  Wonder if there would have been any way to get rid of that crease in the cloth on the right side?  It''s just a bit distracting.', '2003-02-03 12:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(206105, 11839, 6155, '<td valign="top">like the interpratation, also the wave effect in the water..9</td>', 'like the interpratation, also the wave effect in the water..9', '2003-02-03 12:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(206106, 12047, 5044, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I love the expression on his face. The screen adds a nice texture to this BW shot. If the screen had not been damaged, it would have looked like an oil painting on a textured canvas.</td>', 'Nice shot. I love the expression on his face. The screen adds a nice texture to this BW shot. If the screen had not been damaged, it would have looked like an oil painting on a textured canvas.', '2003-02-03 12:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(206107, 11755, 6328, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I''m not going to get near this cat!  Very lovely black and white photo.  The eye grabs my attention and just keeps it.  Very sharp focus and the composition is excellent and undistracting!  Great lighting.  (I''d like to know how you did it) The color texture is excellent even though i call it a b&amp;w.</td>', 'Wow!  I''m not going to get near this cat!  Very lovely black and white photo.  The eye grabs my attention and just keeps it.  Very sharp focus and the composition is excellent and undistracting!  Great lighting.  (I''d like to know how you did it) The color texture is excellent even though i call it a b&w.', '2003-02-03 12:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(206110, 11943, 4517, '<td valign="top">seen better days</td>', 'seen better days', '2003-02-03 12:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
