(206274, 11754, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Good<br/>Technical: Can''t quite tell the filtering you''ve used, but it looks slightly strange.  It looks like you''ve used sharpening and then smoothing?  Border may have looked stronger with the red line black, making it twice as thick.<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: Excellent idea and shot, but post-processing seems a little overdone.  6</td>', 'Composition: GoodTechnical: Can''t quite tell the filtering you''ve used, but it looks slightly strange.  It looks like you''ve used sharpening and then smoothing?  Border may have looked stronger with the red line black, making it twice as thick.Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: Excellent idea and shot, but post-processing seems a little overdone.  6', '2003-02-03 14:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(206275, 11959, 6450, '<td valign="top">What a different picture, i really dont like picures of people.</td>', 'What a different picture, i really dont like picures of people.', '2003-02-03 14:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(206277, 11711, 6450, '<td valign="top">Good pic.</td>', 'Good pic.', '2003-02-03 14:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(206278, 11791, 51167, '<td valign="top">I love this.  What a cute kitten.  I love the lighing on this.  I hope you don''t get tons of comments about the overexposed light.  I think it is great, your composition and DOF are perfect.</td>', 'I love this.  What a cute kitten.  I love the lighing on this.  I hope you don''t get tons of comments about the overexposed light.  I think it is great, your composition and DOF are perfect.', '2003-02-03 14:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(206279, 11876, 6450, '<td valign="top">Good picture, very creative.</td>', 'Good picture, very creative.', '2003-02-03 14:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(206280, 11942, 6450, '<td valign="top">Good picture, very creative.</td>', 'Good picture, very creative.', '2003-02-03 14:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(206281, 12024, 51167, '<td valign="top">I love your composition, I just wish the whole photo was super sharp.  I love his cute little nose.</td>', 'I love your composition, I just wish the whole photo was super sharp.  I love his cute little nose.', '2003-02-03 14:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(206282, 11959, 4536, '<td valign="top">Great composition. I find the lighting a bit harsh and the shadow distracting. Looks like an on-camera flash shot. Another light or two stragically placed would have helped produce a more pleasing shot with less harsh shadows. good title.</td>', 'Great composition. I find the lighting a bit harsh and the shadow distracting. Looks like an on-camera flash shot. Another light or two stragically placed would have helped produce a more pleasing shot with less harsh shadows. good title.', '2003-02-03 14:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(206283, 11753, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Excellent<br/>Technical: Fantastic DOF apart from bottom part of the subject is slightly out of focus.  White border is different width top/bottom compared with left/right.<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: Good take on the challenge.  8</td>', 'Composition: ExcellentTechnical: Fantastic DOF apart from bottom part of the subject is slightly out of focus.  White border is different width top/bottom compared with left/right.Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: Good take on the challenge.  8', '2003-02-03 14:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(206284, 12003, 6450, '<td valign="top">Good picture, very creative.</td>', 'Good picture, very creative.', '2003-02-03 14:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(206285, 11727, 1143, '<td valign="top">This would work better in next weeks'' members challenge probably. I have to give it a 9 instead of a 10 just because I don''t really think of powerlines as being in the top ranks of overdone photography subjects. Very cool photo!</td>', 'This would work better in next weeks'' members challenge probably. I have to give it a 9 instead of a 10 just because I don''t really think of powerlines as being in the top ranks of overdone photography subjects. Very cool photo!', '2003-02-03 14:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(206288, 11710, 5399, '<td valign="top">nice job!  i like the way the pixels have separated and create texture in the caboose it gives it a feeling of antiquity! good job</td>', 'nice job!  i like the way the pixels have separated and create texture in the caboose it gives it a feeling of antiquity! good job', '2003-02-03 14:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(206289, 11916, 1143, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot. It has that old photo feel to it. I like how the bg is so desaturated. Great choice of an overdone subject IMO. I''m on the fence about giving it a 10 just because I think the nose is too close to the edge of the frame. Great exposure too.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot. It has that old photo feel to it. I like how the bg is so desaturated. Great choice of an overdone subject IMO. I''m on the fence about giving it a 10 just because I think the nose is too close to the edge of the frame. Great exposure too.', '2003-02-03 14:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(206290, 11818, 5399, '<td valign="top">puppy looks out of it!</td>', 'puppy looks out of it!', '2003-02-03 14:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(206291, 11723, 51167, '<td valign="top">this is a great night shot.  I think it would look a little better if you cropped out the border.  You can tell that the photo was rotated about 1 degree CCW, if you want a border crop it out and add one back that is all level. For the photo I give you a 7</td>', 'this is a great night shot.  I think it would look a little better if you cropped out the border.  You can tell that the photo was rotated about 1 degree CCW, if you want a border crop it out and add one back that is all level. For the photo I give you a 7', '2003-02-03 14:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(206293, 11862, 1143, '<td valign="top">Yet another shot that might work better in the perspective challenge. I love the perspective here. Could maybe give a tad more room on the left of the frame. Lighting also seems a little too dark or underexposed. 8</td>', 'Yet another shot that might work better in the perspective challenge. I love the perspective here. Could maybe give a tad more room on the left of the frame. Lighting also seems a little too dark or underexposed. 8', '2003-02-03 14:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(206294, 11712, 5399, '<td valign="top">very bright and exciting!  l particularly respond to the lines in the light! good job!</td>', 'very bright and exciting!  l particularly respond to the lines in the light! good job!', '2003-02-03 14:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(206296, 11703, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Excellent choice of shape.  The number of boats you have included seems to confuse the picture.  I think I might prefer it slightly more open (not quite sure how).<br/>Technical: Colours and lack of border are good.  I guess the shot was hand-held making deep DOF difficult, but I think crisper focus would have benefited the end result.<br/>Meets challenge: Holiday photo?<br/>Overall impression: Good idea but let down slightly by aesthetics for me personally.  6</td>', 'Composition: Excellent choice of shape.  The number of boats you have included seems to confuse the picture.  I think I might prefer it slightly more open (not quite sure how).Technical: Colours and lack of border are good.  I guess the shot was hand-held making deep DOF difficult, but I think crisper focus would have benefited the end result.Meets challenge: Holiday photo?Overall impression: Good idea but let down slightly by aesthetics for me personally.  6', '2003-02-03 14:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(206299, 11706, 6450, '<td valign="top">Good picture, very creative.</td>', 'Good picture, very creative.', '2003-02-03 14:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(206300, 11850, 1143, '<td valign="top">Yup. Very cliche. Well done. I like the water droplets. Not crazy about the grey surrounding it. I think it would work better with a tad more lighting - esp in the top right. 8</td>', 'Yup. Very cliche. Well done. I like the water droplets. Not crazy about the grey surrounding it. I think it would work better with a tad more lighting - esp in the top right. 8', '2003-02-03 14:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(206301, 11857, 6450, '<td valign="top">Good picture, very creative.I think if the picture was closer you would have a better feel.</td>', 'Good picture, very creative.I think if the picture was closer you would have a better feel.', '2003-02-03 14:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(206302, 11780, 1143, '<td valign="top">This isn''t in my list of the most overdone shots, but it''s definitely a good one. Excellent focus. Good composition. Nice job dealing w/ the harsh lighting. 8</td>', 'This isn''t in my list of the most overdone shots, but it''s definitely a good one. Excellent focus. Good composition. Nice job dealing w/ the harsh lighting. 8', '2003-02-03 14:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(206304, 12018, 6450, '<td valign="top">Good picture, very creative and i like the elaboratedetail with the color and the contour of the subject.</td>', 'Good picture, very creative and i like the elaboratedetail with the color and the contour of the subject.', '2003-02-03 14:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(206305, 11886, 1143, '<td valign="top">My favorite cat photo. Great dof and focus. I love the blue and orange together. Excellent exposure!! So many have really hot spots, but you don''t even with the white fur. Very nice composition with the placement of the eye.</td>', 'My favorite cat photo. Great dof and focus. I love the blue and orange together. Excellent exposure!! So many have really hot spots, but you don''t even with the white fur. Very nice composition with the placement of the eye.', '2003-02-03 14:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(206307, 11981, 6450, '<td valign="top">Good picture, very creative but id rather see an orioles fan, haha just kidding,nice photo.</td>', 'Good picture, very creative but id rather see an orioles fan, haha just kidding,nice photo.', '2003-02-03 14:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(206309, 11912, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition:  Flowers are excellent.  Would have preferred slightly more cat?!  Having a cat myself, I appreciate the problems!<br/>Technical: Nice use of colour and contrast.  Bold decision to use the high sharpening, but it really suits the pic.  Might have thickened the white border slightly and got rid of the very thin black border.<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: Lovely photo lacking only in animal cooperation!  7</td>', 'Composition:  Flowers are excellent.  Would have preferred slightly more cat?!  Having a cat myself, I appreciate the problems!Technical: Nice use of colour and contrast.  Bold decision to use the high sharpening, but it really suits the pic.  Might have thickened the white border slightly and got rid of the very thin black border.Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: Lovely photo lacking only in animal cooperation!  7', '2003-02-03 14:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(206310, 11878, 6450, '<td valign="top">Good picture, very creative.</td>', 'Good picture, very creative.', '2003-02-03 14:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(206311, 12031, 6450, '<td valign="top">Good picture, very creative.</td>', 'Good picture, very creative.', '2003-02-03 14:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(206312, 11702, 5399, '<td valign="top">good concept!  because of the lack of available light, it caused a lot of grain. nice job!</td>', 'good concept!  because of the lack of available light, it caused a lot of grain. nice job!', '2003-02-03 14:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(206313, 11753, 1143, '<td valign="top">My idea of this challenge was to take an overdone shot and do it yourself just to see how hard it really is. This is a different take on the topic, but it''s still a good idea. I like the dof. I might prefer a little more light, but the darkness does add to the somber feel. 8</td>', 'My idea of this challenge was to take an overdone shot and do it yourself just to see how hard it really is. This is a different take on the topic, but it''s still a good idea. I like the dof. I might prefer a little more light, but the darkness does add to the somber feel. 8', '2003-02-03 14:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(206316, 11915, 6450, '<td valign="top">Good picture, very creative.</td>', 'Good picture, very creative.', '2003-02-03 14:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(206318, 11888, 1143, '<td valign="top">I love this flower. It''s a perfect subject. I think I might like to see a little more stem as it seems to be cropped a little too close on the bottom. Good lighting - almost got some hot spots, but it isn''t bad. Yellow on black is a great choice. 8</td>', 'I love this flower. It''s a perfect subject. I think I might like to see a little more stem as it seems to be cropped a little too close on the bottom. Good lighting - almost got some hot spots, but it isn''t bad. Yellow on black is a great choice. 8', '2003-02-03 14:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(206323, 11854, 6450, '<td valign="top">Good picture, very creative.v gb gh</td>', 'Good picture, very creative.v gb gh', '2003-02-03 14:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(206324, 11764, 5399, '<td valign="top">nice job! i like the way the color all works together in this image!</td>', 'nice job! i like the way the color all works together in this image!', '2003-02-03 14:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(206325, 11800, 6450, '<td valign="top">Good picture, very creative.Nice title.</td>', 'Good picture, very creative.Nice title.', '2003-02-03 14:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(206329, 11788, 6450, '<td valign="top">Good picture, very creative.</td>', 'Good picture, very creative.', '2003-02-03 14:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(206330, 11736, 5399, '<td valign="top">this is one of my favorites!  i like the high contrast of the black against the white! good job!</td>', 'this is one of my favorites!  i like the high contrast of the black against the white! good job!', '2003-02-03 14:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(206331, 11978, 1143, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. Great exposure and lighting. Love the color combination. Very nice composition but the center of the flower is almost too centered IMO. Nice use of dof.  9</td>', 'This is beautiful. Great exposure and lighting. Love the color combination. Very nice composition but the center of the flower is almost too centered IMO. Nice use of dof.  9', '2003-02-03 14:32:44.000000', NULL, 1);
