(206333, 11808, 6450, '<td valign="top">Good picture, very creative.Cute.</td>', 'Good picture, very creative.Cute.', '2003-02-03 14:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(206334, 11734, 5399, '<td valign="top">i like the way you used the stairs to frame the brick wall!   i also like the way the light lights the way and darkens the stairway! good job!</td>', 'i like the way you used the stairs to frame the brick wall!   i also like the way the light lights the way and darkens the stairway! good job!', '2003-02-03 14:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(206335, 11714, 6450, '<td valign="top">Good picture, very creative.</td>', 'Good picture, very creative.', '2003-02-03 14:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(206337, 11717, 6450, '<td valign="top">I think the cat is real, how could someone take a picture of a real cat,Good picture, very creative.</td>', 'I think the cat is real, how could someone take a picture of a real cat,Good picture, very creative.', '2003-02-03 14:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(206338, 11908, 1143, '<td valign="top">Great dof. Love the colors. I like the lighting - how it fades as you go into the shot. Almost looks like it was sharpened too much. On my monitor the front petals dont seem as smooth as they should for some reason.  It might also work as a vertical shot without all the space on the left and some off the top. 8</td>', 'Great dof. Love the colors. I like the lighting - how it fades as you go into the shot. Almost looks like it was sharpened too much. On my monitor the front petals dont seem as smooth as they should for some reason.  It might also work as a vertical shot without all the space on the left and some off the top. 8', '2003-02-03 14:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(206339, 11701, 5399, '<td valign="top">i  like the composition of the phone and the way you took something with a very hard surface and made it appear soft!   the sepia tone also makes a new phone look very old.   good job!</td>', 'i  like the composition of the phone and the way you took something with a very hard surface and made it appear soft!   the sepia tone also makes a new phone look very old.   good job!', '2003-02-03 14:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(206340, 11994, 6450, '<td valign="top">Good picture, very creative.kinda disgusting.</td>', 'Good picture, very creative.kinda disgusting.', '2003-02-03 14:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(206341, 11759, 6450, '<td valign="top">Good picture, very creative.</td>', 'Good picture, very creative.', '2003-02-03 14:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(206342, 11865, 1143, '<td valign="top">Yup. That''s cliche! The refraction in the droplet is awesome! If you have enough resolution I''d try a closer crop of just that (for a variation) since it''s so cool. Good, even lighting. Really neat that the droplet is right in the middle of a square too. 8</td>', 'Yup. That''s cliche! The refraction in the droplet is awesome! If you have enough resolution I''d try a closer crop of just that (for a variation) since it''s so cool. Good, even lighting. Really neat that the droplet is right in the middle of a square too. 8', '2003-02-03 14:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(206343, 11895, 6450, '<td valign="top">Good picture, very creative.</td>', 'Good picture, very creative.', '2003-02-03 14:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(206344, 11695, 6450, '<td valign="top">Good picture, very creative.</td>', 'Good picture, very creative.', '2003-02-03 14:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(206345, 11694, 5364, '<td valign="top">Pointillism as a justification for a noisy picture - I like it.</td>', 'Pointillism as a justification for a noisy picture - I like it.', '2003-02-03 14:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(206347, 11866, 6450, '<td valign="top">Good picture, very creative.i really like dogs.</td>', 'Good picture, very creative.i really like dogs.', '2003-02-03 14:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(206348, 11855, 1143, '<td valign="top">Very very nice. Perfect crop. The leaves moving out to the edge of the frame are great. Excellent lighting. I don''t think you need the water - is that what all the white spots are? Petals are a tad hot, but everything else is so great that you get a 10 anyway.</td>', 'Very very nice. Perfect crop. The leaves moving out to the edge of the frame are great. Excellent lighting. I don''t think you need the water - is that what all the white spots are? Petals are a tad hot, but everything else is so great that you get a 10 anyway.', '2003-02-03 14:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(206350, 11941, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice maco, good color.</td>', 'Nice maco, good color.', '2003-02-03 14:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(206351, 11791, 6450, '<td valign="top">goodswxdwse</td>', 'goodswxdwse', '2003-02-03 14:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(206353, 11991, 1143, '<td valign="top">hahaha! What a great capture! You can just sense the jealousy of that bird next to him. Harsh lighting conditions. The feathers are hot in places. Also not quite as cliche as some of the other subjects  9</td>', 'hahaha! What a great capture! You can just sense the jealousy of that bird next to him. Harsh lighting conditions. The feathers are hot in places. Also not quite as cliche as some of the other subjects  9', '2003-02-03 14:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(206354, 11797, 327, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful, lower left antenna could be cropped out.</td>', 'Very beautiful, lower left antenna could be cropped out.', '2003-02-03 14:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(206355, 11699, 6450, '<td valign="top">i really dont like little dogs they bite my ankles.</td>', 'i really dont like little dogs they bite my ankles.', '2003-02-03 14:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
