(206363, 11879, 327, '<td valign="top">Just a good good marco.........well done.</td>', 'Just a good good marco.........well done.', '2003-02-03 14:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(206364, 11949, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is a very unique window sill.  I love it.  Where is this home?.  I love the setting in the window sill.  It''s so natural and earthy.  This is a fantastic composition and I love the diffference from inside to outside.  Very real and lifelike.  Great photo well executed.  This should be right at the top.</td>', 'This is a very unique window sill.  I love it.  Where is this home?.  I love the setting in the window sill.  It''s so natural and earthy.  This is a fantastic composition and I love the diffference from inside to outside.  Very real and lifelike.  Great photo well executed.  This should be right at the top.', '2003-02-03 14:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(206365, 11923, 1143, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors! Excellent lighting. I like the composition tho I think I''d rather see a perspective from a bit lower or a bit higher instead of right from the side. Perfect exposure. 10</td>', 'Beautiful colors! Excellent lighting. I like the composition tho I think I''d rather see a perspective from a bit lower or a bit higher instead of right from the side. Perfect exposure. 10', '2003-02-03 14:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(206367, 11711, 5399, '<td valign="top">i like the line work in this image. the line really keeps my eye moving. good job!</td>', 'i like the line work in this image. the line really keeps my eye moving. good job!', '2003-02-03 14:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(206368, 11754, 327, '<td valign="top">Is this dog a saint? My gosh he loves you so much and is so patient...what a great dog. Cute shot!!</td>', 'Is this dog a saint? My gosh he loves you so much and is so patient...what a great dog. Cute shot!!', '2003-02-03 14:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(206369, 11692, 5399, '<td valign="top">i like the detail in the water droplets!</td>', 'i like the detail in the water droplets!', '2003-02-03 14:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(206370, 12019, 1143, '<td valign="top">Very cliche. I like how it fades from view. It''s almost too close to the edges of the frame and I don''t like the bright reflections on the right edge of the petal. Very beautiful tho. 9</td>', 'Very cliche. I like how it fades from view. It''s almost too close to the edges of the frame and I don''t like the bright reflections on the right edge of the petal. Very beautiful tho. 9', '2003-02-03 14:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(206371, 11714, 327, '<td valign="top">Too darling for words.....my gosh. What a great/cute capture.</td>', 'Too darling for words.....my gosh. What a great/cute capture.', '2003-02-03 14:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(206373, 11995, 327, '<td valign="top">Sweet dog and darling baby.</td>', 'Sweet dog and darling baby.', '2003-02-03 14:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(206374, 11942, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty, good blue.</td>', 'Pretty, good blue.', '2003-02-03 14:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(206375, 11703, 5399, '<td valign="top">nice composition. the zig-zag line work in the boats move the eye nicely through the photo!</td>', 'nice composition. the zig-zag line work in the boats move the eye nicely through the photo!', '2003-02-03 14:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(206377, 11821, 327, '<td valign="top">Just a great shot.....I love the color of true red, clean crisp shot.</td>', 'Just a great shot.....I love the color of true red, clean crisp shot.', '2003-02-03 14:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(206378, 11821, 5399, '<td valign="top">excellent clarity and advertisment!</td>', 'excellent clarity and advertisment!', '2003-02-03 14:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(206379, 11930, 4648, '<td valign="top">I love his expression.  Give the kid an "A" for acting.  This is a fantastic macro.  I love the skin texture.  What we''d give to have that skin texture again.  A little shadow from the nose, but not bad.  Love how you cropped it.  This is just fantastic.  Maybe in color?  Still ranks high.</td>', 'I love his expression.  Give the kid an "A" for acting.  This is a fantastic macro.  I love the skin texture.  What we''d give to have that skin texture again.  A little shadow from the nose, but not bad.  Love how you cropped it.  This is just fantastic.  Maybe in color?  Still ranks high.', '2003-02-03 14:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(206380, 11967, 4967, '<td valign="top">You included shoetie in the title, but you can''t actually see her tying her shoes, plus this isn''t exactly a candid as she is looking directly at the camera and obviously knows your there.  I prolly wouldn''t have used ths title.  It bothers me that her hands are cut off at the wrists and the fact that your lighting is uneven, there must be a window somewhere to the left?!  The colors are good, and I think the focus is good, but overall not a very interesting photo.</td>', 'You included shoetie in the title, but you can''t actually see her tying her shoes, plus this isn''t exactly a candid as she is looking directly at the camera and obviously knows your there.  I prolly wouldn''t have used ths title.  It bothers me that her hands are cut off at the wrists and the fact that your lighting is uneven, there must be a window somewhere to the left?!  The colors are good, and I think the focus is good, but overall not a very interesting photo.', '2003-02-03 14:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(206381, 11749, 327, '<td valign="top">Sweetheart face. Look at the eyelashes!!</td>', 'Sweetheart face. Look at the eyelashes!!', '2003-02-03 14:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(206382, 11958, 5399, '<td valign="top">nice detail.</td>', 'nice detail.', '2003-02-03 14:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
