(206729, 11945, 6328, '<td valign="top">absolutely beautiful!  Excellent macro  with a pleasant feel to it and the background of blue is not distracting, bringing the eyes back to the centre of the flower, showing the red and green of the filament.  Excellent use of the rule of 3rds also.  The eyes focus on the flower and stay there. Very elegant image.</td>', 'absolutely beautiful!  Excellent macro  with a pleasant feel to it and the background of blue is not distracting, bringing the eyes back to the centre of the flower, showing the red and green of the filament.  Excellent use of the rule of 3rds also.  The eyes focus on the flower and stay there. Very elegant image.', '2003-02-03 19:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(206730, 11890, 6349, '<td valign="top">very beautiful photo.  One of 4 of my 10''s this week.  Composition is excellent.  The slow shutter speed is excellent in catching the blurred motion of the water in the stream.  I like the blue tone.  Was this done in duotone or tritone?</td>', 'very beautiful photo.  One of 4 of my 10''s this week.  Composition is excellent.  The slow shutter speed is excellent in catching the blurred motion of the water in the stream.  I like the blue tone.  Was this done in duotone or tritone?', '2003-02-03 19:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(206731, 11945, 4411, '<td valign="top">Lovely focus &amp; composition. Great job losing the background.</td>', 'Lovely focus & composition. Great job losing the background.', '2003-02-03 19:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(206732, 11983, 3575, '<td valign="top">Very nice sunset. I love the sun just behind the tree branches. May be cliche'' but I never get tired of looking at them.</td>', 'Very nice sunset. I love the sun just behind the tree branches. May be cliche'' but I never get tired of looking at them.', '2003-02-03 19:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(206733, 11697, 6349, '<td valign="top">Splendid shot!  One of 4 of my 10''s this week.  I love the composition -- the way the straightness of the stick comes nicely out of the bottom of the curved line of rocks.  I like that the boy is looking down at something on the muddy ground (for small wildlife perhaps) and not at you or out at the water as would be the case in a typical shot.  The one thing I don''t like is the color you chose for what I assume was a duotone process.  However, I can''t decide on what color would have been better.  Perhaps something a little less red but still similar.  Maybe a tritone.  I would play with some variations.  It is, of course, still quite excellent how it is and one of my favorites.  I have a feeling that you''ll be receiving a ribbon this week.</td>', 'Splendid shot!  One of 4 of my 10''s this week.  I love the composition -- the way the straightness of the stick comes nicely out of the bottom of the curved line of rocks.  I like that the boy is looking down at something on the muddy ground (for small wildlife perhaps) and not at you or out at the water as would be the case in a typical shot.  The one thing I don''t like is the color you chose for what I assume was a duotone process.  However, I can''t decide on what color would have been better.  Perhaps something a little less red but still similar.  Maybe a tritone.  I would play with some variations.  It is, of course, still quite excellent how it is and one of my favorites.  I have a feeling that you''ll be receiving a ribbon this week.', '2003-02-03 19:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(206734, 12003, 3575, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. It''s so heard photo  a white flower without blowing it out but you succeeded.</td>', 'Beautiful. It''s so heard photo  a white flower without blowing it out but you succeeded.', '2003-02-03 19:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(206735, 11983, 6328, '<td valign="top">You/ve captured a very nice sunset with the sun behind the tree.  Nice colors on the waters and the sky.  I would like to have seen some beach or something.  It''s a nice sharp photo, but the sun is too bright for me and my eyes  want to wander down to the coolness of the water.</td>', 'You/ve captured a very nice sunset with the sun behind the tree.  Nice colors on the waters and the sky.  I would like to have seen some beach or something.  It''s a nice sharp photo, but the sun is too bright for me and my eyes  want to wander down to the coolness of the water.', '2003-02-03 19:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(206737, 11991, 6349, '<td valign="top">Awesome picture!  One of 4 of my 10''s this week.  The white and blue colors are excellent and the fact that you threw the bread up to the bird added tons to this picture.  The composition is awesome.  The only thing I would change, but I''m sure it isn''t possible at this point is the cut of wing of the gull in the background.  Nice job!</td>', 'Awesome picture!  One of 4 of my 10''s this week.  The white and blue colors are excellent and the fact that you threw the bread up to the bird added tons to this picture.  The composition is awesome.  The only thing I would change, but I''m sure it isn''t possible at this point is the cut of wing of the gull in the background.  Nice job!', '2003-02-03 19:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(206738, 11965, 3575, '<td valign="top">Waited too long to take the photo, did you? Just kidding. I wish it wasn''t quite so dark, I would like to see the whole flower.</td>', 'Waited too long to take the photo, did you? Just kidding. I wish it wasn''t quite so dark, I would like to see the whole flower.', '2003-02-03 19:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(206739, 12022, 6349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, very relaxing and contemplative.  THe DOF and lighting are perfect in my opinion.  I would crop slightly differently to rermove the small dark tree on the left and the cut off tree on the right.  Wonderful shot, one of 4 of my 10''s this week.</td>', 'Beautiful photo, very relaxing and contemplative.  THe DOF and lighting are perfect in my opinion.  I would crop slightly differently to rermove the small dark tree on the left and the cut off tree on the right.  Wonderful shot, one of 4 of my 10''s this week.', '2003-02-03 19:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(206740, 11842, 3575, '<td valign="top">I love the sepia tones. This is a really nice portrate. Good job.</td>', 'I love the sepia tones. This is a really nice portrate. Good job.', '2003-02-03 19:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(206744, 11722, 6349, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Very much.  Excellent composition and much more interesting than the multitude of bad cat shots in this challenge.  THis is my highest rated cat.  Nice work.  9</td>', 'I like this.  Very much.  Excellent composition and much more interesting than the multitude of bad cat shots in this challenge.  THis is my highest rated cat.  Nice work.  9', '2003-02-03 19:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
