(206746, 11863, 6328, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured the speed of the train really nicely, that blurred feature on the door and window is really nice.  The photo is sharp and is in focus, and the colors are bright, but I don''t understand the story that you''re trying to tell me.</td>', 'You''ve captured the speed of the train really nicely, that blurred feature on the door and window is really nice.  The photo is sharp and is in focus, and the colors are bright, but I don''t understand the story that you''re trying to tell me.', '2003-02-03 19:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
