(206757, 11927, 6349, '<td valign="top">My top dog this week!  I love the compostion.  It stood out from the rest in that the entire frame is filled with the dog colors and doesn''t have a distracting ill composed background or what I consider a ridiculously perfect set up with a sheet and lighting that usually renders an unnatural image of mans best friend.  The dog, of course, is very cure, and the tennis ball is excellent in the foreground.  I love how the wisps on the end of the tail seem to almost blend into the shredded part of the ball.  I would print this and frame it (if it was my dog)  Excellent job.   9</td>', 'My top dog this week!  I love the compostion.  It stood out from the rest in that the entire frame is filled with the dog colors and doesn''t have a distracting ill composed background or what I consider a ridiculously perfect set up with a sheet and lighting that usually renders an unnatural image of mans best friend.  The dog, of course, is very cure, and the tennis ball is excellent in the foreground.  I love how the wisps on the end of the tail seem to almost blend into the shredded part of the ball.  I would print this and frame it (if it was my dog)  Excellent job.   9', '2003-02-03 19:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
