(206773, 12046, 6349, '<td valign="top">My top cat this week!  I love the composition.  I would have liked to see more depth of field so that the frontal part of the nose was not quite so blurry.  I think you might have lost some definition in making the file size smaller or you cropped down from a larger image after lowering the resolution.  This is just my guess.  Still, wonderful photo. 9</td>', 'My top cat this week!  I love the composition.  I would have liked to see more depth of field so that the frontal part of the nose was not quite so blurry.  I think you might have lost some definition in making the file size smaller or you cropped down from a larger image after lowering the resolution.  This is just my guess.  Still, wonderful photo. 9', '2003-02-03 19:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
