(206782, 12032, 6349, '<td valign="top">My top rated sunset this week!  It may help that I am from NY, but even for other viewers, I think the statue of liberty and what it represents is a lot more powerful a silhoutee than pom trees, houses, and bushes.  I like that you got the bird in the photo as well and the cranes or whatever in the background give it a very interesting feel.  They make me think of strange mechanic giraffes and make me question the meaning of beauty and liberty in our great country.  I might have cropped out the upper parts of the sky and the water on the bottom to get rid of the lightest whites as well as give it a nice widescreen look.  Excellent job, 9.</td>', 'My top rated sunset this week!  It may help that I am from NY, but even for other viewers, I think the statue of liberty and what it represents is a lot more powerful a silhoutee than pom trees, houses, and bushes.  I like that you got the bird in the photo as well and the cranes or whatever in the background give it a very interesting feel.  They make me think of strange mechanic giraffes and make me question the meaning of beauty and liberty in our great country.  I might have cropped out the upper parts of the sky and the water on the bottom to get rid of the lightest whites as well as give it a nice widescreen look.  Excellent job, 9.', '2003-02-03 20:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
