(206791, 11727, 6349, '<td valign="top">cold, harsh colors and composition blending with a soothing cool tone make this photo one of my top choices this week.  The simplicstic elegance is enticing and contemplative to behold.  I would like to know where this is.  The only thing I would have changed is the shadow of the pole closest to you that isn''t visible.  I find it disturbing to the eye.  I would crop it out or have gone back at a time when the shadows were angled differently, perhaps to show more of the one from the first visible pole.  Excellent job, 8.</td>', 'cold, harsh colors and composition blending with a soothing cool tone make this photo one of my top choices this week.  The simplicstic elegance is enticing and contemplative to behold.  I would like to know where this is.  The only thing I would have changed is the shadow of the pole closest to you that isn''t visible.  I find it disturbing to the eye.  I would crop it out or have gone back at a time when the shadows were angled differently, perhaps to show more of the one from the first visible pole.  Excellent job, 8.', '2003-02-03 20:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(206792, 12021, 6480, '<td valign="top">good cliche.</td>', 'good cliche.', '2003-02-03 20:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(206793, 11933, 6349, '<td valign="top">I think I know who you are, since you posted in the forum about this, although suprisingly there were two of you that lived in the area.  I think this is a super photo for this challenge.  It made me laugh then smile.  the perspective is nice and makes you follow the trail of top hats into the solid blue night sky.  Did he see his shadow?  8</td>', 'I think I know who you are, since you posted in the forum about this, although suprisingly there were two of you that lived in the area.  I think this is a super photo for this challenge.  It made me laugh then smile.  the perspective is nice and makes you follow the trail of top hats into the solid blue night sky.  Did he see his shadow?  8', '2003-02-03 20:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(206796, 11755, 6349, '<td valign="top">I really liked this cat shot.  It is one of my favorites in the challenge.  I like the composition and the facial expression.  You''re choice of levels and contrast make it look like a pen and ink drawing.  Very artistic.  8</td>', 'I really liked this cat shot.  It is one of my favorites in the challenge.  I like the composition and the facial expression.  You''re choice of levels and contrast make it look like a pen and ink drawing.  Very artistic.  8', '2003-02-03 20:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(206799, 11915, 6349, '<td valign="top">Nice cat.  Nice colors, esp the green in the eyes and background.  Good DOF.  There seems to be a slightly blurry area on top of the outer corner of the left eye.  I would like to see less of the window reflections in the cats eyes, but this can be fixed later with some good spot editing.  8</td>', 'Nice cat.  Nice colors, esp the green in the eyes and background.  Good DOF.  There seems to be a slightly blurry area on top of the outer corner of the left eye.  I would like to see less of the window reflections in the cats eyes, but this can be fixed later with some good spot editing.  8', '2003-02-03 20:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(206803, 11976, 6349, '<td valign="top">This shot really caught my attention and kept it.  Very different from the rest.  I like the contrast, especially on the creases in the white shot.  I very nice shot.  My only possible suggestion is to get rid of the red border, I don''t think it''s needed and draws away from the firecracker.  8</td>', 'This shot really caught my attention and kept it.  Very different from the rest.  I like the contrast, especially on the creases in the white shot.  I very nice shot.  My only possible suggestion is to get rid of the red border, I don''t think it''s needed and draws away from the firecracker.  8', '2003-02-03 20:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(206805, 12031, 6480, '<td valign="top">good cliche</td>', 'good cliche', '2003-02-03 20:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(206806, 11957, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite flower picture this week (this was not an easy decision).  I like the composition, colors, and fact that there are a group of flowers and not just one set up under perfect conditions.  Excellent job.</td>', 'This is my favorite flower picture this week (this was not an easy decision).  I like the composition, colors, and fact that there are a group of flowers and not just one set up under perfect conditions.  Excellent job.', '2003-02-03 20:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(206808, 11997, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like the way the flowers appear to be floating over the background.  I don''t think there is enough contrast between the petals and the background though, also the flowers look a little weathered.</td>', 'I like the way the flowers appear to be floating over the background.  I don''t think there is enough contrast between the petals and the background though, also the flowers look a little weathered.', '2003-02-03 20:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(206809, 11791, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is the cutest cat shot this week.  I like the softness of it and the white light, which some people might disagree with.  I think it shows the contentment of the cat as he bathes in the sunlight.  Wonderful shot!</td>', 'This is the cutest cat shot this week.  I like the softness of it and the white light, which some people might disagree with.  I think it shows the contentment of the cat as he bathes in the sunlight.  Wonderful shot!', '2003-02-03 20:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(206811, 11932, 6349, '<td valign="top">This certainly is a cliche shot!  Of course, therefore, it is quite good.  Well exposed.  I think it would be interesting to crop this to a closeup of the top of the cactus only to the right border, it kind of looks like a man with a camera hanging around his neck.  lol.  nice job!</td>', 'This certainly is a cliche shot!  Of course, therefore, it is quite good.  Well exposed.  I think it would be interesting to crop this to a closeup of the top of the cactus only to the right border, it kind of looks like a man with a camera hanging around his neck.  lol.  nice job!', '2003-02-03 20:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(206812, 11966, 1647, '<td valign="top">Let''s see...  Exposure = great, Focus = super clear, Framing = wonderful, Border = fine, Facial expression of dog = perfect.  I hope this picture is already hanging on a wall somewhere because it certainly deserves to be.  Awesome shot with nothing wrong at all - 10.</td>', 'Let''s see...  Exposure = great, Focus = super clear, Framing = wonderful, Border = fine, Facial expression of dog = perfect.  I hope this picture is already hanging on a wall somewhere because it certainly deserves to be.  Awesome shot with nothing wrong at all - 10.', '2003-02-03 20:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(206813, 11854, 6349, '<td valign="top">One of the top dogs!  I like the choice of black and white3 for this shot and the feeling of him looking out the window.  This would look better with a few of the things easily removed with some spot editing after the contest is over, such as the things in the upper left background and the wire on the floor.  You captured a contemplative moment in a dogs world very well.</td>', 'One of the top dogs!  I like the choice of black and white3 for this shot and the feeling of him looking out the window.  This would look better with a few of the things easily removed with some spot editing after the contest is over, such as the things in the upper left background and the wire on the floor.  You captured a contemplative moment in a dogs world very well.', '2003-02-03 20:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(206815, 12002, 6328, '<td valign="top">Where does one start?  The black background is simple and creates and elegant image of the vase and flowers as does the mirrored table top?  The double image of the primrose in front is nicely photographed, although you leave a little image of something not quite cropped off at the bottom.  To actually capture the Stem of the flowers through the vase is an achievement of your lighting, and it is very professional.  Your composition in being slightly off left centre is great, and your color and focus are right on. . .  Your white and black framing is also creative!</td>', 'Where does one start?  The black background is simple and creates and elegant image of the vase and flowers as does the mirrored table top?  The double image of the primrose in front is nicely photographed, although you leave a little image of something not quite cropped off at the bottom.  To actually capture the Stem of the flowers through the vase is an achievement of your lighting, and it is very professional.  Your composition in being slightly off left centre is great, and your color and focus are right on. . .  Your white and black framing is also creative!', '2003-02-03 20:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(206816, 11930, 1647, '<td valign="top">That''s a lovely soft exposure - so much texture in the skin.  The lighting is wonderful and I really like your framing.  Great job</td>', 'That''s a lovely soft exposure - so much texture in the skin.  The lighting is wonderful and I really like your framing.  Great job', '2003-02-03 20:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(206819, 12020, 1647, '<td valign="top">Lighting and exposure are both good, however I''m not so sure about the chosen crop.  Perhaps you could have focused purely on the keypad, especially since there is flar on both "Page Down" and "[num] Lock".</td>', 'Lighting and exposure are both good, however I''m not so sure about the chosen crop.  Perhaps you could have focused purely on the keypad, especially since there is flar on both "Page Down" and "[num] Lock".', '2003-02-03 20:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(206820, 11742, 1647, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of artifacts in the petals - perhaps more light was needed for this shot?  The shallow depth of field works well to blur the background - keeps eyes on flowers well.</td>', 'There are a lot of artifacts in the petals - perhaps more light was needed for this shot?  The shallow depth of field works well to blur the background - keeps eyes on flowers well.', '2003-02-03 20:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(206822, 11876, 1647, '<td valign="top">Exposure and lighting look great here.  I think the shot could have been improved from a composition standpoint though - the black ears of the dog disappear into the black top, and the tree appears to come out of the persons head a little.  These are only minor things though - its still quite a good shot.  And the dog is looking directly at the camera, which is great.</td>', 'Exposure and lighting look great here.  I think the shot could have been improved from a composition standpoint though - the black ears of the dog disappear into the black top, and the tree appears to come out of the persons head a little.  These are only minor things though - its still quite a good shot.  And the dog is looking directly at the camera, which is great.', '2003-02-03 20:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(206823, 11731, 1647, '<td valign="top">The colour of the field is wonderful, and I really like the way the vines (?) roll over the landscape - very picturesque.  Well done on a classical landscape.</td>', 'The colour of the field is wonderful, and I really like the way the vines (?) roll over the landscape - very picturesque.  Well done on a classical landscape.', '2003-02-03 20:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
