(206879, 11903, 6328, '<td valign="top">lovey photo of Churchill.  The lighting is really nice, but plays mostly on his hind quarters and not much on his upper body, which makes his look a bit out of focus.  Not sure what the lighting is at Churchill''s head, but that and the wood in the fireplace is a mite distracting, leading the looker away from Churchill.  Anyway you could have changed your angle of the camera to do away with those those distractions?</td>', 'lovey photo of Churchill.  The lighting is really nice, but plays mostly on his hind quarters and not much on his upper body, which makes his look a bit out of focus.  Not sure what the lighting is at Churchill''s head, but that and the wood in the fireplace is a mite distracting, leading the looker away from Churchill.  Anyway you could have changed your angle of the camera to do away with those those distractions?', '2003-02-03 21:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
