(206941, 11891, 5677, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, but there is something about it that looks off.  It could be oversharpened, or maybe it''s the colors that are bothering me.  I can''t put my finger on it.</td>', 'I really like this shot, but there is something about it that looks off.  It could be oversharpened, or maybe it''s the colors that are bothering me.  I can''t put my finger on it.', '2003-02-03 22:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(206943, 11870, 2823, '<td valign="top">nice shades of blue and good focus.  a very peaceful moment captured.</td>', 'nice shades of blue and good focus.  a very peaceful moment captured.', '2003-02-03 22:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(206945, 12025, 2823, '<td valign="top">good lighting and focus but the area at the top is a little dark and distracting, there''s not enough light to bring what''s in the back forward...  wouldn''t a photo of the little tree been cliché enough tho?</td>', 'good lighting and focus but the area at the top is a little dark and distracting, there''s not enough light to bring what''s in the back forward...  wouldn''t a photo of the little tree been cliché enough tho?', '2003-02-03 22:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(206946, 11842, 2823, '<td valign="top">nice lighting, focus, and tone.  i''m tempted to say that it''s not cliché enough tho (whatever that says)...  there''s so much more this photo says to me and not one of them would be a cliché.</td>', 'nice lighting, focus, and tone.  i''m tempted to say that it''s not cliché enough tho (whatever that says)...  there''s so much more this photo says to me and not one of them would be a cliché.', '2003-02-03 22:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(206947, 11961, 6328, '<td valign="top">nice sharp photo, good focus, nice depth of field.  Subjects are located at a decent position in the frame for compositional elements.  Perhaps a different color for the framing instead of White? i.e. the dogs, snow, etc.</td>', 'nice sharp photo, good focus, nice depth of field.  Subjects are located at a decent position in the frame for compositional elements.  Perhaps a different color for the framing instead of White? i.e. the dogs, snow, etc.', '2003-02-03 22:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(206949, 11788, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this shot.  The colours are perhaps a little washed out, but nothing major - perhaps you were working with low light.  Focus is good.</td>', 'I like the composition of this shot.  The colours are perhaps a little washed out, but nothing major - perhaps you were working with low light.  Focus is good.', '2003-02-03 22:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(206950, 11925, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot</td>', 'Beautiful shot', '2003-02-03 22:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(206951, 11758, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice work - the shallow DOF really makes the orchid stand out.  Colours and focus are good, however there is a little bit of camera shake (most noticeable on top left petal).  Other than the camera shake though it''s quite a good photo.</td>', 'Nice work - the shallow DOF really makes the orchid stand out.  Colours and focus are good, however there is a little bit of camera shake (most noticeable on top left petal).  Other than the camera shake though it''s quite a good photo.', '2003-02-03 22:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(206952, 11814, 2823, '<td valign="top">that border is just a bit too much...  just a bit too much...</td>', 'that border is just a bit too much...  just a bit too much...', '2003-02-03 22:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(206953, 11855, 4162, '<td valign="top">A very elegant flower, lovely composition and strong background.  Looks a little bright on the flower and possibly oversharpened.  Definitely one of the best flower shots so far.</td>', 'A very elegant flower, lovely composition and strong background.  Looks a little bright on the flower and possibly oversharpened.  Definitely one of the best flower shots so far.', '2003-02-03 22:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(206954, 11981, 1647, '<td valign="top">Good work - I like this photo.  The only thing I might have done differently was try to include the entire logo on the right (unless something else also came into shot ruining it).  I like the vividness of the child against the softer background - it really brings the child into focus.  Well done.</td>', 'Good work - I like this photo.  The only thing I might have done differently was try to include the entire logo on the right (unless something else also came into shot ruining it).  I like the vividness of the child against the softer background - it really brings the child into focus.  Well done.', '2003-02-03 22:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(206955, 12005, 4793, '<td valign="top">Cute, no they are beautiful, nice shot</td>', 'Cute, no they are beautiful, nice shot', '2003-02-03 22:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(206956, 11911, 6328, '<td valign="top">Nice clear shot, nicely focused.  The colors are good quality, especially showing the bluish tinge on the inner ear, and the pink nose.  Any way you could have taken the ''light'' away from the eye? It''s a bit distracting.  Overall, a nice shot.</td>', 'Nice clear shot, nicely focused.  The colors are good quality, especially showing the bluish tinge on the inner ear, and the pink nose.  Any way you could have taken the ''light'' away from the eye? It''s a bit distracting.  Overall, a nice shot.', '2003-02-03 22:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(206957, 12044, 2823, '<td valign="top">purtyyy...</td>', 'purtyyy...', '2003-02-03 22:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(206958, 11695, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful cat, I like the black and white</td>', 'Beautiful cat, I like the black and white', '2003-02-03 22:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(206959, 11898, 4162, '<td valign="top">This is very beautiful, lovely soft colours and great use of DOF.</td>', 'This is very beautiful, lovely soft colours and great use of DOF.', '2003-02-03 22:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(206960, 11915, 2823, '<td valign="top">i''m biased.  this impeccably captures that "pensive" expression that makes me love cats so much.</td>', 'i''m biased.  this impeccably captures that "pensive" expression that makes me love cats so much.', '2003-02-03 22:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(206961, 11842, 4162, '<td valign="top">This is a cool looking modern portrait, pretty original style. Good Luck</td>', 'This is a cool looking modern portrait, pretty original style. Good Luck', '2003-02-03 22:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(206964, 11943, 2823, '<td valign="top">i''m biased: i like things depicted in a state of decay, tastefully, beautifully, movingly.  what a coincidence that this pushes all of those buttons for me!</td>', 'i''m biased: i like things depicted in a state of decay, tastefully, beautifully, movingly.  what a coincidence that this pushes all of those buttons for me!', '2003-02-03 22:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(206966, 11836, 6328, '<td valign="top">Excellent pinks and yellows. This photograph is vibrant with color and the background is simple and undistracting except for that one piece of blue/white at the top of the pink petal.  Good lighting, good focus.</td>', 'Excellent pinks and yellows. This photograph is vibrant with color and the background is simple and undistracting except for that one piece of blue/white at the top of the pink petal.  Good lighting, good focus.', '2003-02-03 22:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(206968, 11782, 6328, '<td valign="top">Definately shows the age of the roses, the dried up leaves and stems.  The colors of the flowers are nice, but the lighting on the leaves on the upper and middle rose are a bit harsh and are distracting.  You also seem to have some kind of red feflection on the bottom right side with two white spots which you might have been able to control when you cropped.  Nicely focused, and the background you used was wise.</td>', 'Definately shows the age of the roses, the dried up leaves and stems.  The colors of the flowers are nice, but the lighting on the leaves on the upper and middle rose are a bit harsh and are distracting.  You also seem to have some kind of red feflection on the bottom right side with two white spots which you might have been able to control when you cropped.  Nicely focused, and the background you used was wise.', '2003-02-03 22:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(206969, 11978, 2823, '<td valign="top">i''m transcendentally purring...</td>', 'i''m transcendentally purring...', '2003-02-03 22:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(206970, 11972, 5585, '<td valign="top">boy.... sheesh.... I am sure it was hard finding grass....sharp pic.... funny title.... went with th Cliche hallenge.... 8</td>', 'boy.... sheesh.... I am sure it was hard finding grass....sharp pic.... funny title.... went with th Cliche hallenge.... 8', '2003-02-03 23:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(206971, 12001, 2823, '<td valign="top">nnnnnnno...</td>', 'nnnnnnno...', '2003-02-03 23:05:50.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(206972, 11887, 6328, '<td valign="top">This makes me want to say "Wow!"  The faces of these two dogs really grab me and hold my attention.  You''ve captured their brown eyes just perfectly. And those white bow ties. . .  Those tinge marks on their hind legs are great.  And the black claws on the guy sitting on the chair show up beautifully. I belive your composition has truly shown the rule of 3rds.  The portrait is sharp and is truly in focus. Even the scroll on the chair is in focus.  Lovely job!</td>', 'This makes me want to say "Wow!"  The faces of these two dogs really grab me and hold my attention.  You''ve captured their brown eyes just perfectly. And those white bow ties. . .  Those tinge marks on their hind legs are great.  And the black claws on the guy sitting on the chair show up beautifully. I belive your composition has truly shown the rule of 3rds.  The portrait is sharp and is truly in focus. Even the scroll on the chair is in focus.  Lovely job!', '2003-02-03 23:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(206973, 12010, 3791, '<td valign="top">what a beautiful little lady!<br/>she looks like someone I know<br/>:-)</td>', 'what a beautiful little lady!she looks like someone I know:-)', '2003-02-03 23:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(206977, 11785, 70, '<td valign="top">Wish I was there, too! Gorgeous shot, the purples are wonderful. Too bad about the line(?) tied across the trees.</td>', 'Wish I was there, too! Gorgeous shot, the purples are wonderful. Too bad about the line(?) tied across the trees.', '2003-02-03 23:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(206979, 11763, 4648, '<td valign="top">Brand new baby.  How cute.  I can''t tell if they get along yet or not.  The older one looks like he''s protective of what is his.  The shot is perfect.  Great colors and so bright and clear.  You have the same problem of busy background.  I like the scene enough to put up with the scenery though.  Good photo.</td>', 'Brand new baby.  How cute.  I can''t tell if they get along yet or not.  The older one looks like he''s protective of what is his.  The shot is perfect.  Great colors and so bright and clear.  You have the same problem of busy background.  I like the scene enough to put up with the scenery though.  Good photo.', '2003-02-03 23:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(206980, 11988, 6328, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Sharp focus on most of the flowers and the vase.  The background is nicely done so that it is not distracting from the flowers.  The colors are bright and stand out nicely.  I wish the smaller pink flowers were more in focus, but what the heck. . .  Did you have to use two mats, could you not have used just one instead of having the two joined together like this?  Or perhaps crop the bottom of the vase a little to cut off the 2nd mat?  Nice floral arrangement.</td>', 'Nicely done.  Sharp focus on most of the flowers and the vase.  The background is nicely done so that it is not distracting from the flowers.  The colors are bright and stand out nicely.  I wish the smaller pink flowers were more in focus, but what the heck. . .  Did you have to use two mats, could you not have used just one instead of having the two joined together like this?  Or perhaps crop the bottom of the vase a little to cut off the 2nd mat?  Nice floral arrangement.', '2003-02-03 23:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(206981, 11966, 4648, '<td valign="top">Whatever you''re doing, he''s taking it all in very seriously.  Beautiful colors, so clear and vibrant.  Cropped a little tightly for me personally, but nice photo.  You''ll see this in most of my pet comments.  It''s a personal thing.  Still a beautiful photo.  Well done.</td>', 'Whatever you''re doing, he''s taking it all in very seriously.  Beautiful colors, so clear and vibrant.  Cropped a little tightly for me personally, but nice photo.  You''ll see this in most of my pet comments.  It''s a personal thing.  Still a beautiful photo.  Well done.', '2003-02-03 23:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(206983, 11703, 6328, '<td valign="top">Visual impact doesn''t say much to me, perhaps if you had showed more photo to me?  The overall color is okay, but only 3 of the boats are in focus.  The colors do stand out bright enough, but is that enough?</td>', 'Visual impact doesn''t say much to me, perhaps if you had showed more photo to me?  The overall color is okay, but only 3 of the boats are in focus.  The colors do stand out bright enough, but is that enough?', '2003-02-03 23:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(206984, 12029, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful cat.  Are the eyes 2 different colors?  I wish you had better light and didn''t have the shadows.  With them maybe if you had cropped tighter and had just the face it would be different.  Just a thought.  Still a beautiful cat and super photo.</td>', 'Beautiful cat.  Are the eyes 2 different colors?  I wish you had better light and didn''t have the shadows.  With them maybe if you had cropped tighter and had just the face it would be different.  Just a thought.  Still a beautiful cat and super photo.', '2003-02-03 23:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(206986, 11909, 4648, '<td valign="top">Is the cat really that closely matched to the color of the couch or cushion it''s on, or did it take that tint from the flash.  Beautiful cat.  Very unique color.  Don''t really like the quilt at the rump and blanket on the right.  Maybe if you had cropped it off just behind it''s elbow where the dark line is.  Something to think about.  Then the distracting stuff would not be there, including the dark line.  Still a good photo.</td>', 'Is the cat really that closely matched to the color of the couch or cushion it''s on, or did it take that tint from the flash.  Beautiful cat.  Very unique color.  Don''t really like the quilt at the rump and blanket on the right.  Maybe if you had cropped it off just behind it''s elbow where the dark line is.  Something to think about.  Then the distracting stuff would not be there, including the dark line.  Still a good photo.', '2003-02-03 23:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(206987, 11840, 6328, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors in the sky, and the silhouette of the tree''s, bush, and buildings make a big difference to the landscape.  My eyes focus on the colorful sky and just stay there, wishing it would never end.  Nice job.</td>', 'Beautiful colors in the sky, and the silhouette of the tree''s, bush, and buildings make a big difference to the landscape.  My eyes focus on the colorful sky and just stay there, wishing it would never end.  Nice job.', '2003-02-03 23:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(206988, 11898, 2823, '<td valign="top">very appropriate title.</td>', 'very appropriate title.', '2003-02-03 23:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(206990, 12050, 4648, '<td valign="top">Can''t believe he just laid there so wide eyed.  Love the color of the nose and the tip of the foot.  Beautiful kitten and very nice photo.</td>', 'Can''t believe he just laid there so wide eyed.  Love the color of the nose and the tip of the foot.  Beautiful kitten and very nice photo.', '2003-02-03 23:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(206993, 11919, 6328, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  I think the girl''s winning!  You''ve captured two kids in action here.  You can tell it''s cold out by the color of red on the boy''s left ear!  And look at the snow [or freezing rain?] still falling which you''ve also captured in it''s drizzling effect.  A lot of color here, the yellow line on the road, the yellow sign across the road, the red and white pole across the street, the red porch, the green boxes. Nice job.  Nice picture of the kids.</td>', 'Nice photo.  I think the girl''s winning!  You''ve captured two kids in action here.  You can tell it''s cold out by the color of red on the boy''s left ear!  And look at the snow [or freezing rain?] still falling which you''ve also captured in it''s drizzling effect.  A lot of color here, the yellow line on the road, the yellow sign across the road, the red and white pole across the street, the red porch, the green boxes. Nice job.  Nice picture of the kids.', '2003-02-03 23:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(206995, 11844, 4648, '<td valign="top">You did a fantastic job of photographing a tough animal to get a good one of.  Don''t even mind the dof, even though it''s not my favorite.  The clarity of the head and neck more than make up for any shortcoming anywhere else.  Great one.  Love it.  There are a couple of light spots in your background along the back that don''t help, and I know that appears to be nit-picking, especially after excusing the out of focus area.  Just thought I''d mention it.  Good photo.  I love it.</td>', 'You did a fantastic job of photographing a tough animal to get a good one of.  Don''t even mind the dof, even though it''s not my favorite.  The clarity of the head and neck more than make up for any shortcoming anywhere else.  Great one.  Love it.  There are a couple of light spots in your background along the back that don''t help, and I know that appears to be nit-picking, especially after excusing the out of focus area.  Just thought I''d mention it.  Good photo.  I love it.', '2003-02-03 23:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(206996, 11810, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice picture - both technically and from a subject point of view.  Lighting is quite good and colour is excellent.  It helps that her costume matches her skin / hair.  Personally I think it''s cropped a little too tightly at the bottom (each of the other sides has at least 1cm) - it''s not a big deal though.  Good luck on the comments, they should range from "she''s great" to "this is soft porn", but I think it''s a great cliche shot.</td>', 'Nice picture - both technically and from a subject point of view.  Lighting is quite good and colour is excellent.  It helps that her costume matches her skin / hair.  Personally I think it''s cropped a little too tightly at the bottom (each of the other sides has at least 1cm) - it''s not a big deal though.  Good luck on the comments, they should range from "she''s great" to "this is soft porn", but I think it''s a great cliche shot.', '2003-02-03 23:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(206998, 11784, 4648, '<td valign="top">That''s what I''m asking you.  Forget the obvious problem, the white background has two distinct seams that are distracting.  The background on the left top side is another color and too dark.  I think you might have a cute cat here, but can''t tell from this photo.</td>', 'That''s what I''m asking you.  Forget the obvious problem, the white background has two distinct seams that are distracting.  The background on the left top side is another color and too dark.  I think you might have a cute cat here, but can''t tell from this photo.', '2003-02-03 23:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(207000, 11826, 5120, '<td valign="top">This would be better for me if the eye was in focus.  I am guessing you are hearing this a lot this week.  For wildlife pictures it is usually customary that the eyes are in sharp focus.  However, I also believe that there is nothing wrong with breaking the rules.  I like your picture and I hope you do well.  It looks like quite a cute kitty, and it is a wonderful expression.  You captured the moment well.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'This would be better for me if the eye was in focus.  I am guessing you are hearing this a lot this week.  For wildlife pictures it is usually customary that the eyes are in sharp focus.  However, I also believe that there is nothing wrong with breaking the rules.  I like your picture and I hope you do well.  It looks like quite a cute kitty, and it is a wonderful expression.  You captured the moment well. Greg', '2003-02-03 23:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(207001, 11940, 1647, '<td valign="top">It looks like this photo was taken without enough light - even though there is a hard shadow behind them.  There just seems to be a lot of noise on the skin.  Composition is good</td>', 'It looks like this photo was taken without enough light - even though there is a hard shadow behind them.  There just seems to be a lot of noise on the skin.  Composition is good', '2003-02-03 23:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(207002, 11944, 5120, '<td valign="top">Very cute picture!  I think this one meets the challenge very well.  I can see this one ending up in the top 3 this week.  It does look like the focus is just ever so slightly off.<br/> <br/>Great job.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'Very cute picture!  I think this one meets the challenge very well.  I can see this one ending up in the top 3 this week.  It does look like the focus is just ever so slightly off. Great job. Greg', '2003-02-03 23:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(207004, 11888, 2823, '<td valign="top">impeccable lighting and contrast.</td>', 'impeccable lighting and contrast.', '2003-02-03 23:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(207006, 11892, 5120, '<td valign="top">I wish the eyes were just a tad sharper.  Nice lighting and wonderful pose.  The background is a bit distracting.  It might have been better with less DOF.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'I wish the eyes were just a tad sharper.  Nice lighting and wonderful pose.  The background is a bit distracting.  It might have been better with less DOF. Greg', '2003-02-03 23:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(207007, 11866, 6328, '<td valign="top">My first thought is "this must be one mean dog, the way he''s chained up".<br/>You''ve captured him nicely.  His reflection in that back porch window shows another side to him.  The direct sunlight warming him up "lights" him up nicely for this photograph and at the same time it seems to leave his face in the shadows "deep in thought"<br/>Upon looking at this photograph, I can''t help but think how cruel it is that this dog can''t lay down, but is chained up in such a way that he has to sit up all day long in such a cramped position!</td>', 'My first thought is "this must be one mean dog, the way he''s chained up".You''ve captured him nicely.  His reflection in that back porch window shows another side to him.  The direct sunlight warming him up "lights" him up nicely for this photograph and at the same time it seems to leave his face in the shadows "deep in thought"Upon looking at this photograph, I can''t help but think how cruel it is that this dog can''t lay down, but is chained up in such a way that he has to sit up all day long in such a cramped position!', '2003-02-03 23:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(207009, 11902, 2823, '<td valign="top">a little too plain, and not quite simple: i have a thing about white objects against a white background, and the ripples and waves of the petals twist and bend more than "simple" suggests.  otherwise nice, very nice.</td>', 'a little too plain, and not quite simple: i have a thing about white objects against a white background, and the ripples and waves of the petals twist and bend more than "simple" suggests.  otherwise nice, very nice.', '2003-02-03 23:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(207010, 11897, 5120, '<td valign="top">I think there is too much in this picture.  Technically I think it looks very good.  Color is nice, everything is in sharp focus.  I think it would be better with softer lighting and some color in the background.  I would have liked it more if it was more focused on a single part of the plant.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'I think there is too much in this picture.  Technically I think it looks very good.  Color is nice, everything is in sharp focus.  I think it would be better with softer lighting and some color in the background.  I would have liked it more if it was more focused on a single part of the plant. Greg', '2003-02-03 23:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(207011, 11717, 693, '<td valign="top">This looks too real!  I love it!  Great originality and creativity!</td>', 'This looks too real!  I love it!  Great originality and creativity!', '2003-02-03 23:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(207013, 11774, 5120, '<td valign="top">It looks like the camera locked the focus on the wall instead of the kitty.  What a cute kitty though.  Very nice pose.  I love the way the paws are positioned.  <br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'It looks like the camera locked the focus on the wall instead of the kitty.  What a cute kitty though.  Very nice pose.  I love the way the paws are positioned.   Greg', '2003-02-03 23:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(207014, 11898, 5120, '<td valign="top">The focus looks a bit too soft for my taste.  The color is nice and I like the lines and composition.  I just wish the soft focus effect wasnt quite as strong.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'The focus looks a bit too soft for my taste.  The color is nice and I like the lines and composition.  I just wish the soft focus effect wasnt quite as strong. Greg', '2003-02-04 00:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(207016, 11834, 2823, '<td valign="top">the bright spot in the upper right corner is a little distracting.  otherwise: mahvelous.</td>', 'the bright spot in the upper right corner is a little distracting.  otherwise: mahvelous.', '2003-02-04 00:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(207017, 11846, 5120, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been better if there was a little less DOF and a little more USM.  I dont like how the plant looks like it is growing out of the bird.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'I think this would have been better if there was a little less DOF and a little more USM.  I dont like how the plant looks like it is growing out of the bird. Greg', '2003-02-04 00:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(207019, 11823, 5120, '<td valign="top">I might have liked this one better if you had used a soft focus effect and overexposed the petals just a tad.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'I might have liked this one better if you had used a soft focus effect and overexposed the petals just a tad. Greg', '2003-02-04 00:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(207020, 11769, 5120, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been better if the lighting was softer.  I would also do without the border.  Soft focus would have been nice with this picture possibly.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'I think this would have been better if the lighting was softer.  I would also do without the border.  Soft focus would have been nice with this picture possibly. Greg', '2003-02-04 00:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(207021, 12031, 2823, '<td valign="top">nice idea for subject but you could have done more to "clean up" the composition.  it looks a little too haphazard for its own sake...  unless haphazardness and "candid" are the clichés you intended to work with.</td>', 'nice idea for subject but you could have done more to "clean up" the composition.  it looks a little too haphazard for its own sake...  unless haphazardness and "candid" are the clichés you intended to work with.', '2003-02-04 00:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(207022, 12039, 5120, '<td valign="top">Maybe it is just my screen, but this picture looks a little bit soft. I like the lighting on the strings and the composition quite a bit though.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'Maybe it is just my screen, but this picture looks a little bit soft. I like the lighting on the strings and the composition quite a bit though. Greg', '2003-02-04 00:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(207023, 11975, 5120, '<td valign="top">I think if you had used a larger aperture that this picture would have benefited.  The background is pulling my attention away from the bird.  The birds eye seems soft to me.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'I think if you had used a larger aperture that this picture would have benefited.  The background is pulling my attention away from the bird.  The birds eye seems soft to me. Greg', '2003-02-04 00:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
