(207027, 11996, 4648, '<td valign="top">Not my kind of loving, cuddly pet.  But to each his own.  I know a lot of people like them, including my grandson.  Is this the natural color of him?  I really don''t like the color of the photo.  Hope it''s not his real color.  Sorry if it is.  But it is a very clear, well focused photo.  Nice DOF.  Don''t particularly go for the frame work.  Not my thing personally.  But good photo.  Well done.  How did you get him to pose?  What was your command?  Having a little fun.</td>', 'Not my kind of loving, cuddly pet.  But to each his own.  I know a lot of people like them, including my grandson.  Is this the natural color of him?  I really don''t like the color of the photo.  Hope it''s not his real color.  Sorry if it is.  But it is a very clear, well focused photo.  Nice DOF.  Don''t particularly go for the frame work.  Not my thing personally.  But good photo.  Well done.  How did you get him to pose?  What was your command?  Having a little fun.', '2003-02-04 00:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(207028, 11996, 2823, '<td valign="top">i''m biased: i don''t trust snakes.  otherwise, nice focus, it brings out the texture of the scales.</td>', 'i''m biased: i don''t trust snakes.  otherwise, nice focus, it brings out the texture of the scales.', '2003-02-04 00:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(207029, 11702, 4648, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but I can''t tell a lot about this photo.  It looks like it''s been way over sharpened.  I can''t read what the book is and don''t understand the background.    It''s cropped to tightly to tell much about it.  Sorry.</td>', 'I''m sorry but I can''t tell a lot about this photo.  It looks like it''s been way over sharpened.  I can''t read what the book is and don''t understand the background.    It''s cropped to tightly to tell much about it.  Sorry.', '2003-02-04 00:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(207030, 11995, 2823, '<td valign="top">the focus ought to have been only the dog.  the baby seems a little...  out of place with the dog since it''s just laying down (i''m morbid and i want to say it looks like it was just dropped on the ground by the dog for the photo).  the hand and foot cut off are a little off-putting as well.</td>', 'the focus ought to have been only the dog.  the baby seems a little...  out of place with the dog since it''s just laying down (i''m morbid and i want to say it looks like it was just dropped on the ground by the dog for the photo).  the hand and foot cut off are a little off-putting as well.', '2003-02-04 00:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(207031, 11699, 4648, '<td valign="top">What a cute puppy.  But I can''t tell a lot about the photo because it is so washed out.  I feel this was intentional on your part, but can''t understand why.  It looks like a chachuahua with something in it''s mouth.  That''s about all I can tell, other than it looks like it''s a cute as a button.  Wish I could see a good photo of the dog.</td>', 'What a cute puppy.  But I can''t tell a lot about the photo because it is so washed out.  I feel this was intentional on your part, but can''t understand why.  It looks like a chachuahua with something in it''s mouth.  That''s about all I can tell, other than it looks like it''s a cute as a button.  Wish I could see a good photo of the dog.', '2003-02-04 00:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(207033, 11988, 2823, '<td valign="top">kind of blurry and the green placemats are kind of distracting, ditto for the shadow to the left and the card holder.  maybe it could have been centered or photographed from a diferent angle.  otherwise, not bad for plastic plants.</td>', 'kind of blurry and the green placemats are kind of distracting, ditto for the shadow to the left and the card holder.  maybe it could have been centered or photographed from a diferent angle.  otherwise, not bad for plastic plants.', '2003-02-04 00:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(207034, 11917, 4648, '<td valign="top">10.  Need I say more.</td>', '10.  Need I say more.', '2003-02-04 00:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(207035, 11944, 6328, '<td valign="top">Oh Maddy, You are so cute!  Visual impact is very striking and the photo is really sharp and in focus.  I like the way the dogs eyes follow you over top of the eyeglasses. The dog''s face captures you and holds your attention immediately. <br/> I wonder if you could have moved the one light on the dog''s left eye over a bit so that it would only have reflected one light from it''s eye instead of two?</td>', 'Oh Maddy, You are so cute!  Visual impact is very striking and the photo is really sharp and in focus.  I like the way the dogs eyes follow you over top of the eyeglasses. The dog''s face captures you and holds your attention immediately.  I wonder if you could have moved the one light on the dog''s left eye over a bit so that it would only have reflected one light from it''s eye instead of two?', '2003-02-04 00:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(207036, 11925, 4648, '<td valign="top">You couldn''t see before the flash, so shut up!  He''ll never make a good seeing eye dog, that''s for sure.  But he is sure a beautiful pet, and cuddly.  The only way you could have improved this photo was to have included all of him.  But that''s just my personal opinion.  It''s a beautiful photo, well done.  Wet, big, black noses</td>', 'You couldn''t see before the flash, so shut up!  He''ll never make a good seeing eye dog, that''s for sure.  But he is sure a beautiful pet, and cuddly.  The only way you could have improved this photo was to have included all of him.  But that''s just my personal opinion.  It''s a beautiful photo, well done.  Wet, big, black noses', '2003-02-04 00:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(207037, 11991, 4648, '<td valign="top">10!  10!    What a catch.  What in the world did you throw up for them to catch.  There''s not a thing wrong with this, and everything right.  Maybe you could have made the lucky one catching the bait stick his other leg out to where we can see it easily.  This should produce a ribbon.  Fantastic.</td>', '10!  10!    What a catch.  What in the world did you throw up for them to catch.  There''s not a thing wrong with this, and everything right.  Maybe you could have made the lucky one catching the bait stick his other leg out to where we can see it easily.  This should produce a ribbon.  Fantastic.', '2003-02-04 00:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(207038, 11810, 2823, '<td valign="top">nice composition, pose (oh bettie!), and lighting.  she should have had red lipstick tho (ahem), and maybe some lusciously false eyelashes (a-a-a-HEM).  otherwise, fantastic.</td>', 'nice composition, pose (oh bettie!), and lighting.  she should have had red lipstick tho (ahem), and maybe some lusciously false eyelashes (a-a-a-HEM).  otherwise, fantastic.', '2003-02-04 00:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(207040, 11825, 4648, '<td valign="top">Looks like he''s had a lot of fun.  With all that beautiful fur, he doesn''t even realize it''s cold outside.  Would love to have seen a photo with his nose in the snow, and romping around outside.  Beautiful photo.  Technically it''s right on, and I''ve looked hard for a problem.  Great shot of a beautiful dog.  You deserve the 8.</td>', 'Looks like he''s had a lot of fun.  With all that beautiful fur, he doesn''t even realize it''s cold outside.  Would love to have seen a photo with his nose in the snow, and romping around outside.  Beautiful photo.  Technically it''s right on, and I''ve looked hard for a problem.  Great shot of a beautiful dog.  You deserve the 8.', '2003-02-04 00:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(207041, 11754, 6328, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture of the drool on his lower lip!  The color of the red flowers and green leaves in the hair are great as the red flower hanging out of his mouth. [or is it a her?]  The lighting on the face is pleasing to the eye and makes you focus on the dog''s eyes.  My only complaint would be that the flower in the dog''s mouth is slightly out of focus, but otherwise this is a lovely portrait of your dog!</td>', 'Excellent picture of the drool on his lower lip!  The color of the red flowers and green leaves in the hair are great as the red flower hanging out of his mouth. [or is it a her?]  The lighting on the face is pleasing to the eye and makes you focus on the dog''s eyes.  My only complaint would be that the flower in the dog''s mouth is slightly out of focus, but otherwise this is a lovely portrait of your dog!', '2003-02-04 00:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(207042, 11915, 4648, '<td valign="top">She is a beautiful calico.  I just wish you had let us see all of her.  Much too tight of a crop for me personally.  Great photo, just not enough of it.</td>', 'She is a beautiful calico.  I just wish you had let us see all of her.  Much too tight of a crop for me personally.  Great photo, just not enough of it.', '2003-02-04 00:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(207043, 12003, 2823, '<td valign="top">the branches would otherwise be distracting if the subject weren''t such a lustrous and vibrant hue (yeah, tho it''s only white).  it really stands out tho, crisp, clean, neat.</td>', 'the branches would otherwise be distracting if the subject weren''t such a lustrous and vibrant hue (yeah, tho it''s only white).  it really stands out tho, crisp, clean, neat.', '2003-02-04 00:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
