(207047, 11715, 4648, '<td valign="top">I sure hope someone is able to tell you how to get this beautiful horse to show up clearer.  I hate it that we can''t really see him.  Maybe if he had been out of the stall infront of the white he''d show up beautifully.  Love the expression on that guys face.  The horse just seems to disappear.  Only thing we can see is his ears, the white, and his nose.  I hate it.  Otherwise the photo is perfectly done and deserves a very high score.  BUT I really think the horse is your subject and we can tell nothing about him.  Next time try to get more of him in the light.</td>', 'I sure hope someone is able to tell you how to get this beautiful horse to show up clearer.  I hate it that we can''t really see him.  Maybe if he had been out of the stall infront of the white he''d show up beautifully.  Love the expression on that guys face.  The horse just seems to disappear.  Only thing we can see is his ears, the white, and his nose.  I hate it.  Otherwise the photo is perfectly done and deserves a very high score.  BUT I really think the horse is your subject and we can tell nothing about him.  Next time try to get more of him in the light.', '2003-02-04 00:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
