(207049, 11721, 4648, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe you got him to keep that hat on.  That''s too much.  Wish the photo had been lighter and brighter.  He''s a beautiful dog, and deserves to be seen in his best light.  Still not a bad photo.</td>', 'I can''t believe you got him to keep that hat on.  That''s too much.  Wish the photo had been lighter and brighter.  He''s a beautiful dog, and deserves to be seen in his best light.  Still not a bad photo.', '2003-02-04 00:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(207050, 11784, 1135, '<td valign="top">I like the expression on the cat''s face but the flash over powered the shot and it looks like it was too close for the camera to focus. This is just my opinion but I like the pet photos that are taken with natural light, the flash can ruin an otherwise good photo.</td>', 'I like the expression on the cat''s face but the flash over powered the shot and it looks like it was too close for the camera to focus. This is just my opinion but I like the pet photos that are taken with natural light, the flash can ruin an otherwise good photo.', '2003-02-04 00:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(207051, 11961, 4648, '<td valign="top">You said that.  I had one and these wasn''t anything he couldn''t get into.  These are georgeous westies.  They almost look like they got caught at something.  Beautiful photo.  The empty space works well here, as does the border, and I usually don''t like borders.  But then it kinda makes it look like an old snapshot, when they were bordered in white by the drugstores.  Well done.</td>', 'You said that.  I had one and these wasn''t anything he couldn''t get into.  These are georgeous westies.  They almost look like they got caught at something.  Beautiful photo.  The empty space works well here, as does the border, and I usually don''t like borders.  But then it kinda makes it look like an old snapshot, when they were bordered in white by the drugstores.  Well done.', '2003-02-04 00:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
