(207119, 11803, 4648, '<td valign="top">I love that wisp of hair on top of the head.  That makes the photo, in my opinion.  Nice black and white..  Very clear and sharp.  Nice profile.  Should do well.</td>', 'I love that wisp of hair on top of the head.  That makes the photo, in my opinion.  Nice black and white..  Very clear and sharp.  Nice profile.  Should do well.', '2003-02-04 01:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(207120, 11912, 4648, '<td valign="top">You can see him almost jumping after the flower.  There''s something wrong with the photo and I can''t quite put my finger on it.  The vase appears to have moved, but the roses haven''t.  But the roses appear to have been over sharpened, as does the background.  Maybe it''s from the colorization.  The cat is the only thing in nice focus and we can''t see much, or even enough of him.  In my opinion, there should be as much of the cat as there is of the flowers.  This is just my opinon though.  Nice composition, but needs better execution.  I also think natural color would have been much better.  I don''t feel you accomplished what you intended with the color.  But I could be wrong.</td>', 'You can see him almost jumping after the flower.  There''s something wrong with the photo and I can''t quite put my finger on it.  The vase appears to have moved, but the roses haven''t.  But the roses appear to have been over sharpened, as does the background.  Maybe it''s from the colorization.  The cat is the only thing in nice focus and we can''t see much, or even enough of him.  In my opinion, there should be as much of the cat as there is of the flowers.  This is just my opinon though.  Nice composition, but needs better execution.  I also think natural color would have been much better.  I don''t feel you accomplished what you intended with the color.  But I could be wrong.', '2003-02-04 01:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(207121, 11819, 6172, '<td valign="top">Nice Focus and color, I don''t like the angle though, just my  opinion.</td>', 'Nice Focus and color, I don''t like the angle though, just my  opinion.', '2003-02-04 01:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(207123, 11923, 6172, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, nice macro.  The border does alot for this photo.  I like your angle on the flower.  Too bad the petals closest are not focused well.</td>', 'Very pretty, nice macro.  The border does alot for this photo.  I like your angle on the flower.  Too bad the petals closest are not focused well.', '2003-02-04 01:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
