(207141, 11832, 4648, '<td valign="top">Oh, he needs a bath.  Where''s that pretty white fur we see all the time.  Beautiful close up.  I hope the close up was the result of a good telephoto lens.  This is too tightly cropped to suit me, and not because I like to see all the animal.  It just feels crowded as it is.  I think you could have gotten the same quality as you have here, which is great, pulled back a little.  But, this is just my opinion.</td>', 'Oh, he needs a bath.  Where''s that pretty white fur we see all the time.  Beautiful close up.  I hope the close up was the result of a good telephoto lens.  This is too tightly cropped to suit me, and not because I like to see all the animal.  It just feels crowded as it is.  I think you could have gotten the same quality as you have here, which is great, pulled back a little.  But, this is just my opinion.', '2003-02-04 02:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(207142, 12024, 6470, '<td valign="top">Cat''s nose from up close, very good action shot.  Would be better to see the cat''s eyes, I think.</td>', 'Cat''s nose from up close, very good action shot.  Would be better to see the cat''s eyes, I think.', '2003-02-04 02:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
