(207145, 11975, 4648, '<td valign="top">Is the same one I saw earlier?  Don''t think so.  I don''t remember the blue on his back, (but I will go back and check.)  Beautiful shot.  I love the addition of the plant in the background.  To me it adds to the idea of the bird.  Great photo.  I really like it a lot.  Can''t find anything wrong with it.  Nice focus and really nice composition.</td>', 'Is the same one I saw earlier?  Don''t think so.  I don''t remember the blue on his back, (but I will go back and check.)  Beautiful shot.  I love the addition of the plant in the background.  To me it adds to the idea of the bird.  Great photo.  I really like it a lot.  Can''t find anything wrong with it.  Nice focus and really nice composition.', '2003-02-04 02:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
