(207151, 11808, 6172, '<td valign="top">Disgusting!</td>', 'Disgusting!', '2003-02-04 02:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(207152, 11933, 4648, '<td valign="top">Not everyone will understand Punxsutawney, even with the groundhog.  They probably won''t even know what kind of animal that is.  But I''m sure glad he saw his shadow in Georgia.  Spring is coming.  I would like for this photo to be a little lighter.  Also is fixing red eyes against the rules?  Never thought about that before.  That''s considered spot editing I guess.  Great photo, just needs to be lighter for me.  Great timing for this challenge for you.  Lucked out.  Good one.</td>', 'Not everyone will understand Punxsutawney, even with the groundhog.  They probably won''t even know what kind of animal that is.  But I''m sure glad he saw his shadow in Georgia.  Spring is coming.  I would like for this photo to be a little lighter.  Also is fixing red eyes against the rules?  Never thought about that before.  That''s considered spot editing I guess.  Great photo, just needs to be lighter for me.  Great timing for this challenge for you.  Lucked out.  Good one.', '2003-02-04 02:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
