(207156, 11954, 4648, '<td valign="top">I don''t see it in the body, but his tongue says chow somewhere in his ancestry.  Any special reason for cropping off the top of his ears..  Is his fur at the ear red or is he bleeding for some reason?  Good color and nice sharp focus.  Good photo.</td>', 'I don''t see it in the body, but his tongue says chow somewhere in his ancestry.  Any special reason for cropping off the top of his ears..  Is his fur at the ear red or is he bleeding for some reason?  Good color and nice sharp focus.  Good photo.', '2003-02-04 02:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(207157, 11890, 6172, '<td valign="top">Good job!  The wheel doesn''t turn?  I ask that because you got a nice effect on the water falling downstream, but no blur on the wheel.</td>', 'Good job!  The wheel doesn''t turn?  I ask that because you got a nice effect on the water falling downstream, but no blur on the wheel.', '2003-02-04 02:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(207158, 11940, 4648, '<td valign="top">I have great news for you.  You will survive them.  Mine are 34 this year, and I still have half my mind left.  Looks like there''s a light behind them off to the side.  Don''t like the shadow of their heads.  Nice job of minimizing red eye, as well as you did.  Shame we can''t spot edit that..  Good luck.</td>', 'I have great news for you.  You will survive them.  Mine are 34 this year, and I still have half my mind left.  Looks like there''s a light behind them off to the side.  Don''t like the shadow of their heads.  Nice job of minimizing red eye, as well as you did.  Shame we can''t spot edit that..  Good luck.', '2003-02-04 02:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
