(207165, 11866, 4648, '<td valign="top">Don''t think I will approach this porch.  I have to use one of the collars also and I know what they''re for.  Beautiful dog, but not sure how friendly.  The sun did you in on the photo though.  Washing out the stomach area and putting the head in the dark.  T hate that for you.</td>', 'Don''t think I will approach this porch.  I have to use one of the collars also and I know what they''re for.  Beautiful dog, but not sure how friendly.  The sun did you in on the photo though.  Washing out the stomach area and putting the head in the dark.  T hate that for you.', '2003-02-04 02:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
