(207168, 11921, 4648, '<td valign="top">I DO NOT LIKE THIS AT ALL!.  Joking or not.  The appearance is cruelty.  It give as negative of a message as your photo is.  Think about this a while.  I do not promote cruelty to animals and don''t think this site does either. This is a very upsetting snapshot. Enogh said.</td>', 'I DO NOT LIKE THIS AT ALL!.  Joking or not.  The appearance is cruelty.  It give as negative of a message as your photo is.  Think about this a while.  I do not promote cruelty to animals and don''t think this site does either. This is a very upsetting snapshot. Enogh said.', '2003-02-04 02:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
