(207180, 11727, 4055, '<td valign="top">A lovely shot. I like everything in it except the shadow at bottom lrft. Perhaps you should crop it away? Anyway, good colour, focus and composition. High score from me. Good luck.</td>', 'A lovely shot. I like everything in it except the shadow at bottom lrft. Perhaps you should crop it away? Anyway, good colour, focus and composition. High score from me. Good luck.', '2003-02-04 02:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(207181, 11714, 6349, '<td valign="top">nice kittens!  I like the shot a lot.  Its one of the best of the many cats this week.  I could see it in some kind of cat magazine.  The only thing I don''t like is whatever that is in the upper right corner.  Is it the light?  I like the ripped up chair and the cats are posing very well.  lucky for you.</td>', 'nice kittens!  I like the shot a lot.  Its one of the best of the many cats this week.  I could see it in some kind of cat magazine.  The only thing I don''t like is whatever that is in the upper right corner.  Is it the light?  I like the ripped up chair and the cats are posing very well.  lucky for you.', '2003-02-04 03:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(207183, 11785, 6349, '<td valign="top">I like this photo a lot.  The colors and the composition are excellent but the dark sky blending in with the top of the palm trees bothers me.  This was of course not your fault, you should have just gotten there a little bit earlier I guess.  Also, is that a string between the two trees to hold them up?  That can be taken out later with some nice spot editing.  Nice job!</td>', 'I like this photo a lot.  The colors and the composition are excellent but the dark sky blending in with the top of the palm trees bothers me.  This was of course not your fault, you should have just gotten there a little bit earlier I guess.  Also, is that a string between the two trees to hold them up?  That can be taken out later with some nice spot editing.  Nice job!', '2003-02-04 03:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(207184, 11984, 4055, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition. Focus is perfect and your b&amp;w choice is splendid. The border is just right. Can´t see what can be done better. Good luck!</td>', 'Wonderful composition. Focus is perfect and your b&w choice is splendid. The border is just right. Can´t see what can be done better. Good luck!', '2003-02-04 03:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(207185, 11886, 6349, '<td valign="top">The softness of light, focus, and feeling make this one of my favorite cat shots this week.  The head resting on the paw is a great touch.  The bottom left may be a bit too bright and the fact that the far side of the cats face is not in focus kind of gives it an illusional look.  Wonderful photo overall.  Good job.</td>', 'The softness of light, focus, and feeling make this one of my favorite cat shots this week.  The head resting on the paw is a great touch.  The bottom left may be a bit too bright and the fact that the far side of the cats face is not in focus kind of gives it an illusional look.  Wonderful photo overall.  Good job.', '2003-02-04 03:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(207187, 11782, 6349, '<td valign="top">I like this picture.  I don''t think its going to get rave reviews from the rest of the peanut gallery but I think it''s wonderful and very powerful.  I like seeing the roses portrayed in this way.  They look beautifully rough and disturbing and were obviously taken with an artistic eye that is lacking in many of the "perfect" flower pictures.</td>', 'I like this picture.  I don''t think its going to get rave reviews from the rest of the peanut gallery but I think it''s wonderful and very powerful.  I like seeing the roses portrayed in this way.  They look beautifully rough and disturbing and were obviously taken with an artistic eye that is lacking in many of the "perfect" flower pictures.', '2003-02-04 03:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(207188, 12002, 4055, '<td valign="top">Perfect lighting and focus. Nice composition. Background, reflections, colours - everything is great. I also like your choice of borders. One of my favourites this week. Good luck!</td>', 'Perfect lighting and focus. Nice composition. Background, reflections, colours - everything is great. I also like your choice of borders. One of my favourites this week. Good luck!', '2003-02-04 03:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(207189, 11961, 6349, '<td valign="top">LOL.  This is a cute picture and my favoite non close-up animal shot.  The colors of the dogs and the snow and leaves go absolutely perfectly together (but you already know that.)  Personally, I''d drop the green border.  It''s nice to see some pets in motion!  If I had a dog (or wasnt too embarassed to obviously take pictures of other people''s dogs) I would have taken a similar picture.  Dogs + snow = fun!  Nice job.</td>', 'LOL.  This is a cute picture and my favoite non close-up animal shot.  The colors of the dogs and the snow and leaves go absolutely perfectly together (but you already know that.)  Personally, I''d drop the green border.  It''s nice to see some pets in motion!  If I had a dog (or wasnt too embarassed to obviously take pictures of other people''s dogs) I would have taken a similar picture.  Dogs + snow = fun!  Nice job.', '2003-02-04 03:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(207191, 11897, 6349, '<td valign="top">Im getting so so so sick of looking at flowers, but this is a refreshing interesting one!  Thank you!  Is it upside down?  Is it a praying mantis plant?  I can''t tell.  What I can tell is that the shape of this rare plant lends itself perfectly into your creative composition.  The water drops are a nice touch.  Definetely my favorite flower this week!</td>', 'Im getting so so so sick of looking at flowers, but this is a refreshing interesting one!  Thank you!  Is it upside down?  Is it a praying mantis plant?  I can''t tell.  What I can tell is that the shape of this rare plant lends itself perfectly into your creative composition.  The water drops are a nice touch.  Definetely my favorite flower this week!', '2003-02-04 03:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(207194, 11898, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorite flower shots this week (which is quite something given the multitudes)  The macro was a good choice and the DOF is right on.  You could, of course, have made this any color of rose that you wanted, but I like the choice, and the name Orange Sherbert.  Excellent work.</td>', 'This is one of my favorite flower shots this week (which is quite something given the multitudes)  The macro was a good choice and the DOF is right on.  You could, of course, have made this any color of rose that you wanted, but I like the choice, and the name Orange Sherbert.  Excellent work.', '2003-02-04 03:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(207195, 11923, 6349, '<td valign="top">NIce shot!  The colors are smashing!  I like how only the petals on the sides are in focus.  I dont like the frame.  The colors are what did it for me the most.  Radical shot!</td>', 'NIce shot!  The colors are smashing!  I like how only the petals on the sides are in focus.  I dont like the frame.  The colors are what did it for me the most.  Radical shot!', '2003-02-04 03:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(207196, 11969, 6349, '<td valign="top">what can I say except awesome?  I dont know where you found the clothes, the models, the book, but they are all awesome.  Awesome.  Awesome job of color management and saturation.  I would like to know how you achieved this look so awesomely.</td>', 'what can I say except awesome?  I dont know where you found the clothes, the models, the book, but they are all awesome.  Awesome.  Awesome job of color management and saturation.  I would like to know how you achieved this look so awesomely.', '2003-02-04 03:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(207197, 11945, 6349, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite flowers.  Love the DOF and the choice of flower.  Composition is right on.  What can I say, no criticism, so I guess this comment isn''t useful.  Hey, not everyone needs help!  Great job.</td>', 'One of my favorite flowers.  Love the DOF and the choice of flower.  Composition is right on.  What can I say, no criticism, so I guess this comment isn''t useful.  Hey, not everyone needs help!  Great job.', '2003-02-04 03:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(207198, 11865, 6349, '<td valign="top">Perfect.  Could not have chosen a better cliche photo after the recent challenges.  This would have won them both (lol).  You made the water drop look just like a chess piece (but you already know this of course).  My only recommendation is that you stop doing creative things like this and let some other people win for a while.  jk.  great job.</td>', 'Perfect.  Could not have chosen a better cliche photo after the recent challenges.  This would have won them both (lol).  You made the water drop look just like a chess piece (but you already know this of course).  My only recommendation is that you stop doing creative things like this and let some other people win for a while.  jk.  great job.', '2003-02-04 03:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(207199, 11916, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is the only horse.  That''s good.  I was sick of all the flowers, kids, cats, and dogs.  It also happens to be a very very nice photograph that I like better than the pictures of the flowers, kids, cats, and dogs.  I would have liked a little more DOF, especially on the ground behind the horse.  The composition is nice with the crooked tree and the barn, but I would have tried to get the tree to not cut through the ear.  Of course, I''m being way too overcritical here and I wish I could take such a nice picture.  Good job.</td>', 'This is the only horse.  That''s good.  I was sick of all the flowers, kids, cats, and dogs.  It also happens to be a very very nice photograph that I like better than the pictures of the flowers, kids, cats, and dogs.  I would have liked a little more DOF, especially on the ground behind the horse.  The composition is nice with the crooked tree and the barn, but I would have tried to get the tree to not cut through the ear.  Of course, I''m being way too overcritical here and I wish I could take such a nice picture.  Good job.', '2003-02-04 03:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(207200, 11887, 6349, '<td valign="top">--Laughter---:  THIS was FUNNY.  You chose the perfect dogs for such a shot.  II love it.  I would like to know (Im sure this is a pathetic amateur question but I need to learn somehow) how you get the background to be a sold white with no horizon whatsoever.  I also find it strange that the shadows seem reddish.  Awesome photograph.</td>', '--Laughter---:  THIS was FUNNY.  You chose the perfect dogs for such a shot.  II love it.  I would like to know (Im sure this is a pathetic amateur question but I need to learn somehow) how you get the background to be a sold white with no horizon whatsoever.  I also find it strange that the shadows seem reddish.  Awesome photograph.', '2003-02-04 03:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(207202, 11769, 6349, '<td valign="top">My favorite rose, hands down.  Lovely exposure and the water drops add a nice touch.  Thanks for reminding me that Valentine''s day is coming up soon!</td>', 'My favorite rose, hands down.  Lovely exposure and the water drops add a nice touch.  Thanks for reminding me that Valentine''s day is coming up soon!', '2003-02-04 03:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(207204, 11963, 6349, '<td valign="top">Splendid!  Black and white was a good choice.  The dark lips and nose come out of the white and grey fur with such vigor and force that they threaten to pop out far past the black border.  I would have had him looking at the camera though, especially given the title.  Nice work.  Cheers.</td>', 'Splendid!  Black and white was a good choice.  The dark lips and nose come out of the white and grey fur with such vigor and force that they threaten to pop out far past the black border.  I would have had him looking at the camera though, especially given the title.  Nice work.  Cheers.', '2003-02-04 03:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(207205, 11888, 6349, '<td valign="top">Hey, is this for the curves challenge.  A most interesting flower.  I like the lighting although it may be a little strong in places.  I think it would be interesting with the bottom cut of so that people wouldnt know exactly what it was.  It would make an excellent abstract.</td>', 'Hey, is this for the curves challenge.  A most interesting flower.  I like the lighting although it may be a little strong in places.  I think it would be interesting with the bottom cut of so that people wouldnt know exactly what it was.  It would make an excellent abstract.', '2003-02-04 03:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(207206, 11845, 6349, '<td valign="top">An inspiring sunset shot.  Man vs Nature.  What are those huge odd shaped animals chasing after that poor bird flying through the beach in the sky?  An interesting twist on the sunset.  I like!</td>', 'An inspiring sunset shot.  Man vs Nature.  What are those huge odd shaped animals chasing after that poor bird flying through the beach in the sky?  An interesting twist on the sunset.  I like!', '2003-02-04 03:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(207208, 11826, 6349, '<td valign="top">hello cat!  Hoy, nice beast!  I like the white patcha nose and the techture of the white black and greys.  I dont like the shadow cast on the eye itself nor the blurryness around the top edges.  Good lookin shot of a good lookin cat though.  Cheers</td>', 'hello cat!  Hoy, nice beast!  I like the white patcha nose and the techture of the white black and greys.  I dont like the shadow cast on the eye itself nor the blurryness around the top edges.  Good lookin shot of a good lookin cat though.  Cheers', '2003-02-04 03:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(207209, 11966, 6349, '<td valign="top">Fine lookin beast friend!  Good expression, good brown colors, good lighting. Talkin bout that photo and the dog! Jazz''ll be proud to see this shot of himself up on your wall.  what kind of dog is he (or her)?</td>', 'Fine lookin beast friend!  Good expression, good brown colors, good lighting. Talkin bout that photo and the dog! Jazz''ll be proud to see this shot of himself up on your wall.  what kind of dog is he (or her)?', '2003-02-04 03:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(207210, 11903, 6349, '<td valign="top">now THAT''''s a very dignified lookin beast friend sittin in fronta your fire!  Love the pose and the location, but the composition seems a bit crooked and I dont like whatever it is in the upper left corner, esp. since its so near the dogs face.  Beautiful dog.  Nice job.</td>', 'now THAT''''s a very dignified lookin beast friend sittin in fronta your fire!  Love the pose and the location, but the composition seems a bit crooked and I dont like whatever it is in the upper left corner, esp. since its so near the dogs face.  Beautiful dog.  Nice job.', '2003-02-04 03:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(207211, 11753, 6349, '<td valign="top">Wow.  This gets more interesting the more I look at it.  It looks like an alien creature resembling a mixture of a squid on a stick and a flying starfish strawberry.  Nice framing and small dof.  I really like this and hope it does well.</td>', 'Wow.  This gets more interesting the more I look at it.  It looks like an alien creature resembling a mixture of a squid on a stick and a flying starfish strawberry.  Nice framing and small dof.  I really like this and hope it does well.', '2003-02-04 03:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(207212, 11767, 6349, '<td valign="top">I would love to know where the smoke is coming from.  Nice job, although the lighting seems a bit dark, it is perfect for a dark artists smoke filled room.  Good spotlighting.</td>', 'I would love to know where the smoke is coming from.  Nice job, although the lighting seems a bit dark, it is perfect for a dark artists smoke filled room.  Good spotlighting.', '2003-02-04 03:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(207213, 11929, 6349, '<td valign="top">This composition is very interesting and intriguing.  At first I loved it, then I hated it.  Now, I''ve decided it is interesting.  The face and the body just somehow dont seem to go right together (although Im sure they do in reality).  It looks like some sort of puzzle you''re supposed to put together into a square or something.  i dont know exaclty.  The colors are nice and the dog is beautiful.  I would be proud of such and interesting animal picture.</td>', 'This composition is very interesting and intriguing.  At first I loved it, then I hated it.  Now, I''ve decided it is interesting.  The face and the body just somehow dont seem to go right together (although Im sure they do in reality).  It looks like some sort of puzzle you''re supposed to put together into a square or something.  i dont know exaclty.  The colors are nice and the dog is beautiful.  I would be proud of such and interesting animal picture.', '2003-02-04 03:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(207214, 11695, 6349, '<td valign="top">THis is the most artistic of the cat photos this week.  I love the background and would love to know how yhou achieved it.  Those are some long whiskers.  The cat must be rather fat (since they tell him he can only fit through large places.)  B+W was an excellent choice.  Meow not my favorite title.</td>', 'THis is the most artistic of the cat photos this week.  I love the background and would love to know how yhou achieved it.  Those are some long whiskers.  The cat must be rather fat (since they tell him he can only fit through large places.)  B+W was an excellent choice.  Meow not my favorite title.', '2003-02-04 03:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(207215, 11825, 6349, '<td valign="top">Adorable golden.  The picture seems a bit pixalized.  Nice photo.</td>', 'Adorable golden.  The picture seems a bit pixalized.  Nice photo.', '2003-02-04 03:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(207216, 11921, 6349, '<td valign="top">ahhh, an inverted cat being strangled by a shadow-man.  Always one of my favorite subjects as well!  The inversion lost a lot of the texture however, especially in the lovely bed sheets.  THose eyes, those eyes, full of deep mystery.  The cat cut in half is beating you by a tail.  Nice work</td>', 'ahhh, an inverted cat being strangled by a shadow-man.  Always one of my favorite subjects as well!  The inversion lost a lot of the texture however, especially in the lovely bed sheets.  THose eyes, those eyes, full of deep mystery.  The cat cut in half is beating you by a tail.  Nice work', '2003-02-04 03:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(207217, 11959, 6349, '<td valign="top">He doesn''t look ready!  Buy him a real gun for pete''s sake!  jk.  Nice use of shadows on the white wall and an interesting compostion that renders nice negative space and line forms.  Something is just too drab about the focus and colors.  A boy and a photo to be proud of!</td>', 'He doesn''t look ready!  Buy him a real gun for pete''s sake!  jk.  Nice use of shadows on the white wall and an interesting compostion that renders nice negative space and line forms.  Something is just too drab about the focus and colors.  A boy and a photo to be proud of!', '2003-02-04 03:58:23.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(207218, 11960, 6349, '<td valign="top">Yes, the sunset is missing, but I don''t see how it would possibly be encorporated anyway, so I guess its better that the sun didnt set in the house just this once.  I like the blue on the girls headband and how it mimicks the blue in the vase.  Also, the wood tones and grains are nice.  I would ger rid of the glass statue (what is it a polar bear?)  It somehow doesn''t fit the warmth of the rest of the loving photograph.  Nice job.  Good portrait shot.</td>', 'Yes, the sunset is missing, but I don''t see how it would possibly be encorporated anyway, so I guess its better that the sun didnt set in the house just this once.  I like the blue on the girls headband and how it mimicks the blue in the vase.  Also, the wood tones and grains are nice.  I would ger rid of the glass statue (what is it a polar bear?)  It somehow doesn''t fit the warmth of the rest of the loving photograph.  Nice job.  Good portrait shot.', '2003-02-04 04:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(207219, 12049, 6230, '<td valign="top">The picture would have scored higher if there were two wings.</td>', 'The picture would have scored higher if there were two wings.', '2003-02-04 04:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(207220, 11972, 6349, '<td valign="top">Nice title.  Better than Wilson.  Good photograph.  Not such a great subject.  These familiar pig skinned creatures are generally better captured in motion.</td>', 'Nice title.  Better than Wilson.  Good photograph.  Not such a great subject.  These familiar pig skinned creatures are generally better captured in motion.', '2003-02-04 04:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(207224, 11767, 6230, '<td valign="top">Some petals at the top is over exposed, otherwise it''s a good take.</td>', 'Some petals at the top is over exposed, otherwise it''s a good take.', '2003-02-04 04:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(207227, 11958, 6230, '<td valign="top">It would have a "wild" theme if the blue sweater is absent.</td>', 'It would have a "wild" theme if the blue sweater is absent.', '2003-02-04 04:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(207228, 11764, 6349, '<td valign="top">A visually compelling portrayal of a middle class winter dwelling.  The color tones are well chosen but I think the tree should cut more evenly between the two windoes.  The slant of the lines on the roof goes real nice witrh the ones on the house and shutter.  I dont like the sign pose or whatever it is between the trees in the front.  I would take 2 to 3 steps closer and center the attention on the small window.</td>', 'A visually compelling portrayal of a middle class winter dwelling.  The color tones are well chosen but I think the tree should cut more evenly between the two windoes.  The slant of the lines on the roof goes real nice witrh the ones on the house and shutter.  I dont like the sign pose or whatever it is between the trees in the front.  I would take 2 to 3 steps closer and center the attention on the small window.', '2003-02-04 04:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(207233, 11806, 6230, '<td valign="top">The overexposure/reflection is distrating. The colours of the petals looks unnatural unless it was deliberate.</td>', 'The overexposure/reflection is distrating. The colours of the petals looks unnatural unless it was deliberate.', '2003-02-04 04:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(207234, 11877, 6230, '<td valign="top">Nice colours. If the theme is sunset, then why cover the cover with a branch?<br/></td>', 'Nice colours. If the theme is sunset, then why cover the cover with a branch?', '2003-02-04 04:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(207235, 11752, 6230, '<td valign="top">A very cheerful baby.</td>', 'A very cheerful baby.', '2003-02-04 04:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(207236, 11800, 6230, '<td valign="top">The "black hole" ruined the photo. Thats the heart and soul of the flower!!!</td>', 'The "black hole" ruined the photo. Thats the heart and soul of the flower!!!', '2003-02-04 04:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(207237, 11850, 6230, '<td valign="top">I believe the colours should be brighter by approx. +0.7  to 1.0 EV. Full marks for sharpness though.</td>', 'I believe the colours should be brighter by approx. +0.7  to 1.0 EV. Full marks for sharpness though.', '2003-02-04 04:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(207238, 12032, 6230, '<td valign="top">What are those cranes doing there? Where is the sun? A brown coloured filter would do the trick even in broad daylight. Was this actually taken during sunset?</td>', 'What are those cranes doing there? Where is the sun? A brown coloured filter would do the trick even in broad daylight. Was this actually taken during sunset?', '2003-02-04 04:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(207240, 12005, 6230, '<td valign="top">Beautiful children. Strong contrast and colours. The dog should have "looked up" to complte the composition.</td>', 'Beautiful children. Strong contrast and colours. The dog should have "looked up" to complte the composition.', '2003-02-04 04:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(207241, 11995, 6328, '<td valign="top">nice photo.  both the baby and the dog have my attention; the photo is in sharp focus, and the colors are pleasing to the eye.  I like the way you have the dog looking directly into your camera.  Perhaps you could have used your cropping a little better and left the babies hand and foot in the picture, but otherwise, nice job.</td>', 'nice photo.  both the baby and the dog have my attention; the photo is in sharp focus, and the colors are pleasing to the eye.  I like the way you have the dog looking directly into your camera.  Perhaps you could have used your cropping a little better and left the babies hand and foot in the picture, but otherwise, nice job.', '2003-02-04 04:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(207242, 11688, 6230, '<td valign="top">The colour of the blue jean gave the "scupture" away.</td>', 'The colour of the blue jean gave the "scupture" away.', '2003-02-04 04:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(207243, 11786, 6328, '<td valign="top">this just doesn''t seem to match the description of the contest.<br/>The color of the bowl is nice as is the floor/counter, however. . .</td>', 'this just doesn''t seem to match the description of the contest.The color of the bowl is nice as is the floor/counter, however. . .', '2003-02-04 04:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(207245, 11942, 6230, '<td valign="top">Nice symmetry and colours. The subject, the droplets is too small.</td>', 'Nice symmetry and colours. The subject, the droplets is too small.', '2003-02-04 04:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(207246, 11976, 6230, '<td valign="top">Take the foot/shoe away and zoom in!!!  What a waste!!!</td>', 'Take the foot/shoe away and zoom in!!!  What a waste!!!', '2003-02-04 04:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(207247, 11980, 6230, '<td valign="top">Looks unreal. Good idea but lack central focus/subject.</td>', 'Looks unreal. Good idea but lack central focus/subject.', '2003-02-04 04:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(207248, 11803, 6230, '<td valign="top">Fit for a magazine cover.</td>', 'Fit for a magazine cover.', '2003-02-04 04:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(207249, 11876, 5728, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait. You two are the best of friends aren''t you!</td>', 'Excellent portrait. You two are the best of friends aren''t you!', '2003-02-04 05:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(207250, 11975, 6230, '<td valign="top">Subject in the picture is too far and small.</td>', 'Subject in the picture is too far and small.', '2003-02-04 05:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(207251, 11797, 6328, '<td valign="top">nice clouds and colorful sky here, but perhaps you should show a bit more horizon. The sky looks like it''s on fire, and the photo is sharp and in focus, but there should be more to it for me to look at.</td>', 'nice clouds and colorful sky here, but perhaps you should show a bit more horizon. The sky looks like it''s on fire, and the photo is sharp and in focus, but there should be more to it for me to look at.', '2003-02-04 05:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(207252, 11919, 6230, '<td valign="top">A frontal shot would make the photo more interesting.</td>', 'A frontal shot would make the photo more interesting.', '2003-02-04 05:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(207253, 12050, 6328, '<td valign="top">nice photo.  you''ve captured Kermit nicely.  The lighting is right on, focusing makes the cat stand right out.  The coloring is so cool.  He seems so relaxed as he looks into the lens of the camera.  Nice job</td>', 'nice photo.  you''ve captured Kermit nicely.  The lighting is right on, focusing makes the cat stand right out.  The coloring is so cool.  He seems so relaxed as he looks into the lens of the camera.  Nice job', '2003-02-04 05:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(207254, 11861, 1073, '<td valign="top">nice composition, over sharped and too grainy.</td>', 'nice composition, over sharped and too grainy.', '2003-02-04 05:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(207255, 11837, 5628, '<td valign="top">The scenery really distracts from the main focus. In other words too much other stuff in the picture, not enough rainbow.</td>', 'The scenery really distracts from the main focus. In other words too much other stuff in the picture, not enough rainbow.', '2003-02-04 05:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(207256, 11932, 5628, '<td valign="top">Very nice! One of my favourites this week.</td>', 'Very nice! One of my favourites this week.', '2003-02-04 05:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
