(207363, 11717, 2553, '<td valign="top">This is probably my lowest rated picture.  I''m really not into sick humor.  I don''t like the composition much - there is just too much space around your subject, and the shot overall is very dark, and lacking in contrast.  I don''t find the photo to be shocking, just sad and sick.  Oh, and the only emotion it stirs in me is to wonder if you seriously need help.</td>', 'This is probably my lowest rated picture.  I''m really not into sick humor.  I don''t like the composition much - there is just too much space around your subject, and the shot overall is very dark, and lacking in contrast.  I don''t find the photo to be shocking, just sad and sick.  Oh, and the only emotion it stirs in me is to wonder if you seriously need help.', '2003-02-04 11:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
