(207567, 11890, 5822, '<td valign="top">Like the composition and bluish cast that the picture has alot, but it appears a bit underexposed. I also like the compositional balance between the wheel and the brook. Contrast could be improved here as well.  Is that a bluish tint or is this a straight on B&amp;W picture? Also, how long did you expose it for?</td>', 'Like the composition and bluish cast that the picture has alot, but it appears a bit underexposed. I also like the compositional balance between the wheel and the brook. Contrast could be improved here as well.  Is that a bluish tint or is this a straight on B&W picture? Also, how long did you expose it for?', '2003-02-04 14:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
