(207647, 11930, 3575, '<td valign="top">Absolutely Beautiful. I am thrilled with the exposure and the beautiful sparkling eyes. The lighting is soft which, I think, really makes those eyse pop more.</td>', 'Absolutely Beautiful. I am thrilled with the exposure and the beautiful sparkling eyes. The lighting is soft which, I think, really makes those eyse pop more.', '2003-02-04 14:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(207656, 11908, 6328, '<td valign="top">Very fascinating photograph.  The lighting is nicely done, showing buds starting to open up, the one flower in the background just starting to bloom and of course the one in centre stage in full bloom showing it''s full beauty for all to see and admire.  My eyes focus on the front flower, wander to the upper one, then on to the closed buds and return to the front flower again.  Nicely job.</td>', 'Very fascinating photograph.  The lighting is nicely done, showing buds starting to open up, the one flower in the background just starting to bloom and of course the one in centre stage in full bloom showing it''s full beauty for all to see and admire.  My eyes focus on the front flower, wander to the upper one, then on to the closed buds and return to the front flower again.  Nicely job.', '2003-02-04 15:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
