(207683, 12010, 6328, '<td valign="top">Lovely candid shot.  Such a beautiful little smile.  Correct me if I''m wrong, but I believe you''ve used just the natural lighting here?  The colors of the sweater are really vibrant and alive and the two blue''s of the swing seat and plastic wiring are great.  I like the way the little earrings show up in her ears, you''ve captured a lot of detail, and that smile is worth a million words.  You''ve done a good job using the rule of 3rds by not having her smack in the middle of the photo, too.</td>', 'Lovely candid shot.  Such a beautiful little smile.  Correct me if I''m wrong, but I believe you''ve used just the natural lighting here?  The colors of the sweater are really vibrant and alive and the two blue''s of the swing seat and plastic wiring are great.  I like the way the little earrings show up in her ears, you''ve captured a lot of detail, and that smile is worth a million words.  You''ve done a good job using the rule of 3rds by not having her smack in the middle of the photo, too.', '2003-02-04 15:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
