(207704, 11808, 6328, '<td valign="top">What beautiful expressive eyes.  A look of shear delight on her face warms my heart.  You''ve taken a good photograph, but the checkered background interferes with your prime subject which is the baby''s eyes and grin, but my eyes wander to the checkered background.  Perhaps a neuteral background would have been better.  Clarity is good, different shades of pink is clear and sharp, and those brown eyes are so beautiful.  Very good photograph.</td>', 'What beautiful expressive eyes.  A look of shear delight on her face warms my heart.  You''ve taken a good photograph, but the checkered background interferes with your prime subject which is the baby''s eyes and grin, but my eyes wander to the checkered background.  Perhaps a neuteral background would have been better.  Clarity is good, different shades of pink is clear and sharp, and those brown eyes are so beautiful.  Very good photograph.', '2003-02-04 16:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
