(207718, 11960, 6328, '<td valign="top">Oh, come on now, you couldn''t have waited for the sun to set?  You''ve got everything in here, and even though it looks cluttered, everything seems to fit. The black and white game board, the blue vase, the glass bear, the lovely polished box, the polished table, the beauty of that little girl with her smiling eyes looking out at you.  Is that a blue ribbon on top of her hair?  The only distracting thing is the photograph on the left wall.  I think I would have taken it down for this picture.<br/>Congratulations - - I think you''re worth a</td>', 'Oh, come on now, you couldn''t have waited for the sun to set?  You''ve got everything in here, and even though it looks cluttered, everything seems to fit. The black and white game board, the blue vase, the glass bear, the lovely polished box, the polished table, the beauty of that little girl with her smiling eyes looking out at you.  Is that a blue ribbon on top of her hair?  The only distracting thing is the photograph on the left wall.  I think I would have taken it down for this picture.Congratulations - - I think you''re worth a', '2003-02-04 16:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
