(207739, 12044, 6328, '<td valign="top">I like the diagonal display, and the color that you''ve brought into play has a good quality to it. The "star" filter effect is also nicely done.  The harsh light on the top left corner on the Pawn and Rook is a bit distracting however, and I would like to perhaps have seen the whole board in focus if possible.  The lighting/reflection below your King is also a bit annoying, draws attention away from the pieces on the board.  Excellent idea and very creative. . .</td>', 'I like the diagonal display, and the color that you''ve brought into play has a good quality to it. The "star" filter effect is also nicely done.  The harsh light on the top left corner on the Pawn and Rook is a bit distracting however, and I would like to perhaps have seen the whole board in focus if possible.  The lighting/reflection below your King is also a bit annoying, draws attention away from the pieces on the board.  Excellent idea and very creative. . .', '2003-02-04 16:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(207740, 11912, 2690, '<td valign="top">could have used a little....ah.....focus maybe. lol</td>', 'could have used a little....ah.....focus maybe. lol', '2003-02-04 16:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(207741, 11825, 3419, '<td valign="top">So cute! I have two dogs and they always get snow on their faces too.  I keep saying that I''ll capture that digitally soon. Does this dog like to roll in the snow? Good composition and nice capture of the moment.</td>', 'So cute! I have two dogs and they always get snow on their faces too.  I keep saying that I''ll capture that digitally soon. Does this dog like to roll in the snow? Good composition and nice capture of the moment.', '2003-02-04 16:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(207743, 11852, 3419, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and capture of detail. Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful composition and capture of detail. Well done.', '2003-02-04 16:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(207744, 11936, 6328, '<td valign="top">You''ve tried to come up with a nice photograph, and the background fits in with the white flower, but to me, the flower seems like it is slightly out of focus.  Instead of having it centred, perhaps a bit to the left or to the right would be more suitable?</td>', 'You''ve tried to come up with a nice photograph, and the background fits in with the white flower, but to me, the flower seems like it is slightly out of focus.  Instead of having it centred, perhaps a bit to the left or to the right would be more suitable?', '2003-02-04 16:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(207746, 11955, 4049, '<td valign="top">The lighting should be improved, it''s a bit harsh and unnatural.</td>', 'The lighting should be improved, it''s a bit harsh and unnatural.', '2003-02-04 16:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(207747, 11975, 6328, '<td valign="top">Such vibrant colors on that chair!  No, No, I mean on that bird!  He is just beautiful.  You''ve done a lovely job in taking his photograph.  And the Green jungle behind him complements him completely.  Everything is in focus including the little band on his foot, even his little claws!  I love thos blue feathers coming down off his back.<br/>Just wonder that when you were cropping, could you have gotten rid of the floor and drapes to the right?</td>', 'Such vibrant colors on that chair!  No, No, I mean on that bird!  He is just beautiful.  You''ve done a lovely job in taking his photograph.  And the Green jungle behind him complements him completely.  Everything is in focus including the little band on his foot, even his little claws!  I love thos blue feathers coming down off his back.Just wonder that when you were cropping, could you have gotten rid of the floor and drapes to the right?', '2003-02-04 16:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(207753, 11915, 6328, '<td valign="top">Beautiful closeup.  The colors are great; the whites, the browns, the blacks.  The way you''ve captured the reflection of those windows in the cats eyes is fantastic.  Excellent photograph.</td>', 'Beautiful closeup.  The colors are great; the whites, the browns, the blacks.  The way you''ve captured the reflection of those windows in the cats eyes is fantastic.  Excellent photograph.', '2003-02-04 16:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
