(207757, 12049, 3735, '<td valign="top">All  I can say is   WOW!!!</td>', 'All  I can say is   WOW!!!', '2003-02-04 16:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(207758, 11706, 6328, '<td valign="top">nice photo of your dog.  he''s in focus and the photo is sharp and the colors are good.  Unfortunately, the flash has put his shadow all over the wall behind him, a common mistake we all make.  Perhaps bouncing the flash off the ceiling may help.</td>', 'nice photo of your dog.  he''s in focus and the photo is sharp and the colors are good.  Unfortunately, the flash has put his shadow all over the wall behind him, a common mistake we all make.  Perhaps bouncing the flash off the ceiling may help.', '2003-02-04 16:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(207764, 12028, 6328, '<td valign="top">Really good photograph.  Nice and sharp, great focus.  The colors of the two cats are great and the background complement them both.  Don''t know what you''re holding in front of them, but you''ve certainly got their attention!  I don''t know if you could have done anything about it, but that door at the back is just a little bit of a distraction.  Your composition is great and the angle of the camera on the cat''s is good.  Nice lighting here also, highlights the colors of the cat''s fur just right!</td>', 'Really good photograph.  Nice and sharp, great focus.  The colors of the two cats are great and the background complement them both.  Don''t know what you''re holding in front of them, but you''ve certainly got their attention!  I don''t know if you could have done anything about it, but that door at the back is just a little bit of a distraction.  Your composition is great and the angle of the camera on the cat''s is good.  Nice lighting here also, highlights the colors of the cat''s fur just right!', '2003-02-04 17:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(207765, 12027, 4411, '<td valign="top">A lovely dog portrait. Focus is good &amp; sharp, and the dog is posing really nicely. I can understand the use of B&amp;W with a black dog, but it leaves this photo a little too dark. I think leaving it in colour would have provided more contrast between the dog and the ground beneath him.<br/>Still, a very nice shot and a cool looking dog, well done.</td>', 'A lovely dog portrait. Focus is good & sharp, and the dog is posing really nicely. I can understand the use of B&W with a black dog, but it leaves this photo a little too dark. I think leaving it in colour would have provided more contrast between the dog and the ground beneath him.Still, a very nice shot and a cool looking dog, well done.', '2003-02-04 17:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(207768, 11733, 573, '<td valign="top">I promiss I''ll stay out of your terratory.  A beautifull capture of a cat moment, but in my opinion if the tip of the nose were in focus you would have a winner.</td>', 'I promiss I''ll stay out of your terratory.  A beautifull capture of a cat moment, but in my opinion if the tip of the nose were in focus you would have a winner.', '2003-02-04 17:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
