(207792, 11784, 5266, '<td valign="top">I know that cats (and especially black cats) are hard to get a good photo of, but surely you could have gotten a better photo, per the challenge.</td>', 'I know that cats (and especially black cats) are hard to get a good photo of, but surely you could have gotten a better photo, per the challenge.', '2003-02-04 17:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(207793, 11717, 6155, '<td valign="top">Looks like it 9 lives just ran out, I hope people will see the sense of humour.<br/>Glad its in b&amp;w, colour would have made it more gory.Thanks for no entrails, I would have used some spaghetti, for that effect., By the way I am vegetarian, but I like humour in things, which this has.</td>', 'Looks like it 9 lives just ran out, I hope people will see the sense of humour.Glad its in b&w, colour would have made it more gory.Thanks for no entrails, I would have used some spaghetti, for that effect., By the way I am vegetarian, but I like humour in things, which this has.', '2003-02-04 17:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(207794, 11695, 5266, '<td valign="top">Very crisp shot!!!  Nice expression and posing (yeah, right, posing for a cat!!).  I think the only negative thing I can say, if I have to say anything negative would be "get rid of the bells" - they''re distracting me from the pretty kitty''s wonderful eyes and whiskers.  Meow!!!</td>', 'Very crisp shot!!!  Nice expression and posing (yeah, right, posing for a cat!!).  I think the only negative thing I can say, if I have to say anything negative would be "get rid of the bells" - they''re distracting me from the pretty kitty''s wonderful eyes and whiskers.  Meow!!!', '2003-02-04 17:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(207795, 11776, 4518, '<td valign="top">odd moire patterns on the building</td>', 'odd moire patterns on the building', '2003-02-04 17:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(207796, 11932, 4518, '<td valign="top">a little gainy in the dark areas</td>', 'a little gainy in the dark areas', '2003-02-04 17:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(207797, 11845, 5266, '<td valign="top">I''d like the buildings to be completely in silhouette, but this is a very nice photo - love the colors!!!  Good capture on the bird.</td>', 'I''d like the buildings to be completely in silhouette, but this is a very nice photo - love the colors!!!  Good capture on the bird.', '2003-02-04 17:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(207798, 11976, 2158, '<td valign="top">Not quite the cliche the challenge had in mind, but this photo is brilliant.</td>', 'Not quite the cliche the challenge had in mind, but this photo is brilliant.', '2003-02-04 17:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(207799, 11698, 2302, '<td valign="top">This would have been better (imo) if the shot was taken from the same level as the child. The sun is also just a bit too bright on the walls - a softer look (taken a few minutes before or later in the morning) might have given better light.</td>', 'This would have been better (imo) if the shot was taken from the same level as the child. The sun is also just a bit too bright on the walls - a softer look (taken a few minutes before or later in the morning) might have given better light.', '2003-02-04 17:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(207800, 11785, 5266, '<td valign="top">So do I!!!  This had better not be Gordon posting from Playa del Carmen!!!  Very nice colors, love the clouds and the silhouettes of trees.</td>', 'So do I!!!  This had better not be Gordon posting from Playa del Carmen!!!  Very nice colors, love the clouds and the silhouettes of trees.', '2003-02-04 17:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(207801, 12016, 5266, '<td valign="top">Cute!!!</td>', 'Cute!!!', '2003-02-04 17:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(207803, 11916, 5266, '<td valign="top">Love the background - very fitting to the subject.  Nice head &amp; shoulders of a family member!!</td>', 'Love the background - very fitting to the subject.  Nice head & shoulders of a family member!!', '2003-02-04 17:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(207804, 11774, 5266, '<td valign="top">But when is s/he not napping, exactly?  Nice pic of a furry kitty!!  Like the position of kitty''s legs - so cute.  Not crazy about the shiny background (upper left corner).</td>', 'But when is s/he not napping, exactly?  Nice pic of a furry kitty!!  Like the position of kitty''s legs - so cute.  Not crazy about the shiny background (upper left corner).', '2003-02-04 17:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(207805, 11720, 6328, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Another danm flower. . .  I like it.  You''ve captured lovely color here with your camera.  I like your dark background - nothing to distract me.  The Red roses are very nice against the Orange, and the Green of the stem leading off from both is a nice touch as well.  The orange petals look very fragile with the lighting that you''ve given them.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Wow!  Another danm flower. . .  I like it.  You''ve captured lovely color here with your camera.  I like your dark background - nothing to distract me.  The Red roses are very nice against the Orange, and the Green of the stem leading off from both is a nice touch as well.  The orange petals look very fragile with the lighting that you''ve given them.  Nicely done.', '2003-02-04 17:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(207806, 11975, 5266, '<td valign="top">Pretty bird, pretty bird!!  I don''t like the couch color - maybe a towel next time?   And a closer crop to get rid of the curtains ... just bird, towel and plant??</td>', 'Pretty bird, pretty bird!!  I don''t like the couch color - maybe a towel next time?   And a closer crop to get rid of the curtains ... just bird, towel and plant??', '2003-02-04 17:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(207807, 11802, 5266, '<td valign="top">aaaawwww!!! How cute!!!</td>', 'aaaawwww!!! How cute!!!', '2003-02-04 17:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(207808, 11709, 5266, '<td valign="top">Charlie looks like a very nice dog.  I like the b&amp;w effect for a b&amp;w dog (I''m assuming).  Nice focus on his eyes.  Good job.</td>', 'Charlie looks like a very nice dog.  I like the b&w effect for a b&w dog (I''m assuming).  Nice focus on his eyes.  Good job.', '2003-02-04 17:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(207809, 11903, 4411, '<td valign="top">That''s one hell of an expresion on his face! Looks like he''s frowning &amp; thinking ''why do I have to sit up here?''.<br/>Focus &amp; exposure are great, but the slight tilt on the shot is distracting for me. A very nice looking dog though, and overall a good shot.<br/></td>', 'That''s one hell of an expresion on his face! Looks like he''s frowning & thinking ''why do I have to sit up here?''.Focus & exposure are great, but the slight tilt on the shot is distracting for me. A very nice looking dog though, and overall a good shot.', '2003-02-04 17:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(207811, 11896, 2158, '<td valign="top">I agree.</td>', 'I agree.', '2003-02-04 17:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(207812, 11798, 3419, '<td valign="top">This photo would do better in this challenge if the child was looking at the camera, the background was less cluttered, and the woman was not there or was posing with the child.</td>', 'This photo would do better in this challenge if the child was looking at the camera, the background was less cluttered, and the woman was not there or was posing with the child.', '2003-02-04 17:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(207813, 12017, 4411, '<td valign="top">Happy indeed : )<br/>The tube appears to have given his skin a bit of a red cast, but it does provode a great frame for the shot. Only the dark area behind his head spoils it a little. Focus &amp; exposure are great, as is the subject ... what a pose!</td>', 'Happy indeed : )The tube appears to have given his skin a bit of a red cast, but it does provode a great frame for the shot. Only the dark area behind his head spoils it a little. Focus & exposure are great, as is the subject ... what a pose!', '2003-02-04 17:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(207814, 11892, 3419, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot - I love the lighting and your cat''s eyes. The pink flowers in the background add a nice splash of color and interest.  In a landscape format, this photo would look nice in a calendar.</td>', 'Beautiful shot - I love the lighting and your cat''s eyes. The pink flowers in the background add a nice splash of color and interest.  In a landscape format, this photo would look nice in a calendar.', '2003-02-04 17:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(207815, 11692, 6328, '<td valign="top">I think the white background is too harsh for your flower.  You''ve created a lovely photograph here.  The colors are bright and the picture is nicely in focus.  I like the water droplets on the flower petal and the greenery.  You''ve captured the vibrancy of the inner Orange petals nicely.</td>', 'I think the white background is too harsh for your flower.  You''ve created a lovely photograph here.  The colors are bright and the picture is nicely in focus.  I like the water droplets on the flower petal and the greenery.  You''ve captured the vibrancy of the inner Orange petals nicely.', '2003-02-04 17:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(207816, 11972, 4518, '<td valign="top">GROAN</td>', 'GROAN', '2003-02-04 17:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(207820, 11921, 3419, '<td valign="top">I hope that you meant this photo to be funny, but it doesn''t feel funny to me. Kitty doesn''t look to happy about being held like that.  I don''t really like the presentation in negative, probably because Kitty isn''t happy. Sorry...</td>', 'I hope that you meant this photo to be funny, but it doesn''t feel funny to me. Kitty doesn''t look to happy about being held like that.  I don''t really like the presentation in negative, probably because Kitty isn''t happy. Sorry...', '2003-02-04 17:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(207822, 11896, 4501, '<td valign="top">Good shot!!<br/>echoes my feelings on that subject</td>', 'Good shot!!echoes my feelings on that subject', '2003-02-04 17:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(207823, 11790, 6328, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo.  Nice sharp focus.  The colors are neat and clear.  The green foliage really show off their veins well, and the yellow looks great against the red petals.  Is there any way you could have moved your camera angle to hide the window and show more flower and foliage?</td>', 'Lovely photo.  Nice sharp focus.  The colors are neat and clear.  The green foliage really show off their veins well, and the yellow looks great against the red petals.  Is there any way you could have moved your camera angle to hide the window and show more flower and foliage?', '2003-02-04 17:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(207824, 11801, 5266, '<td valign="top">Artistic or out of focus???</td>', 'Artistic or out of focus???', '2003-02-04 17:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(207827, 11769, 6593, '<td valign="top">Good light and contrast!</td>', 'Good light and contrast!', '2003-02-04 17:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(207830, 12005, 4501, '<td valign="top">Super portrait,great lighting, get,s ahigh score from me.</td>', 'Super portrait,great lighting, get,s ahigh score from me.', '2003-02-04 18:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(207833, 11896, 4517, '<td valign="top">I normally give keyboard shots a 1, but yours is an exception. 8. Had the hammer been buried in the keyboard you would have got 10.</td>', 'I normally give keyboard shots a 1, but yours is an exception. 8. Had the hammer been buried in the keyboard you would have got 10.', '2003-02-04 18:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(207835, 12007, 3419, '<td valign="top">Awwwww! Very nice composition and focus. A little over-exposed on the right and the bottle''s lid. I like how you''ve captured the translucency on the bottle''s nipple.</td>', 'Awwwww! Very nice composition and focus. A little over-exposed on the right and the bottle''s lid. I like how you''ve captured the translucency on the bottle''s nipple.', '2003-02-04 18:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(207836, 11932, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors and sillouhette.</td>', 'Very nice colors and sillouhette.', '2003-02-04 18:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(207837, 11726, 3419, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture of detail. Nice composition too - long portrait-style makes it unusual. Can you imagine this as a poster?</td>', 'Beautiful capture of detail. Nice composition too - long portrait-style makes it unusual. Can you imagine this as a poster?', '2003-02-04 18:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(207840, 11825, 1826, '<td valign="top">Nice job filling the frame with your subject. Beautiful dog too! :)</td>', 'Nice job filling the frame with your subject. Beautiful dog too! :)', '2003-02-04 18:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(207841, 11923, 1826, '<td valign="top">Love this! It also convinces me to give borders a try, this looks great. :)</td>', 'Love this! It also convinces me to give borders a try, this looks great. :)', '2003-02-04 18:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(207842, 11865, 1826, '<td valign="top">Your backround takes this cliche shot to a whole new level. Excellent!</td>', 'Your backround takes this cliche shot to a whole new level. Excellent!', '2003-02-04 18:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(207843, 11871, 1717, '<td valign="top">very interesting photo.  well executed.  i may have done this in b &amp; w, but that''s just personal preference.  nice work!</td>', 'very interesting photo.  well executed.  i may have done this in b & w, but that''s just personal preference.  nice work!', '2003-02-04 18:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(207845, 11763, 1717, '<td valign="top">awwww how cute!!  great focus and nicely done.  background distracts a bit...a lot going on behind the subjects.  i like how the pups are looking off to the side, though.  good work!</td>', 'awwww how cute!!  great focus and nicely done.  background distracts a bit...a lot going on behind the subjects.  i like how the pups are looking off to the side, though.  good work!', '2003-02-04 18:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(207846, 11758, 1717, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors...soft focus suits this, i think.  good DOF.</td>', 'beautiful colors...soft focus suits this, i think.  good DOF.', '2003-02-04 18:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(207847, 11842, 1826, '<td valign="top">Nice family portrait- really like the sepia use too.</td>', 'Nice family portrait- really like the sepia use too.', '2003-02-04 18:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(207849, 11930, 4815, '<td valign="top">This is my ultimate fav foto of this week and for the past 4 mnths. The skin textures are delicate and with impeccable tone. The eye highlights are much nicer than studio squares. The skin highlights are exceptional, still bright but with pore texture.The elegant eyelashes and touch of earlobe accent the facial features very tastefully. A lovely casual intent smile. If there was a top score for the year at DPC this would likely be a winning candidate. What a stunning masterpiece. Outstanding technical and creative image. Please keep up the marvelous work to make the rest of us jealous.</td>', 'This is my ultimate fav foto of this week and for the past 4 mnths. The skin textures are delicate and with impeccable tone. The eye highlights are much nicer than studio squares. The skin highlights are exceptional, still bright but with pore texture.The elegant eyelashes and touch of earlobe accent the facial features very tastefully. A lovely casual intent smile. If there was a top score for the year at DPC this would likely be a winning candidate. What a stunning masterpiece. Outstanding technical and creative image. Please keep up the marvelous work to make the rest of us jealous.', '2003-02-04 18:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(207850, 11727, 1826, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot- and I didn''t mean just the snow! :)</td>', 'Very cool shot- and I didn''t mean just the snow! :)', '2003-02-04 18:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(207851, 11887, 1717, '<td valign="top">very cute photo!  i think i would have preferred a different colored background.  the contrast is a bit much for my eyes.  i like how the pups are posed, though.  nice work!</td>', 'very cute photo!  i think i would have preferred a different colored background.  the contrast is a bit much for my eyes.  i like how the pups are posed, though.  nice work!', '2003-02-04 18:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(207852, 11697, 1717, '<td valign="top">i love this!  the sepia tone makes this have a very soft feel.  the subject is a little dark, but well done, nevertheless.</td>', 'i love this!  the sepia tone makes this have a very soft feel.  the subject is a little dark, but well done, nevertheless.', '2003-02-04 18:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(207853, 11980, 6597, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2003-02-04 18:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(207854, 11902, 1826, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful. :)</td>', 'Simply beautiful. :)', '2003-02-04 18:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(207855, 11789, 5677, '<td valign="top">I love roses because of their colors but you seemed to make this work in black and white.  There is very good detail within the flower.</td>', 'I love roses because of their colors but you seemed to make this work in black and white.  There is very good detail within the flower.', '2003-02-04 18:45:07.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(207857, 11727, 1717, '<td valign="top">wow...i love this!  very surreal looking.  i love how the poles just disappear into the mist.  beautiful!</td>', 'wow...i love this!  very surreal looking.  i love how the poles just disappear into the mist.  beautiful!', '2003-02-04 18:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(207858, 11895, 1717, '<td valign="top">awwww how sweet!  i like the sepia tone and the focus is great.  i find the light is just a bit too harsh on the face...maybe a diffuser of some sort next time.  still, i beautiful photo!</td>', 'awwww how sweet!  i like the sepia tone and the focus is great.  i find the light is just a bit too harsh on the face...maybe a diffuser of some sort next time.  still, i beautiful photo!', '2003-02-04 18:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(207859, 11879, 4815, '<td valign="top">Sweet success for this winning  photo. Perfect bug and bud focus. The background is blurred well with no annoying harsh highlights. Two  basic colors tightens up the theme of your image and adds well to the bright mood of your shot. A first class macro shot that adds real pizzaz to those typical static flower shots. So when do you start on the payroll for National Geographic?</td>', 'Sweet success for this winning  photo. Perfect bug and bud focus. The background is blurred well with no annoying harsh highlights. Two  basic colors tightens up the theme of your image and adds well to the bright mood of your shot. A first class macro shot that adds real pizzaz to those typical static flower shots. So when do you start on the payroll for National Geographic?', '2003-02-04 18:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(207860, 12001, 2553, '<td valign="top">Don''t get it.  Distracting composition; too much grain for my taste, and I don''t really know what the subject would be.</td>', 'Don''t get it.  Distracting composition; too much grain for my taste, and I don''t really know what the subject would be.', '2003-02-04 18:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(207861, 11682, 2553, '<td valign="top">Kinda weird.  Composition is OK, and thank God for negative space.  The shot just doesn''t appeal to me on any level.</td>', 'Kinda weird.  Composition is OK, and thank God for negative space.  The shot just doesn''t appeal to me on any level.', '2003-02-04 18:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(207862, 11902, 4411, '<td valign="top">Probably a bit too plain &amp; simple for me. Technique and composition are excellent, but it lacks that extra something to make it stand out from the other flower shots. I can''t help but thinking that a touch of colour (a stalk maybe?) would have given it an extra edge. <br/>A good shot anyway.</td>', 'Probably a bit too plain & simple for me. Technique and composition are excellent, but it lacks that extra something to make it stand out from the other flower shots. I can''t help but thinking that a touch of colour (a stalk maybe?) would have given it an extra edge. A good shot anyway.', '2003-02-04 18:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(207863, 11871, 2553, '<td valign="top">Pretty decent focus on the flower, DOF works well for this shot.  I like that the background appears to be in black and white, while the flower is in color.  I''m not altogether crazy about the whole dead flower thing, but you managed to make it look pretty good.</td>', 'Pretty decent focus on the flower, DOF works well for this shot.  I like that the background appears to be in black and white, while the flower is in color.  I''m not altogether crazy about the whole dead flower thing, but you managed to make it look pretty good.', '2003-02-04 18:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(207864, 12047, 3419, '<td valign="top">This looks very much like an old vintage photograph, and works very well in black and white. Nicely done.</td>', 'This looks very much like an old vintage photograph, and works very well in black and white. Nicely done.', '2003-02-04 18:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(207865, 11803, 4815, '<td valign="top">This is a technically incredible shot from the standpoint of the serious DOF. The tones are perfect and certainly speak well in contrast to the background. The nose tip runs into the cheekline to the diappointment of ultra-perfectionists. But this is real life not a statue. So I like it even with the cute chin dribble. I love the wavy hairdo and those ever so delicate highlights. A truly professional job.</td>', 'This is a technically incredible shot from the standpoint of the serious DOF. The tones are perfect and certainly speak well in contrast to the background. The nose tip runs into the cheekline to the diappointment of ultra-perfectionists. But this is real life not a statue. So I like it even with the cute chin dribble. I love the wavy hairdo and those ever so delicate highlights. A truly professional job.', '2003-02-04 18:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(207866, 11914, 1717, '<td valign="top">great photo!  i love the background texture and DOF.  not crazy about the greenish tint, but that''s just personal preference.  very well done!</td>', 'great photo!  i love the background texture and DOF.  not crazy about the greenish tint, but that''s just personal preference.  very well done!', '2003-02-04 18:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(207867, 12041, 2553, '<td valign="top">A very out of focus, "busy" shot with lots of distractions and no discernible subject.</td>', 'A very out of focus, "busy" shot with lots of distractions and no discernible subject.', '2003-02-04 18:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(207868, 11971, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice effect</td>', 'Nice effect', '2003-02-04 18:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(207869, 11915, 1717, '<td valign="top">beautiful photo!  focus is great, subject is beautiful...i love it!  a winner!</td>', 'beautiful photo!  focus is great, subject is beautiful...i love it!  a winner!', '2003-02-04 18:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(207870, 12021, 1717, '<td valign="top">beautiful color.  good focus.  i love the shadows.</td>', 'beautiful color.  good focus.  i love the shadows.', '2003-02-04 19:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(207871, 11710, 3419, '<td valign="top">This photo looks like you''ve applied some kind of filter to it - it has a kind of vintage texture feeling. Very interesting. I like it.</td>', 'This photo looks like you''ve applied some kind of filter to it - it has a kind of vintage texture feeling. Very interesting. I like it.', '2003-02-04 19:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(207872, 11727, 4815, '<td valign="top">And the DPC winner gets two tickets to Hawaii. Man do I pity your front yard buddy. Cryogenics for brass monkeys or what. I am in love with the stark brutal bite of this shot. The fuzzy clouds and disolving poles are spectacular. Personally I would like to trash the shadow near the bottom frame to accentuate the floaty feel. Frozen drool over the poles and the wires. A totally brilliant show.</td>', 'And the DPC winner gets two tickets to Hawaii. Man do I pity your front yard buddy. Cryogenics for brass monkeys or what. I am in love with the stark brutal bite of this shot. The fuzzy clouds and disolving poles are spectacular. Personally I would like to trash the shadow near the bottom frame to accentuate the floaty feel. Frozen drool over the poles and the wires. A totally brilliant show.', '2003-02-04 19:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(207873, 11717, 1717, '<td valign="top">i''m very thankful for the admin. clarification that this is not a real cat!  i was getting upset! :)  still, a very disturbing image...but a good photo should be thought provoking, in my opinion.  unfortunately, the subject blends in with the background and it''s a little too dark on the left side.  nice textures, though</td>', 'i''m very thankful for the admin. clarification that this is not a real cat!  i was getting upset! :)  still, a very disturbing image...but a good photo should be thought provoking, in my opinion.  unfortunately, the subject blends in with the background and it''s a little too dark on the left side.  nice textures, though', '2003-02-04 19:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(207874, 12049, 1717, '<td valign="top">beautiful photo!  i love the shadows and pose.  i wish the feathers were a little more distinctive, but all in all, very well done!  i would love to know how you got this shot!</td>', 'beautiful photo!  i love the shadows and pose.  i wish the feathers were a little more distinctive, but all in all, very well done!  i would love to know how you got this shot!', '2003-02-04 19:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(207875, 11991, 4815, '<td valign="top">Wow! What a spectacular moment. One in a million to get that opened beak on CCD.The freeform acrobatics add real vibrancy to this image. The birds overlap a touch, but then I won''t ask you to reshoot another 1000 frames for punishment either. The brilliant blue and white outstetched wings exemplify freedom. Should be framed on my wall as well as yours. Wonderful.</td>', 'Wow! What a spectacular moment. One in a million to get that opened beak on CCD.The freeform acrobatics add real vibrancy to this image. The birds overlap a touch, but then I won''t ask you to reshoot another 1000 frames for punishment either. The brilliant blue and white outstetched wings exemplify freedom. Should be framed on my wall as well as yours. Wonderful.', '2003-02-04 19:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(207877, 11692, 6444, '<td valign="top">it is were nice i really like the water</td>', 'it is were nice i really like the water', '2003-02-04 19:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(207878, 11995, 1717, '<td valign="top">what a sweet baby...look at all that hair!!  i wish this shot had been a little more posed...maybe with the baby sitting up and more eye level with the dog.  would like to see another try at this...i think it would be worth the effort. :)<br/></td>', 'what a sweet baby...look at all that hair!!  i wish this shot had been a little more posed...maybe with the baby sitting up and more eye level with the dog.  would like to see another try at this...i think it would be worth the effort. :)', '2003-02-04 19:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(207879, 12007, 6444, '<td valign="top">nice job</td>', 'nice job', '2003-02-04 19:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(207880, 11896, 6444, '<td valign="top">good try</td>', 'good try', '2003-02-04 19:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(207881, 12010, 6444, '<td valign="top">i really like it</td>', 'i really like it', '2003-02-04 19:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
