(207913, 11937, 4815, '<td valign="top">A very cool choice of perspective. Superior artistic expression. The orange loop over "cliche" is a truly amzing touch. The fingerprint lines are terrific. The blue background compliments the subject well. Their are going to be some noses up in the air over those burning highlights. Phooey on them.A technically difficult subject to deal with in terms of focus and lighting. You have done admirably well. I still think it''s a great job.</td>', 'A very cool choice of perspective. Superior artistic expression. The orange loop over "cliche" is a truly amzing touch. The fingerprint lines are terrific. The blue background compliments the subject well. Their are going to be some noses up in the air over those burning highlights. Phooey on them.A technically difficult subject to deal with in terms of focus and lighting. You have done admirably well. I still think it''s a great job.', '2003-02-04 19:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
