(208012, 11824, 2553, '<td valign="top">Those feathers look HUGE.  Where''d ya get those? I want some!  I like the feathers and the rose, but the - eggs, I guess, look out of place.  I wouldn''t have put them together with the rose.  Composition really throws me off because it''s hard to know what the actual subject is - rose, feathers, or eggs.  Would have liked a little more light on the rose, I think.</td>', 'Those feathers look HUGE.  Where''d ya get those? I want some!  I like the feathers and the rose, but the - eggs, I guess, look out of place.  I wouldn''t have put them together with the rose.  Composition really throws me off because it''s hard to know what the actual subject is - rose, feathers, or eggs.  Would have liked a little more light on the rose, I think.', '2003-02-04 19:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(208014, 11810, 6444, '<td valign="top">good use of lighting, but she needs some clothes</td>', 'good use of lighting, but she needs some clothes', '2003-02-04 19:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(208015, 11749, 6328, '<td valign="top">Sweet dreams.  He looks tired, doesn''t he?  The colors are refreshing and you''ve done a good job with the lighting.  You can even see the bluish tinge in his eyelids, and I like the way you''ve killed the background.</td>', 'Sweet dreams.  He looks tired, doesn''t he?  The colors are refreshing and you''ve done a good job with the lighting.  You can even see the bluish tinge in his eyelids, and I like the way you''ve killed the background.', '2003-02-04 19:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(208016, 12046, 2553, '<td valign="top">Yep, the eye is the important thing, and that is in great focus.  Beautiful color too.  I like the way you have just a bit of the whiskers in there, and the nose.  I don''t like  pics with JUST the eye. Nice composition, well done.</td>', 'Yep, the eye is the important thing, and that is in great focus.  Beautiful color too.  I like the way you have just a bit of the whiskers in there, and the nose.  I don''t like  pics with JUST the eye. Nice composition, well done.', '2003-02-04 19:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(208017, 11903, 2716, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful dog.  Golden retrieve?  Beautiful capture.  Good luck.  I love just love the colours of the fure</td>', 'What a beautiful dog.  Golden retrieve?  Beautiful capture.  Good luck.  I love just love the colours of the fure', '2003-02-04 19:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(208018, 12024, 2553, '<td valign="top">Would have preferred that the tongue be in focus, since the title kind of makes it the subject.  I like the composition, but would have liked better focus throughout.</td>', 'Would have preferred that the tongue be in focus, since the title kind of makes it the subject.  I like the composition, but would have liked better focus throughout.', '2003-02-04 19:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(208019, 11701, 6444, '<td valign="top">good job, funny title</td>', 'good job, funny title', '2003-02-04 19:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(208021, 11701, 6328, '<td valign="top">Is this what you call an Abstract?  It really doesn''t make any sense to me. It''s really grainy/which you''ve done a good job on, but other than that, it just doesn''t "wow" me.  Sorry.</td>', 'Is this what you call an Abstract?  It really doesn''t make any sense to me. It''s really grainy/which you''ve done a good job on, but other than that, it just doesn''t "wow" me.  Sorry.', '2003-02-04 19:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(208022, 11747, 2553, '<td valign="top">The only thing that saves this for me is that it is in black and white.  That alone does make it an interesting shot for me.  I am not crazy about shots of kids toys generally.  The texture of the draped background adds interest, and I do like the lighting a lot.</td>', 'The only thing that saves this for me is that it is in black and white.  That alone does make it an interesting shot for me.  I am not crazy about shots of kids toys generally.  The texture of the draped background adds interest, and I do like the lighting a lot.', '2003-02-04 19:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(208023, 11851, 2553, '<td valign="top">Not a Mapplethorpe fan at all, but the composition of this alone makes it interesting.  Would have like more light on the flower - not enough contrast there for me.</td>', 'Not a Mapplethorpe fan at all, but the composition of this alone makes it interesting.  Would have like more light on the flower - not enough contrast there for me.', '2003-02-04 19:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(208024, 11972, 2553, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp, clear photo, with decent lighting , but relatively low impact for me.</td>', 'Nice sharp, clear photo, with decent lighting , but relatively low impact for me.', '2003-02-04 19:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(208025, 11933, 2716, '<td valign="top">Good shot Allen (just guessing).  Nice journalism shot.  Good luck.</td>', 'Good shot Allen (just guessing).  Nice journalism shot.  Good luck.', '2003-02-04 19:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(208026, 11967, 2553, '<td valign="top">Um, I seem to be unable to actually see the "shoe tie".  Pretty nice clear shot of a lovely young lady, but a very distracting background.  And the title refers to something I can''t see, so that kind of takes away from the experience for me.</td>', 'Um, I seem to be unable to actually see the "shoe tie".  Pretty nice clear shot of a lovely young lady, but a very distracting background.  And the title refers to something I can''t see, so that kind of takes away from the experience for me.', '2003-02-04 19:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(208027, 11925, 6328, '<td valign="top">Hey, nice teeth.  And that beautiful pink tongue!  He looks like he''s smiling at you, ready to get his photo taken. . . and look at that static on his upper head!</td>', 'Hey, nice teeth.  And that beautiful pink tongue!  He looks like he''s smiling at you, ready to get his photo taken. . . and look at that static on his upper head!', '2003-02-04 19:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(208031, 11801, 6328, '<td valign="top">sorry, but everything here looks completely out of focus, otherwise it would have been a nice picture.  The colors would have been something to have a look at.</td>', 'sorry, but everything here looks completely out of focus, otherwise it would have been a nice picture.  The colors would have been something to have a look at.', '2003-02-04 19:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(208032, 11809, 2553, '<td valign="top">It would be hard for me to tell you why, but this shot just really turns me off.  For the most part, the lighting seems pretty good, and the pink color is nice and vivid, but I''m not comfortable with the composition, or the general overall look of the flower.</td>', 'It would be hard for me to tell you why, but this shot just really turns me off.  For the most part, the lighting seems pretty good, and the pink color is nice and vivid, but I''m not comfortable with the composition, or the general overall look of the flower.', '2003-02-04 19:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(208033, 11996, 70, '<td valign="top">Great cliche! Nice shot.</td>', 'Great cliche! Nice shot.', '2003-02-04 19:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(208034, 12031, 2553, '<td valign="top">Much too much distracting background.  Zoom in on the little guy, he''s adorable!</td>', 'Much too much distracting background.  Zoom in on the little guy, he''s adorable!', '2003-02-04 19:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(208035, 11791, 70, '<td valign="top">This is adorable! A little bright on the upper left hand corner but what a great shot to catch.</td>', 'This is adorable! A little bright on the upper left hand corner but what a great shot to catch.', '2003-02-04 19:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(208036, 11847, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very soft focus, but for me, it doesn''t hurt the shot much, because the eyes and eyelashes are in pretty good focus.  The outer edges of the ears look almost like a painting.</td>', 'Very soft focus, but for me, it doesn''t hurt the shot much, because the eyes and eyelashes are in pretty good focus.  The outer edges of the ears look almost like a painting.', '2003-02-04 19:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(208037, 11912, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very grainy, and looks WAY oversharped, and not nearly enough kitty in the frame!  Way too much empty space between the flowers and the cat for me.  Even so , had this been a nice, crisp, clear shot it would have earned a better score from me.</td>', 'Very grainy, and looks WAY oversharped, and not nearly enough kitty in the frame!  Way too much empty space between the flowers and the cat for me.  Even so , had this been a nice, crisp, clear shot it would have earned a better score from me.', '2003-02-04 19:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(208038, 11912, 2716, '<td valign="top">Great cliche shot, however it looks like quite a bit of camera shake.</td>', 'Great cliche shot, however it looks like quite a bit of camera shake.', '2003-02-04 19:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(208039, 11965, 2553, '<td valign="top">This is actually one of the few "dead" flower shots that I like.  Not enough light on the flowers for me, but otherwise, pretty darn nice.</td>', 'This is actually one of the few "dead" flower shots that I like.  Not enough light on the flowers for me, but otherwise, pretty darn nice.', '2003-02-04 19:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(208040, 11786, 2553, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture of the woodgrain, but  I have no idea how this applies to the "cliche" challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful capture of the woodgrain, but  I have no idea how this applies to the "cliche" challenge.', '2003-02-04 19:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
