(208044, 11820, 2553, '<td valign="top">Guess I''m not familiar with this particular "cliche".  Feels unbalanced with the blinding white light on the bottom and all the dark on the top.  Makes me feel like I do when a car is approaching me with it''s brights on, I just want to look away.</td>', 'Guess I''m not familiar with this particular "cliche".  Feels unbalanced with the blinding white light on the bottom and all the dark on the top.  Makes me feel like I do when a car is approaching me with it''s brights on, I just want to look away.', '2003-02-04 20:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(208045, 12008, 2716, '<td valign="top">Cute dog.  I''d like to see more of him.</td>', 'Cute dog.  I''d like to see more of him.', '2003-02-04 20:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(208046, 11810, 772, '<td valign="top">nicely done portrait... your lighting is excellent... = 10 - setzler</td>', 'nicely done portrait... your lighting is excellent... = 10 - setzler', '2003-02-04 20:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(208047, 11927, 2553, '<td valign="top">I adore the nice tight crop, and that his/her toy is in the shot.  Very nice composition, and pretty good lighting.</td>', 'I adore the nice tight crop, and that his/her toy is in the shot.  Very nice composition, and pretty good lighting.', '2003-02-04 20:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(208048, 11721, 2716, '<td valign="top">lol.  Great shot.  You could brighten it up (not so dark) in photo shop to give it a bit more kick.  Good capture.  Jacko.  7.  Would like to see more focus</td>', 'lol.  Great shot.  You could brighten it up (not so dark) in photo shop to give it a bit more kick.  Good capture.  Jacko.  7.  Would like to see more focus', '2003-02-04 20:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
