(208114, 11840, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful silowette (sp) and the colors are out of th world.  Some won''t but I do like the cropping of the shorter bushes on one side, buildings, then the 2 taller bushes on the other side.  To me that sets off the photo.  To me you have nailed this sunset.  Great job, well done.</td>', 'This is a beautiful silowette (sp) and the colors are out of th world.  Some won''t but I do like the cropping of the shorter bushes on one side, buildings, then the 2 taller bushes on the other side.  To me that sets off the photo.  To me you have nailed this sunset.  Great job, well done.', '2003-02-04 20:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(208115, 11865, 70, '<td valign="top">Nice combination of cliches. Impressive water drop, especially with the chessboard view. White specks or something detract a bit...</td>', 'Nice combination of cliches. Impressive water drop, especially with the chessboard view. White specks or something detract a bit...', '2003-02-04 20:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(208116, 11878, 70, '<td valign="top">Nice splash. A tad bit on the dark side and would prefer that the splash wasn''t cropped quite so close.</td>', 'Nice splash. A tad bit on the dark side and would prefer that the splash wasn''t cropped quite so close.', '2003-02-04 20:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
