(208127, 11682, 2716, '<td valign="top">How the hell did you do that?  I''m intrigued.  Good job.</td>', 'How the hell did you do that?  I''m intrigued.  Good job.', '2003-02-04 20:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(208128, 11815, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is a really neat old house.  Looks like it was a lodge of some kind.  Looks like it is full of lots of good stories.  Wondering if B&amp;W was the best choice for this one.  I rather like the pealing paint and weathering of the wood.  That might added to the photo to be able to see it in color.  But just a thought.  It is great just like it is.    I really like the hazy soft focus on this.  Wish you the best.  It''s really good.</td>', 'This is a really neat old house.  Looks like it was a lodge of some kind.  Looks like it is full of lots of good stories.  Wondering if B&W was the best choice for this one.  I rather like the pealing paint and weathering of the wood.  That might added to the photo to be able to see it in color.  But just a thought.  It is great just like it is.    I really like the hazy soft focus on this.  Wish you the best.  It''s really good.', '2003-02-04 20:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(208129, 11957, 70, '<td valign="top">Nice color. Would have liked the buds around the outside to either be more focused or more out of focus.</td>', 'Nice color. Would have liked the buds around the outside to either be more focused or more out of focus.', '2003-02-04 20:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
