(208139, 11723, 4648, '<td valign="top">I love the tone and the reflection.  Does that ever stand out at night.  Are those spot lights shining up in the air, 3 toward it and 2 on the left straight up?  To me those add to the whole idea of pointing out justwhat it is.  This should be right at the top.  Great job and well done.  I can see this hanging on a wall.</td>', 'I love the tone and the reflection.  Does that ever stand out at night.  Are those spot lights shining up in the air, 3 toward it and 2 on the left straight up?  To me those add to the whole idea of pointing out justwhat it is.  This should be right at the top.  Great job and well done.  I can see this hanging on a wall.', '2003-02-04 20:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(208140, 11699, 1717, '<td valign="top">a little too bright for my liking.  i like the cropping, although, i probably would have not cropped the right side as much.  cute pup!</td>', 'a little too bright for my liking.  i like the cropping, although, i probably would have not cropped the right side as much.  cute pup!', '2003-02-04 20:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
