(208142, 11712, 2716, '<td valign="top">Very nice (negative image).  Really has a nice surreal effect.</td>', 'Very nice (negative image).  Really has a nice surreal effect.', '2003-02-04 20:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(208143, 12032, 6100, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent sky and an excellent image of the Statue of Liberty. It''s really too bad that all the ironworks in the background and, unfortunately, the bird, too, draw the eye away from the power point of this image. Nice choice of timing for the sky and good exposure.</td>', 'This is an excellent sky and an excellent image of the Statue of Liberty. It''s really too bad that all the ironworks in the background and, unfortunately, the bird, too, draw the eye away from the power point of this image. Nice choice of timing for the sky and good exposure.', '2003-02-04 20:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(208144, 11785, 6100, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. The proportions are nice although straightening the horizon would make this an even stronger image.</td>', 'Very nice photo. The proportions are nice although straightening the horizon would make this an even stronger image.', '2003-02-04 20:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(208145, 11688, 4648, '<td valign="top">Somehow this looks a little contrived to me.  Strange that the ice is infront of the statue rather than all over it.  OR is this a boy standing in front of a sheet of ice.  Yes you got me with this one.  And it has to be good to confuse me.  Wish the building in the background on the right was not there.  Would make it a lot better.  Then the only dark thing would be the boy, or statue, which ever it is.  Nice one.</td>', 'Somehow this looks a little contrived to me.  Strange that the ice is infront of the statue rather than all over it.  OR is this a boy standing in front of a sheet of ice.  Yes you got me with this one.  And it has to be good to confuse me.  Wish the building in the background on the right was not there.  Would make it a lot better.  Then the only dark thing would be the boy, or statue, which ever it is.  Nice one.', '2003-02-04 20:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(208146, 11906, 6100, '<td valign="top">Powerful image but the strong shadows detract. If you could soften these I think it would help the image.</td>', 'Powerful image but the strong shadows detract. If you could soften these I think it would help the image.', '2003-02-04 20:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(208147, 12017, 3575, '<td valign="top">Love this photo! The expression is priceless. I love the concept, what is he inside of? I don''t know how you did the lighting but, although a little dark, it is still a great photograph.</td>', 'Love this photo! The expression is priceless. I love the concept, what is he inside of? I don''t know how you did the lighting but, although a little dark, it is still a great photograph.', '2003-02-04 20:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(208148, 12002, 6100, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The reflection is so well controlled and the choice of black and white with the splash of yellow is intriguing!</td>', 'Very nice. The reflection is so well controlled and the choice of black and white with the splash of yellow is intriguing!', '2003-02-04 20:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(208149, 11790, 3575, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. I love the composition with all of the interest in the lower right. Great lighting and colors. A little soft but not too soft. Nice job.</td>', 'Very pretty. I love the composition with all of the interest in the lower right. Great lighting and colors. A little soft but not too soft. Nice job.', '2003-02-04 20:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(208150, 11978, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp image with the appropriate amount of background out-of-focus. The shadows are soft enough to not be distracting and I like your title.</td>', 'Nice sharp image with the appropriate amount of background out-of-focus. The shadows are soft enough to not be distracting and I like your title.', '2003-02-04 20:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(208151, 11814, 4648, '<td valign="top">That expression is worth a 20 in itself.  What a little ham.  But I''ll tell you up front I do not like the top and the bottom of the photo.  To me it destroys a very beautiful, well done photo that in itself deserves a 9 or 10.  Enough said.</td>', 'That expression is worth a 20 in itself.  What a little ham.  But I''ll tell you up front I do not like the top and the bottom of the photo.  To me it destroys a very beautiful, well done photo that in itself deserves a 9 or 10.  Enough said.', '2003-02-04 20:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(208152, 11968, 6100, '<td valign="top">Looks like there''s something taken out of the photo ... like the background ... or the image was sharpened too much. I always like pictures of dogs, though.</td>', 'Looks like there''s something taken out of the photo ... like the background ... or the image was sharpened too much. I always like pictures of dogs, though.', '2003-02-04 20:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(208154, 12027, 3575, '<td valign="top">Nice pose and composition. I like the b &amp; w but the image is very dark on my monitor so I can barely tell his eyes are open. I would really like to see more of the beautiful face this dog must have.</td>', 'Nice pose and composition. I like the b & w but the image is very dark on my monitor so I can barely tell his eyes are open. I would really like to see more of the beautiful face this dog must have.', '2003-02-04 20:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(208156, 11758, 6325, '<td valign="top">The petal in the main area seems out of focus.</td>', 'The petal in the main area seems out of focus.', '2003-02-04 20:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(208157, 11739, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nice image but I''ve always avoided locations with contrails. Since they are there, it is nice that they lead INTO the sun!</td>', 'Nice image but I''ve always avoided locations with contrails. Since they are there, it is nice that they lead INTO the sun!', '2003-02-04 20:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(208158, 11840, 6100, '<td valign="top">Wow ... what a fantastic color. You selected a great sky and time of day to shoot this one.</td>', 'Wow ... what a fantastic color. You selected a great sky and time of day to shoot this one.', '2003-02-04 20:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(208159, 12039, 6325, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Focus on the inlay could have been sharper.</td>', 'Nice shot. Focus on the inlay could have been sharper.', '2003-02-04 20:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(208160, 12022, 3575, '<td valign="top">I am expecting to see the Norelco Santa appearing over the hill. Actually this is an incredible photograph. The lighting caused by the low sun really accentuates the hills and valleys of the snow drifts and CONGRATULATIONS on the beautiful texture of the snow!! I hope you are going to share your technique with the rest of us. It''s so perfect it doesn''t look real. Truly amazing. 10!!</td>', 'I am expecting to see the Norelco Santa appearing over the hill. Actually this is an incredible photograph. The lighting caused by the low sun really accentuates the hills and valleys of the snow drifts and CONGRATULATIONS on the beautiful texture of the snow!! I hope you are going to share your technique with the rest of us. It''s so perfect it doesn''t look real. Truly amazing. 10!!', '2003-02-04 20:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(208161, 11846, 4648, '<td valign="top">Ohhhhhh.  It hurts that you cropped him up.  I love the photo, but all of it.  I find myself scrolling down to see the rest of the photo.  I''m not kidding.  What you have is nice, just not enough of it.  With all of it I could have even overlooked the too soft of focus on the plant.  I personally think it should have been sharper.  But that''s just me, like the Whole bird thing.  It''s still a nice photo, though.</td>', 'Ohhhhhh.  It hurts that you cropped him up.  I love the photo, but all of it.  I find myself scrolling down to see the rest of the photo.  I''m not kidding.  What you have is nice, just not enough of it.  With all of it I could have even overlooked the too soft of focus on the plant.  I personally think it should have been sharper.  But that''s just me, like the Whole bird thing.  It''s still a nice photo, though.', '2003-02-04 20:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(208162, 11896, 3575, '<td valign="top">LOL, very funny. Nicely composed and great DOF.</td>', 'LOL, very funny. Nicely composed and great DOF.', '2003-02-04 20:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(208163, 11755, 6100, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what animal this is but the half-covered eye makes it looks somewhat sinister. Very sharp image and I like the B/W effect.</td>', 'I''m not sure what animal this is but the half-covered eye makes it looks somewhat sinister. Very sharp image and I like the B/W effect.', '2003-02-04 20:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(208164, 11844, 3575, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a shot, Excellent focus. Not my favorite thing to look at (I''m a girly girl) but I an really appreciate that this must have been difficult to capture. Good job.</td>', 'Wow, what a shot, Excellent focus. Not my favorite thing to look at (I''m a girly girl) but I an really appreciate that this must have been difficult to capture. Good job.', '2003-02-04 20:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(208166, 11731, 6100, '<td valign="top">Well done. The choice of where you shot this from makes a very nice photo. The increasing yellow up the hill is very nice. I would like to see the sky a bit darker and with more detail. Too bad we can''t burn in some areas. Maybe a split ND filter would help a shot like this.</td>', 'Well done. The choice of where you shot this from makes a very nice photo. The increasing yellow up the hill is very nice. I would like to see the sky a bit darker and with more detail. Too bad we can''t burn in some areas. Maybe a split ND filter would help a shot like this.', '2003-02-04 20:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(208167, 11860, 4648, '<td valign="top">The border worked against you in this one.  This is a really nice photo, but with the big brown border your eyes are drawn to it, away from the photo.  The border also points out that there is too much empty space on the left side.  With out the border it would have been ok with that much.  The low hung clouds on the mountains and the haze on the buildings really make this photo.  This looks like a place in Chesapeake, WVa..  Because of the border it went from a 9 to a 6.</td>', 'The border worked against you in this one.  This is a really nice photo, but with the big brown border your eyes are drawn to it, away from the photo.  The border also points out that there is too much empty space on the left side.  With out the border it would have been ok with that much.  The low hung clouds on the mountains and the haze on the buildings really make this photo.  This looks like a place in Chesapeake, WVa..  Because of the border it went from a 9 to a 6.', '2003-02-04 20:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(208168, 11896, 6325, '<td valign="top">I know what you mean! The "Square" challenge was brutal.</td>', 'I know what you mean! The "Square" challenge was brutal.', '2003-02-04 21:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(208169, 11809, 3575, '<td valign="top">This is an example of the inside of the flower being more interesting than the petals. It''s so intricut, it looks like an elaborate kaleidoscope. I like the blue background against the white and then the fuchia just pops. I really love the way you photographed your flower.</td>', 'This is an example of the inside of the flower being more interesting than the petals. It''s so intricut, it looks like an elaborate kaleidoscope. I like the blue background against the white and then the fuchia just pops. I really love the way you photographed your flower.', '2003-02-04 21:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(208171, 12007, 3575, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Oh my goodness, if you didn''t capture the moment - everybody who views this will be right there with you. The way you cropped your image accentuates the feeling even more. Excellent job. Love it!</td>', 'LOL!  Oh my goodness, if you didn''t capture the moment - everybody who views this will be right there with you. The way you cropped your image accentuates the feeling even more. Excellent job. Love it!', '2003-02-04 21:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(208173, 11855, 6100, '<td valign="top">Superb image. The lighting is outstanding!</td>', 'Superb image. The lighting is outstanding!', '2003-02-04 21:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(208174, 11697, 3575, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I love everything about this photograph. I love the texture of the water, the way the rocks are angled up across the canvas and, of course, the little fisherman. Wonderfully emotive. He didn''t lose his shoe in the mud did he? Oh, I like your choice of duo tone.</td>', 'Beautiful! I love everything about this photograph. I love the texture of the water, the way the rocks are angled up across the canvas and, of course, the little fisherman. Wonderfully emotive. He didn''t lose his shoe in the mud did he? Oh, I like your choice of duo tone.', '2003-02-04 21:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(208175, 11845, 4648, '<td valign="top">Looks like a giggle in the camera, leaving the structures with a kinds double image.  Don''t know what the dark spot in the water on the left side but it looks out of place.  On the right the bright sun washed out places in the waves, maybe where they are breaking.  This has a lot of potential to be a beautiful photo of a stunning sunset with a better execution.</td>', 'Looks like a giggle in the camera, leaving the structures with a kinds double image.  Don''t know what the dark spot in the water on the left side but it looks out of place.  On the right the bright sun washed out places in the waves, maybe where they are breaking.  This has a lot of potential to be a beautiful photo of a stunning sunset with a better execution.', '2003-02-04 21:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(208176, 11884, 6325, '<td valign="top">Nice colors. A tighter crop when have made "Bobo" stand out more.</td>', 'Nice colors. A tighter crop when have made "Bobo" stand out more.', '2003-02-04 21:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(208177, 11759, 6100, '<td valign="top">Minor point but I don''t think those are ducks ... look like Canadian Geese to me!</td>', 'Minor point but I don''t think those are ducks ... look like Canadian Geese to me!', '2003-02-04 21:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(208178, 11952, 3575, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset and very artistically presented with the way you place the tree in the corner. I love it.</td>', 'Beautiful sunset and very artistically presented with the way you place the tree in the corner. I love it.', '2003-02-04 21:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(208179, 12022, 6100, '<td valign="top">You''ve gotten an excellent image here. You must have been on snowshoes to get it, though. The light and shadow are excellent and you''ve captured a very nice image here.</td>', 'You''ve gotten an excellent image here. You must have been on snowshoes to get it, though. The light and shadow are excellent and you''ve captured a very nice image here.', '2003-02-04 21:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(208180, 11897, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful Christmas cactus, with or without the water.  To me if you are going to put water on any of it you should have put it on all of it, including the fully bloomed flower.  Personally I don''t feel the water really adds anything to a photo.  The focus on this is fantastic.  Nice choice of blooms, not too many but just enough, especially one open and one closed.  Great choice.  Could be a wonderful piece of art - decide about the water.  Course this is just my opinion.</td>', 'This is a beautiful Christmas cactus, with or without the water.  To me if you are going to put water on any of it you should have put it on all of it, including the fully bloomed flower.  Personally I don''t feel the water really adds anything to a photo.  The focus on this is fantastic.  Nice choice of blooms, not too many but just enough, especially one open and one closed.  Great choice.  Could be a wonderful piece of art - decide about the water.  Course this is just my opinion.', '2003-02-04 21:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(208181, 11879, 4162, '<td valign="top">Great use of DOF here, lovely colours and detail, perhaps the post processing is a little heavy</td>', 'Great use of DOF here, lovely colours and detail, perhaps the post processing is a little heavy', '2003-02-04 21:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(208182, 11769, 6100, '<td valign="top">Your lighting is excellent!</td>', 'Your lighting is excellent!', '2003-02-04 21:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(208184, 11955, 4648, '<td valign="top">To me this would be awesome if the background had been a different color.  The flowers shouldn''t blend into the table and background, in my opinion.  Not sure what I think of the 2 different colored background like that..  The reflection on the table is really an added attraction.  I do realize as you''ve done it is for arttistic sake, and I may be looking at it the wrong way.  But it is a well done photo in my opinion.  And a one color background would have made it art.  But that''s just my thoughts.  I still like it real well</td>', 'To me this would be awesome if the background had been a different color.  The flowers shouldn''t blend into the table and background, in my opinion.  Not sure what I think of the 2 different colored background like that..  The reflection on the table is really an added attraction.  I do realize as you''ve done it is for arttistic sake, and I may be looking at it the wrong way.  But it is a well done photo in my opinion.  And a one color background would have made it art.  But that''s just my thoughts.  I still like it real well', '2003-02-04 21:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(208188, 11774, 4648, '<td valign="top">Much too soft of focus.  Also the cat looks like it is falling down into a crevice between the wall and whatever he is laying on.  You didn''t get quite all the color out which gives him a purple nose.  Good potential with better execution.</td>', 'Much too soft of focus.  Also the cat looks like it is falling down into a crevice between the wall and whatever he is laying on.  You didn''t get quite all the color out which gives him a purple nose.  Good potential with better execution.', '2003-02-04 21:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(208189, 11697, 4648, '<td valign="top">Feel this would have been better in color.  Can''t see what it is that he''s looking at on the ground, and in color might have been able to see it.  I could be wrong, but I don''t see any line or anything on the stick to make it a fishing pole.  Maybe that''s nit-picking but the title says he is fishing.  And the photo doesn''t show that.  Even though it is a nicely focus and well cropped photo.  Has great potential with better execution.  Best of luck.</td>', 'Feel this would have been better in color.  Can''t see what it is that he''s looking at on the ground, and in color might have been able to see it.  I could be wrong, but I don''t see any line or anything on the stick to make it a fishing pole.  Maybe that''s nit-picking but the title says he is fishing.  And the photo doesn''t show that.  Even though it is a nicely focus and well cropped photo.  Has great potential with better execution.  Best of luck.', '2003-02-04 21:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(208192, 12022, 4648, '<td valign="top">This almost looks like a cartoon, such a Rodolph or any of the Christmas cartoons.  The white snow has a blue tint to it, which I feel is the reason for the title.  The sky peaking through the clouds is a beautiful blue.  This is a beautiful snow scene, whether it is real or not.  It''s beautiful and well done.</td>', 'This almost looks like a cartoon, such a Rodolph or any of the Christmas cartoons.  The white snow has a blue tint to it, which I feel is the reason for the title.  The sky peaking through the clouds is a beautiful blue.  This is a beautiful snow scene, whether it is real or not.  It''s beautiful and well done.', '2003-02-04 21:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(208193, 11795, 4648, '<td valign="top">The windmill is broken?  This could be a great photo.  But the sky appears to have been manipulated into that blue and it is too much.  The bottom part of the photo takes on a bluish tint also.  This is too much for me personally.  I would like to have seen it in the natural.</td>', 'The windmill is broken?  This could be a great photo.  But the sky appears to have been manipulated into that blue and it is too much.  The bottom part of the photo takes on a bluish tint also.  This is too much for me personally.  I would like to have seen it in the natural.', '2003-02-04 21:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(208194, 11789, 6100, '<td valign="top">Strong image but it looks to me as if the edges were sharpened too much. Obviously, just an opinion but my tastes would like to see less hard edges. The tonality is very nice and you''ve captured some very nice details.</td>', 'Strong image but it looks to me as if the edges were sharpened too much. Obviously, just an opinion but my tastes would like to see less hard edges. The tonality is very nice and you''ve captured some very nice details.', '2003-02-04 21:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(208195, 12041, 6100, '<td valign="top">Too much background distraction. I can''t quite find what the focal point of this picture is.</td>', 'Too much background distraction. I can''t quite find what the focal point of this picture is.', '2003-02-04 21:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(208196, 11876, 6100, '<td valign="top">What a great dog expression! I''m a sucker for dog pictures.</td>', 'What a great dog expression! I''m a sucker for dog pictures.', '2003-02-04 21:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(208197, 11837, 6100, '<td valign="top">Aren''t rainbows great! I think you''ve got a great subject here but the location you shot from detracts from what the focal point should be --- the rainbow! I would try also to keep the horizon straight across the picture so the viewer doesn''t feel as if he''s about to fall over.</td>', 'Aren''t rainbows great! I think you''ve got a great subject here but the location you shot from detracts from what the focal point should be --- the rainbow! I would try also to keep the horizon straight across the picture so the viewer doesn''t feel as if he''s about to fall over.', '2003-02-04 21:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(208198, 12009, 4648, '<td valign="top">The color is unappealing to me and the cropping should have been more uniform.  the stream of water I feel should have been a drop "splashing" into the water because of the title.  As it is this appears washed out.  I personally think it''s becaue of the color you''ve chosen, but I could be wrong about that.</td>', 'The color is unappealing to me and the cropping should have been more uniform.  the stream of water I feel should have been a drop "splashing" into the water because of the title.  As it is this appears washed out.  I personally think it''s becaue of the color you''ve chosen, but I could be wrong about that.', '2003-02-04 21:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(208199, 11903, 6100, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful dog! You''ve captured the detail in the dog''s coat beautifully, too. I would try to keep vertical lines straight though. Note the fireplace line which should be straight up-and-down. This leaves your viewer with the feeling that he might fall over.</td>', 'What a beautiful dog! You''ve captured the detail in the dog''s coat beautifully, too. I would try to keep vertical lines straight though. Note the fireplace line which should be straight up-and-down. This leaves your viewer with the feeling that he might fall over.', '2003-02-04 21:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(208201, 12049, 6100, '<td valign="top">Well, we all feel that way about our children, don''t we! You''ve captured this quite well. The wing prop and the lipstick are great splashes of color and contrast well with the skin tones. Nice work!</td>', 'Well, we all feel that way about our children, don''t we! You''ve captured this quite well. The wing prop and the lipstick are great splashes of color and contrast well with the skin tones. Nice work!', '2003-02-04 21:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(208203, 12003, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nice picture with good depth of field control. On my monitor, the central white area came up as almost all white and I couldn''t see very much detail. The background is a bit busy and, to me, distracting.</td>', 'Nice picture with good depth of field control. On my monitor, the central white area came up as almost all white and I couldn''t see very much detail. The background is a bit busy and, to me, distracting.', '2003-02-04 21:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(208204, 12034, 6100, '<td valign="top">I like this picture because of the silhouette of the tree/bush/fence post along with the evening light falling on the snow in the foreground giving such a warm tone. You''ve selected a very nice color for the border and that helps the picture.</td>', 'I like this picture because of the silhouette of the tree/bush/fence post along with the evening light falling on the snow in the foreground giving such a warm tone. You''ve selected a very nice color for the border and that helps the picture.', '2003-02-04 21:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(208205, 11890, 6100, '<td valign="top">The cold cyan color enhances this photo. The snow and the water are nice contrasts to the man-made waterwheel. I would tone down the whites some but that may just be my monitor.</td>', 'The cold cyan color enhances this photo. The snow and the water are nice contrasts to the man-made waterwheel. I would tone down the whites some but that may just be my monitor.', '2003-02-04 21:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(208206, 11980, 4648, '<td valign="top">I know what you are getting...busy, too busy, But I don''t care what they say. I LIKE IT and think it is beautiful.  Too many time all the limbs have is ice on them.  I love to see them with this much snow on them.  this is a beautiful B&amp;W.  Fantastic job.  It''s a ribbon winner to me.</td>', 'I know what you are getting...busy, too busy, But I don''t care what they say. I LIKE IT and think it is beautiful.  Too many time all the limbs have is ice on them.  I love to see them with this much snow on them.  this is a beautiful B&W.  Fantastic job.  It''s a ribbon winner to me.', '2003-02-04 21:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(208207, 11879, 6100, '<td valign="top">Great colors but the bee almost seems lost in it all. I guess bees don''t exactly listen to us when we ask them to move to another plant, do they?! I would like to see a slight bit more depth of field to place the bee''s behind in focus.</td>', 'Great colors but the bee almost seems lost in it all. I guess bees don''t exactly listen to us when we ask them to move to another plant, do they?! I would like to see a slight bit more depth of field to place the bee''s behind in focus.', '2003-02-04 21:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(208209, 11963, 4648, '<td valign="top">Cute, but cuter if I could see all of him.  Can''t see wasting b&amp;W on this either.  Should be in color, to show his full beauty.  Maybe you cropped it this closely because of the focus.  What do I know.  It is till good. and he''s cute.</td>', 'Cute, but cuter if I could see all of him.  Can''t see wasting b&W on this either.  Should be in color, to show his full beauty.  Maybe you cropped it this closely because of the focus.  What do I know.  It is till good. and he''s cute.', '2003-02-04 21:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(208211, 12018, 4648, '<td valign="top">The creases in the background should have been ironed out before the shot.  This is a nice still life, but I personally feel the background should have been a little lighter or totally black.  To me either of them would have shown off the gourd better.  Your focus is real good and the light on the gourd is good.  Nice piece of art work.</td>', 'The creases in the background should have been ironed out before the shot.  This is a nice still life, but I personally feel the background should have been a little lighter or totally black.  To me either of them would have shown off the gourd better.  Your focus is real good and the light on the gourd is good.  Nice piece of art work.', '2003-02-04 21:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(208213, 11945, 6219, '<td valign="top">A super shot, lovely texture.</td>', 'A super shot, lovely texture.', '2003-02-04 21:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(208216, 11908, 6219, '<td valign="top">Great depth.</td>', 'Great depth.', '2003-02-04 21:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(208218, 11977, 4648, '<td valign="top">Was going to say you needed to smooth out the background, but the more I look at it the better I like it as it is.  Need more light on the bottle especially, then lighten the whole photo a little.  The bowl appears to be a little different and should be able to be seen better.  Has great potential.</td>', 'Was going to say you needed to smooth out the background, but the more I look at it the better I like it as it is.  Need more light on the bottle especially, then lighten the whole photo a little.  The bowl appears to be a little different and should be able to be seen better.  Has great potential.', '2003-02-04 22:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(208220, 11703, 4648, '<td valign="top">Took some looking to figure this one out.  This is different and nice.  In fact each time I look at it the roofs appear to look different, looking life water, then like a roof, then like etc.  Hope you can see what I mean.  This is unique and I like it.  Great initiative on your part and a well done photo.</td>', 'Took some looking to figure this one out.  This is different and nice.  In fact each time I look at it the roofs appear to look different, looking life water, then like a roof, then like etc.  Hope you can see what I mean.  This is unique and I like it.  Great initiative on your part and a well done photo.', '2003-02-04 22:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(208222, 11829, 4648, '<td valign="top">Give me a little more sky and I''ll give you a 10.  Like the guy on the beach and his location in the photo.  The cropping is especially good in my opinion - as much past the sun on the beach as past the man on the beach.    Great job there.  I would have like more sky, as much as you have land without and water on it on the left corner.  Still a good photo.</td>', 'Give me a little more sky and I''ll give you a 10.  Like the guy on the beach and his location in the photo.  The cropping is especially good in my opinion - as much past the sun on the beach as past the man on the beach.    Great job there.  I would have like more sky, as much as you have land without and water on it on the left corner.  Still a good photo.', '2003-02-04 22:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(208225, 11869, 3575, '<td valign="top">Love the perspective! Great exposure and focus.</td>', 'Love the perspective! Great exposure and focus.', '2003-02-04 22:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(208226, 11825, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  The focus looks a little soft perhaps, but maybe it''s just a shallow depth of field - I would have liked more of the image to be crisp.  The snow on the nose looks wonderful.</td>', 'Great composition.  The focus looks a little soft perhaps, but maybe it''s just a shallow depth of field - I would have liked more of the image to be crisp.  The snow on the nose looks wonderful.', '2003-02-04 22:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(208227, 11677, 4648, '<td valign="top">Please explain how you did the netting appearance on the photo.  To me it ruins the photo, but I didn''t think it was legal either.  I get almost the same effect by using the telephoto lens but not zoomed.  The fuzzy border then white then thin black I thought made 3 borders.  I''m all confused on this photo.  Sorry</td>', 'Please explain how you did the netting appearance on the photo.  To me it ruins the photo, but I didn''t think it was legal either.  I get almost the same effect by using the telephoto lens but not zoomed.  The fuzzy border then white then thin black I thought made 3 borders.  I''m all confused on this photo.  Sorry', '2003-02-04 22:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(208228, 11814, 3575, '<td valign="top">You know, her little face is so animated and your choice of border, making it appear to be a frame from a movie just adds to the animation. I absolutely love it. Everything about it is wonderful. 10</td>', 'You know, her little face is so animated and your choice of border, making it appear to be a frame from a movie just adds to the animation. I absolutely love it. Everything about it is wonderful. 10', '2003-02-04 22:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(208231, 11957, 3575, '<td valign="top">Wow, the whole frame filled with green and yellow. It''s wonderful. It''s beautifully exposed. And there''s this tiny little dew drop on one of the flowers. Lovely.</td>', 'Wow, the whole frame filled with green and yellow. It''s wonderful. It''s beautifully exposed. And there''s this tiny little dew drop on one of the flowers. Lovely.', '2003-02-04 22:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(208232, 11901, 2752, '<td valign="top">well composed and the use of white against the black background just right for this piece.</td>', 'well composed and the use of white against the black background just right for this piece.', '2003-02-04 22:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(208234, 11701, 4648, '<td valign="top">I know it''s intentional but I don''t like how sharpened it is.  Even without sharpening a lot of people wouldn''t recognize what this is.  They haven''t been around in their lifetime.  Sorry but this is personally un-appealing.  Still want to color outside the lines?</td>', 'I know it''s intentional but I don''t like how sharpened it is.  Even without sharpening a lot of people wouldn''t recognize what this is.  They haven''t been around in their lifetime.  Sorry but this is personally un-appealing.  Still want to color outside the lines?', '2003-02-04 22:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(208235, 11996, 51167, '<td valign="top">awesome, is this guy venomous?  This is a cool composition, kind of like the snake picture I did, but mine wasn''t as good. 10</td>', 'awesome, is this guy venomous?  This is a cool composition, kind of like the snake picture I did, but mine wasn''t as good. 10', '2003-02-04 22:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(208236, 11927, 2752, '<td valign="top">well composed and the tattered ball a nice balance.</td>', 'well composed and the tattered ball a nice balance.', '2003-02-04 22:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(208237, 11939, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice macro work.  The centre of the flower is lovely - lots of contrast and shape, however the outer petals start to blend together.  Focus is good and the cropping is fairly good.</td>', 'Nice macro work.  The centre of the flower is lovely - lots of contrast and shape, however the outer petals start to blend together.  Focus is good and the cropping is fairly good.', '2003-02-04 22:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(208238, 11771, 2752, '<td valign="top">He certainly is...nice use of flash..good composition</td>', 'He certainly is...nice use of flash..good composition', '2003-02-04 22:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(208240, 11877, 4648, '<td valign="top">Don''t know if I should say "nice how you used that limb to keep the sun out of your eyes" or "why didn''t you step to one side or the other of that limb so you could get a good shot of the sun".  Everything else is beautiful, colors, cropping, focus, DOF, etc.  It''s all a go.  But I still don''t know which question is correct or which way to score it.  So guess i''ll split it down the middle and give it a 7.</td>', 'Don''t know if I should say "nice how you used that limb to keep the sun out of your eyes" or "why didn''t you step to one side or the other of that limb so you could get a good shot of the sun".  Everything else is beautiful, colors, cropping, focus, DOF, etc.  It''s all a go.  But I still don''t know which question is correct or which way to score it.  So guess i''ll split it down the middle and give it a 7.', '2003-02-04 22:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(208248, 11826, 6425, '<td valign="top">Nice close up.  The color is nice.</td>', 'Nice close up.  The color is nice.', '2003-02-04 22:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(208249, 12027, 6328, '<td valign="top">Lovely Black &amp; White shot of your dog.  I like the way his eyes are just staring at you behind your camera.  You''ve got nice tones on the ground and the natural lighting goes well with your subject.  Your photo is sharp and the dog is nicely in focus.  Good job.</td>', 'Lovely Black & White shot of your dog.  I like the way his eyes are just staring at you behind your camera.  You''ve got nice tones on the ground and the natural lighting goes well with your subject.  Your photo is sharp and the dog is nicely in focus.  Good job.', '2003-02-04 22:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(208254, 11852, 6425, '<td valign="top">Nice color, the sharpness of the flower is good.</td>', 'Nice color, the sharpness of the flower is good.', '2003-02-04 22:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(208256, 12025, 6328, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and lighting.  Good sharp photo.  It looks nice and warm, did you sepia it, or what?  The counter tops and windows in the background are a mite distracting, but other than that, a nice photo.</td>', 'Nice colors and lighting.  Good sharp photo.  It looks nice and warm, did you sepia it, or what?  The counter tops and windows in the background are a mite distracting, but other than that, a nice photo.', '2003-02-04 22:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(208257, 11921, 6425, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting image.  How did you get it to look like this?  Good image.</td>', 'This is an interesting image.  How did you get it to look like this?  Good image.', '2003-02-04 22:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(208258, 12038, 6328, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been a better picture if you hadn''t cut the bear''s head off.  the brown''s are really nice, including the brown eye, and his black nose is cute.  The scarf and sign around his neck is touching also.  That white patch over his shoulder is distracting to me, my eye keeps wandering over to it.</td>', 'I think it would have been a better picture if you hadn''t cut the bear''s head off.  the brown''s are really nice, including the brown eye, and his black nose is cute.  The scarf and sign around his neck is touching also.  That white patch over his shoulder is distracting to me, my eye keeps wandering over to it.', '2003-02-04 22:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(208261, 11850, 6425, '<td valign="top">The flower is sharp.  The water drops give it a good touch.  Nice work.</td>', 'The flower is sharp.  The water drops give it a good touch.  Nice work.', '2003-02-04 22:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(208262, 11739, 6425, '<td valign="top">wow, i like this image.  The way the sun is setting makes this image appealing to me.</td>', 'wow, i like this image.  The way the sun is setting makes this image appealing to me.', '2003-02-04 22:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(208267, 11697, 6425, '<td valign="top">Good image.  This is a good tone.  Nice job.</td>', 'Good image.  This is a good tone.  Nice job.', '2003-02-04 22:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(208269, 11984, 1647, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo - my brother would love it (being a guitarist).  Perspective and framing are wonderful.  I think the money, pen and pick detract from it slightly though - I would have kept the guitar on it''s own.  It''s a really nice picture overall - definitely worthy of printing.</td>', 'I really like this photo - my brother would love it (being a guitarist).  Perspective and framing are wonderful.  I think the money, pen and pick detract from it slightly though - I would have kept the guitar on it''s own.  It''s a really nice picture overall - definitely worthy of printing.', '2003-02-04 22:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(208270, 12009, 5677, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  I was going to try a similar idea, but couldn''t get a good shot of the water.  It seems very grainy and blurry though.</td>', 'Good idea.  I was going to try a similar idea, but couldn''t get a good shot of the water.  It seems very grainy and blurry though.', '2003-02-04 22:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(208271, 11950, 6328, '<td valign="top">An aspiring DPChallenger!  Me thinks you''ve captured a truely cliche`d photograph here.  A lot of color to look at here but my eye keep coming back to that big camera that the little guy is holding in front of his face.  It''s an excellent photograph with an extremely great mood that you''ve created.  Great lighting,  Great color.  Nicely focused.  Nicely framed.</td>', 'An aspiring DPChallenger!  Me thinks you''ve captured a truely cliche`d photograph here.  A lot of color to look at here but my eye keep coming back to that big camera that the little guy is holding in front of his face.  It''s an excellent photograph with an extremely great mood that you''ve created.  Great lighting,  Great color.  Nicely focused.  Nicely framed.', '2003-02-04 22:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(208272, 11710, 6425, '<td valign="top">Good image.</td>', 'Good image.', '2003-02-04 22:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(208273, 11785, 6425, '<td valign="top">Wow this is a good image.  I could see this on a postcard. Good job.</td>', 'Wow this is a good image.  I could see this on a postcard. Good job.', '2003-02-04 22:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(208274, 12025, 6425, '<td valign="top">Good clear image, i like the lighting that you used.  good job</td>', 'Good clear image, i like the lighting that you used.  good job', '2003-02-04 22:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(208275, 11962, 6425, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  You see coke cans everywhere anymore.  The image could have been a little sharper, but i still like it.</td>', 'Great idea.  You see coke cans everywhere anymore.  The image could have been a little sharper, but i still like it.', '2003-02-04 22:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(208276, 11772, 6425, '<td valign="top">Good picture, the color is nice and clear.  Good job.</td>', 'Good picture, the color is nice and clear.  Good job.', '2003-02-04 22:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(208277, 12005, 6425, '<td valign="top">Cute kids.  This image is nice and clear.  Good job.</td>', 'Cute kids.  This image is nice and clear.  Good job.', '2003-02-04 22:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(208279, 11948, 6328, '<td valign="top">Excellent photograph with good choice of lighting. Good focus on the entire flower, nice macro, and good choice of background.  My eyes focus on the beautiful redness of the rose, down to the green leaves and then immediately back to the rose to take in it''s beauty.  Congratulations!</td>', 'Excellent photograph with good choice of lighting. Good focus on the entire flower, nice macro, and good choice of background.  My eyes focus on the beautiful redness of the rose, down to the green leaves and then immediately back to the rose to take in it''s beauty.  Congratulations!', '2003-02-04 22:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(208281, 11976, 6425, '<td valign="top">For some reason this looks dangerous.  I like it.  The lit fuse brings out a good contrast in this image.</td>', 'For some reason this looks dangerous.  I like it.  The lit fuse brings out a good contrast in this image.', '2003-02-04 23:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(208283, 11833, 6425, '<td valign="top">Good image.  I like the colors on the childs shirt.</td>', 'Good image.  I like the colors on the childs shirt.', '2003-02-04 23:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
