(208286, 11907, 6425, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp image.  Good idea.  I like it.</td>', 'Nice sharp image.  Good idea.  I like it.', '2003-02-04 23:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(208287, 12008, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great composition and great focus on the dogs nose.  I really like the lighting as well</td>', 'Great composition and great focus on the dogs nose.  I really like the lighting as well', '2003-02-04 23:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(208288, 12049, 6425, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  The black backround gives this good contrast.  Is that a pillow or fake wings?</td>', 'Good idea.  The black backround gives this good contrast.  Is that a pillow or fake wings?', '2003-02-04 23:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(208289, 11912, 6425, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  I like the tone that you used.  I think i would have had a little less space in the middle but its still a good image.</td>', 'Good idea.  I like the tone that you used.  I think i would have had a little less space in the middle but its still a good image.', '2003-02-04 23:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(208290, 11690, 6425, '<td valign="top">I like how clearly the eyes show up.  This image is clear and sharp.  Nice job.</td>', 'I like how clearly the eyes show up.  This image is clear and sharp.  Nice job.', '2003-02-04 23:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(208291, 11932, 6425, '<td valign="top">Good sunset picture.  Is that a cactus?</td>', 'Good sunset picture.  Is that a cactus?', '2003-02-04 23:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(208292, 11885, 6425, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the assignment.  Good image.</td>', 'Nice take on the assignment.  Good image.', '2003-02-04 23:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(208293, 11863, 6425, '<td valign="top">Good image.  I like how the train is blurred.  Nice job.</td>', 'Good image.  I like how the train is blurred.  Nice job.', '2003-02-04 23:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(208294, 11711, 6328, '<td valign="top">A very captivating photo.  Just want to say right off that I would like to have seen more lockers and less ceiling as I believe the ceiling is perhaps a distraction to your photo.<br/>The pink sign with the black lettering really stands out and gives a message, but the Blue''s of the lockers is really stunning and draws the eye to that part of the photo.</td>', 'A very captivating photo.  Just want to say right off that I would like to have seen more lockers and less ceiling as I believe the ceiling is perhaps a distraction to your photo.The pink sign with the black lettering really stands out and gives a message, but the Blue''s of the lockers is really stunning and draws the eye to that part of the photo.', '2003-02-04 23:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(208295, 11766, 6425, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Good job.', '2003-02-04 23:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(208296, 11906, 6425, '<td valign="top">I like the color of the flower, good job.</td>', 'I like the color of the flower, good job.', '2003-02-04 23:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(208297, 11865, 4210, '<td valign="top">Now, normally I don''t predict winners, because my tastes are not as most peoples. But for the sole reason of that refection in the water drop.... wow. I really hope this wins.</td>', 'Now, normally I don''t predict winners, because my tastes are not as most peoples. But for the sole reason of that refection in the water drop.... wow. I really hope this wins.', '2003-02-04 23:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(208298, 11846, 6328, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo of the bird.  The various grey''s come out really nice as does his eye and beak, but the background just seems to be too cluttered.</td>', 'Lovely photo of the bird.  The various grey''s come out really nice as does his eye and beak, but the background just seems to be too cluttered.', '2003-02-04 23:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(208299, 11884, 6425, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I like the color and clearity of the bird.</td>', 'Interesting.  I like the color and clearity of the bird.', '2003-02-04 23:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(208301, 11914, 4210, '<td valign="top">I love the colour and textures.</td>', 'I love the colour and textures.', '2003-02-04 23:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(208302, 11781, 4210, '<td valign="top">I love the vibrant colours!</td>', 'I love the vibrant colours!', '2003-02-04 23:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(208303, 12021, 2700, '<td valign="top">the border undermines the flowers''  shocking "redness"...</td>', 'the border undermines the flowers''  shocking "redness"...', '2003-02-04 23:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(208304, 11695, 4210, '<td valign="top">Background is a little distracting</td>', 'Background is a little distracting', '2003-02-04 23:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(208307, 11977, 2700, '<td valign="top">you need a light source lighting the direct front to compensate the light from the top... the wine bottle and basket are very dark.</td>', 'you need a light source lighting the direct front to compensate the light from the top... the wine bottle and basket are very dark.', '2003-02-04 23:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(208308, 11907, 4210, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colours and lighting. It feels like it might have been taken with a lower quality camera, but I''m not sure. Could just be from the post editing...</td>', 'Wonderful colours and lighting. It feels like it might have been taken with a lower quality camera, but I''m not sure. Could just be from the post editing...', '2003-02-04 23:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(208309, 11837, 2700, '<td valign="top">snapshots are bad. this is "snapshot" - bad... crop out the crap around the rainbow and this would be good...</td>', 'snapshots are bad. this is "snapshot" - bad... crop out the crap around the rainbow and this would be good...', '2003-02-04 23:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(208311, 11701, 4210, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. I like the noise. It gives it a nice effect.</td>', 'Very interesting. I like the noise. It gives it a nice effect.', '2003-02-04 23:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(208312, 11797, 2700, '<td valign="top">nice contrast 8</td>', 'nice contrast 8', '2003-02-04 23:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(208313, 11976, 2923, '<td valign="top">i''m not sure this fits the cliche image category, certainly disturbing when related with the title.<br/></td>', 'i''m not sure this fits the cliche image category, certainly disturbing when related with the title.', '2003-02-04 23:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(208314, 11951, 2923, '<td valign="top">boring title...</td>', 'boring title...', '2003-02-04 23:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(208315, 11980, 2923, '<td valign="top">Ah, i love snow on trees....  8</td>', 'Ah, i love snow on trees....  8', '2003-02-04 23:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(208316, 11977, 6325, '<td valign="top">My eye wanted to go to the gold background, not the subject.</td>', 'My eye wanted to go to the gold background, not the subject.', '2003-02-04 23:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(208318, 11727, 2923, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  i like it how the electrical wires fade into the background. 10</td>', 'This is beautiful.  i like it how the electrical wires fade into the background. 10', '2003-02-04 23:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(208319, 11907, 2700, '<td valign="top">loose the glass, gain class</td>', 'loose the glass, gain class', '2003-02-04 23:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(208320, 11980, 6325, '<td valign="top">Not particularly restful as many snow pictures, but I like it. Chaos?</td>', 'Not particularly restful as many snow pictures, but I like it. Chaos?', '2003-02-04 23:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(208321, 11879, 2700, '<td valign="top">wow first bug shot... seems you will beat all the others... 8</td>', 'wow first bug shot... seems you will beat all the others... 8', '2003-02-04 23:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(208322, 11902, 6325, '<td valign="top">I think the border distracts from anotherwise good shot.</td>', 'I think the border distracts from anotherwise good shot.', '2003-02-04 23:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(208325, 11977, 5822, '<td valign="top">One issue with this photo is that there is just too much empty space in the top third and the background material is just not that interesting to look at. You could have cut a lot of that out by a tighter shot/crop. But if you wanted to maintain this shot, a tall vase with flowers or the like would have added a lot to fill up the space. Another issus is the the lighting, which appears to be overhead, should instead be directed more at an angle with front or side lighting. The pic on the whole appears underexposed, and this could easily be fixed with better lighting.  Also, the angle you chose to take the picture does not reveal a lot of your subject...A higher angle showing more of the fruit I feel would be much better. I hope you haven''t found this to be too critical, as I really just want to help. If you do feel so, I apologize now.</td>', 'One issue with this photo is that there is just too much empty space in the top third and the background material is just not that interesting to look at. You could have cut a lot of that out by a tighter shot/crop. But if you wanted to maintain this shot, a tall vase with flowers or the like would have added a lot to fill up the space. Another issus is the the lighting, which appears to be overhead, should instead be directed more at an angle with front or side lighting. The pic on the whole appears underexposed, and this could easily be fixed with better lighting.  Also, the angle you chose to take the picture does not reveal a lot of your subject...A higher angle showing more of the fruit I feel would be much better. I hope you haven''t found this to be too critical, as I really just want to help. If you do feel so, I apologize now.', '2003-02-04 23:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(208326, 11717, 6504, '<td valign="top">I think this is a sick picture.  What did you have in mind???</td>', 'I think this is a sick picture.  What did you have in mind???', '2003-02-05 00:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(208329, 11958, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and colors, just think that blue thing in the background should not be there. Good DOF.</td>', 'Nice shot and colors, just think that blue thing in the background should not be there. Good DOF.', '2003-02-05 00:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(208331, 11846, 2567, '<td valign="top">You''ve made the bird come alive in this shot.  Good luck.</td>', 'You''ve made the bird come alive in this shot.  Good luck.', '2003-02-05 00:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(208333, 11856, 2567, '<td valign="top">Excellent coloring, focus and composition.  Good luck.</td>', 'Excellent coloring, focus and composition.  Good luck.', '2003-02-05 00:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(208334, 11717, 5822, '<td valign="top">If I could give this picture a zero, I would.</td>', 'If I could give this picture a zero, I would.', '2003-02-05 01:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(208335, 11861, 5822, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to see the yellow petals more saturated.</td>', 'Would have liked to see the yellow petals more saturated.', '2003-02-05 01:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(208336, 12017, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2003-02-05 01:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(208337, 11717, 4852, '<td valign="top">hmmm</td>', 'hmmm', '2003-02-05 01:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(208338, 11995, 4852, '<td valign="top">maybe a litle gravy would help this.kidding</td>', 'maybe a litle gravy would help this.kidding', '2003-02-05 01:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(208339, 11896, 4852, '<td valign="top">I agree wholeheartedly</td>', 'I agree wholeheartedly', '2003-02-05 01:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(208341, 11921, 1863, '<td valign="top">It looks like you''re strangling the cat. Well, that''s one bad thing, for starters. Then we have the look on the cats face which doesn''t look best pleased. Also looks a bit haphazard.</td>', 'It looks like you''re strangling the cat. Well, that''s one bad thing, for starters. Then we have the look on the cats face which doesn''t look best pleased. Also looks a bit haphazard.', '2003-02-05 01:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(208342, 11976, 4852, '<td valign="top">That title got me rolling, very funny</td>', 'That title got me rolling, very funny', '2003-02-05 01:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(208344, 12049, 4852, '<td valign="top">I hope you didnt use super glue for the feathers</td>', 'I hope you didnt use super glue for the feathers', '2003-02-05 01:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(208347, 11885, 3273, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but the composition is just too busy with this shot.  It would have been better if you would have tried to isolate one of the flowers and focused on that instead.</td>', 'Sorry, but the composition is just too busy with this shot.  It would have been better if you would have tried to isolate one of the flowers and focused on that instead.', '2003-02-05 01:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(208351, 11781, 6100, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flowers, well lit and very sharp!</td>', 'Beautiful flowers, well lit and very sharp!', '2003-02-05 02:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(208352, 11797, 6100, '<td valign="top">Quite a beautiful sky. I would like to see something in front of it but it''s still very nice looking!</td>', 'Quite a beautiful sky. I would like to see something in front of it but it''s still very nice looking!', '2003-02-05 02:01:57.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(208354, 11829, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nice composition! The almost monotone color adds to the dramatic impact of your image.</td>', 'Nice composition! The almost monotone color adds to the dramatic impact of your image.', '2003-02-05 02:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(208355, 11692, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nice handling of this subject!</td>', 'Nice handling of this subject!', '2003-02-05 02:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(208356, 11941, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured colors. Quite unusual.</td>', 'Nicely captured colors. Quite unusual.', '2003-02-05 02:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(208357, 11854, 6100, '<td valign="top">Looks like he''s waiting for his master. Quite sharp and the B&amp;W effect adds strength to the image.</td>', 'Looks like he''s waiting for his master. Quite sharp and the B&W effect adds strength to the image.', '2003-02-05 02:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(208358, 11902, 6100, '<td valign="top">Excellent handling of the lighting without wiping out the image! Well done.</td>', 'Excellent handling of the lighting without wiping out the image! Well done.', '2003-02-05 02:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(208359, 11962, 6100, '<td valign="top">Sharper focus coupled with depth of field would have improved this image in my opinion.</td>', 'Sharper focus coupled with depth of field would have improved this image in my opinion.', '2003-02-05 02:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(208360, 11887, 6100, '<td valign="top">Dogs are a great subject. This is nice lighting.</td>', 'Dogs are a great subject. This is nice lighting.', '2003-02-05 02:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(208361, 11923, 6100, '<td valign="top">Gerber Daisys are such beautiful flowers and this one you''ve lit very nicely. It''s an unusual angle but shows off the delicacy AND the strength of the flower.</td>', 'Gerber Daisys are such beautiful flowers and this one you''ve lit very nicely. It''s an unusual angle but shows off the delicacy AND the strength of the flower.', '2003-02-05 02:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(208363, 11861, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nice job. The depth of field is well handled and the image looks as if it''s painted on a canvas! The broad lighting illuminates these flowers nicely!</td>', 'Nice job. The depth of field is well handled and the image looks as if it''s painted on a canvas! The broad lighting illuminates these flowers nicely!', '2003-02-05 02:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(208364, 11888, 6172, '<td valign="top">Nice texture, the lighting is a little too dark for my taste.</td>', 'Nice texture, the lighting is a little too dark for my taste.', '2003-02-05 02:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(208365, 12021, 6100, '<td valign="top">Well lit but I''d like to see a little detail inside of the main flower. Possibly a small reflector could have opened up this shadow area.</td>', 'Well lit but I''d like to see a little detail inside of the main flower. Possibly a small reflector could have opened up this shadow area.', '2003-02-05 02:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(208366, 11932, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nicely done and evocative of "the wild west".</td>', 'Nicely done and evocative of "the wild west".', '2003-02-05 02:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(208367, 11898, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nice combination of in-focus and out-of-focus. You''ve handled the DOF beautifully here. Striking image!</td>', 'Nice combination of in-focus and out-of-focus. You''ve handled the DOF beautifully here. Striking image!', '2003-02-05 02:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(208369, 11844, 6172, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but it''s not all that cliche! (lol)</td>', 'Nice photo, but it''s not all that cliche! (lol)', '2003-02-05 02:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(208371, 11872, 6100, '<td valign="top">The colors in this photograph evoke a memory of Victorian times (although the markings on the nightgown give it away). The soft rose colors in the piano seat and the nightgown compliment each other. It''s a nice juxtaposition. I would like to see the same photo with the main light to the left lifted a few feet higher and use a fill light or reflector to dampen some of the shadows of the child.</td>', 'The colors in this photograph evoke a memory of Victorian times (although the markings on the nightgown give it away). The soft rose colors in the piano seat and the nightgown compliment each other. It''s a nice juxtaposition. I would like to see the same photo with the main light to the left lifted a few feet higher and use a fill light or reflector to dampen some of the shadows of the child.', '2003-02-05 02:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(208372, 11800, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nice handling of high key lighting!</td>', 'Nice handling of high key lighting!', '2003-02-05 02:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(208373, 11943, 6100, '<td valign="top">The damage to the flower petals is distracting and I would try to select a better angle in order to avoid background clutter.</td>', 'The damage to the flower petals is distracting and I would try to select a better angle in order to avoid background clutter.', '2003-02-05 02:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(208374, 11914, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2003-02-05 02:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(208375, 11952, 6100, '<td valign="top">Obviously, you were in the right place at the right time for this one. I''m left thinking that I''d like to know what is just a little lower on the horizon. It creates a tension in me as I view this but the placement of the palm is excellent.</td>', 'Obviously, you were in the right place at the right time for this one. I''m left thinking that I''d like to know what is just a little lower on the horizon. It creates a tension in me as I view this but the placement of the palm is excellent.', '2003-02-05 02:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(208377, 12005, 6100, '<td valign="top">What beautiful smiles! The portrait lighting is well done. If I could spot retouch this one, I would tone down the catchlights in the right eyes of both subjects (compare the right eye to the left eye) but I''m not sure that could have been improved by changing the portrait lighting.</td>', 'What beautiful smiles! The portrait lighting is well done. If I could spot retouch this one, I would tone down the catchlights in the right eyes of both subjects (compare the right eye to the left eye) but I''m not sure that could have been improved by changing the portrait lighting.', '2003-02-05 02:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(208378, 11988, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp photo but the base and background are distracting to the photo. (Nice arrangement, too!)</td>', 'Nice sharp photo but the base and background are distracting to the photo. (Nice arrangement, too!)', '2003-02-05 02:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(208381, 11795, 6100, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo but I hope you waited for the sun to set and to see whether you could get an unusual sky along with a silhouette of the windmill!</td>', 'This is a nice photo but I hope you waited for the sun to set and to see whether you could get an unusual sky along with a silhouette of the windmill!', '2003-02-05 02:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(208382, 11983, 1143, '<td valign="top">This looks like a great postcard shot. Very nice colors. Good job keeping the sun from overpowering the tree. I think I''d like to see the bottom of the tree so it''s anchored a little more, but it''s still beautiful. 10</td>', 'This looks like a great postcard shot. Very nice colors. Good job keeping the sun from overpowering the tree. I think I''d like to see the bottom of the tree so it''s anchored a little more, but it''s still beautiful. 10', '2003-02-05 02:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(208384, 12022, 1143, '<td valign="top">Winter wonderland. It sort of has a dreamlike quality to it. Snow is tough to expose properly. Nice job. The horizon is a bit too centered vertically maybe. 9</td>', 'Winter wonderland. It sort of has a dreamlike quality to it. Snow is tough to expose properly. Nice job. The horizon is a bit too centered vertically maybe. 9', '2003-02-05 02:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(208385, 11891, 6607, '<td valign="top">Perfect:  The position of the ball; the snow; the brutal, angular geometry of the barred windows, tree branches, bench slats, chain links, and the frame of the hoop contrasted with the imagined arc of the ball; the red sleeves and rim and flying ball; the posture.  Beautiful picture.</td>', 'Perfect:  The position of the ball; the snow; the brutal, angular geometry of the barred windows, tree branches, bench slats, chain links, and the frame of the hoop contrasted with the imagined arc of the ball; the red sleeves and rim and flying ball; the posture.  Beautiful picture.', '2003-02-05 03:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(208386, 11877, 1143, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette. Cool sunset, but the sun is too centered. I like the black on the bottom but might crop a tad more off of it. 8</td>', 'Nice silhouette. Cool sunset, but the sun is too centered. I like the black on the bottom but might crop a tad more off of it. 8', '2003-02-05 03:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(208388, 11769, 1143, '<td valign="top">Yup! That''s cliche.  :)  Nice job. Good focus and lighting on the front petal. I''d prefer a little more dof as the other petals seem to blur slightly. 8</td>', 'Yup! That''s cliche.  :)  Nice job. Good focus and lighting on the front petal. I''d prefer a little more dof as the other petals seem to blur slightly. 8', '2003-02-05 03:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(208389, 11734, 6607, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, but looks almost accidental.</td>', 'Nice subject, but looks almost accidental.', '2003-02-05 03:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(208390, 11838, 6607, '<td valign="top">Nice car, but the light is wrong, too glaring.</td>', 'Nice car, but the light is wrong, too glaring.', '2003-02-05 03:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(208391, 11965, 1143, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the traditional flower shot. I like the black bg and the composition. Would like a little more light on the flower and a tighter crop. 8</td>', 'Interesting take on the traditional flower shot. I like the black bg and the composition. Would like a little more light on the flower and a tighter crop. 8', '2003-02-05 03:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(208392, 12002, 6607, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2003-02-05 03:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(208393, 11806, 6607, '<td valign="top">Weird.  Nice.</td>', 'Weird.  Nice.', '2003-02-05 03:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(208394, 11969, 6607, '<td valign="top">looks staged (even if it''s not)</td>', 'looks staged (even if it''s not)', '2003-02-05 03:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
