(208399, 11996, 1143, '<td valign="top">Cute? If you say so  :P  Great focus! Lighting seems a little weird and the photo seems more grey than it should be, but the eye is just so distinct. 7</td>', 'Cute? If you say so  :P  Great focus! Lighting seems a little weird and the photo seems more grey than it should be, but the eye is just so distinct. 7', '2003-02-05 03:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
