(208402, 11948, 1143, '<td valign="top">Very cliche - esp since there''s almost an identical shot in the challenge. I like the red on black. Would like a little more lighting. I do like the angle though. 7</td>', 'Very cliche - esp since there''s almost an identical shot in the challenge. I like the red on black. Would like a little more lighting. I do like the angle though. 7', '2003-02-05 03:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
