(208421, 12025, 6607, '<td valign="top">nice colors, nice light</td>', 'nice colors, nice light', '2003-02-05 03:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(208422, 11927, 1143, '<td valign="top">Cute puppy!  That nose reminds me of my greyhound. Nice composition though I''d rather see all of his nose and no tail. I think I''d also like a little more focus since the dog is really the subject and his focus is softer than that of the ball. 7</td>', 'Cute puppy!  That nose reminds me of my greyhound. Nice composition though I''d rather see all of his nose and no tail. I think I''d also like a little more focus since the dog is really the subject and his focus is softer than that of the ball. 7', '2003-02-05 03:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(208423, 11766, 6607, '<td valign="top">nice moment</td>', 'nice moment', '2003-02-05 03:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(208424, 11907, 1143, '<td valign="top">woohoo. I like the indigo-ish color of this. Lighting is a bit harsh for those white petals. Also not the best choice of vases. It''s still a strong, simple image for me. 7</td>', 'woohoo. I like the indigo-ish color of this. Lighting is a bit harsh for those white petals. Also not the best choice of vases. It''s still a strong, simple image for me. 7', '2003-02-05 03:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(208425, 11700, 6607, '<td valign="top">good idea</td>', 'good idea', '2003-02-05 03:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(208426, 11717, 6607, '<td valign="top">SICK!</td>', 'SICK!', '2003-02-05 03:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(208427, 12032, 1143, '<td valign="top">I like the bird! The statue is a little too close to the bottom of the shot. I''d prefer a little more water. Might also try changing the black point to make a stronger silhouette. 7</td>', 'I like the bird! The statue is a little too close to the bottom of the shot. I''d prefer a little more water. Might also try changing the black point to make a stronger silhouette. 7', '2003-02-05 03:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(208428, 11829, 1143, '<td valign="top">I like the crop. Not a true silhouette, but I like where the subject is in the frame - with lots of space to move into. 7</td>', 'I like the crop. Not a true silhouette, but I like where the subject is in the frame - with lots of space to move into. 7', '2003-02-05 03:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(208429, 11887, 1143, '<td valign="top">Very cute. I could see someone hiring a photographer to take a pet photo like this. Not crazy about the chair, but I do like that the smaller dog is higher than the other. Good lighting on them. 7</td>', 'Very cute. I could see someone hiring a photographer to take a pet photo like this. Not crazy about the chair, but I do like that the smaller dog is higher than the other. Good lighting on them. 7', '2003-02-05 03:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(208431, 11845, 1143, '<td valign="top">The foreground isn''t all that interesting to me and it''s really hard to make out. I think it should either be all black and a true silhouette or be lighter so that we can see what it is. Nice warm colors in the sky though. 7</td>', 'The foreground isn''t all that interesting to me and it''s really hard to make out. I think it should either be all black and a true silhouette or be lighter so that we can see what it is. Nice warm colors in the sky though. 7', '2003-02-05 03:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(208432, 11898, 1143, '<td valign="top">I like the crop/composition. Good placement of the rose center. I like that the outer edges of the shot are out of focus, but I think that the center of the rose should be a bit sharper. Nice even lighting.</td>', 'I like the crop/composition. Good placement of the rose center. I like that the outer edges of the shot are out of focus, but I think that the center of the rose should be a bit sharper. Nice even lighting.', '2003-02-05 03:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(208433, 11863, 1143, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in this picture and the lines are great. The convergence point is almost too centered for my taste, but it''s still an interesting shot. 7</td>', 'I like the colors in this picture and the lines are great. The convergence point is almost too centered for my taste, but it''s still an interesting shot. 7', '2003-02-05 03:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(208435, 11945, 1143, '<td valign="top">I really like the color of the lighting in the bg. Center of the flower looks oversharpened maybe. I would like to see the petals in focus as well and a bit more lighting on them. 7</td>', 'I really like the color of the lighting in the bg. Center of the flower looks oversharpened maybe. I would like to see the petals in focus as well and a bit more lighting on them. 7', '2003-02-05 03:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(208436, 11791, 1143, '<td valign="top">Such an adorable kitty! That pink nose is just too cute. Lighting caused some hot spots that are bothersome on the fur. I like the selective focus on the face and the paws in the foreground. 7</td>', 'Such an adorable kitty! That pink nose is just too cute. Lighting caused some hot spots that are bothersome on the fur. I like the selective focus on the face and the paws in the foreground. 7', '2003-02-05 03:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(208438, 11806, 1143, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the white bg. It makes the lighting seem too harsh. The center of the flower  also seems oversharpened but maybe it''s just all the texture creating an illusion. It''s still a decent studio shot though. 7</td>', 'I don''t like the white bg. It makes the lighting seem too harsh. The center of the flower  also seems oversharpened but maybe it''s just all the texture creating an illusion. It''s still a decent studio shot though. 7', '2003-02-05 03:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(208439, 11726, 1143, '<td valign="top">This seems a little washed out or desaturated - too grey if you know what I mean. I like the composition though and the blue with the yellow. 7</td>', 'This seems a little washed out or desaturated - too grey if you know what I mean. I like the composition though and the blue with the yellow. 7', '2003-02-05 03:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(208440, 11879, 1143, '<td valign="top">Good focus and use of dof. The bee is a little too close to the top of the frame IMO. I like the green and yellow colors but think the bee would stand out better against something other than more yellow. Nice capture. Interesting flower. 7</td>', 'Good focus and use of dof. The bee is a little too close to the top of the frame IMO. I like the green and yellow colors but think the bee would stand out better against something other than more yellow. Nice capture. Interesting flower. 7', '2003-02-05 03:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(208441, 11891, 1143, '<td valign="top">The colors of this are cool. The person is too close to the left of the frame, but I like the composition otherwise.  Not the best representation of a cliche IMO, but a very good image.</td>', 'The colors of this are cool. The person is too close to the left of the frame, but I like the composition otherwise.  Not the best representation of a cliche IMO, but a very good image.', '2003-02-05 03:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(208442, 11952, 1143, '<td valign="top">I like the sunset and the tree but dont like how it is placed in the frame. It needs more trunk rather than being stuck down in the corner like it is. 7</td>', 'I like the sunset and the tree but dont like how it is placed in the frame. It needs more trunk rather than being stuck down in the corner like it is. 7', '2003-02-05 03:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(208443, 11722, 1143, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Good idea. Needs better focus though. I guess you''d have to have a lot of dof to get the cat and the teapot in focus. Also need a little better lighting on the kitty. 7</td>', 'Nice shot. Good idea. Needs better focus though. I guess you''d have to have a lot of dof to get the cat and the teapot in focus. Also need a little better lighting on the kitty. 7', '2003-02-05 03:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(208444, 11937, 1143, '<td valign="top">First of all, this should be flipped! It''s supposed to be a drop, but it''s upside down. Interesting idea. Good execution. Lighting is too harsh. Need to get rid of that glare on the water. I like the bg color. 7</td>', 'First of all, this should be flipped! It''s supposed to be a drop, but it''s upside down. Interesting idea. Good execution. Lighting is too harsh. Need to get rid of that glare on the water. I like the bg color. 7', '2003-02-05 03:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(208446, 11958, 1143, '<td valign="top">Good use of dof. Great focus. Very cool subject. Decent exposure with obviously harsh lighting situation. Would''ve been much better to ask use an angle that exclused the blue in the bg. 7</td>', 'Good use of dof. Great focus. Very cool subject. Decent exposure with obviously harsh lighting situation. Would''ve been much better to ask use an angle that exclused the blue in the bg. 7', '2003-02-05 03:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(208447, 11872, 1143, '<td valign="top">Awe. Nice shot. I really like that you used the piano. The lighting isn''t the best - sort of has a spotlight feel to it as it is so bright on the face and too dark around the edges of the frame. The black level also seems off as the darkest shadows are really just grey instead of black. I''d also like to have to flowers a tad lower so that they dont cover her mouth.</td>', 'Awe. Nice shot. I really like that you used the piano. The lighting isn''t the best - sort of has a spotlight feel to it as it is so bright on the face and too dark around the edges of the frame. The black level also seems off as the darkest shadows are really just grey instead of black. I''d also like to have to flowers a tad lower so that they dont cover her mouth.', '2003-02-05 03:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(208449, 12005, 1143, '<td valign="top">OH NO! It''s a kid shot!  :P  They''re adorable - are they twins? I''m not sure I like the doll and puppy in the shot. It has sort of a formal portrait feel otherwise. It does make it more personal I guess, but the doll especially is just distracting to me. I like their outfits and I like the chair. I''d try getting a solid bg behind it though. Also, try not to cut off any elbows.</td>', 'OH NO! It''s a kid shot!  :P  They''re adorable - are they twins? I''m not sure I like the doll and puppy in the shot. It has sort of a formal portrait feel otherwise. It does make it more personal I guess, but the doll especially is just distracting to me. I like their outfits and I like the chair. I''d try getting a solid bg behind it though. Also, try not to cut off any elbows.', '2003-02-05 03:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(208450, 11873, 1143, '<td valign="top">Very classic photo. I like the black, white, and red. Strong shot with nice lines. Good placement of the flower. Might need a tad more light.</td>', 'Very classic photo. I like the black, white, and red. Strong shot with nice lines. Good placement of the flower. Might need a tad more light.', '2003-02-05 03:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(208451, 12003, 1143, '<td valign="top">Pretty flower. Lighting is too uneven. I think I''d rather see a solid color background or atleast exclude the leaves along the bottom as they are distracting. Good focus.</td>', 'Pretty flower. Lighting is too uneven. I think I''d rather see a solid color background or atleast exclude the leaves along the bottom as they are distracting. Good focus.', '2003-02-05 03:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(208453, 11697, 1143, '<td valign="top">Bumping this one up. It''s growing on me. Nice shot. I like the diagonal of the shore and stick. Needs a little more range of tones IMO. Not sure I like the choice of color, but it''s a cute capture.</td>', 'Bumping this one up. It''s growing on me. Nice shot. I like the diagonal of the shore and stick. Needs a little more range of tones IMO. Not sure I like the choice of color, but it''s a cute capture.', '2003-02-05 03:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(208454, 11939, 1143, '<td valign="top">Lovely color. I think this would be cool if it were blown up really big and made into a poster. Needs to be cropped IMO b/c the area outside the flower is just distracting from the cool lines inside.</td>', 'Lovely color. I think this would be cool if it were blown up really big and made into a poster. Needs to be cropped IMO b/c the area outside the flower is just distracting from the cool lines inside.', '2003-02-05 03:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(208455, 12024, 1143, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Pink &amp; grey work very well together. Nose is very sharp, but I''d like to see a little more dof so that the tongue is in better focus if not the paw as well. I like the crop. Bumping this one up.</td>', 'Great capture. Pink & grey work very well together. Nose is very sharp, but I''d like to see a little more dof so that the tongue is in better focus if not the paw as well. I like the crop. Bumping this one up.', '2003-02-05 03:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(208456, 11895, 1143, '<td valign="top">I like this but I think it could be better. Needs a slightly different angle to get rid of the distractions in the bg on the right. I also don''t like the choice of color. I''d rather see it in true color or just b&amp;w.</td>', 'I like this but I think it could be better. Needs a slightly different angle to get rid of the distractions in the bg on the right. I also don''t like the choice of color. I''d rather see it in true color or just b&w.', '2003-02-05 03:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(208457, 11840, 4494, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is really beautiful!  The colors are spectacular and the dark trees and landscape give a great contrast.  10.</td>', 'Wow, that is really beautiful!  The colors are spectacular and the dark trees and landscape give a great contrast.  10.', '2003-02-05 04:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(208459, 11752, 1143, '<td valign="top">This looks almost exactly like a photo taken of me when I was a baby. I''m not sure if that''s good or not. I don''t like the color cast chosen. It makes the photo feel old. I''d rather see it in color. The head is also a little too far to the left of the frame while the eyes should be higher in the frame. Very close to looking like a professional portrait though. Good focus and lighting.</td>', 'This looks almost exactly like a photo taken of me when I was a baby. I''m not sure if that''s good or not. I don''t like the color cast chosen. It makes the photo feel old. I''d rather see it in color. The head is also a little too far to the left of the frame while the eyes should be higher in the frame. Very close to looking like a professional portrait though. Good focus and lighting.', '2003-02-05 04:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(208461, 11850, 4494, '<td valign="top">A little dark.</td>', 'A little dark.', '2003-02-05 04:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(208462, 11870, 1143, '<td valign="top">It''s not halloween!  Cute title. Needs a bit more lighting - esp on the face. I''d also crop some off the right side. Cute shot though.</td>', 'It''s not halloween!  Cute title. Needs a bit more lighting - esp on the face. I''d also crop some off the right side. Cute shot though.', '2003-02-05 04:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(208463, 11912, 4494, '<td valign="top">Too much empty space in the middle... should have zoomed out a little bit to more of the subjects.  The lighting is nice.</td>', 'Too much empty space in the middle... should have zoomed out a little bit to more of the subjects.  The lighting is nice.', '2003-02-05 04:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(208464, 11771, 1143, '<td valign="top">Very happy! Cute shot. Doesn''t need the throw underneath though. Did you use flash? The lighting should be more even and not so bright on the face.</td>', 'Very happy! Cute shot. Doesn''t need the throw underneath though. Did you use flash? The lighting should be more even and not so bright on the face.', '2003-02-05 04:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(208465, 11932, 4494, '<td valign="top">Holy moly, that''s excellent.  I''ve never really seen a very yellow sky like that that.  Very nice!  9.</td>', 'Holy moly, that''s excellent.  I''ve never really seen a very yellow sky like that that.  Very nice!  9.', '2003-02-05 04:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(208466, 11976, 1143, '<td valign="top">Ummm. This is an overdone photography subject? I don''t get it. It''s a cool shot though. Focus could be a little better.</td>', 'Ummm. This is an overdone photography subject? I don''t get it. It''s a cool shot though. Focus could be a little better.', '2003-02-05 04:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(208467, 12047, 4494, '<td valign="top">That door give a great texture...  I don''t know if Blur would have made it even better or not.</td>', 'That door give a great texture...  I don''t know if Blur would have made it even better or not.', '2003-02-05 04:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(208468, 11897, 4494, '<td valign="top">Picture perfect!  Love the black background and the water droplets.  9.</td>', 'Picture perfect!  Love the black background and the water droplets.  9.', '2003-02-05 04:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(208469, 11814, 1143, '<td valign="top">I don''t count off for frames, but this one has to go.  :)  Really cute expression. Not sure of the circumstances, but the bg color makes the whole photo a little blah so I''d change it if possible. Good even lighting.</td>', 'I don''t count off for frames, but this one has to go.  :)  Really cute expression. Not sure of the circumstances, but the bg color makes the whole photo a little blah so I''d change it if possible. Good even lighting.', '2003-02-05 04:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(208470, 11972, 4494, '<td valign="top">Not really a Cliche.</td>', 'Not really a Cliche.', '2003-02-05 04:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(208471, 11869, 1143, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle. Nice clear shot. Good job with exposure! Might''ve chosen a shirt that''s not quite so busy.</td>', 'Interesting angle. Nice clear shot. Good job with exposure! Might''ve chosen a shirt that''s not quite so busy.', '2003-02-05 04:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
