(208473, 12046, 1143, '<td valign="top">Cool crop. I like it. Love the placement of the eye in the frame. Seems like it might''ve been oversharpened or something. Good lighting though. Would like to see better focus on the nose.</td>', 'Cool crop. I like it. Love the placement of the eye in the frame. Seems like it might''ve been oversharpened or something. Good lighting though. Would like to see better focus on the nose.', '2003-02-05 04:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
