(208614, 12025, 3575, '<td valign="top">I love this! Can your lens really focus that close? I like the lighting, although dark, the important details are in the llight. I''m not so sure about the composition and placement, I think I would like the whole thing moved right a little so the one stem of the plant isn''t cropped and there would be more balance.</td>', 'I love this! Can your lens really focus that close? I like the lighting, although dark, the important details are in the llight. I''m not so sure about the composition and placement, I think I would like the whole thing moved right a little so the one stem of the plant isn''t cropped and there would be more balance.', '2003-02-05 11:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
