(208622, 11727, 3575, '<td valign="top">Amazing photo. I though it was unusual that the telephone poles were white and then I noticed that they aren''t, they''re covered in snow! I love the perspective and the way they just disappear into the fog.</td>', 'Amazing photo. I though it was unusual that the telephone poles were white and then I noticed that they aren''t, they''re covered in snow! I love the perspective and the way they just disappear into the fog.', '2003-02-05 11:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
