(208974, 11790, 4494, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah this is AWESOME... the best flower picture I''ve seen.  The color is magnificent!!!  It''s absolutely a perfect 10.  This is the only 10 I''ve given.  EXCELLENT!!  If this isn''t in the top 10 pics I don''t know what will be.</td>', 'Oh yeah this is AWESOME... the best flower picture I''ve seen.  The color is magnificent!!!  It''s absolutely a perfect 10.  This is the only 10 I''ve given.  EXCELLENT!!  If this isn''t in the top 10 pics I don''t know what will be.', '2003-02-05 18:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
