(208978, 11806, 4815, '<td valign="top">Brilliant unusual color combination. The texture of the leaves is very attractive. I find the highlights a tad glarey ( small nitpick). Lots of bite on the edge of all blossum bits, great. Nice high key border that accents the image well. Good job.</td>', 'Brilliant unusual color combination. The texture of the leaves is very attractive. I find the highlights a tad glarey ( small nitpick). Lots of bite on the edge of all blossum bits, great. Nice high key border that accents the image well. Good job.', '2003-02-05 18:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(208979, 11996, 6451, '<td valign="top">Wow! What a pet.  This photo looks very professional .  I also like how clear the closeup is. Nice job.</td>', 'Wow! What a pet.  This photo looks very professional .  I also like how clear the closeup is. Nice job.', '2003-02-05 18:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(208981, 12046, 6451, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo.  Good job.  I like how only half of the cat''s face is shown.  The closeup is very nice.</td>', 'I really like this photo.  Good job.  I like how only half of the cat''s face is shown.  The closeup is very nice.', '2003-02-05 18:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(208982, 11862, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice car!  I really like the use of colors and the way that the refections provide a nice shiney look on the finish of the car.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice car!  I really like the use of colors and the way that the refections provide a nice shiney look on the finish of the car.  Good job.', '2003-02-05 18:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(208983, 11943, 1005, '<td valign="top">Black eyed Susan.....Very nice photo.  Looks like this flower has been in bloom for four or five days.  Very good shot of the flower, but the background isn''t as nice.  Even though blurred out, I would like to have seen flower leaves and/or more flowers as background, rather than the street.  Overall very nice.  Wrong title!<br/>7 Swash</td>', 'Black eyed Susan.....Very nice photo.  Looks like this flower has been in bloom for four or five days.  Very good shot of the flower, but the background isn''t as nice.  Even though blurred out, I would like to have seen flower leaves and/or more flowers as background, rather than the street.  Overall very nice.  Wrong title!7 Swash', '2003-02-05 18:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(208984, 12001, 6451, '<td valign="top">Very unique image. I''m not sure I''m understanding the concept though. Nice colors and technique.</td>', 'Very unique image. I''m not sure I''m understanding the concept though. Nice colors and technique.', '2003-02-05 18:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(208985, 11714, 6451, '<td valign="top">Very nice image!  I really like the background that was used behind the cats.  Nice colors and planning. Good job.</td>', 'Very nice image!  I really like the background that was used behind the cats.  Nice colors and planning. Good job.', '2003-02-05 18:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(208986, 11797, 5266, '<td valign="top">Very pretty sunset, but I wish there was some silhouetted scenery as well.</td>', 'Very pretty sunset, but I wish there was some silhouetted scenery as well.', '2003-02-05 18:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(208987, 11935, 5266, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the brick background, sorry!!</td>', 'Don''t like the brick background, sorry!!', '2003-02-05 18:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(208988, 11853, 4815, '<td valign="top">You have a great concept. The lighting, color, focus and composition are all good technically speaking. Personally I would alter a few minor things. A female hand to match the femininity of the flower and to avoid the hairy arm. Rather sexist I do admit. The fake blood is a little dark, thick and copious. A few lighter color drops to indicate a pricked pinky would be OK. However, this is a very creative foto which deserves substantial merit on that effort alone. You have a great imagination. Keep up the good work.</td>', 'You have a great concept. The lighting, color, focus and composition are all good technically speaking. Personally I would alter a few minor things. A female hand to match the femininity of the flower and to avoid the hairy arm. Rather sexist I do admit. The fake blood is a little dark, thick and copious. A few lighter color drops to indicate a pricked pinky would be OK. However, this is a very creative foto which deserves substantial merit on that effort alone. You have a great imagination. Keep up the good work.', '2003-02-05 18:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(208989, 12046, 5266, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - you have captured the eye in perfect focus and the DOF makes for a nice contrast.  Wow - that''s one beautiful kitty!!!  I can''t believe how nice the eye looks!!!</td>', 'Beautiful - you have captured the eye in perfect focus and the DOF makes for a nice contrast.  Wow - that''s one beautiful kitty!!!  I can''t believe how nice the eye looks!!!', '2003-02-05 18:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(208990, 12049, 6451, '<td valign="top">Wow! What a touching image.  The lighting and the use of the black background make the picture very peaceful and beautiful.  Nice job.</td>', 'Wow! What a touching image.  The lighting and the use of the black background make the picture very peaceful and beautiful.  Nice job.', '2003-02-05 18:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(208992, 11803, 5266, '<td valign="top">Cuter than a bugs ear!!!!  I love the B&amp;W - reminds me of a photo of me at that age.  Very nice composition - but is the chin a bit wet?</td>', 'Cuter than a bugs ear!!!!  I love the B&W - reminds me of a photo of me at that age.  Very nice composition - but is the chin a bit wet?', '2003-02-05 18:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
