(208994, 11944, 5266, '<td valign="top">Oh, how embarrassing!!  But very funny!!  Great composition, and the expression is to die for!!</td>', 'Oh, how embarrassing!!  But very funny!!  Great composition, and the expression is to die for!!', '2003-02-05 18:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
