(209011, 11759, 1005, '<td valign="top">O.K. Nature Biology 101 - these are Canadian Geese, all of them, not a duck in sight.  (I''m having fun at your expense, please laugh along)  Very good shot.  Love the geese struggling to walk across the ice.  There are a lot of them!!!  Small suggestion:  crop the top 1/10 or so, basically at the water line and a higher angle would have netted you some great reflections on the lake surface.  8 Swash<br/>(I was tempted to minus 1 more point for the duck/geese thing, but I''m feeling generous!!!)</td>', 'O.K. Nature Biology 101 - these are Canadian Geese, all of them, not a duck in sight.  (I''m having fun at your expense, please laugh along)  Very good shot.  Love the geese struggling to walk across the ice.  There are a lot of them!!!  Small suggestion:  crop the top 1/10 or so, basically at the water line and a higher angle would have netted you some great reflections on the lake surface.  8 Swash(I was tempted to minus 1 more point for the duck/geese thing, but I''m feeling generous!!!)', '2003-02-05 18:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
