(209043, 11852, 5250, '<td valign="top">The only problem that I can see with this picture is that the top edge of the flower petals, and the lower edge just do not seem to be crisp! Almost like they are out of focus! I like the contrasting shade of green from the leaves, which provides a nice backdrop! I think if those leaves were slightly out of focus, the flower would be a bit more pronounced! One more thing, I just do not like the border! I find it really distracting for this shot! jgillard6</td>', 'The only problem that I can see with this picture is that the top edge of the flower petals, and the lower edge just do not seem to be crisp! Almost like they are out of focus! I like the contrasting shade of green from the leaves, which provides a nice backdrop! I think if those leaves were slightly out of focus, the flower would be a bit more pronounced! One more thing, I just do not like the border! I find it really distracting for this shot! jgillard6', '2003-02-05 19:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(209044, 11788, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great little actor you got there.  Cute, too.  I really like the soft focus on this one.  Bedtime should not be bright and sharp.  Good choice.  Colors are real natural.  Crop is great.  Love the title.  Only problem when he bathed he forgot to wash the juice off his fingers and mouth.  Just like all younguns.  Pic was so good had to pic at you.  This is a real nice photo.</td>', 'Great little actor you got there.  Cute, too.  I really like the soft focus on this one.  Bedtime should not be bright and sharp.  Good choice.  Colors are real natural.  Crop is great.  Love the title.  Only problem when he bathed he forgot to wash the juice off his fingers and mouth.  Just like all younguns.  Pic was so good had to pic at you.  This is a real nice photo.', '2003-02-05 19:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(209046, 11705, 5266, '<td valign="top">This is an absolutely precious little kitten (I think I know who it is - DPChallenge''s most photographed tabby)  I like that the kitten is all curled up in a blanket that is different levels.  If I have to pick, I would say crop out the stuffed animals foot - top right corner.  Purr!!!</td>', 'This is an absolutely precious little kitten (I think I know who it is - DPChallenge''s most photographed tabby)  I like that the kitten is all curled up in a blanket that is different levels.  If I have to pick, I would say crop out the stuffed animals foot - top right corner.  Purr!!!', '2003-02-05 19:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(209047, 11842, 4648, '<td valign="top">From the sweatshirt hood and facial expressions, I''m taking this is a "pun".  If not forgive me.  I love the sepia tone.  Really and truly this is a really fantastic photo that''s why I''m wondering why you were playing at it.  Great focus, great portrait.  Super portrait background.  Am I missing something?  By the way, congratulatons on the one on the way.  When it gets here take a real one as well as this one.</td>', 'From the sweatshirt hood and facial expressions, I''m taking this is a "pun".  If not forgive me.  I love the sepia tone.  Really and truly this is a really fantastic photo that''s why I''m wondering why you were playing at it.  Great focus, great portrait.  Super portrait background.  Am I missing something?  By the way, congratulatons on the one on the way.  When it gets here take a real one as well as this one.', '2003-02-05 19:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
