(209054, 11766, 4648, '<td valign="top">I love the title.  This is what my kids think about me.  I just wish the photo were lighter so I could see their faces better.  Beautifully done with good, sharp, clear focus.  Nice composition.  This is a really nice photo, especially considering the weather.  Just lighten it up some, and don''t crop off the one persons feet.  Would rather see less sky and have his feet, or cut off the feet of all three.</td>', 'I love the title.  This is what my kids think about me.  I just wish the photo were lighter so I could see their faces better.  Beautifully done with good, sharp, clear focus.  Nice composition.  This is a really nice photo, especially considering the weather.  Just lighten it up some, and don''t crop off the one persons feet.  Would rather see less sky and have his feet, or cut off the feet of all three.', '2003-02-05 19:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
