(209071, 11873, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wow, double wammie.  A piano will usually get a 4 from me, and a lili will get a 4.  2 x 4 = 8.  actually it''s a very nice shot.  I like the contrasting colours.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'Wow, double wammie.  A piano will usually get a 4 from me, and a lili will get a 4.  2 x 4 = 8.  actually it''s a very nice shot.  I like the contrasting colours.  Jacko.  8', '2003-02-05 19:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(209072, 11919, 4648, '<td valign="top">Looks like they are really enjoying the snow.  Snow is not really an easy thing to photograph well.  And you did a pretty good job of it.  Just a hair light.  Wouldn''t have hurt the shot of the children if it were darkened some, then the snow wouldn''t be so washed.  Good of the children.  Love how red (cold) his ear shows up.  To me the background is not out of focus quite enough for nice dof nor in focus enough for great focus.  Maybe darkening would help that some too.   More contrast would help a little.  But still not that bad of a shot.</td>', 'Looks like they are really enjoying the snow.  Snow is not really an easy thing to photograph well.  And you did a pretty good job of it.  Just a hair light.  Wouldn''t have hurt the shot of the children if it were darkened some, then the snow wouldn''t be so washed.  Good of the children.  Love how red (cold) his ear shows up.  To me the background is not out of focus quite enough for nice dof nor in focus enough for great focus.  Maybe darkening would help that some too.   More contrast would help a little.  But still not that bad of a shot.', '2003-02-05 19:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(209073, 11884, 5266, '<td valign="top">Pretty bird, pretty bird.  I like how Bobo is leaning towards us!!  I think the lighting is a bit harsh - see the shadows behind Bobo?  A slightly different angle and you could have cropped out the piece of vertical lumber on the right side.</td>', 'Pretty bird, pretty bird.  I like how Bobo is leaning towards us!!  I think the lighting is a bit harsh - see the shadows behind Bobo?  A slightly different angle and you could have cropped out the piece of vertical lumber on the right side.', '2003-02-05 19:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(209075, 11897, 5266, '<td valign="top">Wow - great shot of a Christmas cactus!!  Impressed that yours is still blooming at this time of year.  Your focus is impressive, and the lighting is excellent.</td>', 'Wow - great shot of a Christmas cactus!!  Impressed that yours is still blooming at this time of year.  Your focus is impressive, and the lighting is excellent.', '2003-02-05 19:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(209076, 11821, 4648, '<td valign="top">Thank you for paying attention to the little details that make a photo.  In this one it is the tasted, and put back, pieces of candy.  That cements your title and makes this one.  The focus is right one, the composition is really nice, and the cropping is not crowed and cramped or too airy.  In my opinion this is one of the top ten.</td>', 'Thank you for paying attention to the little details that make a photo.  In this one it is the tasted, and put back, pieces of candy.  That cements your title and makes this one.  The focus is right one, the composition is really nice, and the cropping is not crowed and cramped or too airy.  In my opinion this is one of the top ten.', '2003-02-05 19:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(209077, 12007, 5266, '<td valign="top">Great shot - you definitely meet the challenge with this cute kid and the milk reference.  I love the B&amp;W journalism look to this photo.</td>', 'Great shot - you definitely meet the challenge with this cute kid and the milk reference.  I love the B&W journalism look to this photo.', '2003-02-05 19:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
