(209081, 11940, 2158, '<td valign="top">You really should have tried for a plainer background.</td>', 'You really should have tried for a plainer background.', '2003-02-05 19:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(209083, 11850, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful peach rose.  Leave off the water.  Tops as it is.  The beauty is in the rose.  Background should be totally black or real soft light color.  This could be a beautiful piece of art.  Well done.  Really nice focus and cropping.  Perfectly shaped rose in perfect condition.  Nice one.  The more I look the better I like this.  Also decided the background should be solid the color of the botom right corner or soft light color.  Had to up the score to a 10.</td>', 'Beautiful peach rose.  Leave off the water.  Tops as it is.  The beauty is in the rose.  Background should be totally black or real soft light color.  This could be a beautiful piece of art.  Well done.  Really nice focus and cropping.  Perfectly shaped rose in perfect condition.  Nice one.  The more I look the better I like this.  Also decided the background should be solid the color of the botom right corner or soft light color.  Had to up the score to a 10.', '2003-02-05 19:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(209086, 11887, 2158, '<td valign="top">You''ve either got great patience, or very well-behaved dogs.  Great job!</td>', 'You''ve either got great patience, or very well-behaved dogs.  Great job!', '2003-02-05 20:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(209088, 11903, 4648, '<td valign="top">As beautiful as I expected: dog and photograph.  He looks so regal laying here so perfectly.  Beautiful rich colors and beautiful cropping job.  He looks like this is a normal place to lay, or possess.  He is absolutly beautiful.  It''s easy to take a 1st place photo when you have a 1st place subject.  Not fair.  Great job.</td>', 'As beautiful as I expected: dog and photograph.  He looks so regal laying here so perfectly.  Beautiful rich colors and beautiful cropping job.  He looks like this is a normal place to lay, or possess.  He is absolutly beautiful.  It''s easy to take a 1st place photo when you have a 1st place subject.  Not fair.  Great job.', '2003-02-05 20:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(209094, 11948, 4648, '<td valign="top">There''s only one other rose that comes close to this one and it may be a tad better, (or not)  It has a little lighter background which make''s it stand out just a tad more.  But you both will get the same score of 10 because there is nothing more beautiful than a perfectly shaped rose photographed perfectly. And I''m not sure which one I like the best.   How''s that for a comment.  I know it''s not really helpful but it is true.  As is the 10 you get.</td>', 'There''s only one other rose that comes close to this one and it may be a tad better, (or not)  It has a little lighter background which make''s it stand out just a tad more.  But you both will get the same score of 10 because there is nothing more beautiful than a perfectly shaped rose photographed perfectly. And I''m not sure which one I like the best.   How''s that for a comment.  I know it''s not really helpful but it is true.  As is the 10 you get.', '2003-02-05 20:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(209096, 12047, 4648, '<td valign="top">This gives a really neat effect to the photo.  It makes it look like it is printed on canvas.  Hate the 2 little holes in your screen.  Bet you didn''t know they were there until you took the photo.  This is a really neat, good photo.  Great intuition and way to color outside the lines.  I like it.</td>', 'This gives a really neat effect to the photo.  It makes it look like it is printed on canvas.  Hate the 2 little holes in your screen.  Bet you didn''t know they were there until you took the photo.  This is a really neat, good photo.  Great intuition and way to color outside the lines.  I like it.', '2003-02-05 20:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(209099, 11836, 5044, '<td valign="top">Nice closeup, but I find it a little overexposed, and maybe a little too much USM. The edges of the flower on the background are very harsh.</td>', 'Nice closeup, but I find it a little overexposed, and maybe a little too much USM. The edges of the flower on the background are very harsh.', '2003-02-05 20:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(209100, 11821, 5044, '<td valign="top">Great cliché. Beautifully composed and the lighting is excellent.</td>', 'Great cliché. Beautifully composed and the lighting is excellent.', '2003-02-05 20:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(209102, 11951, 5044, '<td valign="top">A little too much sky, and not enough city. Sharpness on the city could be better as well.</td>', 'A little too much sky, and not enough city. Sharpness on the city could be better as well.', '2003-02-05 20:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(209107, 12049, 472, '<td valign="top">nice one :)  you''re so lucky to have such a beautiful little model at your disposal.  im wondering how this was lit so softly</td>', 'nice one :)  you''re so lucky to have such a beautiful little model at your disposal.  im wondering how this was lit so softly', '2003-02-05 20:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
