(209109, 11912, 472, '<td valign="top">i would totally love this even more if not for what appears to be camera shake.  maybe you did it on purpose but it doesnt add. im sure you were just trying to get a moving animal in the frame just so. i know how hard that can be. i have 2 cats :)</td>', 'i would totally love this even more if not for what appears to be camera shake.  maybe you did it on purpose but it doesnt add. im sure you were just trying to get a moving animal in the frame just so. i know how hard that can be. i have 2 cats :)', '2003-02-05 20:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(209110, 11858, 472, '<td valign="top">excellent in every way except for composition. should not be centered perfectly in the frame - this is too static.   better slightly offcenter, a little more negative space on a side but less up above (show more stem)</td>', 'excellent in every way except for composition. should not be centered perfectly in the frame - this is too static.   better slightly offcenter, a little more negative space on a side but less up above (show more stem)', '2003-02-05 20:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
