(209116, 11906, 5044, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the shadows of the pollen on the left petal.</td>', 'Very nice. I like the shadows of the pollen on the left petal.', '2003-02-05 20:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(209117, 11903, 472, '<td valign="top">my goodness what an imperious expression!  great looking dog.  now what i would have done was either a) gotten in closer sso it wasnt a living room snapshot, and focused in on his face and shoulders, OR, if b) if i wanted to show his whole body, i would have put him a different bg, maybe a white sheet or a green blanket</td>', 'my goodness what an imperious expression!  great looking dog.  now what i would have done was either a) gotten in closer sso it wasnt a living room snapshot, and focused in on his face and shoulders, OR, if b) if i wanted to show his whole body, i would have put him a different bg, maybe a white sheet or a green blanket', '2003-02-05 20:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(209119, 11709, 3575, '<td valign="top">What a sweet face! I like the B&amp;W.</td>', 'What a sweet face! I like the B&W.', '2003-02-05 20:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(209120, 11930, 472, '<td valign="top">this is a terrific picture of an attractive face .. very compelling. one of my faves.  only thing is there seems some level of overprocessing in the pixels .. not deducting pts because the rest of the pic is so good :)</td>', 'this is a terrific picture of an attractive face .. very compelling. one of my faves.  only thing is there seems some level of overprocessing in the pixels .. not deducting pts because the rest of the pic is so good :)', '2003-02-05 20:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
