(209141, 11984, 3575, '<td valign="top">Excellent! I love the perspective you took. The clarity is perfection. Don''t know why there''s a pen on your guitar, it doesn''t make sense to me, unless it''s there to sign autographs of your adoring fans.</td>', 'Excellent! I love the perspective you took. The clarity is perfection. Don''t know why there''s a pen on your guitar, it doesn''t make sense to me, unless it''s there to sign autographs of your adoring fans.', '2003-02-05 21:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
