(209147, 11803, 3575, '<td valign="top">Composition = 10, lighting = 10, exposure = 10, creativity = 10, beautiful baby = 10. no deduction for the drool on the chin because this is a fabulously beautiful work of art. AND Thank you SOOO much for not cropping of those curls!</td>', 'Composition = 10, lighting = 10, exposure = 10, creativity = 10, beautiful baby = 10. no deduction for the drool on the chin because this is a fabulously beautiful work of art. AND Thank you SOOO much for not cropping of those curls!', '2003-02-05 21:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
