(209150, 11856, 5044, '<td valign="top">It''s quite amazing how you got them to sit still during this photo shoot. Background is good, lighting is good, focus is dead on. Nice job.</td>', 'It''s quite amazing how you got them to sit still during this photo shoot. Background is good, lighting is good, focus is dead on. Nice job.', '2003-02-05 21:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(209151, 11944, 3575, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe this! It''s the funniest thing I have ever seen. If there was a little more focus on the snout, I''d give you a perfect score but I have to settle for a 9. Love it!!!! Addendum: I had to open this up again to show the guys in the office - they really enjoyed it and relieved a lot of their tension after a long/heated meeting.</td>', 'I can''t believe this! It''s the funniest thing I have ever seen. If there was a little more focus on the snout, I''d give you a perfect score but I have to settle for a 9. Love it!!!! Addendum: I had to open this up again to show the guys in the office - they really enjoyed it and relieved a lot of their tension after a long/heated meeting.', '2003-02-05 21:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(209152, 11991, 2752, '<td valign="top">crisp and well composed photo..like the interaction of the gulls</td>', 'crisp and well composed photo..like the interaction of the gulls', '2003-02-05 21:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
