(209158, 11969, 2752, '<td valign="top">the colors make this photo  for me. It is a well composed piece....the angles of the stairs and windows and railings direct the eyes to the yellow book.  Good job.</td>', 'the colors make this photo  for me. It is a well composed piece....the angles of the stairs and windows and railings direct the eyes to the yellow book.  Good job.', '2003-02-05 21:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
