(209205, 11873, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2003-02-05 22:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(209206, 11769, 4648, '<td valign="top">I''ve got to know why put the water on a rose.  I, personally, think it is as pretty without and don''t feel it adds anything.  Just wandering.  To the photo.  Personally I feel there is too much stem, without anything on it.  I would have cropped it just below the rose itself or left some of the green sticking up the stem.  I do like the background and think the rose is beautiful and in great focus.  I personally like to see the photo from the end of the rose or angled so I can see the end.  But that''s just me.  This is a really good photo of a great flower.</td>', 'I''ve got to know why put the water on a rose.  I, personally, think it is as pretty without and don''t feel it adds anything.  Just wandering.  To the photo.  Personally I feel there is too much stem, without anything on it.  I would have cropped it just below the rose itself or left some of the green sticking up the stem.  I do like the background and think the rose is beautiful and in great focus.  I personally like to see the photo from the end of the rose or angled so I can see the end.  But that''s just me.  This is a really good photo of a great flower.', '2003-02-05 22:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(209207, 11720, 4648, '<td valign="top">These roses do not look the same color, but I could be wrong.  The two from the side in the background appear read and the main one looks orange or dark peach.  This is disturbing and distracting.  Also the 2 read ones are buds and this one appears opened up.  Part of each flower was cropped off by doing such a tight crop.  I feel they should have been left whole.  The open rose is a very soft focus, as soft as the other 2.  With them in the background I feel the main one should be brighter as yours is but also sharper focus.  To me the only difference appears to be the amount of light.  But I could be wrong.  Pretty roses anyway.</td>', 'These roses do not look the same color, but I could be wrong.  The two from the side in the background appear read and the main one looks orange or dark peach.  This is disturbing and distracting.  Also the 2 read ones are buds and this one appears opened up.  Part of each flower was cropped off by doing such a tight crop.  I feel they should have been left whole.  The open rose is a very soft focus, as soft as the other 2.  With them in the background I feel the main one should be brighter as yours is but also sharper focus.  To me the only difference appears to be the amount of light.  But I could be wrong.  Pretty roses anyway.', '2003-02-05 22:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(209208, 11865, 4648, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand this one.  But I don''t really like what I see.  It''s just not appealing to me.  I think it is supposed to be water, thats why the background is not smooth.  And I don''t know what is in the center.  It''s just not personally my kind of photo.</td>', 'I don''t understand this one.  But I don''t really like what I see.  It''s just not appealing to me.  I think it is supposed to be water, thats why the background is not smooth.  And I don''t know what is in the center.  It''s just not personally my kind of photo.', '2003-02-05 22:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(209209, 12008, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is neat.  His right eye and the right side of his mouth look like he is saying something and getting ready to wink at you.  I wish you had left a ittle more on the top of the photo.  It appears a little of the head, not much but a little, was cropped off.  Beautiful dog and really nice photo.  Just zoom out a little for me.</td>', 'This is neat.  His right eye and the right side of his mouth look like he is saying something and getting ready to wink at you.  I wish you had left a ittle more on the top of the photo.  It appears a little of the head, not much but a little, was cropped off.  Beautiful dog and really nice photo.  Just zoom out a little for me.', '2003-02-05 22:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(209214, 11726, 1280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2003-02-05 22:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(209216, 11727, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!!</td>', 'Great shot!!!', '2003-02-05 22:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(209221, 11797, 5822, '<td valign="top">Whoa !</td>', 'Whoa !', '2003-02-05 23:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(209223, 11845, 1863, '<td valign="top">The composition, the colour, the framing, everything is just caught right. Even the bird flying through. I cannot fault this picture. The sun riding the waves too. Amazing. 10 -Annida</td>', 'The composition, the colour, the framing, everything is just caught right. Even the bird flying through. I cannot fault this picture. The sun riding the waves too. Amazing. 10 -Annida', '2003-02-05 23:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(209224, 11845, 6325, '<td valign="top">But what about the UFO on the left?</td>', 'But what about the UFO on the left?', '2003-02-05 23:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(209226, 11759, 6325, '<td valign="top">Well, geese, actually.</td>', 'Well, geese, actually.', '2003-02-05 23:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(209228, 11701, 1647, '<td valign="top">I''m curious to hear how you created this effect in/before camera.  It looks great - so "old style" if I can be so boring in my description.  Framing is wonderful also, and I like the way the background is fading to black around the edges - did you light this deliberately?</td>', 'I''m curious to hear how you created this effect in/before camera.  It looks great - so "old style" if I can be so boring in my description.  Framing is wonderful also, and I like the way the background is fading to black around the edges - did you light this deliberately?', '2003-02-05 23:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(209229, 11791, 4430, '<td valign="top">This is very sweet, I just wish that the ears weren''t cut off.</td>', 'This is very sweet, I just wish that the ears weren''t cut off.', '2003-02-05 23:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(209231, 11885, 4430, '<td valign="top">I guess I''m just not goovin'' on all the brown spots on the flower.  Also, I can''t really tell where your focus is.  I do like the green leaves out of focus though.</td>', 'I guess I''m just not goovin'' on all the brown spots on the flower.  Also, I can''t really tell where your focus is.  I do like the green leaves out of focus though.', '2003-02-05 23:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(209232, 11838, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, although it''s perhaps cropped a little too closely on the left edge.  Orientation of the car is very good.  The background is perhaps a little too dark for my preference.  The reflections in the cars body and windscreen are well managed - nothing too distracting, but you could have played to remove more perhaps.  Good work.</td>', 'I like the composition, although it''s perhaps cropped a little too closely on the left edge.  Orientation of the car is very good.  The background is perhaps a little too dark for my preference.  The reflections in the cars body and windscreen are well managed - nothing too distracting, but you could have played to remove more perhaps.  Good work.', '2003-02-05 23:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(209234, 11902, 1647, '<td valign="top">Plain and simple - yet also elegant.  Great focus and wonderful lighting on this flower.  The border is also cliche, yet appropriate.  I might have tried something other than awhite background, but I like the white anyway.  Interesting choice of composition - it works really well.</td>', 'Plain and simple - yet also elegant.  Great focus and wonderful lighting on this flower.  The border is also cliche, yet appropriate.  I might have tried something other than awhite background, but I like the white anyway.  Interesting choice of composition - it works really well.', '2003-02-05 23:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(209235, 11761, 1647, '<td valign="top">This is perhaps a little too much like a "home" shot than a professionally taken shot.  The colours are a little dark and the image is cropped a little too much on the left and bottom edges.</td>', 'This is perhaps a little too much like a "home" shot than a professionally taken shot.  The colours are a little dark and the image is cropped a little too much on the left and bottom edges.', '2003-02-05 23:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(209245, 11890, 6328, '<td valign="top">Lovely photograph you''ve got here.  Your slow shutter speed does wonders for the water from the little falls up on the right all the way down to the wheel.  The natural lighting puts a very cool mood into the picture, and the background of the wooded area is not the slightest distracting.  No matter where you look, the small water falls brings your eyes right back to the wheel.  The detail that you''ve captured is great, right down to the ice on the rock beside the wheel and the stones on the bank.  Slendid Photograph!</td>', 'Lovely photograph you''ve got here.  Your slow shutter speed does wonders for the water from the little falls up on the right all the way down to the wheel.  The natural lighting puts a very cool mood into the picture, and the background of the wooded area is not the slightest distracting.  No matter where you look, the small water falls brings your eyes right back to the wheel.  The detail that you''ve captured is great, right down to the ice on the rock beside the wheel and the stones on the bank.  Slendid Photograph!', '2003-02-06 00:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(209247, 11703, 714, '<td valign="top">This shot isn''t very interesing and it seems to be out of focus.  Nothing really to focus my eye on.</td>', 'This shot isn''t very interesing and it seems to be out of focus.  Nothing really to focus my eye on.', '2003-02-06 00:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(209248, 11722, 6328, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  I like the way you''ve mirrored the cat in the kettle.  And I''m surprised at the cats colors that you were able to capture, along with the grain of the wooden table.  Really creative.</td>', 'Nice job.  I like the way you''ve mirrored the cat in the kettle.  And I''m surprised at the cats colors that you were able to capture, along with the grain of the wooden table.  Really creative.', '2003-02-06 00:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(209249, 11968, 714, '<td valign="top">This would have been an excellent shot.  some how their is some weird noise going on.  Not sure what you did to it.  Would love to see the original.</td>', 'This would have been an excellent shot.  some how their is some weird noise going on.  Not sure what you did to it.  Would love to see the original.', '2003-02-06 00:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(209251, 11838, 714, '<td valign="top">You did a good job of getting the whole car in focus. I have tried this many and I mean many times and wasn''t able to achieve it.  I think my camera is messed up.  The lighting seems a bit harsh on the right side.  Great shot and good luck.</td>', 'You did a good job of getting the whole car in focus. I have tried this many and I mean many times and wasn''t able to achieve it.  I think my camera is messed up.  The lighting seems a bit harsh on the right side.  Great shot and good luck.', '2003-02-06 00:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(209252, 12031, 714, '<td valign="top">did you try to shoot just his face in the frame?  I don''t like the couch or being able to see the other things on the wall.  You should also try not to use your flash on your camera.  You can buy a lights at hardware stores that could help you out.    I do like the pictures of the babies on the wall.  What a good idea for a portrait.  Good luck.  :)</td>', 'did you try to shoot just his face in the frame?  I don''t like the couch or being able to see the other things on the wall.  You should also try not to use your flash on your camera.  You can buy a lights at hardware stores that could help you out.    I do like the pictures of the babies on the wall.  What a good idea for a portrait.  Good luck.  :)', '2003-02-06 00:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(209253, 11930, 714, '<td valign="top">Very nice choice of b/w.  Great smile and beautiful eyes.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very nice choice of b/w.  Great smile and beautiful eyes.  Good luck.', '2003-02-06 00:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(209254, 11758, 714, '<td valign="top">The background is to busy and blends in to much with the flower.  I do like the flower and the color of it.  Very different.</td>', 'The background is to busy and blends in to much with the flower.  I do like the flower and the color of it.  Very different.', '2003-02-06 00:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(209256, 11919, 714, '<td valign="top">I like the way you captured the snow moving.  The girls exspression is great.  Looks like fun.</td>', 'I like the way you captured the snow moving.  The girls exspression is great.  Looks like fun.', '2003-02-06 00:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(209257, 11983, 714, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  My only nit is I would have liked you to use the rule of thirds here.    Great colors and wonderful focus.  Good Luck.</td>', 'This is beautiful.  My only nit is I would have liked you to use the rule of thirds here.    Great colors and wonderful focus.  Good Luck.', '2003-02-06 00:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(209258, 12024, 714, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand why you didn''t show the eyes of the cat.  This is not very interesting.</td>', 'I don''t understand why you didn''t show the eyes of the cat.  This is not very interesting.', '2003-02-06 00:42:11.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(209260, 11940, 714, '<td valign="top">What a cute bunch.  The background is distracting and try not to use your flash on the camera.  When I take picture of my kids I always take about 100-200 shots before I get the right one.  The best way to get a good shot of kids is let them do their own pose.  Try it and let me know if you need more help.  Good luck and keep shooting.</td>', 'What a cute bunch.  The background is distracting and try not to use your flash on the camera.  When I take picture of my kids I always take about 100-200 shots before I get the right one.  The best way to get a good shot of kids is let them do their own pose.  Try it and let me know if you need more help.  Good luck and keep shooting.', '2003-02-06 00:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(209261, 11969, 714, '<td valign="top">I like the effect.  This picture is telling a story,  I am just clueless. You did a good job with the framing.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like the effect.  This picture is telling a story,  I am just clueless. You did a good job with the framing.  Good luck.', '2003-02-06 00:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(209263, 11935, 714, '<td valign="top">Background is good and the flowers are great.  The framing is bad.  I would have liked to see more of the flowers.</td>', 'Background is good and the flowers are great.  The framing is bad.  I would have liked to see more of the flowers.', '2003-02-06 00:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(209268, 11785, 1135, '<td valign="top">Great sunset photo but I don''t like how the trees disappear into the clouds. It could just be my monitor but it is a bit too dark. I still like this shot and would much rather be there than here!</td>', 'Great sunset photo but I don''t like how the trees disappear into the clouds. It could just be my monitor but it is a bit too dark. I still like this shot and would much rather be there than here!', '2003-02-06 01:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(209270, 11781, 1135, '<td valign="top">Excellent color and clarity. This photo is just beautiful. My only nit is the border, probably one of those love it or hate it things. I''m afraid I''m on the hate it side. - 7</td>', 'Excellent color and clarity. This photo is just beautiful. My only nit is the border, probably one of those love it or hate it things. I''m afraid I''m on the hate it side. - 7', '2003-02-06 01:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(209273, 11991, 1135, '<td valign="top">Great shot and good timing. I wish that the top bird''s wing was not cropped off otherwise this is perfect.</td>', 'Great shot and good timing. I wish that the top bird''s wing was not cropped off otherwise this is perfect.', '2003-02-06 01:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(209274, 11879, 1135, '<td valign="top">You must be very persistent to have gotten this shot. Every thing is just right. Good Job!</td>', 'You must be very persistent to have gotten this shot. Every thing is just right. Good Job!', '2003-02-06 01:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(209276, 11865, 6087, '<td valign="top">You came pretty close to perfection on this shot!</td>', 'You came pretty close to perfection on this shot!', '2003-02-06 01:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(209278, 11759, 3273, '<td valign="top">They''re Geese!!  It''s a shame that the group in the foreground are walking away from you.  You''ve got a nice depth of focus though.</td>', 'They''re Geese!!  It''s a shame that the group in the foreground are walking away from you.  You''ve got a nice depth of focus though.', '2003-02-06 02:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(209282, 11988, 5158, '<td valign="top">The flowers and the pot look very nice: the arrangment of the flowers, the color (although they could be more vivid) and sharpness. It''s a little bright in some parts of the flower and the ligth is set a little flat (probably due to using a flash!?).<br/>What really makes the picture look not too great is the table, the backgound and most important the two green boards. Taking them away and using a lower angle so the table would not be seen too much would have made the picture a lot better.</td>', 'The flowers and the pot look very nice: the arrangment of the flowers, the color (although they could be more vivid) and sharpness. It''s a little bright in some parts of the flower and the ligth is set a little flat (probably due to using a flash!?).What really makes the picture look not too great is the table, the backgound and most important the two green boards. Taking them away and using a lower angle so the table would not be seen too much would have made the picture a lot better.', '2003-02-06 03:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(209283, 11852, 5158, '<td valign="top">I like many things of this photo: the arrangement is clear with the flower on a green background made from the leafs; the composition with the flower in the center is also very got here (rule of third is not always the way to go); the frame is good too; the colors and light are very good too. What I do not like is the sharppness or focus: I realy don''t get what happend to the image. Can''t say that it is out of focus but somehow it looks like blurring, double exposure or so. Is it from the digital sharpening?</td>', 'I like many things of this photo: the arrangement is clear with the flower on a green background made from the leafs; the composition with the flower in the center is also very got here (rule of third is not always the way to go); the frame is good too; the colors and light are very good too. What I do not like is the sharppness or focus: I realy don''t get what happend to the image. Can''t say that it is out of focus but somehow it looks like blurring, double exposure or so. Is it from the digital sharpening?', '2003-02-06 03:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(209284, 12018, 3942, '<td valign="top">WOW, what a great photo! Your composition / cropping is perfect, the texture und the colours are highly impressive. IMHO only the vertical wrinkles in your background are  disturbing a little bit. But this is nerly nothing and marginal. One of my favourites this week, good luck! (10)</td>', 'WOW, what a great photo! Your composition / cropping is perfect, the texture und the colours are highly impressive. IMHO only the vertical wrinkles in your background are  disturbing a little bit. But this is nerly nothing and marginal. One of my favourites this week, good luck! (10)', '2003-02-06 04:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(209285, 11897, 3942, '<td valign="top">A very clear and professional looking picture with perfect lighting. The selective use of water is well done too. Perhaps I would have cropped a little stronger on the top and the bottom of this shot. But that''s only marginal. Great work, good luck!</td>', 'A very clear and professional looking picture with perfect lighting. The selective use of water is well done too. Perhaps I would have cropped a little stronger on the top and the bottom of this shot. But that''s only marginal. Great work, good luck!', '2003-02-06 04:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(209286, 11965, 3942, '<td valign="top">"Out of the dark" could have been an other apposite title, but yours is much more cliche :-). Personally I like, that you don''t show more of the stem by your lighting. Perhaps I would have cropped a little different. IMHO there is too much black space around the blossom. But this is only marginal. Great work, good luck!</td>', '"Out of the dark" could have been an other apposite title, but yours is much more cliche :-). Personally I like, that you don''t show more of the stem by your lighting. Perhaps I would have cropped a little different. IMHO there is too much black space around the blossom. But this is only marginal. Great work, good luck!', '2003-02-06 04:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(209289, 11925, 6635, '<td valign="top">Ahahaha, that dog is awesome.</td>', 'Ahahaha, that dog is awesome.', '2003-02-06 05:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(209290, 11702, 6635, '<td valign="top">Waay too grainy...I can''t even tell what this picture is about</td>', 'Waay too grainy...I can''t even tell what this picture is about', '2003-02-06 05:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(209293, 11865, 3540, '<td valign="top">A combination of cliches.  The idea is great.  Well executed and looks like it gives us a little more effect than I would''ve anticipated with the checkerboard  pattern at the top of the drop.  Really really well done - Inspzil</td>', 'A combination of cliches.  The idea is great.  Well executed and looks like it gives us a little more effect than I would''ve anticipated with the checkerboard  pattern at the top of the drop.  Really really well done - Inspzil', '2003-02-06 05:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(209294, 11966, 4906, '<td valign="top">Nice dog portrait. I would like a little more exposure.</td>', 'Nice dog portrait. I would like a little more exposure.', '2003-02-06 05:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(209295, 11800, 4906, '<td valign="top">The middle of the flower seems a little dark and the focus is a little off. I like the composition.</td>', 'The middle of the flower seems a little dark and the focus is a little off. I like the composition.', '2003-02-06 05:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(209296, 11722, 4906, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Bad pun :)</td>', 'Nice idea. Bad pun :)', '2003-02-06 05:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(209297, 11865, 6635, '<td valign="top">Wow, that turned out exceptionally well. When first looking at it, I almost mistook that water droplet for a chess piece :)</td>', 'Wow, that turned out exceptionally well. When first looking at it, I almost mistook that water droplet for a chess piece :)', '2003-02-06 05:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(209298, 11937, 4906, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Shame you can see a bit of the wording on the background and the lighting is a little harsh.</td>', 'Nicely done. Shame you can see a bit of the wording on the background and the lighting is a little harsh.', '2003-02-06 05:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(209299, 11774, 4906, '<td valign="top">Cute picture but focus is a little off and lighting could be stronger.</td>', 'Cute picture but focus is a little off and lighting could be stronger.', '2003-02-06 05:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(209300, 11721, 4906, '<td valign="top">lol. Picture is a bit dark. Would be nice to have the dog''s attention on the camera.</td>', 'lol. Picture is a bit dark. Would be nice to have the dog''s attention on the camera.', '2003-02-06 05:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(209301, 11782, 4906, '<td valign="top">I''d have preferred this if the lighting was lesh harsh.</td>', 'I''d have preferred this if the lighting was lesh harsh.', '2003-02-06 05:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(209302, 11960, 4906, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but a bit cluttered. Would be better with stronger lighting.</td>', 'Nice idea but a bit cluttered. Would be better with stronger lighting.', '2003-02-06 05:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(209303, 11697, 4906, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and nice subject. Could do with more exposure and focus seems a little too soft on the child''s face.</td>', 'I like the composition and nice subject. Could do with more exposure and focus seems a little too soft on the child''s face.', '2003-02-06 05:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(209304, 11720, 3540, '<td valign="top">Should''ve concentrated on the roses.  They photograph better than almost every othe flower.  The background roses are also a little dark as well. - Inspzil</td>', 'Should''ve concentrated on the roses.  They photograph better than almost every othe flower.  The background roses are also a little dark as well. - Inspzil', '2003-02-06 05:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(209305, 11975, 4906, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop on the bird would have been better, the subject looks a little too central.</td>', 'A tighter crop on the bird would have been better, the subject looks a little too central.', '2003-02-06 05:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(209306, 11767, 3540, '<td valign="top">Some hotspos on this flower.  Move the light source back a little and I think you would''ve gotten rid of that prblem. - Inspzil</td>', 'Some hotspos on this flower.  Move the light source back a little and I think you would''ve gotten rid of that prblem. - Inspzil', '2003-02-06 05:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(209307, 11830, 4906, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and composition. The blurred leaves at the top left are a little distracting though.</td>', 'Nice focus and composition. The blurred leaves at the top left are a little distracting though.', '2003-02-06 05:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(209308, 11869, 4906, '<td valign="top">This would have been good for the perspective challenge. Nice picture.</td>', 'This would have been good for the perspective challenge. Nice picture.', '2003-02-06 05:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(209309, 11750, 4906, '<td valign="top">lol. Nice. Would have been better without the logo on the top left.</td>', 'lol. Nice. Would have been better without the logo on the top left.', '2003-02-06 05:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(209310, 12003, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nice flower pic.  I don''t like the dark ominous background.  The color contrast is good, just the background being a different mood is not so good. - Inspzil</td>', 'Nice flower pic.  I don''t like the dark ominous background.  The color contrast is good, just the background being a different mood is not so good. - Inspzil', '2003-02-06 05:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(209311, 11826, 3540, '<td valign="top">Not a bad macro all in all.  It just hard to capture a macro with this much depth without something getting blurry - Inspzil</td>', 'Not a bad macro all in all.  It just hard to capture a macro with this much depth without something getting blurry - Inspzil', '2003-02-06 05:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(209312, 11782, 5158, '<td valign="top">Good composition, but the light and thus the shadows are a little strong</td>', 'Good composition, but the light and thus the shadows are a little strong', '2003-02-06 05:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(209313, 12025, 4906, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Interesting lighting. Focus could be a bit sharper.</td>', 'Nice idea. Interesting lighting. Focus could be a bit sharper.', '2003-02-06 05:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(209314, 12018, 4906, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2003-02-06 05:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(209315, 11790, 4906, '<td valign="top">Very nice textures and colours.</td>', 'Very nice textures and colours.', '2003-02-06 05:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(209316, 11855, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Very simple and artsy.  Elegant is the word I''m looking for. - Inspzil</td>', 'Nice shot.  Very simple and artsy.  Elegant is the word I''m looking for. - Inspzil', '2003-02-06 05:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(209317, 11948, 5158, '<td valign="top">Wonderfull rose picture. I like the soft light. It is a little dark in my opinion. It fits the challenge well. Good luck with this great submission.</td>', 'Wonderfull rose picture. I like the soft light. It is a little dark in my opinion. It fits the challenge well. Good luck with this great submission.', '2003-02-06 05:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(209318, 12008, 3540, '<td valign="top">The dogs expression is priceless.  I don''t like the effect of the flash on his eye though. - Inspzil</td>', 'The dogs expression is priceless.  I don''t like the effect of the flash on his eye though. - Inspzil', '2003-02-06 05:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(209319, 11788, 3540, '<td valign="top">This needs to be sharper.  Lighting is not very good either - Inspzil</td>', 'This needs to be sharper.  Lighting is not very good either - Inspzil', '2003-02-06 05:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(209320, 11916, 3540, '<td valign="top">I like the mood of this shot.  THe horse is looking quite sullen, it isn''t a beautiful sunny day at the perfect farm with the perfect red barn.  Its more real life with a great shot of the horse on a dreary day in front of a beat up old barn.  Nice image- Inspzil</td>', 'I like the mood of this shot.  THe horse is looking quite sullen, it isn''t a beautiful sunny day at the perfect farm with the perfect red barn.  Its more real life with a great shot of the horse on a dreary day in front of a beat up old barn.  Nice image- Inspzil', '2003-02-06 05:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(209321, 12002, 5158, '<td valign="top">Great still life shot. I especially like the soft light, the reflections from the surface and it''s stillness. I think the vase is a little too big compared to the flowers: I was looking back and forth between the flowers and the vase to see what is more important to the picture. Still, a great image and it will probably do well. good luck.</td>', 'Great still life shot. I especially like the soft light, the reflections from the surface and it''s stillness. I think the vase is a little too big compared to the flowers: I was looking back and forth between the flowers and the vase to see what is more important to the picture. Still, a great image and it will probably do well. good luck.', '2003-02-06 05:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
