(209327, 11925, 5158, '<td valign="top">LOL!! That''s what I call a cliché-photo: I acctually expected more pure dog-nose pictures in this challenge, because on DPC-dog noses are the most clichéy subject beside flowers and sunsets. And this one with onyl a mouth, nose and plenty of hairs is one of the best!</td>', 'LOL!! That''s what I call a cliché-photo: I acctually expected more pure dog-nose pictures in this challenge, because on DPC-dog noses are the most clichéy subject beside flowers and sunsets. And this one with onyl a mouth, nose and plenty of hairs is one of the best!', '2003-02-06 05:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
