(209490, 11784, 2700, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but this photo doesn''t apeal to me. AT ALL. The face of the cat is VERY overexposed ( use less flash, or stand back more). It also looks like the focus point is beoynd the cat (the white wall infact). To aliveate this, you could turn on the macro function (if your camera has it), or you could hold a magnifing glass next to your lens to "focus" on the subject. 1</td>', 'I''m sorry but this photo doesn''t apeal to me. AT ALL. The face of the cat is VERY overexposed ( use less flash, or stand back more). It also looks like the focus point is beoynd the cat (the white wall infact). To aliveate this, you could turn on the macro function (if your camera has it), or you could hold a magnifing glass next to your lens to "focus" on the subject. 1', '2003-02-06 10:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
