(209566, 11780, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful close-up, or is it considered a macro, of a cactus.  It is so real looking, and the colors are perfect.  I love the angle with the sky included.  Great composition and beautifully executed.  I''m looking hard for something wrong, so my comment can be helpful, but I can''t find it. I''ll keep coming back, maybe I''ll find something wrong eventually and can help you and can lower your score from the 9 that it is now.</td>', 'This is a beautiful close-up, or is it considered a macro, of a cactus.  It is so real looking, and the colors are perfect.  I love the angle with the sky included.  Great composition and beautifully executed.  I''m looking hard for something wrong, so my comment can be helpful, but I can''t find it. I''ll keep coming back, maybe I''ll find something wrong eventually and can help you and can lower your score from the 9 that it is now.', '2003-02-06 11:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(209568, 11700, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great title.  Very ingenius.  I really like the photo and the concept of it.  But personally, and I said personally I have some problems.  I don''t really go for this DOF thing so many like.  To me this whole thing should have been in as good of focus as the can on thel eft.  It is great.  Also the rounded background leaves dark triangles at the top two corners, very distracting.  The shadows on the focused can are too dark, as is the end of the can.  I realize you went with a loft of "correct'' photography techs.  This is why I believe they are rules of thumb and not laws, as do a lot of people.  To me this one, because of the concept and your obvious photographic abilities, could have been a 1st place winner, with a score of 10.  As it is it really should be scored very low.  But I am going to give it a 6 because the concept is so good, it meets the challenge, it is different and unique, I really do love the whole idea, and I can see a lot of potential that is obvious you have thea ability to do.  This is not my norm on comments or score but feel is warranted by this photo.  I really wish you the best.  This one is a perfect example why we should shot what we really like.</td>', 'Great title.  Very ingenius.  I really like the photo and the concept of it.  But personally, and I said personally I have some problems.  I don''t really go for this DOF thing so many like.  To me this whole thing should have been in as good of focus as the can on thel eft.  It is great.  Also the rounded background leaves dark triangles at the top two corners, very distracting.  The shadows on the focused can are too dark, as is the end of the can.  I realize you went with a loft of "correct'' photography techs.  This is why I believe they are rules of thumb and not laws, as do a lot of people.  To me this one, because of the concept and your obvious photographic abilities, could have been a 1st place winner, with a score of 10.  As it is it really should be scored very low.  But I am going to give it a 6 because the concept is so good, it meets the challenge, it is different and unique, I really do love the whole idea, and I can see a lot of potential that is obvious you have thea ability to do.  This is not my norm on comments or score but feel is warranted by this photo.  I really wish you the best.  This one is a perfect example why we should shot what we really like.', '2003-02-06 12:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(209569, 11898, 4648, '<td valign="top">What a beautifully color of a rose.  I really like the focus on this.  The cropping stinks in my opinion.  This is much too beautiful of a rose to crop any of it off.  But this is my opinion, and probably the only one that feels this way.  Personally I would love to see this cropped very tightly, but with all of the rose included.  Still a beautiful rose.</td>', 'What a beautifully color of a rose.  I really like the focus on this.  The cropping stinks in my opinion.  This is much too beautiful of a rose to crop any of it off.  But this is my opinion, and probably the only one that feels this way.  Personally I would love to see this cropped very tightly, but with all of the rose included.  Still a beautiful rose.', '2003-02-06 12:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
