(209637, 11723, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a very good shot.  The trees and stuff on shore is a little soft, but it isn''t majorly distracting from the shot.  The monument is a little bright but I can understand that as 1.) it was meant to be. or 2.) it was necessary to get the rest of the exposure right.  Either way, its a great pic - Inspzil</td>', 'This is a very good shot.  The trees and stuff on shore is a little soft, but it isn''t majorly distracting from the shot.  The monument is a little bright but I can understand that as 1.) it was meant to be. or 2.) it was necessary to get the rest of the exposure right.  Either way, its a great pic - Inspzil', '2003-02-06 13:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(209644, 11923, 5044, '<td valign="top">Very cool picture. I like the different perspective on the flower, with more emphasis on the stem. I find that the DOF is a little too narrow. I would have liked to see more of the petals in focus, especially the closest ones. The flower on the blue background is great. As is your border. I am not a border fan, but that one works really well.</td>', 'Very cool picture. I like the different perspective on the flower, with more emphasis on the stem. I find that the DOF is a little too narrow. I would have liked to see more of the petals in focus, especially the closest ones. The flower on the blue background is great. As is your border. I am not a border fan, but that one works really well.', '2003-02-06 14:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(209645, 11907, 5044, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The mood you have set with your background is excellent. You have somehow managed to attain this warm softness to it. I find the flower a little overexposed. I long to see more detail to the petals. Maybe cropped a little closer as well. Excellent photo nonetheless.</td>', 'Very nice. The mood you have set with your background is excellent. You have somehow managed to attain this warm softness to it. I find the flower a little overexposed. I long to see more detail to the petals. Maybe cropped a little closer as well. Excellent photo nonetheless.', '2003-02-06 14:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
