(209926, 11853, 1759, '<td valign="top">Good job of composition and getting a nice clean image. I also like the imagery portrayed. One observation I have is that the hand is so much brighter (and larger) than the rose, that it tends to dominate. I think you could get a nice effect and more attention to the rose by pointing a background light behind the rose.</td>', 'Good job of composition and getting a nice clean image. I also like the imagery portrayed. One observation I have is that the hand is so much brighter (and larger) than the rose, that it tends to dominate. I think you could get a nice effect and more attention to the rose by pointing a background light behind the rose.', '2003-02-06 19:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(209927, 11782, 6454, '<td valign="top">I like the black added to the back of this picture. The lighting on just the flowers brings alot of intrest to the picture. Nice Work</td>', 'I like the black added to the back of this picture. The lighting on just the flowers brings alot of intrest to the picture. Nice Work', '2003-02-06 19:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
