(209949, 11697, 6328, '<td valign="top">He''s sure paying attention to something.  Nicely composed, angle of the photo seems just right, doesn''t it?  Most of the photo is sharp.  Nice soothing color to the eyes of the beholder.<br/>[Just my curiosity, but what''s that little plastic bag behind the boy by the rock?]</td>', 'He''s sure paying attention to something.  Nicely composed, angle of the photo seems just right, doesn''t it?  Most of the photo is sharp.  Nice soothing color to the eyes of the beholder.[Just my curiosity, but what''s that little plastic bag behind the boy by the rock?]', '2003-02-06 19:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(209952, 11952, 1647, '<td valign="top">I think the palm tree is perhaps a little too small in this shot.  Focus is quite good and the tree is almost completely black - which is very good.</td>', 'I think the palm tree is perhaps a little too small in this shot.  Focus is quite good and the tree is almost completely black - which is very good.', '2003-02-06 20:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(209953, 11823, 1647, '<td valign="top">That''s a very interesting crop.  Colour is great and the water drops are nice.  It looks like you had a very shallow depth of field - I might have tried to get the entire flower in focus since there is no background, but it''s still pretty good as it is.</td>', 'That''s a very interesting crop.  Colour is great and the water drops are nice.  It looks like you had a very shallow depth of field - I might have tried to get the entire flower in focus since there is no background, but it''s still pretty good as it is.', '2003-02-06 20:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(209954, 11803, 2752, '<td valign="top">He/she is certainly a keeper...great portrait especially in black and white..the lighting is very good and I like the mood caught here.  This child is a thinker.  Very crisp and clean photo.  Good luck.</td>', 'He/she is certainly a keeper...great portrait especially in black and white..the lighting is very good and I like the mood caught here.  This child is a thinker.  Very crisp and clean photo.  Good luck.', '2003-02-06 20:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(209955, 11951, 1647, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition - it makes those towering buildings seem incredibly insignificant.  As a cityscape it''s not that good - not enough city, but as a photo it''s quite interesting.  There is some distortion from the lens (buildings on each edge lean in) which you could process out if you were going to print this image, although it would probably not be allowed in the competition.</td>', 'Interesting composition - it makes those towering buildings seem incredibly insignificant.  As a cityscape it''s not that good - not enough city, but as a photo it''s quite interesting.  There is some distortion from the lens (buildings on each edge lean in) which you could process out if you were going to print this image, although it would probably not be allowed in the competition.', '2003-02-06 20:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(209956, 12050, 5266, '<td valign="top">Kermit is absolutely precious!!  You did a great job with his eyes.  Like the muted background, but the collar tags are distracting.</td>', 'Kermit is absolutely precious!!  You did a great job with his eyes.  Like the muted background, but the collar tags are distracting.', '2003-02-06 20:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(209957, 11932, 5266, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors, pretty silhouette.  Nice composition!!</td>', 'Pretty colors, pretty silhouette.  Nice composition!!', '2003-02-06 20:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(209958, 11929, 1280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful~</td>', 'Beautiful~', '2003-02-06 20:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(209959, 11727, 1647, '<td valign="top">Wow, I love the way the sky/fog blends into the snow - there is really no horizon line.  My only negative about this image is the shadow at the very bottom - obvisouly from the next pole.  I might have included this pole and then the perspective of the shadows would also be obvious - very well done though.</td>', 'Wow, I love the way the sky/fog blends into the snow - there is really no horizon line.  My only negative about this image is the shadow at the very bottom - obvisouly from the next pole.  I might have included this pole and then the perspective of the shadows would also be obvious - very well done though.', '2003-02-06 20:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(209960, 11842, 5266, '<td valign="top">This is a nicely different family portrait!!  Not your typical family all shined, polished, and in their Sunday best -- which makes this a better than average photo.  I like the sepia!!</td>', 'This is a nicely different family portrait!!  Not your typical family all shined, polished, and in their Sunday best -- which makes this a better than average photo.  I like the sepia!!', '2003-02-06 20:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(209961, 11821, 2752, '<td valign="top">lovely colors and delicious looking candy.  I think that the rose and vase detract<br/>from the composition that otherwise would be great.</td>', 'lovely colors and delicious looking candy.  I think that the rose and vase detractfrom the composition that otherwise would be great.', '2003-02-06 20:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(209962, 11846, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice photo - Focus is ok, colour is good and the bird is delightful.  I might have tried applying "rule of thirds" to this image - perhaps placing the birds eye at the top/left third point.  The shallow depth of field brings attention to the bird, but I might have tried even a shallow-er depth of field to really blur the background.  Great shot.</td>', 'Nice photo - Focus is ok, colour is good and the bird is delightful.  I might have tried applying "rule of thirds" to this image - perhaps placing the birds eye at the top/left third point.  The shallow depth of field brings attention to the bird, but I might have tried even a shallow-er depth of field to really blur the background.  Great shot.', '2003-02-06 20:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(209963, 11942, 5266, '<td valign="top">Nice colors - I wish there were more drops/splashes!!  But I really like the light reflections on the bottom of the dish(?) and the ripples.</td>', 'Nice colors - I wish there were more drops/splashes!!  But I really like the light reflections on the bottom of the dish(?) and the ripples.', '2003-02-06 20:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(209964, 11824, 5266, '<td valign="top">The feather and eggs distract from the flower.  It''s a bit busy for my liking, so thumbs down on composition.  Your focus and color are great.</td>', 'The feather and eggs distract from the flower.  It''s a bit busy for my liking, so thumbs down on composition.  Your focus and color are great.', '2003-02-06 20:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(209965, 11983, 1647, '<td valign="top">This could become a postcard - so I guess it definitely meets the "cliche" component.  Colours are wonderful, focus is very good and placing the sun behind the palm was a really good idea.  Well done.</td>', 'This could become a postcard - so I guess it definitely meets the "cliche" component.  Colours are wonderful, focus is very good and placing the sun behind the palm was a really good idea.  Well done.', '2003-02-06 20:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(209966, 11767, 2752, '<td valign="top">The green smoke adds an interesting element..the colors are good...like the black background..only negative for me would be the blue flowers.</td>', 'The green smoke adds an interesting element..the colors are good...like the black background..only negative for me would be the blue flowers.', '2003-02-06 20:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(209967, 11943, 5266, '<td valign="top">Rather withered and dying flower, don''t you think?  But you''ve captured the brown and grey spots as well as the yellow - a new swing on a cliche.  Not crazy about the road in the background - would have liked to see all greenery.</td>', 'Rather withered and dying flower, don''t you think?  But you''ve captured the brown and grey spots as well as the yellow - a new swing on a cliche.  Not crazy about the road in the background - would have liked to see all greenery.', '2003-02-06 20:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(209968, 11818, 1647, '<td valign="top">He looks sleepy.  It''s a good shot, but I might have tried taking it a little closer to the ground, and perhaps including more of his body.</td>', 'He looks sleepy.  It''s a good shot, but I might have tried taking it a little closer to the ground, and perhaps including more of his body.', '2003-02-06 20:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(209969, 11832, 5266, '<td valign="top">Oh, he could break you in two!!  Great shot in a zoo (I''m assuming!!)  I love the detail in the bear''s fur - love the background.  And he''s sort of looking at you!!  Great job with a live, uncooperative subject!!  9</td>', 'Oh, he could break you in two!!  Great shot in a zoo (I''m assuming!!)  I love the detail in the bear''s fur - love the background.  And he''s sort of looking at you!!  Great job with a live, uncooperative subject!!  9', '2003-02-06 20:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(209970, 11968, 1647, '<td valign="top">I think the white background and the darkness of the dogs makes them a little hard to look at.  I like your composition - it''s different and works quite well</td>', 'I think the white background and the darkness of the dogs makes them a little hard to look at.  I like your composition - it''s different and works quite well', '2003-02-06 20:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(209972, 11892, 5266, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous cat - could have stood being brushed before the photo.  I like the background with the flowers - nice contrast against the muted colors of kitty.</td>', 'Gorgeous cat - could have stood being brushed before the photo.  I like the background with the flowers - nice contrast against the muted colors of kitty.', '2003-02-06 20:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
