(209974, 11945, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice macro.  The shallow depth of field has started to blur the flower, and that really brings attention to the centre of the flower well.  Your focus is perfect.  Great work.</td>', 'Nice macro.  The shallow depth of field has started to blur the flower, and that really brings attention to the centre of the flower well.  Your focus is perfect.  Great work.', '2003-02-06 20:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(209975, 11694, 5266, '<td valign="top">Very pretty!!  Amazing effect - want to know how you achieved it!!!  Wow, I like this a lot - wonderful composition, colors, everything!!!  9</td>', 'Very pretty!!  Amazing effect - want to know how you achieved it!!!  Wow, I like this a lot - wonderful composition, colors, everything!!!  9', '2003-02-06 20:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(209976, 11858, 1647, '<td valign="top">The lighting is very well balanced - good work.  Focus is also good.  Your framing is quite different from what I might have done, but it is interesting nonetheless.  I like the way the background ties in with the centre of the flower.</td>', 'The lighting is very well balanced - good work.  Focus is also good.  Your framing is quite different from what I might have done, but it is interesting nonetheless.  I like the way the background ties in with the centre of the flower.', '2003-02-06 20:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(209977, 11691, 5266, '<td valign="top">She''s saying, "Aren''t I pretty?"  And yes, she is!!  I would have liked to see a closer crop on the left side - too  much white right now.  I love the angle of the mirror.  The white carpet works, but the end of her tail is cut off -- OUCH!!!</td>', 'She''s saying, "Aren''t I pretty?"  And yes, she is!!  I would have liked to see a closer crop on the left side - too  much white right now.  I love the angle of the mirror.  The white carpet works, but the end of her tail is cut off -- OUCH!!!', '2003-02-06 20:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(209978, 11808, 1280, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful face!  Pure joy!</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful face!  Pure joy!', '2003-02-06 20:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
