(209980, 12010, 5266, '<td valign="top">Adorable little girl!!  I like the "action" shot, and you''ve managed to get her well focussed, too.  Cute top - red looks great on her.</td>', 'Adorable little girl!!  I like the "action" shot, and you''ve managed to get her well focussed, too.  Cute top - red looks great on her.', '2003-02-06 20:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(209981, 12028, 5266, '<td valign="top">HILARIOUS!!!  Two, Two, Two cats at once - you are amazing!!  And how did you get them to wave???   The eyes on the orange tabby are a bit "weird" if you''ll excuse the word - but not quite the nuclear glow I sometimes get with my guys.  Nice job, overall.</td>', 'HILARIOUS!!!  Two, Two, Two cats at once - you are amazing!!  And how did you get them to wave???   The eyes on the orange tabby are a bit "weird" if you''ll excuse the word - but not quite the nuclear glow I sometimes get with my guys.  Nice job, overall.', '2003-02-06 20:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(209982, 12029, 5266, '<td valign="top">Duster is very beautiful.  But a brushing before the photo could help here.  The lighting is nice - natural - and your focus on Duster''s eyes is spot on.</td>', 'Duster is very beautiful.  But a brushing before the photo could help here.  The lighting is nice - natural - and your focus on Duster''s eyes is spot on.', '2003-02-06 20:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(209983, 11977, 5266, '<td valign="top">Too much gold at the top - crop it down a bit and the photo would be better IMO.  Also, there is a big reflection on the bottle - perhaps a different lighting setup would diffuse that.</td>', 'Too much gold at the top - crop it down a bit and the photo would be better IMO.  Also, there is a big reflection on the bottle - perhaps a different lighting setup would diffuse that.', '2003-02-06 21:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(209985, 11869, 5266, '<td valign="top">Neat perspective!!!  Cute kid, nice set up!!  I like this photo.</td>', 'Neat perspective!!!  Cute kid, nice set up!!  I like this photo.', '2003-02-06 21:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(209986, 11736, 5266, '<td valign="top">I can''t figure out what this is.</td>', 'I can''t figure out what this is.', '2003-02-06 21:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(209987, 11909, 5266, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - I''d lose the collar on kitty, and crop out a bit of the background at the top, but it''s a good overall effect.</td>', 'Nice shot - I''d lose the collar on kitty, and crop out a bit of the background at the top, but it''s a good overall effect.', '2003-02-06 21:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(209988, 11996, 5266, '<td valign="top">Cool!!!!  Like the color, the focus is great - the texture of the snake''s skin is great!!</td>', 'Cool!!!!  Like the color, the focus is great - the texture of the snake''s skin is great!!', '2003-02-06 21:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(209989, 12031, 5266, '<td valign="top">LOL!!!!  I like the setup here!!  Not crazy about the couch, but a sheet would fix that up.  Very creative - very original!!</td>', 'LOL!!!!  I like the setup here!!  Not crazy about the couch, but a sheet would fix that up.  Very creative - very original!!', '2003-02-06 21:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(209990, 11755, 5266, '<td valign="top">Great shot - the eye is perfectly focussed!!  I wouldn''t mess with that catnip ball!!!</td>', 'Great shot - the eye is perfectly focussed!!  I wouldn''t mess with that catnip ball!!!', '2003-02-06 21:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(209991, 11697, 5266, '<td valign="top">This is a keeper!!  I have seen photos like this from professionals.    And that''s no fish tale!!    Love the composition and the fact that the little cutie''s feet seem to be covered in mud.</td>', 'This is a keeper!!  I have seen photos like this from professionals.    And that''s no fish tale!!    Love the composition and the fact that the little cutie''s feet seem to be covered in mud.', '2003-02-06 21:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(209992, 11722, 5266, '<td valign="top">Neat idea!! That''s one clean teapot!!  It looks like the cat is leaning so you can see all of it in the tea pot.  Very nice photo.</td>', 'Neat idea!! That''s one clean teapot!!  It looks like the cat is leaning so you can see all of it in the tea pot.  Very nice photo.', '2003-02-06 21:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(209993, 12005, 5266, '<td valign="top">So adorable.  I like the stuffed dog, and I think the photo would be better if the little girl was holding an older-fashioned stuffy instead of the cloth doll.  But the outfits are wonderful - the chair is great, and the kids are precious!!!</td>', 'So adorable.  I like the stuffed dog, and I think the photo would be better if the little girl was holding an older-fashioned stuffy instead of the cloth doll.  But the outfits are wonderful - the chair is great, and the kids are precious!!!', '2003-02-06 21:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(209994, 12049, 5266, '<td valign="top">WOW!!!  Great professional quality shot.  And you just happen to have wings laying around the house?  LOL!!!  This is beautiful - something to go on your wall.</td>', 'WOW!!!  Great professional quality shot.  And you just happen to have wings laying around the house?  LOL!!!  This is beautiful - something to go on your wall.', '2003-02-06 21:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(209995, 11715, 5266, '<td valign="top">Pucker up honey!!!  Good shot, but the man seems to have greenery growing from the back of his head.</td>', 'Pucker up honey!!!  Good shot, but the man seems to have greenery growing from the back of his head.', '2003-02-06 21:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(209997, 11933, 5266, '<td valign="top">Hey Phil!!!!  Did he see his shadow?  Hope not for your sake!!  Although maybe your flash scared him back in his hole.  I like the lighting in this photo, but one man is red-eyed.</td>', 'Hey Phil!!!!  Did he see his shadow?  Hope not for your sake!!  Although maybe your flash scared him back in his hole.  I like the lighting in this photo, but one man is red-eyed.', '2003-02-06 21:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(209998, 12025, 5266, '<td valign="top">You can afford TWO digicams?  You''re much too wealthy!!  Love the colors in this - the composition is nice.  Hope you enjoy your A40 - what''s your second camera?</td>', 'You can afford TWO digicams?  You''re much too wealthy!!  Love the colors in this - the composition is nice.  Hope you enjoy your A40 - what''s your second camera?', '2003-02-06 21:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(210000, 11898, 1280, '<td valign="top">Soft and lovely.</td>', 'Soft and lovely.', '2003-02-06 21:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(210001, 11862, 5266, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective - love the chrome.  I''d like the photo to be a bit brighter to accentuate the colors more.</td>', 'Nice perspective - love the chrome.  I''d like the photo to be a bit brighter to accentuate the colors more.', '2003-02-06 21:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(210002, 11966, 5266, '<td valign="top">Great expressive shot!!!  And I''m not a dog person!!  Thank you for taking off the dog''s collar - attention to detail counts.  Great lighting - wonderful composition.</td>', 'Great expressive shot!!!  And I''m not a dog person!!  Thank you for taking off the dog''s collar - attention to detail counts.  Great lighting - wonderful composition.', '2003-02-06 21:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
