(210019, 11966, 4210, '<td valign="top">Looks like something you would find in a pet book, and I mean that in a good way!</td>', 'Looks like something you would find in a pet book, and I mean that in a good way!', '2003-02-06 22:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
