(210022, 12046, 4210, '<td valign="top">Great composition. This photo has tons of potential, but it has this noise/grainyness that really takes away from it...</td>', 'Great composition. This photo has tons of potential, but it has this noise/grainyness that really takes away from it...', '2003-02-06 22:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(210023, 11714, 4210, '<td valign="top">Bit of a boarder there at the top.</td>', 'Bit of a boarder there at the top.', '2003-02-06 22:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(210029, 11939, 4210, '<td valign="top">I have alot to say about this photo. I love the colour, and the focus is great. I would have cropped this photo a little differently however, and (hopefully you don''t mind, and if you do, please say so and I will delete it all immediately) I saved this photo on my comp and cropped it as an example to show you what I mean. <br/>//elysiux.flnet.org/~machaira/Flower.jpg<br/> <br/>I think I took too much off the bottom, but you get the idea. It remove all the flaws of the flower (ragged edges and brown spots etc) and there is no background to distract the eye. So perhaps playing with the crops next time would yeild interesting results. (I can also see this as a tall thin shot with the center of the flower at the top).<br/>Best of luck in the future!</td>', 'I have alot to say about this photo. I love the colour, and the focus is great. I would have cropped this photo a little differently however, and (hopefully you don''t mind, and if you do, please say so and I will delete it all immediately) I saved this photo on my comp and cropped it as an example to show you what I mean. //elysiux.flnet.org/~machaira/Flower.jpg I think I took too much off the bottom, but you get the idea. It remove all the flaws of the flower (ragged edges and brown spots etc) and there is no background to distract the eye. So perhaps playing with the crops next time would yeild interesting results. (I can also see this as a tall thin shot with the center of the flower at the top).Best of luck in the future!', '2003-02-06 22:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(210036, 11797, 4210, '<td valign="top">Beautifully vibrant colours!</td>', 'Beautifully vibrant colours!', '2003-02-06 22:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
