(210080, 11981, 5268, '<td valign="top">Nice photo!  Good colors and focus.  Some would complain of the "Rule of Thirds" violation but it doesn''t bother me. In fact I think it is necessary for the background... Cub</td>', 'Nice photo!  Good colors and focus.  Some would complain of the "Rule of Thirds" violation but it doesn''t bother me. In fact I think it is necessary for the background... Cub', '2003-02-06 23:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
