(210106, 11833, 4648, '<td valign="top">Not sure I understand what you title has to do with the photo.  But you met the challenge with out the title.  Beautiful, well done photo.  Good focus, color, composition, lighting, etc.  Some will have a problem with the chair arm, but it is of no consequence in the photo.  Doesn''t add to or take away from.  The kid and the dog hold your eyes fine.  Nice one.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Not sure I understand what you title has to do with the photo.  But you met the challenge with out the title.  Beautiful, well done photo.  Good focus, color, composition, lighting, etc.  Some will have a problem with the chair arm, but it is of no consequence in the photo.  Doesn''t add to or take away from.  The kid and the dog hold your eyes fine.  Nice one.  Congratulations.', '2003-02-06 23:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(210109, 11903, 1280, '<td valign="top">A beauty!</td>', 'A beauty!', '2003-02-06 23:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
