(210113, 11853, 4648, '<td valign="top">Don''t care if it is fake or not.  I had already cried ouch before I saw the blood.  Like the tiny detail of the scratch on the arm at the edge, or did you mean to do that.  Sosrry but you can''t get a rose without the thornes.  But you did get a well done photo.  Technically you got them all right.  Except for 1 tiny little thing:  I can''t find any thorns on the stem, guess they''re all stuck in the hand.  Not a beauty winner, but you expected that, but a good of a photo as any.  Good one.</td>', 'Don''t care if it is fake or not.  I had already cried ouch before I saw the blood.  Like the tiny detail of the scratch on the arm at the edge, or did you mean to do that.  Sosrry but you can''t get a rose without the thornes.  But you did get a well done photo.  Technically you got them all right.  Except for 1 tiny little thing:  I can''t find any thorns on the stem, guess they''re all stuck in the hand.  Not a beauty winner, but you expected that, but a good of a photo as any.  Good one.', '2003-02-06 23:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(210114, 12034, 1280, '<td valign="top">Fine coloring and clarity.</td>', 'Fine coloring and clarity.', '2003-02-06 23:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
