(210123, 11727, 6325, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this one. It really draws me in. Did you try it in black and white?</td>', 'I keep coming back to this one. It really draws me in. Did you try it in black and white?', '2003-02-07 00:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(210125, 11887, 4648, '<td valign="top">Should have done it in sepia tone.  Go back and do one in it.  They are posed like the old fashioned photos.  What breed is the one on the chair.  Looks bassett hound, blood hound, chocolate lab, all three which is it.  They are beautiful and the is a beautifully done photo.  Great lighting and background  Like how it''s almost shadow free.  Great job there.  This is a reall good composition.  I love the bow ties.  Couldn''t you find any white shoes to slip on them?  This is an 8 for sure.</td>', 'Should have done it in sepia tone.  Go back and do one in it.  They are posed like the old fashioned photos.  What breed is the one on the chair.  Looks bassett hound, blood hound, chocolate lab, all three which is it.  They are beautiful and the is a beautifully done photo.  Great lighting and background  Like how it''s almost shadow free.  Great job there.  This is a reall good composition.  I love the bow ties.  Couldn''t you find any white shoes to slip on them?  This is an 8 for sure.', '2003-02-07 00:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(210127, 11857, 4648, '<td valign="top">The light brown border being so close to the color of the pine cone makes it a little hard to see the pint cone.  It draws your eye out so that you see the whole photo as a unit rather than being able to look at the pine cone.  The brown leaves add to this affect.  I truly believe the border really hurt you this time.  The black one alone would have forced your eyes inward toward the center.  Don''t get me wrong.  It is a well focused photogaph, nicely done.  But the border prevents you from seeing this, and acutally makes it look like just almost a messy piece of grass.  It actually takes this from a 9 to a 4.</td>', 'The light brown border being so close to the color of the pine cone makes it a little hard to see the pint cone.  It draws your eye out so that you see the whole photo as a unit rather than being able to look at the pine cone.  The brown leaves add to this affect.  I truly believe the border really hurt you this time.  The black one alone would have forced your eyes inward toward the center.  Don''t get me wrong.  It is a well focused photogaph, nicely done.  But the border prevents you from seeing this, and acutally makes it look like just almost a messy piece of grass.  It actually takes this from a 9 to a 4.', '2003-02-07 00:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(210128, 11692, 1143, '<td valign="top">I love this color of flower. The photo as a whole seems a bit noisy and I''m not sure that I like it touching the frame on the top and the shadow touching on bottom. Nice angle and focus tho. 7</td>', 'I love this color of flower. The photo as a whole seems a bit noisy and I''m not sure that I like it touching the frame on the top and the shadow touching on bottom. Nice angle and focus tho. 7', '2003-02-07 00:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(210129, 11863, 4648, '<td valign="top">Took me a minute to understand your title.  Now I get it.  Would have been a little easier if the photo had been a little lighter.  And that''s all it needs.  Everything else is great.  Love the motion.  Great motion shot.  Lighten it a little and you have a winner.</td>', 'Took me a minute to understand your title.  Now I get it.  Would have been a little easier if the photo had been a little lighter.  And that''s all it needs.  Everything else is great.  Love the motion.  Great motion shot.  Lighten it a little and you have a winner.', '2003-02-07 00:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(210130, 11823, 1143, '<td valign="top">so so cliche  :)  TONS of water on flower shots. I love the yellow on black. What is it focus is really great, but I''d like a bit more dof. High quality shot.7</td>', 'so so cliche  :)  TONS of water on flower shots. I love the yellow on black. What is it focus is really great, but I''d like a bit more dof. High quality shot.7', '2003-02-07 00:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(210131, 11972, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great play on scripture.  Fits the photo and the photo fits the cliche.  It''s also a good photo except for the shadow.  It cuts out the whole end of the football.  Very good focus and great color, very natural and vivid.  Only problem is the shadow.  Otherwise great one.</td>', 'Great play on scripture.  Fits the photo and the photo fits the cliche.  It''s also a good photo except for the shadow.  It cuts out the whole end of the football.  Very good focus and great color, very natural and vivid.  Only problem is the shadow.  Otherwise great one.', '2003-02-07 00:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(210132, 11941, 1143, '<td valign="top">This would be really cool blown up as a huge abstract shot. The soft focus makes me really notice the color and shape. I like it. 7</td>', 'This would be really cool blown up as a huge abstract shot. The soft focus makes me really notice the color and shape. I like it. 7', '2003-02-07 00:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(210133, 11808, 5822, '<td valign="top">Such a beautiful smile!</td>', 'Such a beautiful smile!', '2003-02-07 00:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(210135, 11844, 1143, '<td valign="top">Really good focus and dof use. Nice lighting too. Good composition. Not something I''d hang on my wall personally (maybe in b&amp;w)  but technically very good.</td>', 'Really good focus and dof use. Nice lighting too. Good composition. Not something I''d hang on my wall personally (maybe in b&w)  but technically very good.', '2003-02-07 00:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(210136, 11755, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful brooding cat</td>', 'Beautiful brooding cat', '2003-02-07 00:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(210137, 11750, 4648, '<td valign="top">This would make a great greeting card, maybe a birthday card for a grandchild from grandmom.  You put a lot of thought into this.  Really good photo.  Cropped t to tightly.  Besides that 1 things bother me.One is the tag or whatever on the left side. Maybe if I could read it I would see that it fit the photo.  The other thing is what is sticking out from behind the bears head.  Other than these things this is a fantastic photo.  Good job.  Spot clean these things after the challenge and you have a wonderful greeting card.</td>', 'This would make a great greeting card, maybe a birthday card for a grandchild from grandmom.  You put a lot of thought into this.  Really good photo.  Cropped t to tightly.  Besides that 1 things bother me.One is the tag or whatever on the left side. Maybe if I could read it I would see that it fit the photo.  The other thing is what is sticking out from behind the bears head.  Other than these things this is a fantastic photo.  Good job.  Spot clean these things after the challenge and you have a wonderful greeting card.', '2003-02-07 00:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(210138, 11715, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but I think you should have exposed for the shadows here...the main subject, the horse is too dark and has lost detail.</td>', 'Nice composition, but I think you should have exposed for the shadows here...the main subject, the horse is too dark and has lost detail.', '2003-02-07 01:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(210139, 11869, 4648, '<td valign="top">Love the angle of this shot.  This makes the photo.  Doesn''t even need the title.  Would liked to have seen the whole thing in focus, personally, or crop off the lower part that isn''t in focus and leave the top.  That would even be better.  The more I look the better I like, (still prefer the bottome cropped of.)  The rest if real good.  Congratulations.  I rally like it.</td>', 'Love the angle of this shot.  This makes the photo.  Doesn''t even need the title.  Would liked to have seen the whole thing in focus, personally, or crop off the lower part that isn''t in focus and leave the top.  That would even be better.  The more I look the better I like, (still prefer the bottome cropped of.)  The rest if real good.  Congratulations.  I rally like it.', '2003-02-07 01:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(210140, 11819, 5822, '<td valign="top">Wow! What great detail in the flower...Very well exposed and terrific DOF</td>', 'Wow! What great detail in the flower...Very well exposed and terrific DOF', '2003-02-07 01:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(210142, 11891, 4648, '<td valign="top">You sure captured that one and titled it correctly.  The church down the road always has a ton of kids playing basketball on all 4 courts in the parking lot.  Call me crazy but this appears to be covered in snow, including the basket ball.  I know I''m not seeing things.  This is great.  Good focus, light, etc.  it''s an 8</td>', 'You sure captured that one and titled it correctly.  The church down the road always has a ton of kids playing basketball on all 4 courts in the parking lot.  Call me crazy but this appears to be covered in snow, including the basket ball.  I know I''m not seeing things.  This is great.  Good focus, light, etc.  it''s an 8', '2003-02-07 01:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(210143, 11853, 1143, '<td valign="top">OK. That is just nasty. I can understand journalistm photography and product photography and wedding photography but what exactly is this?  ;P  It is technically sound. A few too many leaves maybe and the blood looks too dark and thick. It fits the challenge (tho my idea of the challenge was to take a really good shot of a common subject so that you appreciate it more rather than coming up with something different). I''m just not sure what you would do with this photo outside of dpc. If your goal is just to practice technically then you succeeded. If you''re trying to make pleasing picture then I think you might wanna forget the gore. If you just wanna push the envelope then you might need something that''s a little more emotionally charged.</td>', 'OK. That is just nasty. I can understand journalistm photography and product photography and wedding photography but what exactly is this?  ;P  It is technically sound. A few too many leaves maybe and the blood looks too dark and thick. It fits the challenge (tho my idea of the challenge was to take a really good shot of a common subject so that you appreciate it more rather than coming up with something different). I''m just not sure what you would do with this photo outside of dpc. If your goal is just to practice technically then you succeeded. If you''re trying to make pleasing picture then I think you might wanna forget the gore. If you just wanna push the envelope then you might need something that''s a little more emotionally charged.', '2003-02-07 01:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(210146, 11774, 1143, '<td valign="top">This needs quite a bit of technical help. The crop and composition are pretty good. The wall behind the kitty is too shiny. Perhaps you could tack up a little fabric or something less reflective. The lighting overall is too dark, but there are (what appears to be) flash burns on the paws and bottom left corner. If you had even, diffused lighting then the soft focus wouldn''t be that big a problem to me. I just can''t see the kitty''s eyes.</td>', 'This needs quite a bit of technical help. The crop and composition are pretty good. The wall behind the kitty is too shiny. Perhaps you could tack up a little fabric or something less reflective. The lighting overall is too dark, but there are (what appears to be) flash burns on the paws and bottom left corner. If you had even, diffused lighting then the soft focus wouldn''t be that big a problem to me. I just can''t see the kitty''s eyes.', '2003-02-07 01:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(210156, 11791, 5158, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a keeper: excelently captured moment, wonderfull color and although it is a little overexposed at the left side this overeposure is fien, because it gives the feeling of relaxing in the warm sun. Focus and DOF are great too. It''s one of my favorits and it will probably do good. good luck to you.</td>', 'Now that''s a keeper: excelently captured moment, wonderfull color and although it is a little overexposed at the left side this overeposure is fien, because it gives the feeling of relaxing in the warm sun. Focus and DOF are great too. It''s one of my favorits and it will probably do good. good luck to you.', '2003-02-07 04:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(210158, 12005, 5158, '<td valign="top">For sure one of my favorits this time: fits the challenge best. It''s really cute and a keeper for the parents but probably even more for grandma and grandpa.<br/>And although it''s a studio shot where you probably asked the kids to smille or say cheese, it does not look unnatural. The doll and the dog helps to make it look natural very much. Light and color are set great too. Good luck with this wonderfull submission.</td>', 'For sure one of my favorits this time: fits the challenge best. It''s really cute and a keeper for the parents but probably even more for grandma and grandpa.And although it''s a studio shot where you probably asked the kids to smille or say cheese, it does not look unnatural. The doll and the dog helps to make it look natural very much. Light and color are set great too. Good luck with this wonderfull submission.', '2003-02-07 04:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(210159, 11957, 5158, '<td valign="top">It looks very fresh! Especially the color of the green leafs. Accutally you didn''t need the few water-dorplets to achieve freshness. Great composition, setting of light and color. Nice frame too. One of my favorits this time, so good luck to you.</td>', 'It looks very fresh! Especially the color of the green leafs. Accutally you didn''t need the few water-dorplets to achieve freshness. Great composition, setting of light and color. Nice frame too. One of my favorits this time, so good luck to you.', '2003-02-07 04:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(210160, 11784, 3942, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but this shot doesn''t look very nice to me. O.K., your cropping is IMHO well done and thereby you are dirceting the attention of the viewer to the face / eyes of your cat. But unfortunately  the face is extremely out of focus.  Personally I think, that it is impossible to achieve an interesting lighting by using the cameras flash. Nevertheless, good luck with your next submission :-)</td>', 'Sorry, but this shot doesn''t look very nice to me. O.K., your cropping is IMHO well done and thereby you are dirceting the attention of the viewer to the face / eyes of your cat. But unfortunately  the face is extremely out of focus.  Personally I think, that it is impossible to achieve an interesting lighting by using the cameras flash. Nevertheless, good luck with your next submission :-)', '2003-02-07 04:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(210161, 11855, 5158, '<td valign="top">Well set light, although it could have benn a little brighter on the leafs. good composition and well made frame. Don''t know if the water drops are needed: flower looks fresh by itself and the small drops just appers as tiny white dots. Still a very good submission.</td>', 'Well set light, although it could have benn a little brighter on the leafs. good composition and well made frame. Don''t know if the water drops are needed: flower looks fresh by itself and the small drops just appers as tiny white dots. Still a very good submission.', '2003-02-07 04:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(210162, 11714, 5158, '<td valign="top">Yo captured a great moment, especially because of the left cat with it''s turned head. I also like the color of the background. You might have moved more to the right so the undifined right background would not be visible but some more of the plant on the left side.<br/>Still a grest submission. Good luck to you.</td>', 'Yo captured a great moment, especially because of the left cat with it''s turned head. I also like the color of the background. You might have moved more to the right so the undifined right background would not be visible but some more of the plant on the left side.Still a grest submission. Good luck to you.', '2003-02-07 04:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(210163, 11903, 5158, '<td valign="top">Don''t know if the name Churchill did fit when the dog was a puppy, but now it shurely does! His pose is excellent. I like the color of the image and that you used the wood-stove as background. You might have acctually moved yourself more to the left (or the doog to the right). In this way only the stove would make the background. good luck to you.</td>', 'Don''t know if the name Churchill did fit when the dog was a puppy, but now it shurely does! His pose is excellent. I like the color of the image and that you used the wood-stove as background. You might have acctually moved yourself more to the left (or the doog to the right). In this way only the stove would make the background. good luck to you.', '2003-02-07 04:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(210164, 11869, 5158, '<td valign="top">Great composition with nice colors (especially the blue). The cropping at the top is a little tight because the ellbow is cut away. Like the light too. good luck to you.</td>', 'Great composition with nice colors (especially the blue). The cropping at the top is a little tight because the ellbow is cut away. Like the light too. good luck to you.', '2003-02-07 04:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(210165, 11856, 5158, '<td valign="top">Very clear and simple composition, which is good: its a "one-loock-fully-captured"-image. I like the light, the colors and also the frame.</td>', 'Very clear and simple composition, which is good: its a "one-loock-fully-captured"-image. I like the light, the colors and also the frame.', '2003-02-07 04:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(210166, 11866, 3540, '<td valign="top">I would''ve put a little more focus (so to speak) on the shadow of the dog in the window. - Inspzil</td>', 'I would''ve put a little more focus (so to speak) on the shadow of the dog in the window. - Inspzil', '2003-02-07 05:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(210169, 12005, 3540, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  A white background, a little clearer and you''d have yourself quite a portrait.  I might PS a little white background, brighten in up accordingly and sharpen and see what you get. - Inspzil</td>', 'Very cute.  A white background, a little clearer and you''d have yourself quite a portrait.  I might PS a little white background, brighten in up accordingly and sharpen and see what you get. - Inspzil', '2003-02-07 05:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(210170, 11983, 3540, '<td valign="top">Awesome sunset.  Great colors.  I like how the sky sorta fades into the water. - Inspzil</td>', 'Awesome sunset.  Great colors.  I like how the sky sorta fades into the water. - Inspzil', '2003-02-07 05:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(210171, 11829, 3540, '<td valign="top">The sun''s reflecion is a little burned out but a nice pic regardless</td>', 'The sun''s reflecion is a little burned out but a nice pic regardless', '2003-02-07 05:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(210172, 11862, 3540, '<td valign="top">A little underexposed IMO.  Cool car though.  - Inspzil</td>', 'A little underexposed IMO.  Cool car though.  - Inspzil', '2003-02-07 05:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(210173, 12009, 3540, '<td valign="top">Motion and shape are well portrayed.  The picture quality leaves something to be desired.  Its not really clear, and it looks al ittle grainy to me - Inspzil</td>', 'Motion and shape are well portrayed.  The picture quality leaves something to be desired.  Its not really clear, and it looks al ittle grainy to me - Inspzil', '2003-02-07 05:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(210174, 11856, 3540, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the subjects but the picture is pretty well done.  Good lighting and background - Inspzil</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the subjects but the picture is pretty well done.  Good lighting and background - Inspzil', '2003-02-07 05:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(210179, 11944, 3540, '<td valign="top">Cute but the clarity isn''t there.  The DOF is too shallow and the focus is on her ears, so the face is out of focus.  As a sharp pic, it would do fairly well.  I have mixed emotions about dressing dogs up.  She doesn''t seem to mind so thats good.  If she could play poker though, you might really have something..... Inspzil</td>', 'Cute but the clarity isn''t there.  The DOF is too shallow and the focus is on her ears, so the face is out of focus.  As a sharp pic, it would do fairly well.  I have mixed emotions about dressing dogs up.  She doesn''t seem to mind so thats good.  If she could play poker though, you might really have something..... Inspzil', '2003-02-07 08:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(210180, 11941, 3540, '<td valign="top">I can''t deny that this is a cool subject.  My approach would''ve been a little different I think.  I think mostly in the framing of the shot.  Its too far right and there is too much blur on the left.  Some of that is cool, but when half the shot is blurred, its too much.  The concept is genuinely cool and I really see where you were going with the shot.  I think just backing off of the subject a little would help to keep more of it focused and still keep the same amount of the petal in the frame, just with a bit more room on the right side.  This subject has great potential - Inspzil</td>', 'I can''t deny that this is a cool subject.  My approach would''ve been a little different I think.  I think mostly in the framing of the shot.  Its too far right and there is too much blur on the left.  Some of that is cool, but when half the shot is blurred, its too much.  The concept is genuinely cool and I really see where you were going with the shot.  I think just backing off of the subject a little would help to keep more of it focused and still keep the same amount of the petal in the frame, just with a bit more room on the right side.  This subject has great potential - Inspzil', '2003-02-07 08:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(210181, 11932, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Was the sky really this orange.  I love it any way.  I love silouitted shots.  Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Was the sky really this orange.  I love it any way.  I love silouitted shots.  Well done.', '2003-02-07 08:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(210182, 11753, 4648, '<td valign="top">This really looks good.  Don''t know where you got the idea but it is fantastic.  Gread DOF and nicely focused.  What is this made of anyway.  Can''t quite figure it out.  Belongs in the top.</td>', 'This really looks good.  Don''t know where you got the idea but it is fantastic.  Gread DOF and nicely focused.  What is this made of anyway.  Can''t quite figure it out.  Belongs in the top.', '2003-02-07 08:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(210183, 12038, 4648, '<td valign="top">Too tightly cropped.  The cross on the right side fits the photo well but can hardly been seen.  In fact being as dark as it is, it is really a distraction.  It''s like a part of the background that shouldn''t be there, as is the wall or whatever it is leaning against.  Instead you should have made the background solid white.  Either have it in, clearly visible or totally out.  Sounds like I''m saying I don''t like the photo, but it is just the opposite.  I really do, or would, if this was changed.  I really like close ups except when they chop up the subject.  Zoom out some and add a little light and this is beautiful.</td>', 'Too tightly cropped.  The cross on the right side fits the photo well but can hardly been seen.  In fact being as dark as it is, it is really a distraction.  It''s like a part of the background that shouldn''t be there, as is the wall or whatever it is leaning against.  Instead you should have made the background solid white.  Either have it in, clearly visible or totally out.  Sounds like I''m saying I don''t like the photo, but it is just the opposite.  I really do, or would, if this was changed.  I really like close ups except when they chop up the subject.  Zoom out some and add a little light and this is beautiful.', '2003-02-07 08:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(210185, 12018, 772, '<td valign="top">i really love the burnt orange glow of the background on this shot... The rustic feel of the gourd is also excellent :) - setzler</td>', 'i really love the burnt orange glow of the background on this shot... The rustic feel of the gourd is also excellent :) - setzler', '2003-02-07 08:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(210186, 11827, 4648, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering why landscape instead of portrait.  Upright with all of the bulb would have been more fitting, I would think.  Is that a reflection?  It is not clear enough, therefore is distracting.  The background being a solid color would have shown off the bulb so much better, in my opinon.  That way there would have been nothing else to fight for your attention.  Not sure this color tone worked to your advantage.  Not sure what would have been better, though.  I really do like your concept very much and think it could be a very interesting photo.  Just needs better execution.  Keep at it.</td>', 'I''m wondering why landscape instead of portrait.  Upright with all of the bulb would have been more fitting, I would think.  Is that a reflection?  It is not clear enough, therefore is distracting.  The background being a solid color would have shown off the bulb so much better, in my opinon.  That way there would have been nothing else to fight for your attention.  Not sure this color tone worked to your advantage.  Not sure what would have been better, though.  I really do like your concept very much and think it could be a very interesting photo.  Just needs better execution.  Keep at it.', '2003-02-07 08:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(210187, 11898, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot... the softness of this shot is what makes it work for me... great closeup... = 10 - setzler</td>', 'beautiful shot... the softness of this shot is what makes it work for me... great closeup... = 10 - setzler', '2003-02-07 08:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(210188, 11983, 4648, '<td valign="top">Love the way you kept the sun from blinding you, and us.  Great idea.  Not so sure I like all the red.  Is this the natural color it was?  Good composition, nicely focused and cropped.  Really like the talllllll tree.  Normally wouldn''t, but for some reason it looks good here.  Love everything but the color.  For me personally, I''d play around with the color some.</td>', 'Love the way you kept the sun from blinding you, and us.  Great idea.  Not so sure I like all the red.  Is this the natural color it was?  Good composition, nicely focused and cropped.  Really like the talllllll tree.  Normally wouldn''t, but for some reason it looks good here.  Love everything but the color.  For me personally, I''d play around with the color some.', '2003-02-07 08:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(210190, 11838, 4648, '<td valign="top">When I get my breath back I''ll comment.  dream, dream, dream.  Wish it were blue and mine.  I couldn''t afford the upkeep, but can dream.  I really like the background.  Nice job of capturing the beauty of this automobile.  Perfect advertisment photo.  Sell it to them, and give me the car.  I''ll give you a 10 for the car.</td>', 'When I get my breath back I''ll comment.  dream, dream, dream.  Wish it were blue and mine.  I couldn''t afford the upkeep, but can dream.  I really like the background.  Nice job of capturing the beauty of this automobile.  Perfect advertisment photo.  Sell it to them, and give me the car.  I''ll give you a 10 for the car.', '2003-02-07 08:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(210191, 11960, 4648, '<td valign="top">Crop out the background from the sword over and this is a beautiful piece of art.  The facial expression is worth a million dollars.  Don''t know what your thoughts or intentions were when you picked the things for this shot, but your imagination and artistic talent are top ranked.  LIke the dark background,.  With the light as it is, this photo has a rich tone to it.  Can''t imagine what the title has to do with the photo, but cropping out the distracting part of the background makes this a ribbon deserving, 10 rated piece of art.  As is it is well worthy of an 8.</td>', 'Crop out the background from the sword over and this is a beautiful piece of art.  The facial expression is worth a million dollars.  Don''t know what your thoughts or intentions were when you picked the things for this shot, but your imagination and artistic talent are top ranked.  LIke the dark background,.  With the light as it is, this photo has a rich tone to it.  Can''t imagine what the title has to do with the photo, but cropping out the distracting part of the background makes this a ribbon deserving, 10 rated piece of art.  As is it is well worthy of an 8.', '2003-02-07 08:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(210193, 12031, 4648, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  His whole head needs to be in the frame.  Brighten, not lighten, it up some.  Don''t take me wrong, but it has a snap shot fee; to it.  Nice memorabilia and all, but belongs in a family album.  But maybe that is really what a "cliche" shot is.  Love the baby photos hanging on the wall.  The shelf is a bit cluttered.  Cute picture.</td>', 'Cute idea.  His whole head needs to be in the frame.  Brighten, not lighten, it up some.  Don''t take me wrong, but it has a snap shot fee; to it.  Nice memorabilia and all, but belongs in a family album.  But maybe that is really what a "cliche" shot is.  Love the baby photos hanging on the wall.  The shelf is a bit cluttered.  Cute picture.', '2003-02-07 08:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(210196, 11824, 3540, '<td valign="top">Very dark for this colorful subject.  Too much stuff and honestly not a very photogenic rose.  I don''t get the point of all the other stuff.  It looks like a box of stuff that had a rose in it.  This photo needs some light and some color - Inspzil</td>', 'Very dark for this colorful subject.  Too much stuff and honestly not a very photogenic rose.  I don''t get the point of all the other stuff.  It looks like a box of stuff that had a rose in it.  This photo needs some light and some color - Inspzil', '2003-02-07 08:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(210197, 11997, 4648, '<td valign="top">Love the constrast between the two flowers.  Wish the one on the left had the bad petals pulled off and leave the one on the right as is.  Nice background for this shot.  Add to the shot well.  Too tightly cropped on the sides.  Like the cropping on the top and bottom.  Of course you know all of our comments are really just our personal opinions, more than photographic techology.  You can''t help but have your personal likes and dislikes from entering in.  From a technical standpoint, I think you did very well.  Technical and personal added together gives this a 6.</td>', 'Love the constrast between the two flowers.  Wish the one on the left had the bad petals pulled off and leave the one on the right as is.  Nice background for this shot.  Add to the shot well.  Too tightly cropped on the sides.  Like the cropping on the top and bottom.  Of course you know all of our comments are really just our personal opinions, more than photographic techology.  You can''t help but have your personal likes and dislikes from entering in.  From a technical standpoint, I think you did very well.  Technical and personal added together gives this a 6.', '2003-02-07 08:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(210198, 11855, 4648, '<td valign="top">Nice touch having the spot light, so to speak, on the bloom.  Works well here.  To me this photo is very artistic and more a piece of art than a photo.  That is a compliment, if you didn''t recognize it.  Not a 10 or ribbon winner, but a very nice piece of art, that could grace a wall nicely.</td>', 'Nice touch having the spot light, so to speak, on the bloom.  Works well here.  To me this photo is very artistic and more a piece of art than a photo.  That is a compliment, if you didn''t recognize it.  Not a 10 or ribbon winner, but a very nice piece of art, that could grace a wall nicely.', '2003-02-07 08:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(210201, 11881, 4648, '<td valign="top">To me you have your dof reversed.  The flower, subject, is in the background, nicely focused, behind an out of focus leaf.  BUT with your title, that is obviously intentional.  Not sure how I feel about that or how it will go over.  I have very mixed feelings about this.  I''ll give your credit for coloring outside the lines.  And you did it very well.  Just not sure personally, how I feel.  It''s not really appealling but there is something about it that holds your attention.  I believe you have accomplished what you intended.  For that you deserve a 10.  For the photo itself I think, as is and as a photok, it deserves a 5.  Together they get you a 7.5</td>', 'To me you have your dof reversed.  The flower, subject, is in the background, nicely focused, behind an out of focus leaf.  BUT with your title, that is obviously intentional.  Not sure how I feel about that or how it will go over.  I have very mixed feelings about this.  I''ll give your credit for coloring outside the lines.  And you did it very well.  Just not sure personally, how I feel.  It''s not really appealling but there is something about it that holds your attention.  I believe you have accomplished what you intended.  For that you deserve a 10.  For the photo itself I think, as is and as a photok, it deserves a 5.  Together they get you a 7.5', '2003-02-07 08:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(210202, 12044, 4648, '<td valign="top">Like the idea and the glint sparkling off the clear crystal.  Don''t like the cropping at all.  The frosted pieces should have been either all in the dark out of focus or light on all of it.  Whatever is light reflecting in the bottom left corner is distracting.  Good idea and consept, just needs better execution.</td>', 'Like the idea and the glint sparkling off the clear crystal.  Don''t like the cropping at all.  The frosted pieces should have been either all in the dark out of focus or light on all of it.  Whatever is light reflecting in the bottom left corner is distracting.  Good idea and consept, just needs better execution.', '2003-02-07 08:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(210203, 11731, 4648, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo, the focus, the depth, the cropping, the color, the photo, the , the, the,,,,,,I really like it.  This is a piece of art, and a very nice one..  But I hafta know, what kind of flower is this and what is it used for?  This is obviously a farm, or orchard, of it.  Appears to be grown to harvest and sell.  Or is it just planted in some kind of orchard or even vineyard?  lI hope you tell us more about this one.  Beautiful piece of work, well done.</td>', 'I really like this photo, the focus, the depth, the cropping, the color, the photo, the , the, the,,,,,,I really like it.  This is a piece of art, and a very nice one..  But I hafta know, what kind of flower is this and what is it used for?  This is obviously a farm, or orchard, of it.  Appears to be grown to harvest and sell.  Or is it just planted in some kind of orchard or even vineyard?  lI hope you tell us more about this one.  Beautiful piece of work, well done.', '2003-02-07 09:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(210204, 12027, 4906, '<td valign="top">Black dogs and cats are difficult to photograph. Unfortunately, this is a bit too dark. I like the composition tho.</td>', 'Black dogs and cats are difficult to photograph. Unfortunately, this is a bit too dark. I like the composition tho.', '2003-02-07 09:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(210206, 11764, 4648, '<td valign="top">Didn''t I see this house before, or one just like it?  This is not an interesting house or shot, but I like it.  The reason I like it is ridiculous.  I like it shot through the tree like this.  I love the tin roof.  Nice job of keeping the horizon level.  Looks like a dreary day.  Nice photo.</td>', 'Didn''t I see this house before, or one just like it?  This is not an interesting house or shot, but I like it.  The reason I like it is ridiculous.  I like it shot through the tree like this.  I love the tin roof.  Nice job of keeping the horizon level.  Looks like a dreary day.  Nice photo.', '2003-02-07 09:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(210207, 11815, 4906, '<td valign="top">Could do with a bit more contrast. Snow looks a bit too grey.</td>', 'Could do with a bit more contrast. Snow looks a bit too grey.', '2003-02-07 09:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(210208, 12044, 4906, '<td valign="top">Nice, but the lights at the bottom left are distracting.</td>', 'Nice, but the lights at the bottom left are distracting.', '2003-02-07 09:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(210209, 11988, 4648, '<td valign="top">Nice floral still life.  Nice piece of art work.  Not real happy with the place mats it''s sitting on.  Wold have looked nice on the table cloth, especially since it goes so well with the top let corner.  Beautiful arrangement.  My sinuses can''t take the ecucolyptis.  The background is different, but I like it.  Nice one.</td>', 'Nice floral still life.  Nice piece of art work.  Not real happy with the place mats it''s sitting on.  Wold have looked nice on the table cloth, especially since it goes so well with the top let corner.  Beautiful arrangement.  My sinuses can''t take the ecucolyptis.  The background is different, but I like it.  Nice one.', '2003-02-07 09:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(210210, 11865, 4906, '<td valign="top">Nice effect at the top of the drop.</td>', 'Nice effect at the top of the drop.', '2003-02-07 09:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(210212, 11705, 4906, '<td valign="top">Cute. Shame we can''t see more of the cat. Maybe taking the picture from a higher angle would have been better.</td>', 'Cute. Shame we can''t see more of the cat. Maybe taking the picture from a higher angle would have been better.', '2003-02-07 09:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(210213, 11700, 4906, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF. Would have liked to see string a bit better.</td>', 'Nice DOF. Would have liked to see string a bit better.', '2003-02-07 09:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(210214, 11806, 4648, '<td valign="top">Please don''t take this wrong, but it almost looks like some kind of bug or sea creature.  If you had played with the colors, you could have passed it off as something other than a flower..For a photo of a dead flower it is very pretty.  That was a compliment.  Hate to have to explain myself all the time.  I really like the inside part of the flower, and wished you had zoomed in on it.  It wold make a beautiful photo by itself.  As far as what you did photograph, it is well done.  Beautiful natural colors, good ighting, nice cropping, good focus, borders look nice and add a finishing touch.  A well done nice photo.</td>', 'Please don''t take this wrong, but it almost looks like some kind of bug or sea creature.  If you had played with the colors, you could have passed it off as something other than a flower..For a photo of a dead flower it is very pretty.  That was a compliment.  Hate to have to explain myself all the time.  I really like the inside part of the flower, and wished you had zoomed in on it.  It wold make a beautiful photo by itself.  As far as what you did photograph, it is well done.  Beautiful natural colors, good ighting, nice cropping, good focus, borders look nice and add a finishing touch.  A well done nice photo.', '2003-02-07 09:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(210215, 11863, 4906, '<td valign="top">This would have been good for the perspective challenge.</td>', 'This would have been good for the perspective challenge.', '2003-02-07 09:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(210216, 11758, 4906, '<td valign="top">Focus seems a bit off.</td>', 'Focus seems a bit off.', '2003-02-07 09:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(210217, 11959, 4648, '<td valign="top">Nice one.  Don''t like the shadows, even though there aren''t too many.  Good color, rich and vivid and very natural.  Good focus and ighting, except for the shadows.  Nice composition, not too cramped, nor too airy, but just the right amount of space.  Good model, very natural pose , nice looking and beautiful expression, very photogenic.  Would rank up there in a portrait contest.  You appear to have a talent for this type of photography.  Beautiful photo.</td>', 'Nice one.  Don''t like the shadows, even though there aren''t too many.  Good color, rich and vivid and very natural.  Good focus and ighting, except for the shadows.  Nice composition, not too cramped, nor too airy, but just the right amount of space.  Good model, very natural pose , nice looking and beautiful expression, very photogenic.  Would rank up there in a portrait contest.  You appear to have a talent for this type of photography.  Beautiful photo.', '2003-02-07 09:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(210218, 11739, 4648, '<td valign="top">With the jet streams almost look like it is falling and burning up.  This is a very nice and different sunset photo.  I like it.  Can''t help you any to improve it.  Sorry.</td>', 'With the jet streams almost look like it is falling and burning up.  This is a very nice and different sunset photo.  I like it.  Can''t help you any to improve it.  Sorry.', '2003-02-07 09:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(210219, 11873, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful well done photo.  Is it supposed to have some significance that I''m missing? A song or a movie?  This may sound silly to you, but what makes this photo for me is the red felt showing at the back of the keys. It adds just a very little of color to the photo.  Just one of those tiny details that make or break a photo for me.  Keeps it from being just another piano photo.  Great job.</td>', 'Beautiful well done photo.  Is it supposed to have some significance that I''m missing? A song or a movie?  This may sound silly to you, but what makes this photo for me is the red felt showing at the back of the keys. It adds just a very little of color to the photo.  Just one of those tiny details that make or break a photo for me.  Keeps it from being just another piano photo.  Great job.', '2003-02-07 09:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(210220, 11908, 5677, '<td valign="top">would like it better if more than just the one flower was in focus.</td>', 'would like it better if more than just the one flower was in focus.', '2003-02-07 09:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(210221, 11845, 3540, '<td valign="top">Cool clouds. They really resemble waves in the ocean.  Nice warm colors.  Unusual silhouettes. - Inspzil</td>', 'Cool clouds. They really resemble waves in the ocean.  Nice warm colors.  Unusual silhouettes. - Inspzil', '2003-02-07 09:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(210222, 11878, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nice color.  Crystal clear pic too.  I don''t know if I like the big splash.  Great shot of it though - Inspzil</td>', 'Nice color.  Crystal clear pic too.  I don''t know if I like the big splash.  Great shot of it though - Inspzil', '2003-02-07 09:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(210223, 12032, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great silhouette of Lady Liberty, but all the extra stuff in the pic is not so picturesque.  Reminds me too much of work!!  Seriously this would be great without the other stuff. Poster material to me.  I like the bird too.  Great color - Inspzil</td>', 'Great silhouette of Lady Liberty, but all the extra stuff in the pic is not so picturesque.  Reminds me too much of work!!  Seriously this would be great without the other stuff. Poster material to me.  I like the bird too.  Great color - Inspzil', '2003-02-07 09:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(210224, 11935, 3540, '<td valign="top">Its clear, but not crisp.  The colors should be much more vibrant.  A pic with some potential.  I''d have cropped it a little tighter too.  It could be good tho. - Inspzil</td>', 'Its clear, but not crisp.  The colors should be much more vibrant.  A pic with some potential.  I''d have cropped it a little tighter too.  It could be good tho. - Inspzil', '2003-02-07 09:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(210225, 12041, 6551, '<td valign="top">Splendid and unique concept capturing the South Beach hustle and bustle behind some tranquil flowers.</td>', 'Splendid and unique concept capturing the South Beach hustle and bustle behind some tranquil flowers.', '2003-02-07 09:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(210226, 12016, 3540, '<td valign="top">The lighting is not right.  The picture could be a little crisper too.  With the right lighting this could be a good pic.  It''s genuine and thats the first step.  The next part is all up to you - Inspzil</td>', 'The lighting is not right.  The picture could be a little crisper too.  With the right lighting this could be a good pic.  It''s genuine and thats the first step.  The next part is all up to you - Inspzil', '2003-02-07 09:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(210228, 11714, 3540, '<td valign="top">Cute kittens.  I''m not so sure about the chair and I''m really not so sure about the red cloth hanging on the chair.  THe kittens are adorable tho - Inspzil (cat person)</td>', 'Cute kittens.  I''m not so sure about the chair and I''m really not so sure about the red cloth hanging on the chair.  THe kittens are adorable tho - Inspzil (cat person)', '2003-02-07 09:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
