(210261, 11754, 806, '<td valign="top">oh.. how cute!!!  what a little model! unfortunately this is not as sharp as it could be. Please do it again. I''d love to see it in better focus.. if you can get the dog to cooperate again :)</td>', 'oh.. how cute!!!  what a little model! unfortunately this is not as sharp as it could be. Please do it again. I''d love to see it in better focus.. if you can get the dog to cooperate again :)', '2003-02-07 11:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(210262, 11872, 2337, '<td valign="top">This shot is <b>very</b> nearly a 10.  I had to look long and hard to see why it wasn''t a 10 for me, and I found 2 very small nitpicks. <br/>1 ~ The horizon line (piano keys) appear to be sloped slightly to the left.<br/>2 ~ The flowers are held just a smidgen too high (or possibly too low).  Where they are seems awkward somehow.<br/> <br/>That said, I should point out that this shot has <b>many</b> great aspects.  The concept is great, the model is adorable, the lighting is fantastic (love the 3/4 side light), etc.  The 2 nitpicks hurt the shot for me though.</td>', 'This shot is very nearly a 10.  I had to look long and hard to see why it wasn''t a 10 for me, and I found 2 very small nitpicks. 1 ~ The horizon line (piano keys) appear to be sloped slightly to the left.2 ~ The flowers are held just a smidgen too high (or possibly too low).  Where they are seems awkward somehow. That said, I should point out that this shot has many great aspects.  The concept is great, the model is adorable, the lighting is fantastic (love the 3/4 side light), etc.  The 2 nitpicks hurt the shot for me though.', '2003-02-07 11:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
