(210308, 11842, 6328, '<td valign="top">Great portrait of your family.  They each seem to be telling their own story and they each create their own mood to the photograph.  The colors of the clothing also create the mood for the photograph.  The mother sure is protective of her children, loving too.  Photos is very sharp and continually in focus.  Congratulations on a well taken portrait.</td>', 'Great portrait of your family.  They each seem to be telling their own story and they each create their own mood to the photograph.  The colors of the clothing also create the mood for the photograph.  The mother sure is protective of her children, loving too.  Photos is very sharp and continually in focus.  Congratulations on a well taken portrait.', '2003-02-07 12:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(210309, 11958, 6328, '<td valign="top">I want to start by saying that Me thinks you should have removed that blue blanket from the photo.  It''s distracting.  The colors of the bird are magnificent, The browns, the blacks, the creamy colors, even it''s little talon sticking out.  The way you''ve captured the eye looking outwards for it''s prey - it''s all great!</td>', 'I want to start by saying that Me thinks you should have removed that blue blanket from the photo.  It''s distracting.  The colors of the bird are magnificent, The browns, the blacks, the creamy colors, even it''s little talon sticking out.  The way you''ve captured the eye looking outwards for it''s prey - it''s all great!', '2003-02-07 13:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(210310, 11795, 6328, '<td valign="top">I just  love this photograph.  You''ve captured a great mood with the clouds and the sun, and the windmill.  I especially like the idea that you can see the partial outline of the building in the background.  My eyes are focused on the broken sails of the windmill and the cloud and just stay there.  Great photograph.</td>', 'I just  love this photograph.  You''ve captured a great mood with the clouds and the sun, and the windmill.  I especially like the idea that you can see the partial outline of the building in the background.  My eyes are focused on the broken sails of the windmill and the cloud and just stay there.  Great photograph.', '2003-02-07 13:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
