(210316, 11927, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: I really like the way the frame is filled.<br/>Technical: Focus is slightly off on the subject''s forehead but looks great elsewhere.  Lighting looks a little dark, but this does draw your eye nicely into the centre of the pic.  Excellent use of borders too.<br/>Overall impression: Really nice pic.  8</td>', 'Composition: I really like the way the frame is filled.Technical: Focus is slightly off on the subject''s forehead but looks great elsewhere.  Lighting looks a little dark, but this does draw your eye nicely into the centre of the pic.  Excellent use of borders too.Overall impression: Really nice pic.  8', '2003-02-07 14:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
