(210387, 11879, 5792, '<td valign="top">Something profound should be said about this shot, but I''m to dumbfounded to think of it. One great picture.<br/> <br/>Perhaps the bee should see his barber and have a little more taken "off the top". Doesn''t he know that crew cuts went out years ago? :)</td>', 'Something profound should be said about this shot, but I''m to dumbfounded to think of it. One great picture. Perhaps the bee should see his barber and have a little more taken "off the top". Doesn''t he know that crew cuts went out years ago? :)', '2003-02-07 18:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(210388, 11727, 5792, '<td valign="top">It isn''t one of your more commong cliches, but this is one fine image!</td>', 'It isn''t one of your more commong cliches, but this is one fine image!', '2003-02-07 18:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(210389, 11803, 5792, '<td valign="top">I doubt I''ll ever cease to be amazed by the incredible quality of images submitted for challenges week after week. There is some major talent out there and this artist is one of them.</td>', 'I doubt I''ll ever cease to be amazed by the incredible quality of images submitted for challenges week after week. There is some major talent out there and this artist is one of them.', '2003-02-07 18:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(210390, 12022, 5792, '<td valign="top">This image pays cathedral-like homage to snow picture cliches everywhere.</td>', 'This image pays cathedral-like homage to snow picture cliches everywhere.', '2003-02-07 18:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(210391, 11935, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great color cominations make great pictures. This one is a great of example of that. The colors make it outstanding.</td>', 'Great color cominations make great pictures. This one is a great of example of that. The colors make it outstanding.', '2003-02-07 18:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(210392, 11983, 1570, '<td valign="top">striking!</td>', 'striking!', '2003-02-07 18:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(210393, 11766, 2158, '<td valign="top">Great interpretation of the challenge.  Pity about the pole coming out of the one guy''s head.  If you''d cropped him out you''d still have had a pretty decent photo.</td>', 'Great interpretation of the challenge.  Pity about the pole coming out of the one guy''s head.  If you''d cropped him out you''d still have had a pretty decent photo.', '2003-02-07 18:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(210394, 11930, 5792, '<td valign="top">The photographer just blew this cliche completely out of the water and turned it into a work of art.<br/> <br/>The use of black and white with dark, but not black shadows on this high quality image adds a hint of mystery to the subject.  Like the Mona Lisa, you wonder exactly what they are thinking.</td>', 'The photographer just blew this cliche completely out of the water and turned it into a work of art. The use of black and white with dark, but not black shadows on this high quality image adds a hint of mystery to the subject.  Like the Mona Lisa, you wonder exactly what they are thinking.', '2003-02-07 18:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(210395, 11897, 1570, '<td valign="top">beautiful, just beautiful! it''s a 10... good thing i didn''t submit my picture of my blooming christmas cactus for this challenge - i had the same idea, even sprayed some water on it for droplets and everything, but my takes didn''t even come close to this!</td>', 'beautiful, just beautiful! it''s a 10... good thing i didn''t submit my picture of my blooming christmas cactus for this challenge - i had the same idea, even sprayed some water on it for droplets and everything, but my takes didn''t even come close to this!', '2003-02-07 19:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(210396, 11755, 5792, '<td valign="top">If this is your cat I hope you have good insurance. That''s one scary lookin'' feline!<br/> <br/>You did a super job bringing that out, both in the way you cropped the image, your use of black and white and whatever you did in the "darkroom" to give the final image such a stark appearance.<br/> <br/>Great job!</td>', 'If this is your cat I hope you have good insurance. That''s one scary lookin'' feline! You did a super job bringing that out, both in the way you cropped the image, your use of black and white and whatever you did in the "darkroom" to give the final image such a stark appearance. Great job!', '2003-02-07 19:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(210397, 12027, 2158, '<td valign="top">This needed a bit more light on the dog''s face, so that one could see his eyes.</td>', 'This needed a bit more light on the dog''s face, so that one could see his eyes.', '2003-02-07 19:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(210400, 11897, 5792, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of flower close ups, but few to match this one.<br/> <br/>The framing is simply outstanding and the black background brings out the color of the bloom. The beaded water droplets finish this one off nicely.  One mark of a good photographer is to make a shot look natural. I suspect effort was involved here. This is no snapshot.</td>', 'There are a lot of flower close ups, but few to match this one. The framing is simply outstanding and the black background brings out the color of the bloom. The beaded water droplets finish this one off nicely.  One mark of a good photographer is to make a shot look natural. I suspect effort was involved here. This is no snapshot.', '2003-02-07 19:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(210401, 11823, 3981, '<td valign="top">What a refreshing photo.  I can almost touch it. Composition and focus are excellent, and I love the black background.  Wonderful job! Bitz</td>', 'What a refreshing photo.  I can almost touch it. Composition and focus are excellent, and I love the black background.  Wonderful job! Bitz', '2003-02-07 19:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(210402, 11842, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is an example where the photographer does so well that the "cliche" is no longer recognizable. This is no "cliche", it has been transformed beyond that and the photographer should be rewarded with a very high score.</td>', 'This is an example where the photographer does so well that the "cliche" is no longer recognizable. This is no "cliche", it has been transformed beyond that and the photographer should be rewarded with a very high score.', '2003-02-07 19:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(210403, 11809, 5792, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done!</td>', 'Beautifully done!', '2003-02-07 19:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(210404, 11866, 4815, '<td valign="top">A well cropped vertical format. Glad you attempted the casual candid shot rather than the planned studio setup. Informality has loads of character. The leash, chain, curled position, snow bits and lonesome look in the pooch''s face bring out the message in your photo. The reflection is a nice touch. The lighting is unavoidably harsh in these circumstances. Which means a sacrifice in shadow or highlight detail. If it was my personal choice I would crop or get in closer and just include the chain and dog head. Even underexpose the shadows so you get a photo of just the chain, the brown jowl area and the eye highlght. Sort of a prisoner photo. Another idea would be to use fill flash to lighten the shadows so that the contrast between the shadows and highlights would be less. I would also give a little more space between the reflecting glass pane and the dog''s head by moving slightly to the right. If you have B&amp;W capabilities that would be another attractive alternative as the message is more about the dog''s posture and expression than the colour of the leash,tags or doorstep. These are just opinions and possibilities you might want to consider. Not necessarily better just different. Overall this is a well expressed  image with strong emotive content. Keep up the street photography. It is very challenging but worth it as you have demonstrated</td>', 'A well cropped vertical format. Glad you attempted the casual candid shot rather than the planned studio setup. Informality has loads of character. The leash, chain, curled position, snow bits and lonesome look in the pooch''s face bring out the message in your photo. The reflection is a nice touch. The lighting is unavoidably harsh in these circumstances. Which means a sacrifice in shadow or highlight detail. If it was my personal choice I would crop or get in closer and just include the chain and dog head. Even underexpose the shadows so you get a photo of just the chain, the brown jowl area and the eye highlght. Sort of a prisoner photo. Another idea would be to use fill flash to lighten the shadows so that the contrast between the shadows and highlights would be less. I would also give a little more space between the reflecting glass pane and the dog''s head by moving slightly to the right. If you have B&W capabilities that would be another attractive alternative as the message is more about the dog''s posture and expression than the colour of the leash,tags or doorstep. These are just opinions and possibilities you might want to consider. Not necessarily better just different. Overall this is a well expressed  image with strong emotive content. Keep up the street photography. It is very challenging but worth it as you have demonstrated', '2003-02-07 19:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(210406, 11871, 2158, '<td valign="top">There''s just enough detail in the background to be distracting.  Pity, because the flower''s great.</td>', 'There''s just enough detail in the background to be distracting.  Pity, because the flower''s great.', '2003-02-07 19:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(210407, 11923, 6599, '<td valign="top">Its beautiful and it catches interest</td>', 'Its beautiful and it catches interest', '2003-02-07 19:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(210408, 11812, 6599, '<td valign="top">Its ok needs more interest and needs to catch the eye more</td>', 'Its ok needs more interest and needs to catch the eye more', '2003-02-07 19:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(210409, 11988, 6599, '<td valign="top">Its fake looking , dull .... and i just dont like it ... but good try</td>', 'Its fake looking , dull .... and i just dont like it ... but good try', '2003-02-07 19:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(210411, 11854, 6599, '<td valign="top">I like it very much ... i love dogs and its amusing .... it makes u think</td>', 'I like it very much ... i love dogs and its amusing .... it makes u think', '2003-02-07 19:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(210412, 11846, 6599, '<td valign="top">its good</td>', 'its good', '2003-02-07 19:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(210413, 11912, 6599, '<td valign="top">i see no point in this photo</td>', 'i see no point in this photo', '2003-02-07 19:35:58.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(210414, 11908, 6599, '<td valign="top">its shows life and i like it</td>', 'its shows life and i like it', '2003-02-07 19:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(210415, 11929, 6599, '<td valign="top">its good</td>', 'its good', '2003-02-07 19:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(210416, 11862, 4815, '<td valign="top">You must be commended for the excellent DOF. I love the subtle simple bluesy tones of this image. The chrome is delicious. The sky compliments your image well. The composition is dramatic and obviously a matter of individual taste. My choice for included car parts would be slightly different than yours. What attracts me to this image specifically is the repetition of circles. Thus I would have cropped even closer to include the headlights and hood ornament ( perhaps getting a little lower so that the hood ornament is in the sky and not clashing with the windshield ). The reflections, handles tight against image edge, wheel hub and passenger side windows would be excluded. But that is just me. The grass in shadow and reflections add lots of impact to your image. This is a good photo that packs a solid punch.</td>', 'You must be commended for the excellent DOF. I love the subtle simple bluesy tones of this image. The chrome is delicious. The sky compliments your image well. The composition is dramatic and obviously a matter of individual taste. My choice for included car parts would be slightly different than yours. What attracts me to this image specifically is the repetition of circles. Thus I would have cropped even closer to include the headlights and hood ornament ( perhaps getting a little lower so that the hood ornament is in the sky and not clashing with the windshield ). The reflections, handles tight against image edge, wheel hub and passenger side windows would be excluded. But that is just me. The grass in shadow and reflections add lots of impact to your image. This is a good photo that packs a solid punch.', '2003-02-07 19:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(210417, 11892, 5250, '<td valign="top">That cat has a commanding presence! Nice shot! jgillard8</td>', 'That cat has a commanding presence! Nice shot! jgillard8', '2003-02-07 19:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(210418, 11909, 2716, '<td valign="top">Cute shot.  I like the inclusion of the shado and sunlight.  Almost looks like my cat.</td>', 'Cute shot.  I like the inclusion of the shado and sunlight.  Almost looks like my cat.', '2003-02-07 19:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(210419, 11977, 6599, '<td valign="top">I hate it personally its to much and not enough in one picture the brown makes it look dull and crappy .... but good try</td>', 'I hate it personally its to much and not enough in one picture the brown makes it look dull and crappy .... but good try', '2003-02-07 19:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(210420, 12005, 2158, '<td valign="top">In my opinion it would have been even cuter without the toys.</td>', 'In my opinion it would have been even cuter without the toys.', '2003-02-07 19:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(210421, 11821, 2716, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition, you print it out for Valentine Days cards.  Good luck.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'Very nice composition, you print it out for Valentine Days cards.  Good luck.  Jacko.  8', '2003-02-07 19:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(210422, 11977, 5250, '<td valign="top">This pic looks a bit oversharpened to me! This makes it unatural looking! jgillard6</td>', 'This pic looks a bit oversharpened to me! This makes it unatural looking! jgillard6', '2003-02-07 19:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(210423, 11887, 2716, '<td valign="top">Very,very, very, very nice shot.  I''m a cat person my self but I love this picture.  The whole picture works very effectively: bow ties, the cair, the dogs, the white background.  + congratulations on minimizing the shadow ... great lighting job.  Good luck.  I love it.  Jacko  10</td>', 'Very,very, very, very nice shot.  I''m a cat person my self but I love this picture.  The whole picture works very effectively: bow ties, the cair, the dogs, the white background.  + congratulations on minimizing the shadow ... great lighting job.  Good luck.  I love it.  Jacko  10', '2003-02-07 19:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(210424, 11833, 5250, '<td valign="top">Too bad about the distracting couch in the background! jgillard6</td>', 'Too bad about the distracting couch in the background! jgillard6', '2003-02-07 19:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(210426, 12029, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting job.  Natural light?  Love the way it hits his right eye.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice lighting job.  Natural light?  Love the way it hits his right eye.  Good luck.', '2003-02-07 19:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(210427, 11810, 5250, '<td valign="top">Nice tattoo! Nice lighting jgillard7</td>', 'Nice tattoo! Nice lighting jgillard7', '2003-02-07 19:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(210428, 12031, 2716, '<td valign="top">lol.  this is great.  he is a cutie. hang this one on your wall.</td>', 'lol.  this is great.  he is a cutie. hang this one on your wall.', '2003-02-07 19:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(210429, 11853, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, nice clean background.  I like it.  Jacko.  7</td>', 'Nice concept, nice clean background.  I like it.  Jacko.  7', '2003-02-07 19:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(210430, 11714, 2716, '<td valign="top">What a great portrait.  Did you drug them? lol  how on earth did you get them to stay.  Excellent work.  Looks like a calendar picture.  Good luck.  Jacko   9</td>', 'What a great portrait.  Did you drug them? lol  how on earth did you get them to stay.  Excellent work.  Looks like a calendar picture.  Good luck.  Jacko   9', '2003-02-07 19:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(210432, 11715, 4815, '<td valign="top">A very expressive photo. The candid quality is terrific. Especially the comparable delight between both mammals. The rich blacks and brilliant whites bring terrific zest to the image. It feels so savoir faire and elegant. The knobs and plant growing out of his neck are minor annoyances someone else can quibble over. This would make a really powerful B&amp;W photo too because without the skin,tie and right hand background bit colours the viewer''s attention would focus even more on the expressions. This is a beautiful moment captured by a keen sensitive eye.</td>', 'A very expressive photo. The candid quality is terrific. Especially the comparable delight between both mammals. The rich blacks and brilliant whites bring terrific zest to the image. It feels so savoir faire and elegant. The knobs and plant growing out of his neck are minor annoyances someone else can quibble over. This would make a really powerful B&W photo too because without the skin,tie and right hand background bit colours the viewer''s attention would focus even more on the expressions. This is a beautiful moment captured by a keen sensitive eye.', '2003-02-07 19:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(210433, 12022, 2716, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  Love the composition.  I love how the trees seems to come out of the snow.  God job.</td>', 'Great capture.  Love the composition.  I love how the trees seems to come out of the snow.  God job.', '2003-02-07 19:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(210434, 11958, 2716, '<td valign="top">Very nice sharpness.  Good job at blurring out the back ground.  Good luck.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'Very nice sharpness.  Good job at blurring out the back ground.  Good luck.  Jacko.  8', '2003-02-07 19:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(210436, 11945, 5250, '<td valign="top">Love it! jgillard9</td>', 'Love it! jgillard9', '2003-02-07 19:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(210437, 11968, 5250, '<td valign="top">You oversharpened this picture toooooo much!  It does not look natural, and that is why alot of people have probably questioned the validity of this picture! When your sharpening causes black lines around your subjects, it is just too much! Those are some nice dogs though! ;) jgillard4</td>', 'You oversharpened this picture toooooo much!  It does not look natural, and that is why alot of people have probably questioned the validity of this picture! When your sharpening causes black lines around your subjects, it is just too much! Those are some nice dogs though! ;) jgillard4', '2003-02-07 19:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(210438, 11975, 5250, '<td valign="top">What a cute bird! jgillard7</td>', 'What a cute bird! jgillard7', '2003-02-07 19:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(210439, 12024, 5250, '<td valign="top">That is some nice detail in the tongue! I would of liked to have seen the cats eyes though! jgillard6</td>', 'That is some nice detail in the tongue! I would of liked to have seen the cats eyes though! jgillard6', '2003-02-07 19:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(210440, 12009, 5250, '<td valign="top">This pic looks a little noisy to me! jgillard5</td>', 'This pic looks a little noisy to me! jgillard5', '2003-02-07 19:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(210441, 11721, 5250, '<td valign="top">what a cutie! This image is a bit underexposed though! jgillard6</td>', 'what a cutie! This image is a bit underexposed though! jgillard6', '2003-02-07 19:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(210442, 11866, 5250, '<td valign="top">This image is overexposed. You can see that from all of the white spots on the dog. jgillard5</td>', 'This image is overexposed. You can see that from all of the white spots on the dog. jgillard5', '2003-02-07 19:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(210443, 11691, 4815, '<td valign="top">OK everyone agrees that all cat pictures automatically score 10. This is a pleasant informal homey moment. With cuddly family appeal. Technically it is a good image in terms of DOF, exposure, interesting composition, etc. The rug texture gives it a cozy feel. As a minor point I would like to see all of the cat''s tail. As it sort of looks like a pussy lollipop from this angle. Perhaps it is worth considering something like a human portrait. It''s a choice between the whole anchilada, the midriff and up or  a mugshot  in general. The chioce of just a few colors helps to tie your picture together though. An honorable effort capturing a lovely moment.</td>', 'OK everyone agrees that all cat pictures automatically score 10. This is a pleasant informal homey moment. With cuddly family appeal. Technically it is a good image in terms of DOF, exposure, interesting composition, etc. The rug texture gives it a cozy feel. As a minor point I would like to see all of the cat''s tail. As it sort of looks like a pussy lollipop from this angle. Perhaps it is worth considering something like a human portrait. It''s a choice between the whole anchilada, the midriff and up or  a mugshot  in general. The chioce of just a few colors helps to tie your picture together though. An honorable effort capturing a lovely moment.', '2003-02-07 19:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(210444, 12044, 5250, '<td valign="top">I like the star filter effect, but I would of liked to have seen all of the chess pieces in focus. That is just my opinion! jgillard7</td>', 'I like the star filter effect, but I would of liked to have seen all of the chess pieces in focus. That is just my opinion! jgillard7', '2003-02-07 19:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(210445, 11876, 2158, '<td valign="top">Pity about plants sprouting out of Dad''s head.</td>', 'Pity about plants sprouting out of Dad''s head.', '2003-02-07 19:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(210446, 11695, 5250, '<td valign="top">What a pose! Love it! jgillard8</td>', 'What a pose! Love it! jgillard8', '2003-02-07 19:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(210447, 11771, 5250, '<td valign="top">I like your border! Happy baby I must say! jgillard6</td>', 'I like your border! Happy baby I must say! jgillard6', '2003-02-07 19:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(210448, 11772, 5250, '<td valign="top">What a great colouration on the chin! The cat looks like it has a goatee! jgilard6</td>', 'What a great colouration on the chin! The cat looks like it has a goatee! jgilard6', '2003-02-07 20:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(210449, 11870, 4815, '<td valign="top">A wonderful moment well captured. The blue colors harmonize with the drowsy elf. The expression of shadowed eye and pouty lips is priceless. I would like to see this in B&amp;W too. Although it is beyond your control I find that the white cloth snout is visually overwhelming to some degree. I don''t know if a different camera position would change that or if it was possible. The important thing is that you have a very well expressed human experience. Good work.</td>', 'A wonderful moment well captured. The blue colors harmonize with the drowsy elf. The expression of shadowed eye and pouty lips is priceless. I would like to see this in B&W too. Although it is beyond your control I find that the white cloth snout is visually overwhelming to some degree. I don''t know if a different camera position would change that or if it was possible. The important thing is that you have a very well expressed human experience. Good work.', '2003-02-07 20:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(210454, 11909, 5792, '<td valign="top">Technically high quality image, good use of browns highlighting the cat.</td>', 'Technically high quality image, good use of browns highlighting the cat.', '2003-02-07 20:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(210458, 11769, 5792, '<td valign="top">The "still life" is the classic cliche for both painter and photographer. I wouldnt be surprised that the first photographic image were of a still life.<br/> <br/>Stunning.<br/> <br/> What you have done here is special. Red and green against black brings out the flower nicely. Couple that with good DOF, meticulous focus and lighting and you have a striking image.<br/> <br/>The focus on the near "greenery" of the stem is a little distracting but this is a terrific picture. I hope some day I can do so well.<br/> <br/>Excellant rendition of a classic cliche.</td>', 'The "still life" is the classic cliche for both painter and photographer. I wouldnt be surprised that the first photographic image were of a still life. Stunning.  What you have done here is special. Red and green against black brings out the flower nicely. Couple that with good DOF, meticulous focus and lighting and you have a striking image. The focus on the near "greenery" of the stem is a little distracting but this is a terrific picture. I hope some day I can do so well. Excellant rendition of a classic cliche.', '2003-02-07 20:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(210475, 11965, 4210, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo. Great colours, excellent use of lighting. The only gripe I have is that there is too much black. I would have liked a closer crop (although not a tight one) perhaps a perfect square, and a boarder definately could have added to the presentation of this this photo. But excellent job!</td>', 'I really like this photo. Great colours, excellent use of lighting. The only gripe I have is that there is too much black. I would have liked a closer crop (although not a tight one) perhaps a perfect square, and a boarder definately could have added to the presentation of this this photo. But excellent job!', '2003-02-07 21:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(210476, 11766, 4210, '<td valign="top">Overall it''s just too dark.</td>', 'Overall it''s just too dark.', '2003-02-07 21:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(210478, 11753, 4210, '<td valign="top">Just pointing out that the boarder is wider on the top and left. This may have been intentional on your part, but just thought I''d mention. I like this photo; the star shape is a striking image, and the red is excellent.</td>', 'Just pointing out that the boarder is wider on the top and left. This may have been intentional on your part, but just thought I''d mention. I like this photo; the star shape is a striking image, and the red is excellent.', '2003-02-07 21:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(210480, 11714, 4267, '<td valign="top">oh boy, too damn cute... damn it! I can''t find anything technically wrong with it either..  and you have captured the essense of cliche''... the only shots that will score higher are shots with more wow factor</td>', 'oh boy, too damn cute... damn it! I can''t find anything technically wrong with it either..  and you have captured the essense of cliche''... the only shots that will score higher are shots with more wow factor', '2003-02-07 22:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(210483, 11706, 4267, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped it tighter and adjusted the brightness/contrast a bit</td>', 'I would have cropped it tighter and adjusted the brightness/contrast a bit', '2003-02-07 22:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(210484, 11912, 4210, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition. I really like this!</td>', 'Excellent composition. I really like this!', '2003-02-07 22:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(210486, 11983, 4267, '<td valign="top">fabulouso... meets the challenge with sheer perfection... plus it\''s very technically sound... only shots with more wow factor will score higher</td>', 'fabulouso... meets the challenge with sheer perfection... plus it\''s very technically sound... only shots with more wow factor will score higher', '2003-02-07 22:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(210487, 11800, 4210, '<td valign="top">It might seem like a little thing, but I really like how you pulled the green into your boarder.</td>', 'It might seem like a little thing, but I really like how you pulled the green into your boarder.', '2003-02-07 22:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(210490, 12027, 4267, '<td valign="top">I would give it a tighter crop at the top...  about the same amount as you have on the bottom would be perfect.. maybe even a touch on the left to match the right.. i like the BnW here as well</td>', 'I would give it a tighter crop at the top...  about the same amount as you have on the bottom would be perfect.. maybe even a touch on the left to match the right.. i like the BnW here as well', '2003-02-07 22:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
