(210512, 11710, 4648, '<td valign="top">I love to go in them.  We have one here on a side rail.  And the keep it in good shape.  They are so neat.  Wish the slow trains would come back.  This was really a good shot.  I would have iked it better in color, especially if it is red.  It has been sharpeded way too much, Unless you were going for the "sketch look".  Which, in that case, you did a really good job.  This almost looks like it is a personal rather than public cabbose.  Hope you let us see it in it''s original form.</td>', 'I love to go in them.  We have one here on a side rail.  And the keep it in good shape.  They are so neat.  Wish the slow trains would come back.  This was really a good shot.  I would have iked it better in color, especially if it is red.  It has been sharpeded way too much, Unless you were going for the "sketch look".  Which, in that case, you did a really good job.  This almost looks like it is a personal rather than public cabbose.  Hope you let us see it in it''s original form.', '2003-02-07 23:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(210515, 12049, 4648, '<td valign="top">Much longer and the baby would be too old for this type of shot.  My sister sent me one similar to this of her grandchild.  This is beautiful.  I like how the background almost swallows the child up.  Beautiful shot and really nice piece of art.</td>', 'Much longer and the baby would be too old for this type of shot.  My sister sent me one similar to this of her grandchild.  This is beautiful.  I like how the background almost swallows the child up.  Beautiful shot and really nice piece of art.', '2003-02-07 23:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(210516, 11722, 4648, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe I missed this on my first pass, when I did all the animal shots, because they are my favorite photos.  To me they''re not cliche.  Other than the cat''s neck appearing to have a crick in it, because of the way his head is turned, this is fantastic.  But that doesn''t really hurt it, because it happens right at the spout, which keeps you from pouring his head out the spout. heh, heh, heh.  This is so cute.  I lvoe it.  Nice shot.</td>', 'I can''t believe I missed this on my first pass, when I did all the animal shots, because they are my favorite photos.  To me they''re not cliche.  Other than the cat''s neck appearing to have a crick in it, because of the way his head is turned, this is fantastic.  But that doesn''t really hurt it, because it happens right at the spout, which keeps you from pouring his head out the spout. heh, heh, heh.  This is so cute.  I lvoe it.  Nice shot.', '2003-02-07 23:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(210519, 11749, 4648, '<td valign="top">Akid after my own hart.  Keep him partiotic all his life.  Good beginning and a really good photo.  Well done, especially without waking him.  Like the lighting and the focus.  Cropping a little tight at the top, just a little.  Should have been out to the edge of the pillow, in my opinon.</td>', 'Akid after my own hart.  Keep him partiotic all his life.  Good beginning and a really good photo.  Well done, especially without waking him.  Like the lighting and the focus.  Cropping a little tight at the top, just a little.  Should have been out to the edge of the pillow, in my opinon.', '2003-02-07 23:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(210520, 11811, 4648, '<td valign="top">Really nice DOF, focus, subject, etc.  Nice one.  Good almost B&amp;W.  Like the rail.  No "wow" but a nicely done shot.</td>', 'Really nice DOF, focus, subject, etc.  Nice one.  Good almost B&W.  Like the rail.  No "wow" but a nicely done shot.', '2003-02-07 23:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
