(210651, 11802, 4648, '<td valign="top">Really neat timing that they both had their eyes closed.  Luck or planned?  The cropping is off.  It should, in my opinion, been cropped as tightly on one side as the other.  Personally I would have liked to see a little more of the left side.  The focus is beautiful for this shot, nice and soft enough for the love and emotion to show, yet sharp enough for great clarity.  You already know the top left corner is a little light.  I love the dimple in the baby''s elbow.  This is a beautiful photo packed with emotion and feelings.  Way to go.</td>', 'Really neat timing that they both had their eyes closed.  Luck or planned?  The cropping is off.  It should, in my opinion, been cropped as tightly on one side as the other.  Personally I would have liked to see a little more of the left side.  The focus is beautiful for this shot, nice and soft enough for the love and emotion to show, yet sharp enough for great clarity.  You already know the top left corner is a little light.  I love the dimple in the baby''s elbow.  This is a beautiful photo packed with emotion and feelings.  Way to go.', '2003-02-08 08:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(210652, 11808, 4648, '<td valign="top">Those eyes are going to break hearts!  You can''t help but smile when you look into them, and into them you do look, not at.  Cliche or not this is one beautiful and happy baby.  Of course the food keeps it from being a portrait, but it is a nice photo.  I really like the focus you achieved,  not to sharp or crisp.  Drop your crop a little at the bottom and let us see all the quote on the bib and the photo is right on.</td>', 'Those eyes are going to break hearts!  You can''t help but smile when you look into them, and into them you do look, not at.  Cliche or not this is one beautiful and happy baby.  Of course the food keeps it from being a portrait, but it is a nice photo.  I really like the focus you achieved,  not to sharp or crisp.  Drop your crop a little at the bottom and let us see all the quote on the bib and the photo is right on.', '2003-02-08 08:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(210654, 12007, 4648, '<td valign="top">I love that you captured this showing "no tears", the normal baby milk fit.  All the things I don''t like work for you here.  I don''t like babies in B&amp;W, cropped tightly, focused sharply.  But they work here.  Good shot well done.</td>', 'I love that you captured this showing "no tears", the normal baby milk fit.  All the things I don''t like work for you here.  I don''t like babies in B&W, cropped tightly, focused sharply.  But they work here.  Good shot well done.', '2003-02-08 08:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(210665, 11806, 3585, '<td valign="top">Very nice textures. This one make a great B&amp;W (check monochrome in the channel mixer, then red:+40, green:+78, blue +12) I''m just fooling around! good job, 9</td>', 'Very nice textures. This one make a great B&W (check monochrome in the channel mixer, then red:+40, green:+78, blue +12) I''m just fooling around! good job, 9', '2003-02-08 09:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
