(210674, 11888, 4411, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. Great lighting, focus and composition. What really makes this stand out is the dark yellow tone and the lines of light on the back of the petal. Great shot, well done.</td>', 'Gorgeous. Great lighting, focus and composition. What really makes this stand out is the dark yellow tone and the lines of light on the back of the petal. Great shot, well done.', '2003-02-08 09:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(210675, 11879, 4411, '<td valign="top">Great macro. I would have liked the whole of the front ''ball'' in shot, but apart from that this is really well done. Fantastic detail on the bee &amp; flower.</td>', 'Great macro. I would have liked the whole of the front ''ball'' in shot, but apart from that this is really well done. Fantastic detail on the bee & flower.', '2003-02-08 09:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(210676, 11861, 4411, '<td valign="top">A lovely shot. The only thing I''m not keen on is the composition. Maybe a landscape format with the flowers to one side of the frame would have suited the triangular layout better?<br/>Focus &amp; use of DoF is really good and the photo has a lovely soft look which I really like.<br/>Great shot, well done.</td>', 'A lovely shot. The only thing I''m not keen on is the composition. Maybe a landscape format with the flowers to one side of the frame would have suited the triangular layout better?Focus & use of DoF is really good and the photo has a lovely soft look which I really like.Great shot, well done.', '2003-02-08 09:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
