(210785, 11700, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Left-hand tin seems slightly too close to the left hand edge for me.<br/>Technical: Lovely DOF and choice of B&amp;W.  Is the very thin line around the edge because of sharpening?  Might have benefited from cropping a pixel on each edge.<br/>Meets challenge:  Not sure where the cliche is, sorry.<br/>Overall impression:  Nice interesting pic, but composition lets it down a little for me.  6</td>', 'Composition: Left-hand tin seems slightly too close to the left hand edge for me.Technical: Lovely DOF and choice of B&W.  Is the very thin line around the edge because of sharpening?  Might have benefited from cropping a pixel on each edge.Meets challenge:  Not sure where the cliche is, sorry.Overall impression:  Nice interesting pic, but composition lets it down a little for me.  6', '2003-02-08 13:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(210786, 11852, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Position is good but the flower seems to ''lean'' slightly to the left.<br/>Technical: Did you try reducing the DOF?  Seems a little cluttered atm.<br/>Overall impression:  Nice pic well framed with a good border.  7</td>', 'Composition: Position is good but the flower seems to ''lean'' slightly to the left.Technical: Did you try reducing the DOF?  Seems a little cluttered atm.Overall impression:  Nice pic well framed with a good border.  7', '2003-02-08 13:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(210788, 11758, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Nice use of small number of leaves/branch in the background.<br/>Technical: Really like the DOF.<br/>Overall impression: Might have tried a border myself, but looks excellent as it is.  8</td>', 'Composition: Nice use of small number of leaves/branch in the background.Technical: Really like the DOF.Overall impression: Might have tried a border myself, but looks excellent as it is.  8', '2003-02-08 13:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(210789, 11838, 205, '<td valign="top">is that a model? my dad has a real one.</td>', 'is that a model? my dad has a real one.', '2003-02-08 13:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(210791, 11937, 205, '<td valign="top">just because you write cliche in your photo dosen''t make it cliche</td>', 'just because you write cliche in your photo dosen''t make it cliche', '2003-02-08 13:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(210792, 11759, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Spot on apart from the very left-hand duck looking a bit too far out.<br/>Technical: I really like the contrast in the pic.  The gradient of colour looks excellent.<br/>Overall impression:Quite a painting-like quality.  9</td>', 'Composition: Spot on apart from the very left-hand duck looking a bit too far out.Technical: I really like the contrast in the pic.  The gradient of colour looks excellent.Overall impression:Quite a painting-like quality.  9', '2003-02-08 13:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(210793, 11819, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Nice position and size.<br/>Technical: I like the lighting and vibrancy.  Might have chosen a flatter and possibly less grainy background.<br/>Overall impression:  Slightly boring for me, but technically great.  7</td>', 'Composition: Nice position and size.Technical: I like the lighting and vibrancy.  Might have chosen a flatter and possibly less grainy background.Overall impression:  Slightly boring for me, but technically great.  7', '2003-02-08 13:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(210795, 11722, 205, '<td valign="top">the focus should be on the cat not the nozzle</td>', 'the focus should be on the cat not the nozzle', '2003-02-08 13:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(210797, 11781, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: I like the green thing in the bottom left, but I would be very tempted to crop it out and make the flowers more central.<br/>Technical: Excellent focus and colour.  I really like the border too, although it seems to have a different width on each edge?<br/>Overall impression: Lacking slightly on the above for me personally but excellent technically.  8</td>', 'Composition: I like the green thing in the bottom left, but I would be very tempted to crop it out and make the flowers more central.Technical: Excellent focus and colour.  I really like the border too, although it seems to have a different width on each edge?Overall impression: Lacking slightly on the above for me personally but excellent technically.  8', '2003-02-08 13:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(210798, 11958, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition:  Colours join into simple shapes which seems to support the subject.  If possible I''d prefer it without the blue cloth.<br/>Technical: Lovely DOF and colour.  Nice use of the full 640 too.<br/>Overall impression: Might have prefered it with a border.  7</td>', 'Composition:  Colours join into simple shapes which seems to support the subject.  If possible I''d prefer it without the blue cloth.Technical: Lovely DOF and colour.  Nice use of the full 640 too.Overall impression: Might have prefered it with a border.  7', '2003-02-08 13:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(210800, 11776, 205, '<td valign="top">most interesting picture of the empire state i''ve seen in a while. too bad that its not sharper.</td>', 'most interesting picture of the empire state i''ve seen in a while. too bad that its not sharper.', '2003-02-08 13:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
