(210803, 11912, 205, '<td valign="top">its not that its not in focus, you shook when you hit the shutter. Faster shutter speed could have helped this.</td>', 'its not that its not in focus, you shook when you hit the shutter. Faster shutter speed could have helped this.', '2003-02-08 13:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
