(210807, 11739, 205, '<td valign="top">its cool how you got it so too jet srtreams are pointing right at the sun, looks underexsposed.</td>', 'its cool how you got it so too jet srtreams are pointing right at the sun, looks underexsposed.', '2003-02-08 13:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(210808, 11810, 205, '<td valign="top">what type of backdrop did you use?</td>', 'what type of backdrop did you use?', '2003-02-08 13:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(210809, 12010, 205, '<td valign="top">your focus is on the ground and not on your subject.</td>', 'your focus is on the ground and not on your subject.', '2003-02-08 13:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(210812, 11876, 4967, '<td valign="top">Hi this must be Danny''s daughter, I have some tips for you.  First off this is a great portrait, very cute, and well lit, with the lighting being even on the faces, with no shadows, very nicely done!  The main criticism I have for you here is the tree going out of your dad''s head.  When taking pictures, especially ones that you can control your settings, pay attention to your backgrounds, this would have been an almost perfect picture if you would have moved the duo over a bit, and only had what looks to be the wooden fence behind them.  The leading lines in this picture are excellent everything from the iron fence behind him to the wooden fence they all lead your eye to the main focus the heads, also your dad''s arms tend to bring you that as well.  One other thing I might have tried would have been to move your camera a little more the the left, and gotten more if his shoulder in and maybe less of the right side in.  Just an idea though.  Nice picture overall!  Good luck!  -Talya</td>', 'Hi this must be Danny''s daughter, I have some tips for you.  First off this is a great portrait, very cute, and well lit, with the lighting being even on the faces, with no shadows, very nicely done!  The main criticism I have for you here is the tree going out of your dad''s head.  When taking pictures, especially ones that you can control your settings, pay attention to your backgrounds, this would have been an almost perfect picture if you would have moved the duo over a bit, and only had what looks to be the wooden fence behind them.  The leading lines in this picture are excellent everything from the iron fence behind him to the wooden fence they all lead your eye to the main focus the heads, also your dad''s arms tend to bring you that as well.  One other thing I might have tried would have been to move your camera a little more the the left, and gotten more if his shoulder in and maybe less of the right side in.  Just an idea though.  Nice picture overall!  Good luck!  -Talya', '2003-02-08 14:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(210813, 11908, 4967, '<td valign="top">Pretty, and I love your DOF, definitely would have cropped some off the left though.</td>', 'Pretty, and I love your DOF, definitely would have cropped some off the left though.', '2003-02-08 14:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(210814, 12002, 2567, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites this week.  Good coloring and composition.  The flowers reflection really adds to this.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites this week.  Good coloring and composition.  The flowers reflection really adds to this.  Good luck.', '2003-02-08 14:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(210816, 11996, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is truly a beautiful specimen!  Not necessarily cute, but an amazing creature :-)  I like your picture and the DOF this is just awesome.  -10-  Talya</td>', 'This is truly a beautiful specimen!  Not necessarily cute, but an amazing creature :-)  I like your picture and the DOF this is just awesome.  -10-  Talya', '2003-02-08 14:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(210828, 11960, 573, '<td valign="top">I love the arangement and warm colors.  In my opinion there are too many distractions in the background otherwise this would be a top rating.</td>', 'I love the arangement and warm colors.  In my opinion there are too many distractions in the background otherwise this would be a top rating.', '2003-02-08 14:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(210829, 12005, 573, '<td valign="top">With a little spot editing after the challenge you will have an excelent family photo.</td>', 'With a little spot editing after the challenge you will have an excelent family photo.', '2003-02-08 14:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(210836, 12017, 1826, '<td valign="top">What a great spot for a portrait! Looks like a happy guy.:)  Nice work.</td>', 'What a great spot for a portrait! Looks like a happy guy.:)  Nice work.', '2003-02-08 15:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(210856, 11814, 669, '<td valign="top">I love the pic, but I''m not sure about the border (-1).  7</td>', 'I love the pic, but I''m not sure about the border (-1).  7', '2003-02-08 16:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(210857, 11943, 5677, '<td valign="top">It''s too bad the sunflower is in such bad shape.  I would have liked to see a nice healthy and bright sunflower.</td>', 'It''s too bad the sunflower is in such bad shape.  I would have liked to see a nice healthy and bright sunflower.', '2003-02-08 16:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(210858, 11996, 5677, '<td valign="top">Good detail and I really like the title.</td>', 'Good detail and I really like the title.', '2003-02-08 16:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(210859, 11960, 5677, '<td valign="top">I wish she looked happier.</td>', 'I wish she looked happier.', '2003-02-08 16:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(210860, 11767, 5677, '<td valign="top">What''s with the smoke in the background?  I think it looks cool.  Really nice photo.</td>', 'What''s with the smoke in the background?  I think it looks cool.  Really nice photo.', '2003-02-08 16:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(210863, 11965, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition:  I like the size of the subject and pic itself.<br/>Technical: This comes out very dark on my monitor.  Was this the effect you were going for?  If so, the amount of negative space leaves the pic a little empty.<br/>Overall impression:  I think the subject had a lot going for it, for me it was possibly let down by lighting.  6</td>', 'Composition:  I like the size of the subject and pic itself.Technical: This comes out very dark on my monitor.  Was this the effect you were going for?  If so, the amount of negative space leaves the pic a little empty.Overall impression:  I think the subject had a lot going for it, for me it was possibly let down by lighting.  6', '2003-02-08 16:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(210864, 11784, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Could possibly have been a bit ''higher'' moving the cat''s eyes lower down in the pic.<br/>Technical: Focus let this down big time.  I''d suggest moving further away and having a smaller pic if necessary to get better quality.  The focus of the b/g is excellent, which would have been great if it the cat was at that distance.<br/>Overall impression:Could have been a good one focus lets it down a lot.  4</td>', 'Composition: Could possibly have been a bit ''higher'' moving the cat''s eyes lower down in the pic.Technical: Focus let this down big time.  I''d suggest moving further away and having a smaller pic if necessary to get better quality.  The focus of the b/g is excellent, which would have been great if it the cat was at that distance.Overall impression:Could have been a good one focus lets it down a lot.  4', '2003-02-08 16:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(210865, 11711, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Nice central subject that uses lines to draw your eye to it.<br/>Technical: The negative seems to have made noise in the pic more obvious, especially in the pink sign.<br/>Meets challenge: Not sure this would be a cliche in photography.<br/>Overall impression: Ok pic but iffy regarding the challenge.  4</td>', 'Composition: Nice central subject that uses lines to draw your eye to it.Technical: The negative seems to have made noise in the pic more obvious, especially in the pink sign.Meets challenge: Not sure this would be a cliche in photography.Overall impression: Ok pic but iffy regarding the challenge.  4', '2003-02-08 16:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(210868, 11690, 3102, '<td valign="top">That''s a spittin'' image of one of our cats... almost creepy!</td>', 'That''s a spittin'' image of one of our cats... almost creepy!', '2003-02-08 16:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(210873, 11988, 2158, '<td valign="top">I don''t particularly like the green mats under the pot.  The colour of the table goes really well with the arrangement - it seems a pity to have something dividing them.</td>', 'I don''t particularly like the green mats under the pot.  The colour of the table goes really well with the arrangement - it seems a pity to have something dividing them.', '2003-02-08 17:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(210883, 11785, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very lovely colors and exposure except for the top black.  It makes the image look top-heavy.  I''d like to see this reworked...perhaps a diff crop.</td>', 'Very lovely colors and exposure except for the top black.  It makes the image look top-heavy.  I''d like to see this reworked...perhaps a diff crop.', '2003-02-08 18:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(210884, 11709, 1280, '<td valign="top">omigosh!  What a sweet face! Good image.</td>', 'omigosh!  What a sweet face! Good image.', '2003-02-08 18:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
