(211301, 12007, 5475, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a little hot on the right side of the face.  Great expression!  Background is good all black with this image.  Like it a lot!  Good Luck   8</td>', 'The lighting is a little hot on the right side of the face.  Great expression!  Background is good all black with this image.  Like it a lot!  Good Luck   8', '2003-02-09 17:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(211302, 11940, 6696, '<td valign="top">red eye</td>', 'red eye', '2003-02-09 17:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(211304, 11844, 5475, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail!  Lighting is perfect.  I would have liked more depth of field, but I''ve shot images similar to this and it''s so hard to get the DOF and have a reasonable shutter speed, especially with an uncooperative, moving subject!  I like the hint of green in the background.  Very nice, I give it an 8</td>', 'Excellent detail!  Lighting is perfect.  I would have liked more depth of field, but I''ve shot images similar to this and it''s so hard to get the DOF and have a reasonable shutter speed, especially with an uncooperative, moving subject!  I like the hint of green in the background.  Very nice, I give it an 8', '2003-02-09 17:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(211305, 11759, 6696, '<td valign="top">They''re Geese you idiot</td>', 'They''re Geese you idiot', '2003-02-09 17:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(211306, 11855, 5475, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites this week. Shape and form are perfect, cropping is great.  Simple border is very effective.  Lighting is excellent on the stem and leaves, tiny bit blown out on the top of the flower.  I would have clipped the small leaf in the background at the bottom left of the flower--it''s a little distracting.  A very nice photo-Good job!  9</td>', 'One of my favorites this week. Shape and form are perfect, cropping is great.  Simple border is very effective.  Lighting is excellent on the stem and leaves, tiny bit blown out on the top of the flower.  I would have clipped the small leaf in the background at the bottom left of the flower--it''s a little distracting.  A very nice photo-Good job!  9', '2003-02-09 17:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(211307, 11983, 6696, '<td valign="top">poor re-coloring.  is water supposed to be red?</td>', 'poor re-coloring.  is water supposed to be red?', '2003-02-09 17:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(211308, 12039, 5475, '<td valign="top">A very simple image, but also impactful!  The geometry of this shot is very good.  I like the vertical strings against the curve and inlay shapes.  Reminds me of putting things inside my Dad''s guitar when I was little (he didn''t like that very much!).  Nicely done!  8</td>', 'A very simple image, but also impactful!  The geometry of this shot is very good.  I like the vertical strings against the curve and inlay shapes.  Reminds me of putting things inside my Dad''s guitar when I was little (he didn''t like that very much!).  Nicely done!  8', '2003-02-09 17:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(211309, 11952, 6696, '<td valign="top">so you''re good with photoshop - bravo.</td>', 'so you''re good with photoshop - bravo.', '2003-02-09 17:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(211310, 11887, 5475, '<td valign="top">Nice dogs!</td>', 'Nice dogs!', '2003-02-09 17:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
