(211312, 12010, 5475, '<td valign="top">Love the action depicted in this shot, more by the expression on her face and the implied motion.  Cute girl.  I would have liked to see her left arm, right side of the photo completely in the photo.  Still a great shot! 8</td>', 'Love the action depicted in this shot, more by the expression on her face and the implied motion.  Cute girl.  I would have liked to see her left arm, right side of the photo completely in the photo.  Still a great shot! 8', '2003-02-09 17:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(211313, 11785, 6696, '<td valign="top">nice - except for the wire/string between the trees.</td>', 'nice - except for the wire/string between the trees.', '2003-02-09 17:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(211315, 11836, 6696, '<td valign="top">grainy - over saturated</td>', 'grainy - over saturated', '2003-02-09 17:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(211316, 11869, 1031, '<td valign="top">Could have saved this for the perspective challenge! Nice.</td>', 'Could have saved this for the perspective challenge! Nice.', '2003-02-09 17:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(211317, 11923, 5475, '<td valign="top">I think your choice of DOF makes this shot for me.  If all were sharp, it would just be another flower picture.  Perfect background choice!  These colors work very well together.  Lighting is perfect, with no shadows.   Is that a blue card or sky?  Feels ''studio'' to me, so I''m guessing blue card/paper/material.  Excellent detail at the stem and the shape of the petals, with bright red on top and pink on bottom makes for an interesting composition and shape.  Very nice!  8</td>', 'I think your choice of DOF makes this shot for me.  If all were sharp, it would just be another flower picture.  Perfect background choice!  These colors work very well together.  Lighting is perfect, with no shadows.   Is that a blue card or sky?  Feels ''studio'' to me, so I''m guessing blue card/paper/material.  Excellent detail at the stem and the shape of the petals, with bright red on top and pink on bottom makes for an interesting composition and shape.  Very nice!  8', '2003-02-09 17:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(211318, 12022, 1031, '<td valign="top">Cenetered horizon will bother some but I think it''s OK here. Really fine exposure capturing the snow and clouds both..</td>', 'Cenetered horizon will bother some but I think it''s OK here. Really fine exposure capturing the snow and clouds both..', '2003-02-09 18:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
