(211338, 12044, 1031, '<td valign="top">But, all the pieces except the knight have specular highlights. Would have twisted him, or moved slightly, or something. Otherwise like the idea, overall composition and exposure, etc.</td>', 'But, all the pieces except the knight have specular highlights. Would have twisted him, or moved slightly, or something. Otherwise like the idea, overall composition and exposure, etc.', '2003-02-09 18:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(211339, 11944, 1003, '<td valign="top">very patient dog you have...</td>', 'very patient dog you have...', '2003-02-09 18:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(211340, 11755, 1031, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite lines (from a radio commercial!) would fit here too: "Remember, this is my house, you just live here."</td>', 'One of my favorite lines (from a radio commercial!) would fit here too: "Remember, this is my house, you just live here."', '2003-02-09 18:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(211341, 12017, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice work - he has a wonderful smile.  Personally I would have included all of his arms at the bottom of the shot.  Also the photo looks like it has two much red in it - perhaps reflection from the red tube though - a little work in photoshop might produce a more natural skin tone.  I really like this photo though - well done.</td>', 'Nice work - he has a wonderful smile.  Personally I would have included all of his arms at the bottom of the shot.  Also the photo looks like it has two much red in it - perhaps reflection from the red tube though - a little work in photoshop might produce a more natural skin tone.  I really like this photo though - well done.', '2003-02-09 18:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(211342, 11846, 2716, '<td valign="top">What a lovely bird.  inclusing of the plant in the background is interesting ... very symetrical.</td>', 'What a lovely bird.  inclusing of the plant in the background is interesting ... very symetrical.', '2003-02-09 18:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(211343, 12003, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like the shallow depth of field - it really brings attention to the orchid.  Lighting is wonderful, the white is great without being glaring.  My only problem is I find it a little hard to see the bottom of the orchid against the background - but only a small problem.  Well done.</td>', 'I like the shallow depth of field - it really brings attention to the orchid.  Lighting is wonderful, the white is great without being glaring.  My only problem is I find it a little hard to see the bottom of the orchid against the background - but only a small problem.  Well done.', '2003-02-09 18:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(211344, 11914, 2716, '<td valign="top">What an interesting shot.  Very smart use of depth of field.  Good job.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'What an interesting shot.  Very smart use of depth of field.  Good job.  Jacko.  8', '2003-02-09 18:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(211345, 11961, 2716, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  They are so cute.  Great capture.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'Excellent.  They are so cute.  Great capture.  Jacko.  8', '2003-02-09 18:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(211350, 11697, 2716, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Much more than a kiddie snapshot.  NIce negative space on top, and great use of Black and White.  Good job.  Jacko.</td>', 'Great shot!  Much more than a kiddie snapshot.  NIce negative space on top, and great use of Black and White.  Good job.  Jacko.', '2003-02-09 18:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(211351, 12050, 2716, '<td valign="top">ribit!  Very nice capture.  Nice angle.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'ribit!  Very nice capture.  Nice angle.  Jacko.  8', '2003-02-09 18:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(211352, 11769, 1826, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot! I really like the way you did the border too. 10</td>', 'Beautiful shot! I really like the way you did the border too. 10', '2003-02-09 18:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(211358, 11966, 6073, '<td valign="top">Is this an American Staffordshire?  Beautiful Animal, and great pic.</td>', 'Is this an American Staffordshire?  Beautiful Animal, and great pic.', '2003-02-09 19:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
