(211423, 11903, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the composition a lot, but think that you lost too much detail in the fireplace, and wish the TV screen wasn''t evident in the upper left hand corner.  Also, focus could be a bit better.  Maybe a large plant to the side of the dogs head would have looked better than seeing tv. I do like the angle of your shot though.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like the composition a lot, but think that you lost too much detail in the fireplace, and wish the TV screen wasn''t evident in the upper left hand corner.  Also, focus could be a bit better.  Maybe a large plant to the side of the dogs head would have looked better than seeing tv. I do like the angle of your shot though.  Good luck.', '2003-02-09 20:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
