(211552, 12032, 1031, '<td valign="top">Even though sunsets are traditionally landscape, I think this shot would be stronger if cropped almost in half to a portrait view. The statue is such a strong vertical element (and strong cliche) that I think it should be emphasized. I think the bird would be OK if the stature wern''t there and it was justa harbor sunset, but here I think it''s more of a distraction.</td>', 'Even though sunsets are traditionally landscape, I think this shot would be stronger if cropped almost in half to a portrait view. The statue is such a strong vertical element (and strong cliche) that I think it should be emphasized. I think the bird would be OK if the stature wern''t there and it was justa harbor sunset, but here I think it''s more of a distraction.', '2003-02-09 22:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
