(211585, 12031, 1031, '<td valign="top">What a good idea...I have a big empty frame lying around...I think you could crop at around the knees and tighten things up a bit -- I don''t think the bottom part adds that much. If he''d been sitting 6 inches higher it would then allow a landscape crop with all the important elements still in there.Moving a bit to the right to reduce the apparent slant of the shelf would make it easier to crop too.</td>', 'What a good idea...I have a big empty frame lying around...I think you could crop at around the knees and tighten things up a bit -- I don''t think the bottom part adds that much. If he''d been sitting 6 inches higher it would then allow a landscape crop with all the important elements still in there.Moving a bit to the right to reduce the apparent slant of the shelf would make it easier to crop too.', '2003-02-09 23:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(211587, 11924, 1031, '<td valign="top">Cool hat -- where''s it from? Snow got a bit over-exposed; when I (rarely) shoot snow I usually expose for it and then compensate for everything else (too dark) later on.</td>', 'Cool hat -- where''s it from? Snow got a bit over-exposed; when I (rarely) shoot snow I usually expose for it and then compensate for everything else (too dark) later on.', '2003-02-09 23:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
