(211705, 11839, 6418, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the comments and everything!  I am happy about the result for the fisrt one!  Some of you have said in the comments that couldn''t read the writing on the guitar pick...  Well, I tried to make it clear with the unsharping a bit...  But, when I tried to make it more clear, the picture went too unnatural.  So, basically, this is the best I could.  I thought it was funny that saying extra heavy on the flat pick landing on the water softly...  Anyway, thanks again for all the kind comments and votes.</td>', 'Thank you all for the comments and everything!  I am happy about the result for the fisrt one!  Some of you have said in the comments that couldn''t read the writing on the guitar pick...  Well, I tried to make it clear with the unsharping a bit...  But, when I tried to make it more clear, the picture went too unnatural.  So, basically, this is the best I could.  I thought it was funny that saying extra heavy on the flat pick landing on the water softly...  Anyway, thanks again for all the kind comments and votes.', '2003-02-10 00:40:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(211708, 11855, 714, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!!!! One of my favorites.  Rats, you beat me by 3!  Good job, you are getting good and tough to beat.  ;-)</td>', 'Wonderful!!!! One of my favorites.  Rats, you beat me by 3!  Good job, you are getting good and tough to beat.  ;-)', '2003-02-10 00:44:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(211713, 11874, 4648, '<td valign="top">I thank each one of you for your comments.  I knew you would beat me up about the background before I submitted it.  I liked it and submitted anyway. I hoped for some comments that would help me with areas that weren''t so obvious.  Hind site is 20/20.  I tried Gallatin''s suggestion and it was much better.  Thanks Gallatin for a really helpful comment.<br/> <br/>For an action shot you can''t always choose where it takes place.  The way I look at it, if you want the scene you have to put up with the scenery sometimes.  For my own personal use I spot edit the background and all the mess out and have a very cute photo.<br/> <br/>  Thanks again for those who took the time to comment.  With this many low votes I expected, and hoped for, at least four pages of comments.</td>', 'I thank each one of you for your comments.  I knew you would beat me up about the background before I submitted it.  I liked it and submitted anyway. I hoped for some comments that would help me with areas that weren''t so obvious.  Hind site is 20/20.  I tried Gallatin''s suggestion and it was much better.  Thanks Gallatin for a really helpful comment. For an action shot you can''t always choose where it takes place.  The way I look at it, if you want the scene you have to put up with the scenery sometimes.  For my own personal use I spot edit the background and all the mess out and have a very cute photo.   Thanks again for those who took the time to comment.  With this many low votes I expected, and hoped for, at least four pages of comments.', '2003-02-10 00:48:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(211720, 12002, 714, '<td valign="top">Jo Ann,  You are good.  I love this shot.  It is so clear and I like how I can see the reflection of the flowers and not the vase.  Great shot and darn we didn''t get a ribbon.  Maybe this challenge.  ;-)</td>', 'Jo Ann,  You are good.  I love this shot.  It is so clear and I like how I can see the reflection of the flowers and not the vase.  Great shot and darn we didn''t get a ribbon.  Maybe this challenge.  ;-)', '2003-02-10 00:51:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(211731, 11975, 714, '<td valign="top">Margie,  You didn''t do to bad for your 2nd shot.  Keep shooting.</td>', 'Margie,  You didn''t do to bad for your 2nd shot.  Keep shooting.', '2003-02-10 00:56:11.000000', NULL, 0),
