(211736, 11932, 714, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo.  I love everything about it.</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo.  I love everything about it.', '2003-02-10 01:03:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(211740, 11717, 1959, '<td valign="top">This photo was definitely not a cliche shot and i didn''t expect to do well.  I wanted to see the reaction of all you wanna be photographers.  Photography is a form of art, and art is suppose to move/touch you.  As you can tell from peoples comments, I think i was succesful at it.   There are a lot of photos submitted for this challenge wich required absolutely no effort to produce and, quite honestly, are extremely boring. <br/> <br/>Oh btw, i hate cats!</td>', 'This photo was definitely not a cliche shot and i didn''t expect to do well.  I wanted to see the reaction of all you wanna be photographers.  Photography is a form of art, and art is suppose to move/touch you.  As you can tell from peoples comments, I think i was succesful at it.   There are a lot of photos submitted for this challenge wich required absolutely no effort to produce and, quite honestly, are extremely boring.  Oh btw, i hate cats!', '2003-02-10 01:10:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(211741, 11865, 5223, '<td valign="top">Another one jacko! Great Photo well done <br/></td>', 'Another one jacko! Great Photo well done ', '2003-02-10 01:12:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(211757, 11865, 6418, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!  I new this was the one!  Beautiful work!!</td>', 'Congratulations!  I new this was the one!  Beautiful work!!', '2003-02-10 01:33:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(211777, 11769, 5223, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo</td>', 'This is a great photo', '2003-02-10 01:50:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(211783, 12028, 255, '<td valign="top"><b>CC</b> <br/> <br/>what beautiful cats! they photograph well together since they look so similar (except their colors, of course!). great job on this capture. the focus is nice and their expressions are so cute--both looking so intently at you! you even did a great job with keeping the red eye from hurting your shot---good idea to get more of a profile shot. the only thing that bugs me about the composition is the crop on the right paw, but it isnt that bad, it just takes a little away from the actual waving--which is very impressive by the way! could you come train my animals, too? ;)<br/>technically, it is fine--the flash has a small effect on their eyes, but that really cant be helped! taking animal shots is fairly difficult, but i think you have a good grasp on it! nice work! <br/> <br/></td>', 'CC  what beautiful cats! they photograph well together since they look so similar (except their colors, of course!). great job on this capture. the focus is nice and their expressions are so cute--both looking so intently at you! you even did a great job with keeping the red eye from hurting your shot---good idea to get more of a profile shot. the only thing that bugs me about the composition is the crop on the right paw, but it isnt that bad, it just takes a little away from the actual waving--which is very impressive by the way! could you come train my animals, too? ;)technically, it is fine--the flash has a small effect on their eyes, but that really cant be helped! taking animal shots is fairly difficult, but i think you have a good grasp on it! nice work!  ', '2003-02-10 02:14:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(211835, 11754, 5158, '<td valign="top">Hi everybody,<br/> <br/>Thanx for the many comments, I enjoyed them much!<br/>Here''s a little video made by me showing why I could not make it better:<br/><a href="//adams_nentwich.bei.t-online.de/kaja.avi" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//adams_nentwich.bei.t-online.de/kaja.avi</a>. It''s a compilation of the successful pictures I took of our 9-month-old dog Kaja. She never wanted to sit still as you can see.<br/>Therefore and do to my bad light equipment, I had to select a high ISO-value and a too fast shutter-speed to get at least something.<br/>NeatImage and some sharpening were needed to make the image look a little better.<br/>Still, we had a tremendous amount of fun while making the pictures and reading all the comments during voting was fun too.<br/> <br/>Jörg<br/> <br/>BTW:<br/>You need the divx 5.0 codec to see the video. Get it under <a href="//www.divx.com/divx/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.divx.com/divx/</a></td>', 'Hi everybody, Thanx for the many comments, I enjoyed them much!Here''s a little video made by me showing why I could not make it better://adams_nentwich.bei.t-online.de/kaja.avi. It''s a compilation of the successful pictures I took of our 9-month-old dog Kaja. She never wanted to sit still as you can see.Therefore and do to my bad light equipment, I had to select a high ISO-value and a too fast shutter-speed to get at least something.NeatImage and some sharpening were needed to make the image look a little better.Still, we had a tremendous amount of fun while making the pictures and reading all the comments during voting was fun too. Jörg BTW:You need the divx 5.0 codec to see the video. Get it under //www.divx.com/divx/', '2003-02-10 03:51:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(211840, 11865, 1829, '<td valign="top">Jacko, just outstanding and it really shows that you put effort into your image.  Very well executed and certainly a work of art.  Well done and keep up the fantastic work.</td>', 'Jacko, just outstanding and it really shows that you put effort into your image.  Very well executed and certainly a work of art.  Well done and keep up the fantastic work.', '2003-02-10 04:25:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(211850, 11865, 5515, '<td valign="top">Incredible image. One of the two 10''s I have ever given here. How anyone could rate this a 2 or a 3 obviously doesn''t have a clue what cliche means. LOL. Every week we are guaranteed 3 or 4 chess board shots here and water drop shots are a dime a dozen. Great image. You are one of my favorites here, that''s for sure... Dave</td>', 'Incredible image. One of the two 10''s I have ever given here. How anyone could rate this a 2 or a 3 obviously doesn''t have a clue what cliche means. LOL. Every week we are guaranteed 3 or 4 chess board shots here and water drop shots are a dime a dozen. Great image. You are one of my favorites here, that''s for sure... Dave', '2003-02-10 05:16:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(211874, 11865, 2716, '<td valign="top">Mommy, mommy!  They gave me another Purty Ribbon!<br/> <br/>Seriously, thank you so much for the kind words and the generous votes. I really had fun setting up and shooting this shot.  Woo hoo!  No 1s.</td>', 'Mommy, mommy!  They gave me another Purty Ribbon! Seriously, thank you so much for the kind words and the generous votes. I really had fun setting up and shooting this shot.  Woo hoo!  No 1s.', '2003-02-10 05:48:57.000000', NULL, 0),
