(211886, 11855, 472, '<td valign="top">thank you for your comments ..  someone said if you find a beautiful subject 95% of your work has already been done.  i think that applies in this case.  the flower basically shot itself :P).. <br/> <br/>surprisingly this was a really simple pic to take.  in fact im finding the more simple i get the better the results are.  too bad that doesn''t work at my job :P . . .  <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-02-11 19:27:16.</i></td>', 'thank you for your comments ..  someone said if you find a beautiful subject 95% of your work has already been done.  i think that applies in this case.  the flower basically shot itself :P)..  surprisingly this was a really simple pic to take.  in fact im finding the more simple i get the better the results are.  too bad that doesn''t work at my job :P . . .  ', '2003-02-10 07:40:46.000000', '2003-02-11 19:27:16.000000', 0),
