(211926, 11855, 2716, '<td valign="top">Mag, good show. Very well executed shot.  I know how it feels to finish 4th; happened to me twice so far.  Keep your chin up.  I love your work.  Jacko.</td>', 'Mag, good show. Very well executed shot.  I know how it feels to finish 4th; happened to me twice so far.  Keep your chin up.  I love your work.  Jacko.', '2003-02-10 08:46:28.000000', NULL, 0),
