(221478, 11891, 244, '<td valign="top">This shot was way underated.  You have created a mood, something hard to do with a photo.  The only audible color being red suggest a sence of love in a bleek world.  Great job, keep it up<br/></td>', 'This shot was way underated.  You have created a mood, something hard to do with a photo.  The only audible color being red suggest a sence of love in a bleek world.  Great job, keep it up', '2003-02-23 00:32:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(223244, 12017, 6771, '<td valign="top">A 1-3?!  Give me a break!!  In the way I judge...everything is a 5...average.  This has great focus, depth and color.  Skin tones look good with the red tube coloring it.  I would have given it a 6-7.  I am still trying to figure out peoples method of judging a photo.  <br/>Tracy<br/><a href="//photos4aidan.home.attbi.com" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//photos4aidan.home.attbi.com</a></td>', 'A 1-3?!  Give me a break!!  In the way I judge...everything is a 5...average.  This has great focus, depth and color.  Skin tones look good with the red tube coloring it.  I would have given it a 6-7.  I am still trying to figure out peoples method of judging a photo.  Tracy//photos4aidan.home.attbi.com', '2003-02-24 18:18:07.000000', NULL, 0),
